      "sourceHash": "978d21121de73cb093ad9f19558be6534f07add39a124e7bdb5ba79c4bd636fa",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.42,
          "end": 1.92,
          "en": "Welcome to this course.",
          "zh": "歡迎來到這門課程。"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 1.98,
          "end": 6.87,
          "en": "I'm super excited to have you onboard and to start this journey together with you,",
          "zh": "我非常興奮能有你加入，並和你一起開始這趟旅程，"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.87,
          "end": 9.96,
          "en": "my name is Max and I'll be your instructor in this course.",
          "zh": "我的名字是 Max，我會是你在這門課程裡的講師。"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.99,
          "end": 15.57,
          "en": "I'm a freelance web developer and I've worked with Javascript for years and ages. Now by the end of this",
          "zh": "我是自由接案的網頁開發者，我使用 JavaScript 已經很多年了。到這門"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 15.57,
          "end": 16.14,
          "en": "course,",
          "zh": "課程結束時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 16.23,
          "end": 23.13,
          "en": "you will also be an advanced Javascript developer capable of applying for Javascript jobs, working on your",
          "zh": "你也會成為進階的 JavaScript 開發者，能夠應徵 JavaScript 工作、進行你"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 23.13,
          "end": 30.93,
          "en": "own project or simply dive deeper into the Javascript landscape and ecosystem and explore all the very",
          "zh": "自己的專案，或只是更深入 JavaScript 的版圖與生態系，並探索所有非常"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 30.93,
          "end": 34.36,
          "en": "advanced and niche features Javascript offers.",
          "zh": "進階、也較冷門的 JavaScript 功能。"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 34.41,
          "end": 36.66,
          "en": "Now this course is for everyone,",
          "zh": "這門課程是給所有人的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 36.66,
          "end": 43.83,
          "en": "we start at the very basics, no prior knowledge is assumed but we'll also then build up knowledge and",
          "zh": "我們從最基礎開始，不假設你有任何先備知識，但我們也會接著建立知識，並"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 43.83,
          "end": 47.25,
          "en": "explore the more advanced and also experts topics.",
          "zh": "探索更進階、也包含專家等級的主題。"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 47.25,
          "end": 51.79,
          "en": "So no matter if you already have some Javascript knowledge or if you're just getting started,",
          "zh": "所以無論你已經有一些 JavaScript 知識，或你才剛開始，"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 51.93,
          "end": 53.6,
          "en": "this course is for you.",
          "zh": "這門課程都適合你。"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 53.76,
          "end": 58.77,
          "en": "Now I'll not bore you with entire overview of what's in the course in this lecture because for that,",
          "zh": "我不會在這堂課用整份課程總覽來煩你，因為"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 58.89,
          "end": 61.48,
          "en": "I'll have a separate lecture later in this module.",
          "zh": "我在這個單元稍後會有單獨的一堂課。"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 61.56,
          "end": 66.93,
          "en": "There, you will also learn about different entry points you can use based on your level of knowledge",
          "zh": "在那裡，你也會學到可以依你的知識程度使用的不同進入點"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 67.02,
          "end": 68.78999999999999,
          "en": "because this is not just a complete guide,",
          "zh": "因為這不只是一份完整指南，"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 68.97,
          "end": 71.62,
          "en": "it's also a complete reference in the end.",
          "zh": "到最後它也是一份完整參考。"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 71.64,
          "end": 74.61,
          "en": "This course also is not a theoretical course,",
          "zh": "這門課程也不是理論課，"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 74.61,
          "end": 78.52,
          "en": "of course we have all the theory but it's a practice-oriented course,",
          "zh": "我們當然有所有理論，但它是以實作為導向的課程，"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 78.53999999999999,
          "end": 82.44,
          "en": "there are plenty of opportunities for you to apply what you learned.",
          "zh": "有很多機會讓你應用所學。"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 82.47,
          "end": 88.62,
          "en": "There are quizzes and assignments and a lot of exercises and demo projects because I strongly believe",
          "zh": "有測驗、作業，以及很多練習與示範專案，因為我強烈相信"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 88.71000000000001,
          "end": 93.55,
          "en": "that you'll learn the most if you can apply things in real world scenarios.",
          "zh": "如果你能在真實情境中應用，你會學得最多。"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 93.57,
          "end": 95.78,
          "en": "You're also not alone, in this course,",
          "zh": "你也不會孤單，在這門課程裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 95.78999999999999,
          "end": 100.5,
          "en": "I'll always be there and I'll do my very best to ensure that you get out of the course",
          "zh": "我會一直在，而且我會盡全力確保你從課程中得到"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 100.5,
          "end": 101.86,
          "en": "what you want to get out of it.",
          "zh": "你想得到的東西。"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 102.3,
          "end": 104.85,
          "en": "And with that I'd say let's not waste any time,",
          "zh": "說到這裡，我們不要浪費任何時間，"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 104.88,
          "end": 110.58,
          "en": "let's dive into the most important question right away and let's find out what exactly Javascript is.",
          "zh": "我們立刻深入最重要的問題，弄清楚 JavaScript 到底是什麼。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "15918598",
      "title": "What is JavaScript?",
      "lectureOrder": 2,
      "videoOrder": 2,
      "sourceHash": "dd5fdc1286efb45ded97058416aad1e29ba62e0821b5e3ece95412f0afdebc3c",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.033,
          "end": 7.066,
          "en": "So let's get started with this course and with everything you need to know about Javascript by diving",
          "zh": "所以讓我們開始這門課程，以及你需要知道的一切 JavaScript，方法是深入"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 7.066,
          "end": 10.967,
          "en": "into this important question, what is Javascript?",
          "zh": "這個重要問題：什麼是 JavaScript？"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 10.967,
          "end": 13.4,
          "en": "Let's have a look at a couple of definitions.",
          "zh": "讓我們看幾個定義。"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 13.4,
          "end": 20.1,
          "en": "Javascript is a dynamic, weakly typed programming language which is compiled at runtime.",
          "zh": "JavaScript 是一種動態、弱型別的程式語言，它在執行時期編譯。"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 20.234,
          "end": 27.267,
          "en": "It can be executed as part of a web page in a browser or directly on any machine in a so-called host",
          "zh": "它可以作為網頁的一部分在瀏覽器裡執行，或直接在任何機器上、在所謂的宿主"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 27.267,
          "end": 29,
          "en": "environment.",
          "zh": "環境裡執行。"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 29.267,
          "end": 30.767,
          "en": "Okay, not entirely clear yet,",
          "zh": "好，還不完全清楚，"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 30.801,
          "end": 34.134,
          "en": "let's have a look at an additional definition.",
          "zh": "讓我們再看一個定義。"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 34.534,
          "end": 38.267,
          "en": "Javascript was created to make web pages more dynamic,",
          "zh": "JavaScript 被創造出來，是為了讓網頁更動態，"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 38.301,
          "end": 44.268,
          "en": "that's kind of the idea why Javascript was invented in the past you could say, more about the history",
          "zh": "你可以說那有點是過去發明 JavaScript 的想法，順帶一提，關於歷史"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 44.268,
          "end": 47.101,
          "en": "of Javascript in a second by the way.",
          "zh": "稍後再談。"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 47.568,
          "end": 53.468,
          "en": "So it was invented to change the content on a page directly from inside the browser",
          "zh": "所以它被發明來從瀏覽器內部直接改變頁面上的內容"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 53.568,
          "end": 59.968,
          "en": "and originally, it was called LiveScript but due to the popularity of Java back at the time, it was renamed",
          "zh": "而最初它叫做 LiveScript，但因為當時 Java 很流行，它被改名"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 59.968,
          "end": 64.402,
          "en": "to Javascript to resemble Java by its name.",
          "zh": "為 JavaScript，讓名稱看起來像 Java。"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 64.602,
          "end": 66.968,
          "en": "Javascript however is totally independent from Java,",
          "zh": "然而 JavaScript 和 Java 完全獨立，"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 66.968,
          "end": 69.635,
          "en": "that's important to understand and has nothing in common,",
          "zh": "這很重要，必須理解，而且兩者沒有共同之處，"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 69.635,
          "end": 77.30199999999999,
          "en": "it really was just named Javascript because Java was popular and people who invented Javascript",
          "zh": "它被命名為 JavaScript，真的只是因為 Java 很流行，而發明 JavaScript 的人"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 77.30199999999999,
          "end": 83.969,
          "en": "wanted Javascript to be a thing I guess but I'm not sure, are these definitions really clear?",
          "zh": "我想是希望 JavaScript 能成為一回事，但我不確定，這些定義真的清楚嗎？"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 83.969,
          "end": 86.136,
          "en": "Do you now know what Javascript is?",
          "zh": "你現在知道 JavaScript 是什麼了嗎？"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 86.169,
          "end": 92.369,
          "en": "Does dynamic, weakly typed compiled at runtime make web pages more dynamic?",
          "zh": "動態、弱型別、在執行時期編譯，會讓網頁更動態嗎？"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 92.369,
          "end": 94.536,
          "en": "Does this tell you something?",
          "zh": "這告訴你什麼了嗎？"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 94.536,
          "end": 96.836,
          "en": "Well let's take a step back maybe,",
          "zh": "我們也許退一步，"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 96.90299999999999,
          "end": 105.503,
          "en": "how do web pages work? You are the user visiting a web page and when you do visit a web page, you use",
          "zh": "網頁如何運作？你是造訪網頁的使用者，當你造訪網頁時，你用"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 105.57,
          "end": 112.203,
          "en": "browser for that. You use your client, your machine, your laptop, your computer, where you have a browser",
          "zh": "瀏覽器。你使用你的用戶端、你的機器、你的筆電、你的電腦，上面有瀏覽器"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 112.203,
          "end": 113.40299999999999,
          "en": "installed on it,",
          "zh": "安裝在其中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 113.537,
          "end": 119.60300000000001,
          "en": "you enter a URL or click on a search result on Google and the web page gets loaded,",
          "zh": "你輸入網址，或點擊 Google 上的搜尋結果，網頁就被載入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 119.60300000000001,
          "end": 125.937,
          "en": "To be precise when you initially visit a web page, a request is sent to the server,",
          "zh": "精確地說，當你一開始造訪網頁時，一個請求會送到伺服器，"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 125.937,
          "end": 133.037,
          "en": "so to a computer in the Internet where that web page, where the HTML file is hosted and that server",
          "zh": "也就是網際網路上的一台電腦，那個網頁、那個 HTML 檔案放在那裡，而那台伺服器"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 133.037,
          "end": 141.504,
          "en": "then loads that web page and sends it back to your browser in a so-called response and the most basic",
          "zh": "接著載入那個網頁，並在所謂的回應中把它送回你的瀏覽器，而最基本的"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 141.504,
          "end": 147.038,
          "en": "form of response we know or we typically see and use when we work with the Internet,",
          "zh": "我們知道、或我們使用網際網路時通常看到並使用的回應形式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 147.038,
          "end": 155.538,
          "en": "when we visit a page is simply an HTML page which is sent back by the server to the client.",
          "zh": "當我們造訪頁面時，就是伺服器送回給用戶端的一個 HTML 頁面。"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 155.538,
          "end": 159.638,
          "en": "Now let's say on that loaded web page, let's say it's an online shop,",
          "zh": "現在假設在那個已載入的網頁上，假設它是一個線上商店，"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 159.638,
          "end": 161.038,
          "en": "doesn't really matter,",
          "zh": "其實不重要，"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 161.038,
          "end": 167.772,
          "en": "the user clicks a button to submit a form, for example to order some products.",
          "zh": "使用者點擊按鈕送出表單，例如訂購一些產品。"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 167.905,
          "end": 174.972,
          "en": "Now this will then trigger a new request which is sent by the browser to the server to send this form",
          "zh": "這接著會觸發一個新請求，由瀏覽器送到伺服器，把這個表單"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 174.972,
          "end": 179.805,
          "en": "submission to the server and the server will handle the incoming request,",
          "zh": "提交送到伺服器，而伺服器會處理進來的請求，"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 179.839,
          "end": 188.572,
          "en": "maybe store some order data in a database and once it's done, it will reply back with a new response,",
          "zh": "也許把一些訂單資料存進資料庫，完成之後，它會回覆一個新的回應，"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 188.739,
          "end": 196.073,
          "en": "with a new web page, a new HTML document which is sent back to the client, maybe the order confirmation",
          "zh": "一個新的網頁、一份新的 HTML 文件送回用戶端，也許是訂單確認"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 196.073,
          "end": 200.94,
          "en": "page. So this is how we interact with the web,",
          "zh": "頁面。所以這就是我們和網頁互動的方式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 200.94,
          "end": 204.173,
          "en": "this is how web pages traditionally work.",
          "zh": "這就是網頁傳統上的運作方式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 204.473,
          "end": 208.773,
          "en": "Now Javascript helps us make this more reactive,",
          "zh": "現在 JavaScript 幫助我們讓這件事更有反應，"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 208.773,
          "end": 217.94,
          "en": "it helps us make a web page more reactive and skip that second request response flow in some circumstances",
          "zh": "它幫助我們讓網頁更有反應，並在某些情況下跳過第二次請求與回應流程"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 218.273,
          "end": 223.80700000000002,
          "en": "to instead change the already loaded page and do something there.",
          "zh": "改為改變已經載入的頁面，並在那裡做些事情。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "25650660",
      "title": "JavaScript in Action!",
      "lectureOrder": 3,
      "videoOrder": 3,
      "sourceHash": "3281c0a220d9cad02f71b9aceed4dab04b7c958a15360ed6b39b6e16f0e06277",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2,
          "end": 4.066,
          "en": "Now let's simply see an example,",
          "zh": "現在我們直接看一個例子，"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.066,
          "end": 7.666,
          "en": "which should make this clearer for that attached you find",
          "zh": "這應該會讓它更清楚，為此你會找到附件"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.7,
          "end": 8.8,
          "en": "a simple project,",
          "zh": "一個簡單的專案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.8,
          "end": 12.233,
          "en": "which has? Free folders or 2 folders in one file",
          "zh": "裡面有幾個資料夾，或是兩個資料夾和一個檔案"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.3,
          "end": 15.067,
          "en": "assets folder at info folder and index.",
          "zh": "assets 資料夾、info 資料夾，以及 index。"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.067,
          "end": 18.7,
          "en": "HTML file the extra folders and files we see here.",
          "zh": "HTML 檔案。我們在這裡看到的額外資料夾與檔案。"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 18.7,
          "end": 21.6,
          "en": "Are just here in my local setup for version control",
          "zh": "只是我本機設定裡用來做版本控制的"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 21.634,
          "end": 23.167,
          "en": "and for my editor settings.",
          "zh": "以及給我的編輯器設定用的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 23.167,
          "end": 24.6,
          "en": "We can ignore them right?",
          "zh": "我們可以忽略它們，對吧？"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 24.6,
          "end": 26,
          "en": "Now you don't need them,",
          "zh": "你不需要它們，"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 26,
          "end": 28.534,
          "en": "they're not related to the web page so we get.",
          "zh": "它們和網頁無關，所以我們得到。"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 28.534,
          "end": 32.001,
          "en": "3 things in there to folders and the index HTML",
          "zh": "裡面三樣東西：兩個資料夾和 index HTML"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 32.067,
          "end": 35.867,
          "en": "file now you can simply double click that index HTML",
          "zh": "檔案。現在你只要雙擊那個 index HTML"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 35.934,
          "end": 36.301,
          "en": "file.",
          "zh": "檔案。"
        },
        {
