        {
          "id": 190,
          "start": 490.516,
          "end": 495.349,
          "en": "More dynamic. So if we come back to that question",
          "zh": "更動態。所以如果我們回到那個問題"
        },
        {
          "id": 191,
          "start": 495.349,
          "end": 497.816,
          "en": "of what JavaScript is.",
          "zh": "JavaScript 是什麼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 192,
          "start": 497.816,
          "end": 500.95,
          "en": "If I quickly dive into the core things we learned",
          "zh": "如果我快速深入我們在"
        },
        {
          "id": 193,
          "start": 501.016,
          "end": 502.483,
          "en": "on this previous slide.",
          "zh": "上一張投影片學到的核心事情。"
        },
        {
          "id": 194,
          "start": 502.483,
          "end": 506.15,
          "en": "JavaScript is a dynamic weakly typed programming language.",
          "zh": "JavaScript 是一種動態、弱型別的程式語言。"
        },
        {
          "id": 195,
          "start": 506.15,
          "end": 510.383,
          "en": "It's interpreted language, which means it's compiled on the fly.",
          "zh": "它是直譯語言，意思是它即時編譯。"
        },
        {
          "id": 196,
          "start": 510.383,
          "end": 514.617,
          "en": "It's compiled before it runs and not compiled during development.",
          "zh": "它在執行前編譯，而不是在開發期間編譯。"
        },
        {
          "id": 197,
          "start": 514.617,
          "end": 517.917,
          "en": "As some other programming languages are it's a hosted language",
          "zh": "像其他一些程式語言那樣。它是託管語言"
        },
        {
          "id": 198,
          "start": 517.983,
          "end": 519.917,
          "en": "that runs in different environments,",
          "zh": "在不同環境中執行，"
        },
        {
          "id": 199,
          "start": 519.917,
          "end": 521.917,
          "en": "though, thus far in the last example.",
          "zh": "不過，到目前為止在上一個例子裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 200,
          "start": 521.917,
          "end": 523.55,
          "en": "We just saw it. Run in the browser,",
          "zh": "我們只看到它。在瀏覽器裡執行，"
        },
        {
          "id": 201,
          "start": 523.55,
          "end": 526.117,
          "en": "but I'll come back to our environments in this course",
          "zh": "不過，我會在這門課程中再回來介紹其他執行環境"
        },
        {
          "id": 202,
          "start": 526.15,
          "end": 527.45,
          "en": "as well.",
          "zh": "也會一併說明。"
        },
        {
          "id": 203,
          "start": 527.45,
          "end": 530.051,
          "en": "And the most prominent use cases to case.",
          "zh": "而最主要的使用案例。"
        },
        {
          "id": 204,
          "start": 530.051,
          "end": 532.917,
          "en": "We just thought we run code in a browser on",
          "zh": "我們剛剛想的是，我們在瀏覽器裡的網頁上執行程式碼"
        },
        {
          "id": 205,
          "start": 532.984,
          "end": 535.317,
          "en": "a web page to make it more dynamic.",
          "zh": "讓它更動態。"
        },
        {
          "id": 206,
          "start": 535.651,
          "end": 538.217,
          "en": "So now we understand why we use JavaScript and what",
          "zh": "所以現在我們理解為什麼使用 JavaScript，以及它"
        },
        {
          "id": 207,
          "start": 538.251,
          "end": 539.184,
          "en": "it allows us to do,",
          "zh": "讓我們能做什麼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 208,
          "start": 539.184,
          "end": 540.384,
          "en": "but what do these turns?",
          "zh": "但這些術語呢？"
        },
        {
          "id": 209,
          "start": 540.384,
          "end": 546.684,
          "en": "Dynamic weakly typed, and interpreted as well as host language",
          "zh": "動態、弱型別，以及直譯，還有宿主語言"
        },
        {
          "id": 210,
          "start": 546.784,
          "end": 548.318,
          "en": "mean in detail.",
          "zh": "詳細是什麼意思。"
        }
      ]
