    {
      "id": "25650690",
      "title": "How JavaScript Is Executed",
      "lectureOrder": 5,
      "videoOrder": 4,
      "sourceHash": "e63581de3aaa3bd8343ef837b3197bb4c7ea0b3efd6ff2e1f785f5a7a209b6ad",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.09,
          "end": 6.08,
          "en": "Let's have a look at this interpreted on-the-fly compile thing.",
          "zh": "讓我們看看這個即時直譯、編譯的事情。"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 6.08,
          "end": 8.32,
          "en": "How is the Javascript code in our browser",
          "zh": "我們瀏覽器裡的 JavaScript 程式碼"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.33,
          "end": 15.41,
          "en": "executed and not just in our browser but typically in any environment where you run Javascript? Let's",
          "zh": "是如何被執行的，而且不只在我們的瀏覽器裡，通常是在任何你執行 JavaScript 的環境裡？讓我們"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 15.41,
          "end": 20.16,
          "en": "say you write your Javascript code and you want it to have some effect on the web page",
          "zh": "說你寫了 JavaScript 程式碼，而你希望它對網頁產生一些效果"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 20.18,
          "end": 26.93,
          "en": "if we talk about the browser as the environment where we run our script. Then you have one important",
          "zh": "如果我們把瀏覽器當成執行指令稿的環境。那麼你有一件重要的"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 27.23,
          "end": 32.68,
          "en": "thing built into any environment where you want to run Javascript code",
          "zh": "東西，內建在任何你想執行 JavaScript 程式碼的環境裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 32.68,
          "end": 34.89,
          "en": "and that's a Javascript engine.",
          "zh": "那就是 JavaScript 引擎。"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 34.94,
          "end": 39.86,
          "en": "It's built into the browser as I said, there in Chrome for example, in the Chrome browser,",
          "zh": "如我所說，它內建在瀏覽器裡，例如在 Chrome 裡，在 Chrome 瀏覽器中，"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 39.92,
          "end": 41.06,
          "en": "it's v8,",
          "zh": "它是 V8，"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 41.06,
          "end": 43.58,
          "en": "that's the name of the engine, in Firefox",
          "zh": "那是引擎的名稱，在 Firefox"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 43.58,
          "end": 45.23,
          "en": "the name would be spider monkey",
          "zh": "名稱會是 SpiderMonkey"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 45.23,
          "end": 50.52,
          "en": "and of course other browsers also either reuse these engines or have their own engines.",
          "zh": "而其他瀏覽器當然也會重複使用這些引擎，或有自己的引擎。"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 50.54,
          "end": 58.92,
          "en": "Now the job of the engine is to parse code, so parse, read and understand your Javascript code,",
          "zh": "現在引擎的工作是剖析程式碼，也就是剖析、讀取並理解你的 JavaScript 程式碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 58.97,
          "end": 65.66,
          "en": "then on the fly compile it to machine code because machine code executes faster,",
          "zh": "然後即時把它編譯成機器碼，因為機器碼執行得更快，"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 65.66,
          "end": 72.05,
          "en": "so it reads your code but it does not necessarily execute it like that but instead, it now takes that code",
          "zh": "所以它讀取你的程式碼，但不一定就那樣執行，而是接著拿那段程式碼"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 72.05,
          "end": 78.92,
          "en": "and compiles it to code which is faster to execute by the machine and then it executes that machine",
          "zh": "並編譯成機器執行起來更快的程式碼，然後它執行那個機器"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 78.92,
          "end": 79.31,
          "en": "code.",
          "zh": "碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 79.31,
          "end": 84.7,
          "en": "This all happens in the browser with the help of the Javascript engine",
          "zh": "這一切都在瀏覽器裡、藉由 JavaScript 引擎發生"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 84.83,
          "end": 89.33,
          "en": "and then when that code is executed, we have that effect on our web page.",
          "zh": "然後當那段程式碼被執行，我們就對網頁產生那個效果。"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 89.33,
          "end": 93.7,
          "en": "Now important, modern engines have a lot of optimizations there,",
          "zh": "現在重要的是，現代引擎在那裡有很多最佳化，"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 93.71000000000001,
          "end": 100.16,
          "en": "they might start executing your uncompiled code and then compile the code whilst they're also already",
          "zh": "它們也許先開始執行你尚未編譯的程式碼，然後在它們已經"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 100.16,
          "end": 106.28,
          "en": "executing it to get started executing faster and then switch to the compiled code dynamically and so on,",
          "zh": "執行的同時編譯程式碼，以便更快開始執行，再動態切換到編譯後的程式碼，諸如此類，"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 106.28,
          "end": 111.62,
          "en": "so we have a lot of optimizations going on here and we will dig a bit deeper into what the Javascript",
          "zh": "所以這裡有很多最佳化在進行，而我們會再深入一點 JavaScript"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 111.68,
          "end": 112.72999999999999,
          "en": "engine is",
          "zh": "引擎"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 112.72999999999999,
          "end": 113.36,
          "en": "exactly",
          "zh": "到底是什麼"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 113.36,
          "end": 118.67,
          "en": "in a separate module in the course, for now this is all we need to know, the browser has a built-in tool",
          "zh": "在課程裡的一個單獨單元，現在我們只需要知道這些，瀏覽器有一個內建工具"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 118.67,
          "end": 122.93,
          "en": "that takes our code, compiles it, optimizes it and executes it",
          "zh": "它接收我們的程式碼、編譯它、最佳化它並執行它"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 123.08,
          "end": 129.64,
          "en": "and also a bit more technical side note, all of that happens on a single thread.",
          "zh": "還有一個比較技術的附註，這一切都發生在單一執行緒上。"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 129.71,
          "end": 137.57,
          "en": "Now this is very technical but you might know that in a computer, you have certain tasks that are executed,",
          "zh": "這非常技術性，但你也許知道，在電腦裡有某些被執行的工作，"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 137.63,
          "end": 143.63,
          "en": "for example the browser you opened is a task or actually might consist of multiple different tasks",
          "zh": "例如你開啟的瀏覽器是一個工作，或實際上可能由多個不同工作組成"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 143.93,
          "end": 145.91,
          "en": "that are executed together.",
          "zh": "它們一起被執行。"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 145.91,
          "end": 152.12,
          "en": "The Javascript code is also yet another task which your operating system in the end has to take care",
          "zh": "JavaScript 程式碼也是另一個工作，你的作業系統最終必須處理"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 152.12,
          "end": 152.43,
          "en": "of",
          "zh": "它"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 152.45,
          "end": 154.95,
          "en": "and this runs on a single thread.",
          "zh": "而這在單一執行緒上執行。"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 155.21,
          "end": 161.21,
          "en": "Of course we have multi-threading on modern machines so that they can do multiple tasks at the same time",
          "zh": "當然現代機器有多執行緒，所以它們可以同時做多個工作"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 161.32999999999998,
          "end": 166.1,
          "en": "but the Javascript code execution runs on one single thread there,",
          "zh": "但 JavaScript 程式碼的執行是在那裡的單一執行緒上進行，"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 166.1,
          "end": 171.86,
          "en": "so the Javascript code execution always happens in one single thread on your operating system.",
          "zh": "所以 JavaScript 程式碼的執行永遠發生在你作業系統上的單一執行緒。"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 171.86,
          "end": 173.3,
          "en": "Right now this doesn't really matter,",
          "zh": "現在這其實不重要，"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 173.3,
          "end": 178.49,
          "en": "it will become more important later in the course though when I will come back to this concept of single",
          "zh": "但它在課程稍後會變得更重要，當我回來談這個單一"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 178.49,
          "end": 183.05,
          "en": "threading and which implications this has for Javascript.",
          "zh": "執行緒的概念，以及這對 JavaScript 有什麼影響。"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 183.2,
          "end": 190.13,
          "en": "But with that we know what interpreted means, what compilation means and how the Javascript code is executed.",
          "zh": "說到這裡，我們知道直譯是什麼意思、編譯是什麼意思，以及 JavaScript 程式碼如何被執行。"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 190.13,
          "end": 192.74,
          "en": "What does dynamic and weakly type mean then?",
          "zh": "那麼動態和弱型別是什麼意思？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "25650696",
      "title": "Dynamic vs Weakly Typed Languages",
      "lectureOrder": 6,
      "videoOrder": 5,
      "sourceHash": "c1755aa41521f71116fd1ec2468609ec166cb5ba33efc9ddbd725f5b54a5c001",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.066,
          "end": 9.666,
          "en": "Javascript is a dynamic, interpreted programming language but it's also a weakly typed programming language.",
          "zh": "JavaScript 是一種動態、直譯的程式語言，但它也是弱型別的程式語言。"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 9.666,
          "end": 10.867,
          "en": "Now what does this mean?",
          "zh": "那麼這是什麼意思？"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 10.867,
          "end": 11.633,
          "en": "Now what does this mean?",
          "zh": "那麼這是什麼意思？"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 11.667,
          "end": 17.533,
          "en": "For one, the dynamic interpreted part as you learned means that it's not pre-compiled, other languages like",
          "zh": "一方面，你學過的動態直譯部分表示它不是預先編譯的，其他語言像"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 17.533,
          "end": 21.634,
          "en": "C++ are compiled during or after development,",
          "zh": "C++ 是在開發期間或之後編譯，"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 21.634,
          "end": 21.7,
          "en": "C++ are compiled during or after development,",
          "zh": "C++ 是在開發期間或之後編譯，"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 21.767,
          "end": 26.667,
          "en": "so before you share them with the end users, Javascript is on-the-fly compiled and that means that the",
          "zh": "所以在你和終端使用者分享之前，JavaScript 是即時編譯的，而那表示"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 26.667,
          "end": 28.334,
          "en": "so before you share them with the end users, Javascript is on-the-fly compiled and that means that the",
          "zh": "所以在你和終端使用者分享之前，JavaScript 是即時編譯的，而那表示"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 28.334,
          "end": 31.101,
          "en": "code is evaluated and executed at runtime,",
          "zh": "程式碼在執行時期被評估並執行，"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 31.101,
          "end": 34.334,
          "en": "it also means that the code can change at runtime.",
          "zh": "那也表示程式碼可以在執行時期改變。"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 34.367,
          "end": 40.334,
          "en": "Now of course not the code you wrote and it won't magically change, of course the code you wrote gets executed",
          "zh": "當然不是你寫的程式碼會神奇地改變，你寫的程式碼當然會被執行"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 40.534,
          "end": 45.801,
          "en": "but in that code, you can do some things which you are not allowed to do in other programming languages,",
          "zh": "但在那段程式碼裡，你可以做一些其他程式語言不允許你做的事，"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 45.801,
          "end": 46.234,
          "en": "but in that code, you can do some things which you are not allowed to do in other programming languages,",
          "zh": "但在那段程式碼裡，你可以做一些其他程式語言不允許你做的事，"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 46.268,
          "end": 50.735,
          "en": "for example if you're working with a variable, something we will only learn in the second module,",
          "zh": "例如如果你在使用變數，這是我們要到第二個單元才會學的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 50.735,
          "end": 54.935,
          "en": "for now you can just keep in mind that a variable is a data container,",
          "zh": "現在你只要記住，變數是一個資料容器，"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 55.101,
          "end": 57.901,
          "en": "you might store let's say some text in there, text you need in your script to for example output it to",
          "zh": "你也許在那裡存一些文字，你在指令稿裡需要的文字，例如把它輸出給"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 57.901,
          "end": 61.668,
          "en": "you might store let's say some text in there, text you need in your script to for example output it to",
          "zh": "你也許在那裡存一些文字，你在指令稿裡需要的文字，例如把它輸出給"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 61.668,
          "end": 67.968,
          "en": "the user. In Javascript you are allowed to dynamically switch the type of data there. In a variable, you",
          "zh": "使用者。在 JavaScript 裡，你可以動態切換那裡的資料型別。在一個變數裡，你"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 67.968,
          "end": 73.569,
          "en": "might start by storing some text and suddenly at a later point of time, you store a number in there instead,",
          "zh": "也許一開始存一些文字，然後在稍後突然改存一個數字，"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 73.769,
          "end": 75.569,
          "en": "in the same variable.",
          "zh": "在同一個變數裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 75.569,
          "end": 75.869,
          "en": "in the same variable.",
          "zh": "在同一個變數裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 75.869,
          "end": 78.569,
          "en": "Now again, we haven't really learned about variables yet,",
          "zh": "再說一次，我們還沒真正學過變數，"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 78.669,
          "end": 85.069,
          "en": "we will of course do that but the one thing you can simply keep in mind is that the dynamic thing in",
          "zh": "我們當然會學，但你可以簡單記住的一件事是，JavaScript 裡的動態"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 85.069,
          "end": 92.036,
          "en": "Javascript means that it is parsed and interpreted and compiled at runtime and that therefore it is",
          "zh": "表示它在執行時期被剖析、直譯並編譯，因此它"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 92.036,
          "end": 93.60300000000001,
          "en": "able to do certain things,",
          "zh": "能夠做某些事情，"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 93.60300000000001,
          "end": 99.469,
          "en": "for example switching the data of a variable other programming languages are not allowed to do.",
          "zh": "例如切換變數的資料，這是其他程式語言不被允許做的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 99.469,
          "end": 99.90299999999999,
          "en": "for example switching the data of a variable other programming languages are not allowed to do.",
          "zh": "例如切換變數的資料，這是其他程式語言不被允許做的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 100.003,
          "end": 106.703,
          "en": "Now it's not necessarily good to switch the type of data dynamically or unexpectedly but you can do",
          "zh": "現在，動態或意外地切換資料型別不一定是好事，但你可以"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 106.703,
          "end": 107.23599999999999,
          "en": "that,",
          "zh": "這麼做，"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 107.23599999999999,
          "end": 111.90299999999999,
          "en": "the main takeaway however is the on-the-fly compilation and interpretation. Now what about the weakly",
          "zh": "不過主要重點是即時編譯與直譯。那麼弱"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 111.90299999999999,
          "end": 114.203,
          "en": "the main takeaway however is the on-the-fly compilation and interpretation. Now what about the weakly",
          "zh": "不過主要重點是即時編譯與直譯。那麼弱"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 114.203,
          "end": 116.503,
          "en": "typed part here?",
          "zh": "型別這部分呢？"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 116.537,
          "end": 124.437,
          "en": "This means that when we work with data in Javascript, for example text data or numbers, you don't have",
          "zh": "這表示當我們在 JavaScript 裡使用資料，例如文字資料或數字，你不必"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 124.437,
          "end": 130.204,
          "en": "to tell Javascript that you're going to work with a text now or you're going to work with a number now,",
          "zh": "告訴 JavaScript 你現在要使用文字，或你現在要使用數字，"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 130.404,
          "end": 130.904,
          "en": "instead",
          "zh": "而是"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 130.904,
          "end": 137.171,
          "en": "data types are assumed, are inferred automatically so to say, that's also related to this dynamic",
          "zh": "資料型別是被假設的，可以說是自動推斷的，這也和這種動態"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 137.171,
          "end": 142.038,
          "en": "nature where data types can also change from one line to another.",
          "zh": "性質有關，資料型別也可以從一行變到另一行。"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 142.038,
          "end": 142.704,
          "en": "nature where data types can also change from one line to another.",
          "zh": "性質有關，資料型別也可以從一行變到另一行。"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 142.738,
          "end": 149.138,
          "en": "Now this might sound strange but in other programming languages, you have to define the type of data",
          "zh": "現在這也許聽起來奇怪，但在其他程式語言裡，你必須事先定義"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 149.77100000000002,
          "end": 156.20499999999998,
          "en": "a variable will hold in advance. In Javascript, that's not the case, you don't have to tell Javascript",
          "zh": "一個變數會持有的資料型別。在 JavaScript 裡不是這樣，你不必告訴 JavaScript"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 156.438,
          "end": 163.838,
          "en": "that this variable, this data container will hold a number, instead you store a data in there and if that",
          "zh": "這個變數、這個資料容器會持有一個數字，而是你把資料存進去，如果那"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 163.838,
          "end": 166.338,
          "en": "happens to be a number, so it is. In other programming languages, you have to tell the language that you're",
          "zh": "碰巧是一個數字，那它就是。在其他程式語言裡，你必須告訴語言你"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 166.338,
          "end": 169.805,
          "en": "happens to be a number, so it is. In other programming languages, you have to tell the language that you're",
          "zh": "碰巧是一個數字，那它就是。在其他程式語言裡，你必須告訴語言你"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 169.838,
          "end": 171.20499999999998,
          "en": "going to store a number in there",
          "zh": "要在那裡存一個數字"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 171.272,
          "end": 173.739,
          "en": "and if you store something else, you would get an error.",
          "zh": "而如果你存了別的東西，你會得到錯誤。"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 173.772,
          "end": 179.20499999999998,
          "en": "That's not the case in Javascript, it's forgiving there because it's dynamic and it also doesn't care",
          "zh": "在 JavaScript 裡不是這樣，它在那裡比較寬容，因為它是動態的，而且它也不在乎"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 179.20499999999998,
          "end": 181.872,
          "en": "about strong type definitions in advance,",
          "zh": "事先的強型別定義，"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 181.906,
          "end": 186.906,
          "en": "instead you just store data in there and go with every type of data that holds. So data types are not",
          "zh": "而是你只是把資料存進去，並接受它持有的每一種資料型別。所以資料型別不是"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 186.906,
          "end": 188.472,
          "en": "instead you just store data in there and go with every type of data that holds. So data types are not",
          "zh": "而是你只是把資料存進去，並接受它持有的每一種資料型別。所以資料型別不是"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 188.472,
          "end": 190.539,
          "en": "set in stone but can change.",
          "zh": "刻在石頭上，而是可以改變。"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 190.539,
          "end": 191.006,
          "en": "set in stone but can change.",
          "zh": "刻在石頭上，而是可以改變。"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 191.006,
          "end": 193.239,
          "en": "Now this is arguably a bit more advanced,",
          "zh": "現在這可以說比較進階，"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 193.306,
          "end": 199.106,
          "en": "I just want you to be aware of these terms, dynamic and weakly typed right now and they will make more",
          "zh": "我只是想讓你現在留意這些術語：動態與弱型別，而它們會隨著"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 199.106,
          "end": 203.973,
          "en": "and more sense as we progress throughout this course and work with data and variables.",
          "zh": "我們在這門課程中往前、並使用資料與變數，而越來越有意義。"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 204.073,
          "end": 206.04,
          "en": "For now, just be aware of these terms.",
          "zh": "現在，只要留意這些術語。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "25650720",
      "title": "JavaScript Executes In A Hosted Environment",
      "lectureOrder": 7,
      "videoOrder": 6,
      "sourceHash": "9b649e1a0b96b6de33cfc87d7cacf358d47f42ae7f31f134c7d7cd48c5c9a909",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.05,
          "end": 8.81,
          "en": "Now the last thing we saw on the previous definition slide is that Javascript runs on a host environment,",
          "zh": "現在我們在前一張定義投影片上看到的最後一件事，是 JavaScript 在宿主環境上執行，"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 8.86,
          "end": 15.85,
          "en": "so that means a Javascript engine can be part or can be executed in different environments.",
          "zh": "所以那表示 JavaScript 引擎可以是不同環境的一部分，或在不同環境裡被執行。"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 15.85,
          "end": 18.6,
          "en": "The most well known environment is the browser,",
          "zh": "最廣為人知的環境是瀏覽器，"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 18.65,
          "end": 24.4,
          "en": "modern browsers have Javascript engines built in and they're therefore capable of executing Javascript",
          "zh": "現代瀏覽器內建了 JavaScript 引擎，因此它們能夠執行 JavaScript"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 24.4,
          "end": 28.18,
          "en": "code but you also can run Javascript in other environments,",
          "zh": "程式碼，但你也可以在其他環境裡執行 JavaScript，"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 28.18,
          "end": 34.81,
          "en": "for example on the server side, so right on a computer without having a browser in between, so not inside",
          "zh": "例如在伺服器端，也就是直接在一台電腦上，中間沒有瀏覽器，所以不是在"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 34.81,
          "end": 40.43,
          "en": "of a browser but simply execute code like this on your machine.",
          "zh": "瀏覽器裡面，而是像這樣直接在你的機器上執行程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 40.48,
          "end": 47.14,
          "en": "Now Javascript was invented to run in the browser, to make web sites more dynamic, to be able to change",
          "zh": "JavaScript 被發明是為了在瀏覽器裡執行，讓網站更動態，讓你能夠改變"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 47.2,
          "end": 55.63,
          "en": "things on a web site without loading a new page you could say because Javascript is able to closely",
          "zh": "網站上的東西而不用載入新頁面，你可以這麼說，因為 JavaScript 能夠緊密地"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 55.63,
          "end": 59.89,
          "en": "work together with the loaded HTML code, with CSS,",
          "zh": "和已載入的 HTML 程式碼、和 CSS 一起運作，"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 59.92,
          "end": 67.45,
          "en": "you can also use Javascript to send background HTTP requests, so to send some behind the scenes requests",
          "zh": "你也可以用 JavaScript 送出背景 HTTP 請求，也就是送出一些幕後請求"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 67.45,
          "end": 74.23,
          "en": "and fetch data without reloading the page and much more and it will do all of that throughout the course.",
          "zh": "並取得資料而不重新載入頁面，還有更多，而我們會在整門課程中做這一切。"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 74.23,
          "end": 79.31,
          "en": "Now there also are certain things Javascript can't do when it runs in the browser environment though,",
          "zh": "不過當 JavaScript 在瀏覽器環境裡執行時，也有某些事情它做不到，"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 79.42,
          "end": 85.57,
          "en": "for example it can't access your local file system for security reasons because otherwise every web",
          "zh": "例如它不能存取你的本機檔案系統，這是出於安全性理由，否則每一個你造訪的網"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 85.57,
          "end": 92.59,
          "en": "page you visit would be able to read your file system, maybe delete files on your computer and so on which",
          "zh": "頁都能讀取你的檔案系統，也許刪除你電腦上的檔案等等，那"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 92.59,
          "end": 94.12,
          "en": "would be horrible of course",
          "zh": "當然會很可怕"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 94.39,
          "end": 97.57,
          "en": "and in general it is running in a sandbox",
          "zh": "而一般來說它在沙箱裡執行"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 97.6,
          "end": 102.75999999999999,
          "en": "you can say, it's not able to interact with your operating system and so on, the browser gives you certain",
          "zh": "你可以這麼說，它不能和你的作業系統互動等等，瀏覽器給你某些"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 102.75999999999999,
          "end": 107.21000000000001,
          "en": "things you can do in this environment and doesn't allow other things.",
          "zh": "在這個環境裡可以做的事，而不允許其他事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 107.22999999999999,
          "end": 112.18,
          "en": "Now as I said, the browser is only one environment though, the one for which Javascript was invented",
          "zh": "如我所說，瀏覽器只是其中一個環境，是 JavaScript 被發明時的那個"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 112.36,
          "end": 115.88,
          "en": "but not the only one we're restricted to right now,",
          "zh": "但不是我們現在被限制的唯一一個，"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 115.96000000000001,
          "end": 124.96,
          "en": "instead the Javascript engine Google developed, v8 is the name of the engine, was extracted by some people",
          "zh": "相反地，Google 開發的 JavaScript 引擎，引擎名稱是 V8，被一些人抽出來"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 125.83,
          "end": 131.29,
          "en": "to run Javascript anywhere because the idea was if we have the engine in the browser, why don't",
          "zh": "以便在任何地方執行 JavaScript，因為想法是，如果我們在瀏覽器裡有這個引擎，為什麼不"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 131.29,
          "end": 138.55,
          "en": "we take it out of the browser and then make it available as a standalone tool which you can use to execute",
          "zh": "把它從瀏覽器裡拿出來，然後做成獨立工具，讓你可以用來執行"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 138.55,
          "end": 141.4,
          "en": "Javascript anywhere else directly on your machine",
          "zh": "JavaScript，在你的機器上其他任何地方直接執行"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 141.4,
          "end": 144.24,
          "en": "and this tool is in the end called Node.js.",
          "zh": "而這個工具最後叫做 Node.js。"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 144.41,
          "end": 149.8,
          "en": "Now in this course, I'll have a separate module about Node.js where I show you how that works and",
          "zh": "在這門課程裡，我會有一個關於 Node.js 的單獨單元，我在那裡告訴你它如何運作，以及"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 149.8,
          "end": 155.07999999999998,
          "en": "how it uses the same Javascript syntax you learned throughout the course but which new features it",
          "zh": "它如何使用你在整門課程中學到的相同 JavaScript 語法，但它帶來哪些新功能"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 155.07999999999998,
          "end": 160.42000000000002,
          "en": "brings to the table. For the majority of course however, we'll focus on the browser side because this is",
          "zh": "。不過對課程的大部分來說，我們會把焦點放在瀏覽器端，因為這是"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 160.42000000000002,
          "end": 163.9,
          "en": "the side where you absolutely need Javascript",
          "zh": "你絕對需要 JavaScript 的那一端"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 163.96,
          "end": 168.67000000000002,
          "en": "and it's also the site where you're able to see more because you have a web page where things change",
          "zh": "而那也是你能看到更多東西的一端，因為你有一個網頁，上面的東西會改變"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 168.67000000000002,
          "end": 169.87,
          "en": "and so on.",
          "zh": "等等。"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 169.87,
          "end": 175.03,
          "en": "Now back to Node.js though for a second, Node.js can be executed on any machine and therefore it's",
          "zh": "現在回到 Node.js 一秒，Node.js 可以在任何機器上執行，因此它"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 175.09,
          "end": 180.45,
          "en": "also often used to build web back-ends, to build web servers, server side",
          "zh": "也常常被用來建立網頁後端、建立網頁伺服器，伺服器端"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 180.46,
          "end": 184.49,
          "en": "Javascript is also something you often hear as a description for that.",
          "zh": "JavaScript 也是你常常聽到的一種描述。"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 184.57,
          "end": 191.83,
          "en": "Now you might know about server side languages like PHP or also Java and other languages as well,",
          "zh": "你也許知道伺服器端語言，像是 PHP，或 Java，以及其他語言，"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 191.83,
          "end": 197.45,
          "en": "well Javascript with Node.js can also be used to run it on the back-end of a web page,",
          "zh": "而搭配 Node.js 的 JavaScript 也可以用來在網頁的後端執行，"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 197.47,
          "end": 205.18,
          "en": "so on the server and not on the client in the browser of your users. Now Node.js also has certain things",
          "zh": "也就是在伺服器上，而不是在使用者瀏覽器裡的用戶端。Node.js 也有某些事情"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 205.18,
          "end": 210.52,
          "en": "it can do and can't do, since it runs directly on a machine, in Node.js",
          "zh": "它能做和不能做，因為它直接在機器上執行，在 Node.js 裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 210.54,
          "end": 216.7,
          "en": "you're able to access the local file system, so you are able to write files and so on because unlike browser",
          "zh": "你能夠存取本機檔案系統，所以你能夠寫入檔案等等，因為和瀏覽器"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 216.7,
          "end": 221.11,
          "en": "side Javascript, Node.js code has to be executed actively by you,",
          "zh": "端 JavaScript 不同，Node.js 程式碼必須由你主動執行，"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 221.14,
          "end": 224.28,
          "en": "it's not like you visit a web page and then this starts happening,",
          "zh": "它不是你造訪一個網頁然後事情就開始發生，"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 224.32,
          "end": 227.89,
          "en": "instead it can only access the file system on the machine where it executes",
          "zh": "相反地，它只能存取它執行所在那台機器上的檔案系統"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 227.89,
          "end": 233.92000000000002,
          "en": "which for example is the server where it runs, not your machine and it's also able to interact with the",
          "zh": "例如那是它執行的伺服器，不是你的機器，而且它也能和"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 233.92000000000002,
          "end": 235.39,
          "en": "operating system and so on.",
          "zh": "作業系統互動等等。"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 235.39,
          "end": 240.43,
          "en": "However on the other hand since it doesn't have direct access to the loaded web page, it can't manipulate",
          "zh": "另一方面，因為它不能直接存取已載入的網頁，它不能像瀏覽器端那樣操作"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 240.49,
          "end": 242.97,
          "en": "HTML or CSS like browser side.",
          "zh": "HTML 或 CSS。"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 242.98,
          "end": 250.53,
          "en": "Javascript is able to do, so we basically have even inverse access capabilities here and these are the",
          "zh": "JavaScript 能做的那些，所以我們在這裡基本上甚至有相反的存取能力，而這些是"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 250.53,
          "end": 253.08,
          "en": "different environments where Javascript is able to run.",
          "zh": "JavaScript 能夠執行的不同環境。"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 253.09,
          "end": 258.4,
          "en": "Now in this course, we'll focus on the browser side because the Javascript syntax you learned will be the",
          "zh": "在這門課程裡，我們會把焦點放在瀏覽器端，因為你學到的 JavaScript 語法會是"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 258.4,
          "end": 262.03,
          "en": "same, no matter in which environment you run Javascript code",
          "zh": "相同的，無論你在哪個環境執行 JavaScript 程式碼"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 262.36,
          "end": 267.54,
          "en": "but in the browser, we simply have more visual feedback and can see what happens.",
          "zh": "但在瀏覽器裡，我們有更多視覺回饋，也能看到發生了什麼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 267.67,
          "end": 272.81,
          "en": "Nonetheless as I said, we have the separate Node.js module later in the course",
          "zh": "儘管如此，如我所說，我們在課程稍後有單獨的 Node.js 單元"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 272.83,
          "end": 278.62,
          "en": "where I'll also dive into the different things we can do in Node.js and how that works.",
          "zh": "我在那裡也會深入我們在 Node.js 裡能做的不同事情，以及那如何運作。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "25650728",
      "title": "Course Outline - What's In This Course?",
      "lectureOrder": 8,
      "videoOrder": 7,
      "sourceHash": "72a55951dcf23fb9b0e285c9293253573cdf6232d8db5d4c234420d1f170259c",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.06,
          "end": 4.49,
          "en": "So we saw some Javascript in action,",
          "zh": "所以我們看過一些實際運作的 JavaScript，"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.49,
          "end": 10.55,
          "en": "we have the basic definition out of the way and hopefully now have a basic understanding of what Javascript",
          "zh": "基本定義也講完了，希望你現在對 JavaScript"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 10.55,
          "end": 13.63,
          "en": "is and what this language is all about.",
          "zh": "是什麼、這門語言在做什麼，有了基本理解。"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 13.64,
          "end": 17.54,
          "en": "Now what's in this course though, what will you learn in this course?",
          "zh": "那麼這門課程裡有什麼，你會在這門課程學到什麼？"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 17.66,
          "end": 20.97,
          "en": "You could split this course in two three main blocks",
          "zh": "你可以說這門課程分成三個主要區塊"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 20.99,
          "end": 26.4,
          "en": "I would say - the core basics which you have to know under all circumstances,",
          "zh": "我會說：核心基礎，這是你在任何情況下都必須知道的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 26.78,
          "end": 32.94,
          "en": "then the next block where we build up on these basics and build a really strong foundation,",
          "zh": "然後下一個區塊，我們在這些基礎上建立，並打下很扎實的根基，"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 33.02,
          "end": 37.89,
          "en": "you could therefore still call that basics but these would be the advanced basics",
          "zh": "因此你仍可以把它叫做基礎，但這些會是進階基礎"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 38.09,
          "end": 44.6,
          "en": "and then we have advanced concepts which allow you to get to the next level of Javascript development",
          "zh": "然後我們有進階概念，讓你到達 JavaScript 開發的下一個層級"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 44.78,
          "end": 48.16,
          "en": "and become a really good Javascript developer.",
          "zh": "並成為真正優秀的 JavaScript 開發者。"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 48.17,
          "end": 51.86,
          "en": "Now in the core basics block, we get started,",
          "zh": "在核心基礎區塊，我們開始，"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 51.86,
          "end": 57.7,
          "en": "this is this module, we learned the core basics about Javascript and its history and so on",
          "zh": "就是這個單元，我們學了 JavaScript 的核心基礎、它的歷史等等"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 57.83,
          "end": 63.8,
          "en": "but once we're finished with this module, we'll dive into all the core syntax, the language basics, into",
          "zh": "但這個單元結束後，我們會深入所有核心語法、語言基礎，深入"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 63.8,
          "end": 70.82,
          "en": "variables, functions, what all of that is, all these core things that make up the Javascript language which",
          "zh": "變數、函式、那一切是什麼，所有構成 JavaScript 語言的核心東西，而"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 70.82,
          "end": 77.12,
          "en": "you have to know no matter in which environment you want to execute Javascript. We'll dive into efficient",
          "zh": "無論你想在哪個環境執行 JavaScript，你都必須知道。我們會深入有效率的"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 77.12,
          "end": 82.88,
          "en": "development and debugging, how to configure your environment correctly, how to fix errors and how to find",
          "zh": "開發與除錯、如何正確設定你的環境、如何修正錯誤，以及如何找到"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 82.88,
          "end": 83.4,
          "en": "them.",
          "zh": "它們。"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 83.51,
          "end": 89.15,
          "en": "We'll dive into control structures, if statements, loops so that you can execute code multiple times based",
          "zh": "我們會深入控制結構、if 陳述式、迴圈，讓你能依"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 89.15,
          "end": 92.66,
          "en": "on some conditions. We'll look behind the scenes of Javascript,",
          "zh": "某些條件多次執行程式碼。我們會看 JavaScript 的幕後，"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 92.69,
          "end": 96.43,
          "en": "we'll see what the Javascript engine does in detail.",
          "zh": "我們會詳細看到 JavaScript 引擎做了什麼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 96.62,
          "end": 101.39,
          "en": "We'll have a close look at functions, a very important concept as it will turn out.",
          "zh": "我們會仔細看函式，到頭來這是非常重要的概念。"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 101.47999999999999,
          "end": 109.28,
          "en": "We'll have a look at the DOM basics, DOM stands for Document Object Model and this will all be about manipulating",
          "zh": "我們會看 DOM 基礎，DOM 代表文件物件模型，而這全部是關於操作"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 109.28,
          "end": 110.21000000000001,
          "en": "the web page",
          "zh": "網頁"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 110.24000000000001,
          "end": 114.41,
          "en": "we're running on, adding content, removing content and so on.",
          "zh": "我們正在上面執行的那個，加入內容、移除內容等等。"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 114.41,
          "end": 116.49000000000001,
          "en": "We'll have a look at arrays and iterables,",
          "zh": "我們會看陣列與可迭代物件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 116.50999999999999,
          "end": 119.85,
          "en": "so at lists of data and how we can work with those.",
          "zh": "也就是資料清單，以及我們如何使用它們。"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 119.99000000000001,
          "end": 124.51,
          "en": "We'll have a look at objects which are super important data structures in Javascript",
          "zh": "我們會看物件，它們是 JavaScript 裡非常重要的資料結構"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 124.67,
          "end": 131.6,
          "en": "and once we're done with that, you will have a solid basic understanding of the Javascript core syntax",
          "zh": "而完成之後，你會對 JavaScript 核心語法"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 131.6,
          "end": 136.63,
          "en": "and the core features. Now thereafter, we'll build a stronger foundation",
          "zh": "與核心功能有扎實的基本理解。在那之後，我們會建立更強的根基"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 136.65,
          "end": 141.95,
          "en": "and if you already know all the core based syntax, this of course might be a great entry point.",
          "zh": "而如果你已經知道所有核心基礎語法，這當然也許是很好的進入點。"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 141.96,
          "end": 148.11,
          "en": "You'll find a module, in the curriculum if you check that, about classes and object oriented programming",
          "zh": "如果你查看課程清單，你會找到一個單元，關於類別與物件導向程式設計"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 148.38,
          "end": 151.18,
          "en": "which takes object usage,",
          "zh": "它把物件的使用，"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 151.26,
          "end": 154.47,
          "en": "you learned about objects in the core basics, to the next level.",
          "zh": "你在核心基礎學過的物件，帶到下一個層級。"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 154.53,
          "end": 158.19,
          "en": "You learned about constructor functions and prototypes,",
          "zh": "你會學到建構函式與原型，"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 158.25,
          "end": 162.21,
          "en": "important core concepts baked into the Javascript language.",
          "zh": "這是內建在 JavaScript 語言裡的重要核心概念。"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 162.36,
          "end": 168.57999999999998,
          "en": "We'll dive deeper into the DOM and how to work with the browser and tap into certain browser features.",
          "zh": "我們會更深入 DOM，以及如何和瀏覽器合作、使用某些瀏覽器功能。"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 168.6,
          "end": 173.92000000000002,
          "en": "We'll dive deeper into events, how we can react to mouse clicks and so on.",
          "zh": "我們會更深入事件，我們如何回應滑鼠點擊等等。"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 173.97,
          "end": 176.46,
          "en": "We'll have a look at functions again,",
          "zh": "我們會再看一次函式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 176.46,
          "end": 182.85,
          "en": "we'll dive really deep into functions and learn about things like recursion and more advanced function",
          "zh": "我們會真正深入函式，並學到像遞迴這類事情，以及更進階的函式"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 182.85,
          "end": 183.92,
          "en": "usage.",
          "zh": "用法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 183.99,
          "end": 189.45,
          "en": "We'll explore the number and string types in greater detail and which restrictions we have there and what",
          "zh": "我們會更詳細探索數字與字串型別，我們在那裡有哪些限制，以及"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 189.45,
          "end": 190.64,
          "en": "we can do there.",
          "zh": "我們能在那裡做什麼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 190.67,
          "end": 196.44,
          "en": "We'll dive into asynchronous code which will be related to that single threading I mentioned and how",
          "zh": "我們會深入非同步程式碼，這會和我提過的單一執行緒有關，以及如何"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 196.44,
          "end": 202.14,
          "en": "we can run longer taking operations without freezing our web page.",
          "zh": "執行較久的操作而不凍結我們的網頁。"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 202.14,
          "end": 205.29,
          "en": "We'll dive into these background HTTP requests,",
          "zh": "我們會深入那些背景 HTTP 請求，"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 205.29,
          "end": 211.05,
          "en": "also sometimes referred to as Ajax which I mentioned earlier, which allow us to exchange data behind",
          "zh": "有時也稱為 Ajax，我稍早提過，它讓我們能在幕後交換資料"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 211.05,
          "end": 213.29,
          "en": "the scenes without reloading the page",
          "zh": "而不重新載入頁面"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 213.48,
          "end": 220.89,
          "en": "and once we did all of that, we will have a very solid foundation, not just the basic core syntax but",
          "zh": "而做完這一切之後，我們會有非常扎實的根基，不只是基本核心語法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 220.89,
          "end": 228.45,
          "en": "we'll also know all the important parts of the Javascript language and of using Javascript in the browser.",
          "zh": "我們也會知道 JavaScript 語言的所有重要部分，以及如何在瀏覽器裡使用 JavaScript。"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 228.45,
          "end": 234.12,
          "en": "Now of course then we'll also dive into more advanced concepts, you will learn how to work with third",
          "zh": "當然接著我們也會深入更進階的概念，你會學到如何使用第三方"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 234.12,
          "end": 241.14,
          "en": "party libraries, how to utilize the Javascript modules and split your code efficiently across multiple files.",
          "zh": "函式庫、如何使用 JavaScript 模組，並有效率地把程式碼拆到多個檔案。"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 241.32,
          "end": 247.52,
          "en": "We'll dive into tooling which allows us to optimize our Javascript code, namely webpack and Babel.",
          "zh": "我們會深入工具，讓我們能最佳化 JavaScript 程式碼，也就是 webpack 與 Babel。"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 247.62,
          "end": 252.37,
          "en": "We'll briefly dive into browser storage and how you can store data in the browser,",
          "zh": "我們會簡短深入瀏覽器儲存，以及你如何在瀏覽器裡儲存資料，"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 252.39,
          "end": 257.76,
          "en": "we'll have a look at browser support and how you can ensure that your scripts run in all browsers where",
          "zh": "我們會看瀏覽器支援，以及你如何確保你的指令稿在所有需要執行的瀏覽器裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 257.76,
          "end": 258.81,
          "en": "they need to run,",
          "zh": "都能執行，"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 258.81,
          "end": 262.69,
          "en": "no matter which browsers your end users are going to use.",
          "zh": "無論你的終端使用者要用哪些瀏覽器。"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 262.86,
          "end": 267.97,
          "en": "We'll have a look at Javascript frameworks and there we'll have a look at the React.js library. We'll",
          "zh": "我們會看 JavaScript framework，在那裡我們會看 React.js 函式庫。我們會"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 268.05,
          "end": 273.71,
          "en": "have a look at meta programming, how you can write code which is easier to use by other developers,",
          "zh": "看中介程式設計，你如何寫出其他開發者更容易使用的程式碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 273.75,
          "end": 275.78,
          "en": "really advanced but really important.",
          "zh": "真的很進階，但也真的很重要。"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 275.90999999999997,
          "end": 281.34000000000003,
          "en": "We'll have a look at Node.js and see how that differs from browser side Javascript and what will be",
          "zh": "我們會看 Node.js，看看它和瀏覽器端 JavaScript 有何不同，以及什麼會是"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 281.34000000000003,
          "end": 282.34000000000003,
          "en": "the same.",
          "zh": "相同的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 282.45,
          "end": 289.08,
          "en": "We'll have a look at security and how you secure your code and which security holes you want to avoid.",
          "zh": "我們會看安全性，你如何保護你的程式碼，以及你想避免哪些安全漏洞。"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 289.08,
          "end": 296.01,
          "en": "We'll of course also see how you get your code from your local machine onto a server where other users",
          "zh": "我們當然也會看到，你如何把程式碼從本機送到伺服器，讓其他使用者"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 296.01,
          "end": 297.08,
          "en": "can use it.",
          "zh": "可以使用它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 297.12,
          "end": 302.7,
          "en": "We'll have a look at performance optimizations and fixing memory leaks to ship the best possible code",
          "zh": "我們會看效能最佳化，以及修正記憶體洩漏，以便送出最好的程式碼"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 303.03,
          "end": 305.04,
          "en": "and much more.",
          "zh": "還有更多。"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 305.04,
          "end": 307.26,
          "en": "This course is a big course,",
          "zh": "這是一門很大的課程，"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 307.29,
          "end": 312.64,
          "en": "it has a lot of hours of content because it's simply packed with content.",
          "zh": "它有很多小時的內容，因為內容非常充實。"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 312.84,
          "end": 319.29,
          "en": "You can simply go from it, from lecture 1 to the last lecture or of course also dive into the modules",
          "zh": "你可以從第 1 堂一路看到最後一堂，或當然也深入那些"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 319.32,
          "end": 322.02,
          "en": "which are most interesting to you.",
          "zh": "你最有興趣的單元。"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 322.02,
          "end": 328.74,
          "en": "I did my best to build the course in a way that allows you to also use it as a reference, so that you",
          "zh": "我盡力把課程做成也能當參考來用，所以"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 328.74,
          "end": 334,
          "en": "don't always have to restart at the beginning if you are coming back to it after a year or so",
          "zh": "如果你一年左右之後回來，不必總是從開頭重來"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 334.11,
          "end": 341.67,
          "en": "but that you can dive into the sections which are most interesting to you, though if you are new or relatively",
          "zh": "而是可以深入你最有興趣的章節，不過如果你是新手，或對"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 341.67,
          "end": 342.96,
          "en": "new to Javascript,",
          "zh": "JavaScript 相對陌生，"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 342.96,
          "end": 348.93,
          "en": "my strong recommendation is that you start with lecture one and section one and you go through the course",
          "zh": "我強烈建議你從第 1 堂、第 1 單元開始，一步一步走完課程"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 348.99,
          "end": 352.65,
          "en": "step-by-step, maybe just speeding up playback",
          "zh": "也許只是加快播放"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 352.65,
          "end": 355.68,
          "en": "if I'm going through some concepts you already know.",
          "zh": "如果我在講一些你已經知道的概念。"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 355.68,
          "end": 358.65999999999997,
          "en": "So this is what's in the course and how you can take it.",
          "zh": "所以這就是課程裡有什麼，以及你可以怎麼上。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "25650736",
      "title": "How To Get The Most Out Of This Course",
      "lectureOrder": 9,
      "videoOrder": 8,
      "sourceHash": "d44385a36933ec9e1780be62fa05959c1dc8519cb2e5f00805bba7c2a1f80876",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.1,
          "end": 8.49,
          "en": "I also want to make sure that you get the most out of this course though and for that, of course you",
          "zh": "我也想確保你從這門課程得到最多，為此，你當然"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 8.49,
          "end": 15.45,
          "en": "should watch the videos. Watch them at your speed, use the playback controls, the speed controls in the",
          "zh": "應該看影片。用你自己的速度看，使用播放控制、影片播放器裡的速度控制"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 15.45,
          "end": 22.62,
          "en": "video player to speed me up if I'm going too slow for your taste in a certain video or on a certain concept",
          "zh": "如果我在某支影片或某個概念上對你來說太慢，就加快我的速度"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 22.74,
          "end": 25.31,
          "en": "but also slow me down if you need more time,",
          "zh": "但如果你需要更多時間，也把我放慢，"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 25.36,
          "end": 27.06,
          "en": "also pause and rewind",
          "zh": "也要暫停並倒帶"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 27.06,
          "end": 31,
          "en": "if a certain concept is not clear yet. It's a video on-demand course",
          "zh": "如果某個概念還不清楚。這是隨選視訊課程"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 31.02,
          "end": 32.56,
          "en": "so take advantage of that,",
          "zh": "所以利用這一點，"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 32.61,
          "end": 36.35,
          "en": "you can watch a video more than once, this is absolutely fine.",
          "zh": "你可以把一支影片看超過一次，這完全沒問題。"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 36.36,
          "end": 40.05,
          "en": "Also code along, pause and rewind as I said",
          "zh": "也要跟著寫程式碼，如我所說要暫停並倒帶"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 40.08,
          "end": 46.11,
          "en": "if I'm going too fast and also pause regularly to try implementing what I'm about to implement",
          "zh": "如果我講得太快，也要定期暫停，試著實作我即將實作的內容"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 46.35,
          "end": 47.66,
          "en": "on your own first,",
          "zh": "先自己動手試試，"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 47.7,
          "end": 50.16,
          "en": "this is the best way of practicing.",
          "zh": "這是最好的練習方式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 50.16,
          "end": 56.1,
          "en": "I also got tons of quizzes in this course which you can use because practicing of course is important,",
          "zh": "我在這門課程裡也有大量測驗，你可以使用，因為練習當然很重要，"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 56.16,
          "end": 58.33,
          "en": "so do the assignments you find,",
          "zh": "所以做你找到的作業，"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 58.65,
          "end": 64.41,
          "en": "follow along in the practice projects we dive into and do the quizzes to check your knowledge and make",
          "zh": "跟著我們深入的練習專案，並做測驗來檢查你的知識，並確保"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 64.41,
          "end": 67.44,
          "en": "sure that we're all on the same page.",
          "zh": "我們站在同一頁上。"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 67.83,
          "end": 74.4,
          "en": "Also of course if you're facing errors, if something does not work as expected, use the knowledge you",
          "zh": "當然如果你遇到錯誤、如果某件事不如預期運作，使用你"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 74.4,
          "end": 80.88,
          "en": "gained in the development and debugging section and debug your code, search for errors and also search",
          "zh": "在開發與除錯單元學到的知識來除錯你的程式碼、搜尋錯誤，也搜尋"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 80.88,
          "end": 87.27,
          "en": "for solutions. You can use the attached code snippets which you find attached to multiple lectures per",
          "zh": "解法。你可以使用附上的程式碼片段，它們附在每個單元的多堂課"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 87.27,
          "end": 93.12,
          "en": "module and always to the last lecture of each module, to compare your code to mine.",
          "zh": "以及永遠附在每個單元的最後一堂，用來把你的程式碼和我的比較。"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 93.21000000000001,
          "end": 98.13,
          "en": "If something is not working as shown in the video, chances are that there is a difference in code and",
          "zh": "如果某件事不像影片裡那樣運作，很可能程式碼有差異，而"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 98.13,
          "end": 103.38,
          "en": "comparing code is what you should do in that case to find and fix the error.",
          "zh": "在那種情況下你應該做的就是比較程式碼，找出並修正錯誤。"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 103.38,
          "end": 109.92,
          "en": "You can also replace your code step-by-step with mine temporarily to narrow down the issue but also",
          "zh": "你也可以暫時逐步用我的程式碼替換你的，來縮小問題範圍，但也"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 109.92,
          "end": 117.18,
          "en": "google error messages if you find them and use the search built into the Udemy course player, that allows",
          "zh": "如果找到錯誤訊息就去 Google，並使用 Udemy 課程播放器內建的搜尋，那讓"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 117.18,
          "end": 121.08,
          "en": "you to also find many common issues and fix them on your own.",
          "zh": "你也能找到很多常見問題，並自己修正。"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 121.26,
          "end": 126.76,
          "en": "But of course if you're stuck or if some concept is unclear and you're not able to proceed on your own,",
          "zh": "但當然如果你卡住了，或某個概念不清楚、你無法自己繼續，"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 126.96,
          "end": 133.47,
          "en": "also ask and answer. You have a Q & A section this course and there, you can ask questions and I will",
          "zh": "也要提問與回答。這門課程有問與答區，你可以在那裡發問，而我會"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 133.56,
          "end": 139.71,
          "en": "read and reply there regularly but also use it to help others because you will learn the most if",
          "zh": "定期閱讀並回覆，但也用它來幫助其他人，因為你會學得最多，如果"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 139.71,
          "end": 143.46,
          "en": "you don't just ask but if you solve problems on your own",
          "zh": "你不只是發問，而是自己解決問題"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 143.55,
          "end": 150.45,
          "en": "and if you also help others solve problems because that forces you to think about an issue and find",
          "zh": "並且也幫助其他人解決問題，因為那迫使你思考一個問題並找到"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 150.45,
          "end": 151.19,
          "en": "a solution",
          "zh": "解法"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 151.26,
          "end": 154.74,
          "en": "and that ultimately is always how you learn the most.",
          "zh": "而那最終永遠是你學得最多的方式。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "25650744",
