          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.1,
          "end": 16.05,
          "en": "Let's also have a look at that comparison between JavaScript.",
          "zh": "讓我們也看看 JavaScript 之間的那個比較。"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 16.05,
          "end": 20.095,
          "en": "Java again. Now Java and JavaScript are 2 totally independent",
          "zh": "再看一次 Java。現在 Java 和 JavaScript 是兩種完全獨立的"
