        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 20.161,
          "end": 21.62,
          "en": "programming languages.",
          "zh": "程式語言。"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 21.62,
          "end": 25.743,
          "en": "That's really important, they have a totally different syntax different",
          "zh": "這真的很重要，它們有完全不同的語法、不同的"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 25.801,
          "end": 26.44,
          "en": "principles.",
          "zh": "原則。"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 26.44,
          "end": 29.802,
          "en": "They have almost nothing in common besides the name I",
          "zh": "除了名稱之外，它們幾乎沒有共同之處，我"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 29.866,
          "end": 30.5,
          "en": "would say,",
          "zh": "會這麼說，"
        },
        {
