        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 102.7,
          "end": 107.28999999999999,
          "en": "JavaScript does. And speaking about that differentiation between client side",
          "zh": "JavaScript 會。說到用戶端"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 107.35,
          "end": 111.27600000000001,
          "en": "and server side JavaScript clientside means in the browser server",
          "zh": "與伺服器端的差別，JavaScript 用戶端表示在瀏覽器裡，伺服器"
