        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 138.758,
          "end": 139.18,
          "en": "users.",
          "zh": "使用者。"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 139.18,
          "end": 141.64,
          "en": "And the important thing there is that in the browser.",
          "zh": "而那裡重要的是，在瀏覽器裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 141.64,
          "end": 144.43,
          "en": "You are able to interact with the web page.",
          "zh": "你能夠和網頁互動。"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 144.43,
          "end": 148.46,
          "en": "From inside JavaScript you can manipulate the loaded web page.",
          "zh": "從 JavaScript 內部，你可以操作已載入的網頁。"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 148.46,
          "end": 151.64,
          "en": "You can also use certain browser features so called.",
          "zh": "你也可以使用某些所謂的瀏覽器功能。"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 151.64,
          "end": 155.07,
          "en": "APIs for example, to get the user location on the",
          "zh": "API，例如取得使用者位置，在"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 155.14,
          "end": 155.98,
          "en": "server side.",
          "zh": "伺服器端。"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 155.98,
          "end": 157.24,
          "en": "The idea was to well,",
          "zh": "想法是，"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 157.24,
          "end": 159.35,
          "en": "extract the engine out of the browser.",
          "zh": "把引擎從瀏覽器裡抽出來。"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 159.35,
          "end": 162.15,
          "en": "And allow you to run it outside of the browser.",
          "zh": "並讓你能在瀏覽器之外執行它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 162.15,
          "end": 164.37,
          "en": "So that you can reuse your JavaScript knowledge,",
          "zh": "這樣你就能重複使用你的 JavaScript 知識，"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 164.37,
          "end": 167.09,
          "en": "but now use JavaScript for different tasks.",
          "zh": "但現在把 JavaScript 用在不同工作上。"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 167.09,
          "end": 170.314,
          "en": "And you can now run JavaScript anywhere with no chance",
          "zh": "而你現在可以用 Node.js 在任何地方執行 JavaScript"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 170.374,
          "end": 171.09,
          "en": "for example,",
          "zh": "例如，"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 171.09,
          "end": 172.63,
          "en": "in a server side and there,",
          "zh": "在伺服器端，而在那裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 172.63,
          "end": 174.32,
          "en": "you have special our features.",
          "zh": "你有特別的 Node 功能。"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 174.32,
          "end": 177.34,
          "en": "Our APIs you can tap in for example,",
          "zh": "Node API，你可以接入，例如"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 177.34,
          "end": 181.232,
          "en": "to work with the file system or handle incoming HTTP",
          "zh": "使用檔案系統，或處理進來的 HTTP"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 181.306,
          "end": 181.98,
          "en": "requests.",
          "zh": "請求。"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 181.98,
          "end": 186.303,
          "en": "Now the syntax concepts, and core features are exactly the",
          "zh": "現在語法、概念與核心功能完全"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 186.377,
          "end": 186.75,
          "en": "same,",
          "zh": "相同，"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 186.75,
          "end": 189.34,
          "en": "though there for what you learn in this course.",
          "zh": "因此你在這門課程學到的東西也是。"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 189.34,
          "end": 193.44,
          "en": "Where we primarily focus on the browser side since simply",
          "zh": "我們主要把焦點放在瀏覽器端，因為那單純"
