          "en": "also easier and more visual to use?",
          "zh": "也更容易、更視覺化？"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 196.03,
          "end": 199.395,
          "en": "Are the same would you learn in the browser applies",
          "zh": "在瀏覽器裡學到的是相同的，也適用"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 199.461,
          "end": 202.43,
          "en": "to node JS in our environments as well as you",
          "zh": "於 Node.js，在其他環境裡也是，如你"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 202.496,
          "end": 203.42000000000002,
          "en": "will also see?",
          "zh": "也會看到？"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 203.42000000000002,
          "end": 206.07999999999998,
          "en": "In the node JS section so that's why we start",
          "zh": "在 Node.js 單元裡，所以這就是為什麼我們從"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 206.139,
          "end": 207.44,
          "en": "with the browser side.",
          "zh": "瀏覽器端開始。"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 207.44,
          "end": 211.39,
          "en": "It's JavaScript origene. There are no alternatives to JavaScript.",
          "zh": "它是 JavaScript 的起源。沒有可以取代 JavaScript 的方案。"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 211.39,
          "end": 214.793,
          "en": "Browser so you might not be interested in using JavaScript",
          "zh": "在瀏覽器裡，所以你也許對使用 JavaScript"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 214.852,
          "end": 217.61,
          "en": "on a server if you are interested in front end.",
          "zh": "在伺服器上不感興趣，如果你對前端有興趣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 217.61,
          "end": 221.096,
          "en": "Browser side web development, though you have to learn JavaScript",
          "zh": "瀏覽器端網頁開發，不過你必須學 JavaScript"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 221.15,
          "end": 223.51,
          "en": "cause that is the only programming language,",
          "zh": "因為那是唯一的程式語言，"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 223.51,
          "end": 225.39,
          "en": "you can use there in the end.",
          "zh": "你最終能在那裡使用的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 225.39,
          "end": 229.079,
          "en": "You can then transfer your knowledge becaus node JS uses",
          "zh": "然後你可以轉移你的知識，因為 Node.js 使用"
