        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 229.145,
          "end": 232.372,
          "en": "the same syntax so you easily learn node JS after",
          "zh": "相同的語法，所以你很容易學會 Node.js，只要先"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 232.438,
          "end": 234.48,
          "en": "learning JavaScript in general.",
          "zh": "學過 JavaScript 的一般用法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 234.48,
          "end": 237.225,
          "en": "Or in the browser. And it's more fun to learn",
          "zh": "或在瀏覽器裡。而學習會更有趣"
