        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 237.286,
          "end": 239.97,
          "en": "JavaScript if you see something on the page.",
          "zh": "如果你在頁面上看到東西的話，JavaScript。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "25650748",
      "title": "A Brief History Of JavaScript",
      "lectureOrder": 12,
      "videoOrder": 10,
      "sourceHash": "bf92da491da3092b8fbb9517c04db6df28639bd33f1cd6ff2aebd62022d7b505",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.18,
          "end": 5,
          "en": "So now that we know what Javascript is and where it runs,",
          "zh": "現在我們知道 JavaScript 是什麼、它在哪裡執行，"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.03,
          "end": 12.06,
          "en": "let's have a very brief overview of the Javascript history so that you know how it evolved over time.",
          "zh": "讓我們非常簡短地看一下 JavaScript 的歷史，讓你知道它如何隨時間演進。"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 12.11,
          "end": 20.31,
          "en": "In 1995, Netscape introduces LiveScript which thereafter was renamed to Javascript.",
          "zh": "1995 年，Netscape 推出 LiveScript，之後改名為 JavaScript。"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 20.36,
          "end": 27.05,
          "en": "Now in 1996, Microsoft also released its own version of Javascript in Internet Explorer.",
          "zh": "1996 年，Microsoft 也在 Internet Explorer 裡發布了自己的 JavaScript 版本。"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 27.05,
          "end": 32.28,
          "en": "So same idea, generally same syntax but also differences,",
          "zh": "所以想法相同、語法大致相同，但也有差異，"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 32.36,
          "end": 33.78,
          "en": "so we already had an issue there.",
          "zh": "所以我們當時就已經有問題了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 33.83,
          "end": 37.2,
          "en": "Back then Javascript also wasn't able to do a lot of things,",
          "zh": "當時 JavaScript 也做不了很多事，"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 37.25,
          "end": 43.13,
          "en": "it was mainly used for a spammy things, for annoying overlays and pop-ups",
          "zh": "它主要被用來做垃圾訊息式的東西、討人厭的覆蓋層與彈出視窗"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 43.13,
          "end": 49.55,
          "en": "but another problem was that you had to write very different scripts for different browsers.",
          "zh": "但另一個問題是，你必須為不同瀏覽器寫非常不同的指令稿。"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 49.55,
          "end": 54.69,
          "en": "In late 1996, people saw that this fragmentation could be a problem",
          "zh": "1996 年底，人們看到這種分裂可能是個問題"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 54.83,
          "end": 61.94,
          "en": "and therefore, Javascript the language was submitted to the ECMA committee to start standardization.",
          "zh": "因此，JavaScript 這門語言被提交給 ECMA 委員會，開始標準化。"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 61.94,
          "end": 67.42,
          "en": "This simply is an organization which will stand responsible for standardizing Javascript",
          "zh": "這只是一個組織，將負責標準化 JavaScript"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 67.46,
          "end": 72.89,
          "en": "so that you have one standard which then could be implemented by multiple browsers. So then we had ongoing",
          "zh": "讓你有一個標準，然後可以被多個瀏覽器實作。所以接著我們有持續的"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 72.89,
          "end": 76.39,
          "en": "standardization efforts until 2005 roughly",
          "zh": "標準化努力，大約直到 2005 年"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 76.46000000000001,
          "end": 84.05,
          "en": "and Microsoft did really join the party, well we know how Microsoft was in the late 90s, early 2000s, ultimately",
          "zh": "而 Microsoft 真的加入了，我們知道 Microsoft 在 90 年代末、2000 年代初是什麼樣子，最終"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 84.05,
          "end": 86.71000000000001,
          "en": "they supported the standardized Javascript version.",
          "zh": "他們支援了標準化的 JavaScript 版本。"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 86.78,
          "end": 93.28999999999999,
          "en": "Still there were differences but we had a more common way of using Javascript.",
          "zh": "仍然有差異，但我們有了更共通的 JavaScript 使用方式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 93.32,
          "end": 99.74000000000001,
          "en": "Now the efforts of standardization continue and we had huge progress until 2011 I'd say",
          "zh": "標準化的努力繼續，我會說直到 2011 年我們有了巨大進展"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 99.97999999999999,
          "end": 106.34,
          "en": "and Microsoft eventually joined forces and became part of the standardization process and of contributing",
          "zh": "而 Microsoft 最終合力加入，成為標準化過程的一部分，並貢獻"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 106.34,
          "end": 111.38,
          "en": "to building that standard and adding new features because that's important.",
          "zh": "於建立那個標準、加入新功能，因為那很重要。"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 111.41,
          "end": 113.4,
          "en": "My timeline ends here, the",
          "zh": "我的時間軸在這裡結束，"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 113.5,
          "end": 116.47999999999999,
          "en": "development of Javascript absolutely does not,",
          "zh": "JavaScript 的發展絕對沒有，"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 116.47999999999999,
          "end": 124.07,
          "en": "I would say especially since 2010, 11, it really picked up and it is under active development.",
          "zh": "我會說尤其從 2010、11 年開始，它真的加速了，而且正在積極開發。"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 124.13,
          "end": 127.1,
          "en": "It's evolving, new features are getting added,",
          "zh": "它在演進，新功能被加入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 127.1,
          "end": 134.48,
          "en": "it's getting a better and better programming language and whilst it was quite clunky around 2006 and 7",
          "zh": "它變成越來越好的程式語言，而雖然它在 2006、7 年左右相當笨重"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 134.48,
          "end": 141.48,
          "en": "and despite standardization, every browser still did its own thing in some regards.",
          "zh": "而且儘管有標準化，每個瀏覽器在某些方面仍各做各的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 141.77,
          "end": 150.05,
          "en": "We nowadays really have a uniform language with some small differences but mainly one core language",
          "zh": "如今我們真的有一種統一的語言，有一些小差異，但主要是一種核心語言"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 150.35,
          "end": 155.66,
          "en": "we can use in different browsers. Still different browsers have their own features you can then use",
          "zh": "我們可以在不同瀏覽器裡使用。不同瀏覽器仍有你可以使用的自己的功能"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 155.66,
          "end": 157.99,
          "en": "but the core language is the same",
          "zh": "但核心語言是相同的"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 158.06,
          "end": 164.48,
          "en": "and in the browser support module later in the course, I'll explain how you find out which differences",
          "zh": "而在課程稍後的瀏覽器支援單元，我會說明你如何找出我們仍然有哪些差異"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 164.51,
          "end": 167.14,
          "en": "we still have and how you work around them.",
          "zh": "以及你如何繞過它們。"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 167.24,
          "end": 173.87,
          "en": "But in the end, we now have a standardized language which is really great to use and we have that thanks",
          "zh": "但到頭來，我們現在有一種標準化的語言，真的很好用，而我們有這個要感謝"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 173.87,
          "end": 177.1,
          "en": "to this ECMA international organization.",
          "zh": "這個 ECMA International 組織。"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 177.11,
          "end": 183.14,
          "en": "Now this organization in the end manages a language called ECMAScript but ECMAScript and Javascript",
          "zh": "這個組織最終管理一種叫做 ECMAScript 的語言，但 ECMAScript 和 JavaScript"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 183.14,
          "end": 192.02,
          "en": "actually have a strong relation. ECMAScript is the actual language which is evolved by the ECMA international",
          "zh": "實際上有很強的關係。ECMAScript 是由 ECMA International"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 192.02,
          "end": 197.7,
          "en": "organization but ECMAScript is then implemented as Javascript by browser vendors,",
          "zh": "組織演進的實際語言，但 ECMAScript 接著被瀏覽器廠商實作成 JavaScript，"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 197.72,
          "end": 203.84,
          "en": "so by the companies working on the browsers. So it is the most famous ECMAScript implementation, Javascript",
          "zh": "也就是開發瀏覽器的公司。所以它是最有名的 ECMAScript 實作，JavaScript"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 203.9,
          "end": 209.27,
          "en": "is that most famous ECMAScript implementation, others would be ActionScript or Jscript and you don't really",
          "zh": "就是那個最有名的 ECMAScript 實作，其他會是 ActionScript 或 JScript，而你並不真的"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 209.27,
          "end": 211.79,
          "en": "need to know those. So Javascript in",
          "zh": "需要知道那些。所以 JavaScript 在"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 211.8,
          "end": 217.28,
          "en": "the end is ECMAScript we could say and we have that organization that evolves ECMAScript and with",
          "zh": "最後我們可以說就是 ECMAScript，而我們有那個演進 ECMAScript 的組織，並且隨著"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 217.28,
          "end": 226.94,
          "en": "every new standard version you could say which is the end then created and finalized, browser vendors",
          "zh": "每一個新的標準版本，你可以說它最終被建立並定案，瀏覽器廠商"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 226.94,
          "end": 232.88,
          "en": "take that and implement it into browsers. So ECMAScript itself isn't directly used but browser vendors",
          "zh": "拿去並實作進瀏覽器。所以 ECMAScript 本身不被直接使用，但瀏覽器廠商"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 232.99,
          "end": 239.9,
          "en": "implement it into their Javascript engines. Each browser comes with its own Javascript engine though and therefore",
          "zh": "把它實作進他們的 JavaScript 引擎。每個瀏覽器都帶著自己的 JavaScript 引擎，因此"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 240.02,
          "end": 246.11,
          "en": "it's each browser and the engine used by the browser which defines which exact features are supported",
          "zh": "是每個瀏覽器、以及瀏覽器使用的引擎，定義了哪些確切功能被支援"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 246.77,
          "end": 253.48,
          "en": "and actually browsers also sometimes implement certain features at an earlier point of time than they're",
          "zh": "而實際上瀏覽器有時也會在功能真正"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 253.52,
          "end": 256.25,
          "en": "really finalized in ECMAScript.",
          "zh": "於 ECMAScript 定案之前，就提早實作某些功能。"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 256.28,
          "end": 262.79,
          "en": "So whilst discussions might still be going on over final implementation details, browser vendors could",
          "zh": "所以雖然討論也許仍在進行最終實作細節，瀏覽器廠商可以"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 262.82,
          "end": 268.58,
          "en": "already go ahead and implement a certain feature in their engine already so that you can already use",
          "zh": "已經先行，在他們的引擎裡實作某個功能，讓你已經可以"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 268.79,
          "end": 275.36,
          "en": "next generation Javascript code earlier in one browser than in the other and that's also something I'll",
          "zh": "在某個瀏覽器比另一個更早使用新一代 JavaScript 程式碼，而那也是我會"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 275.36,
          "end": 281.45,
          "en": "come back to in the browser support module where you will learn how to use next-gen Javascript when",
          "zh": "在瀏覽器支援單元回來談的，你會學到如何在"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 281.45,
          "end": 289.78,
          "en": "writing your code and still ensuring that it runs in all browsers. So ECMAScript is under active development",
          "zh": "寫程式碼時使用新一代 JavaScript，同時仍確保它在所有瀏覽器裡執行。所以 ECMAScript 正在積極開發"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 289.81,
          "end": 297.19,
          "en": "and browser vendors are contributing there as well, are shaping how Javascript looks like and which new",
          "zh": "而瀏覽器廠商也在那裡貢獻，塑造 JavaScript 的樣子，以及哪些新"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 297.19,
          "end": 303.22,
          "en": "features we want there and therefore Javascript is under active development and therefore it's an always",
          "zh": "功能我們想要，因此 JavaScript 正在積極開發，因此它是一種一直"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 303.22,
          "end": 304.61,
          "en": "evolving language.",
          "zh": "在演進的語言。"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 304.63,
          "end": 311.98,
          "en": "Now in this course, you will learn Javascript in the most modern way you can, using all the latest modern",
          "zh": "在這門課程裡，你會用最現代的方式學習 JavaScript，使用所有最新的現代"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 311.98,
          "end": 313,
          "en": "syntax",
          "zh": "語法"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 313.06,
          "end": 323.08,
          "en": "and this is important because in 2015, 2016, Javascript saw a major overhaul, a brand new version you",
          "zh": "而這很重要，因為在 2015、2016 年，JavaScript 有一次重大改版，你幾乎可以說是全新版本"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 323.08,
          "end": 330.52,
          "en": "could almost say with a lot of important changes and many many tutorials and courses actually teach",
          "zh": "有很多重要變更，而很多很多教學與課程實際上教"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 330.52,
          "end": 336.88,
          "en": "you the old Javascript syntax which still works but which is not the most recent one and which has certain",
          "zh": "你舊的 JavaScript 語法，它仍然能用，但不是最新的，而且有某些"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 336.88,
          "end": 337.81,
          "en": "downsides",
          "zh": "缺點"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 338.02,
          "end": 344.77,
          "en": "and then they later switch to the modern syntax. In this course, you will learn the most modern syntax",
          "zh": "然後之後才切換到現代語法。在這門課程中，你會學到最新的語法"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 344.77,
          "end": 346.31,
          "en": "right from the start.",
          "zh": "從一開始就會使用。"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 346.33,
          "end": 351.25,
          "en": "I will also show you the older one because you will still see it in other tutorials and code snippets",
          "zh": "我也會給你看較舊的，因為你在其他教學與程式碼片段裡仍會看到它"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 351.25,
          "end": 357.15999999999997,
          "en": "and you should be able to understand those but we start with the modern one and we stick to the modern",
          "zh": "而你應該能理解那些，但我們從現代的開始，並堅持現代的"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 357.15999999999997,
          "end": 361.24,
          "en": "one, so you learn all the latest Javascript in this course.",
          "zh": "所以你在這門課程裡學到所有最新的 JavaScript。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "15918678",
      "title": "Setting Up a Development Environment",
      "lectureOrder": 13,
      "videoOrder": 11,
      "sourceHash": "17d3846a2daeec795ab6f3d9913c285227226a3deebbe94837f87245a5a56b1f",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.12,
          "end": 6.12,
          "en": "Now hopefully, you're now excited to get started and so am I. Before we get started, we just have to make",
          "zh": "現在希望你已經迫不及待想開始，我也是。在我們開始之前，我們只需要確認"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 6.12,
          "end": 9.29,
          "en": "sure that we have a proper development environment,",
          "zh": "我們有一個適當的開發環境，"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 9.39,
          "end": 16.8,
          "en": "so a good environment where we can write code and dive into Javascript because writing code in a",
          "zh": "所以是一個好的環境，讓我們能寫程式碼並深入 JavaScript，因為在"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 16.8,
          "end": 24.18,
          "en": "system text editor as we did it earlier in this module is really too cumbersome, not really a great experience.",
          "zh": "系統文字編輯器裡寫程式碼，像我們稍早在這個單元做的，真的太麻煩，體驗並不好。"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 24.21,
          "end": 25.47,
          "en": "If we have a look at that,",
          "zh": "如果我們看一下那個，"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 25.47,
          "end": 30.78,
          "en": "well this is really hard to read and if we write a lot of code there, that's not fun at all.",
          "zh": "嗯這真的很難讀，而且如果我們在那裡寫很多程式碼，一點都不好玩。"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 30.78,
          "end": 36.57,
          "en": "So we need a better code editor which makes working on our code easier, which takes some work off us",
          "zh": "所以我們需要更好的程式碼編輯器，讓處理程式碼更輕鬆，替我們分擔一些工作"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 37.02,
          "end": 40.27,
          "en": "and makes it more pleasant in general",
          "zh": "而且整體上更愉快"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 40.38,
          "end": 45.78,
          "en": "and we also need an environment where we can test our web page and our code.",
          "zh": "我們也需要一個環境，能測試我們的網頁和程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 45.78,
          "end": 49.71,
          "en": "Now for the editor, I strongly recommend using Visual Studio Code,",
          "zh": "現在說到編輯器，我強烈建議使用 Visual Studio Code，"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 49.83,
          "end": 56.9,
          "en": "this is not the only code editor or IDE, for integrated development environment, which you can use",
          "zh": "這不是你能用的唯一程式碼編輯器或 IDE，也就是整合開發環境，"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 56.97,
          "end": 60.01,
          "en": "but it is free and it's really really great.",
          "zh": "但它是免費的，而且真的非常好。"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 60.01,
          "end": 65.5,
          "en": "It's super fast, very modern, under active development, really extensible and customizable,",
          "zh": "它超快、非常現代、仍在積極開發、真的可擴充也可自訂，"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 65.52,
          "end": 71.26,
          "en": "it's my strong recommendation to use Visual Studio Code and we'll install it together in just a second.",
          "zh": "我強烈建議使用 Visual Studio Code，我們等一下會一起安裝。"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 71.31,
          "end": 76.08,
          "en": "You can combine it with a lot of extensions which you can install from inside Visual Studio Code and",
          "zh": "你可以搭配很多擴充功能，可以從 Visual Studio Code 裡面安裝"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 76.08,
          "end": 78.93,
          "en": "you can configure it to suit your needs",
          "zh": "你也可以設定它來符合你的需求"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 78.93,
          "end": 84.15,
          "en": "and I have a module where we'll dive deeper into that but I'll also show you a basic setup which I use",
          "zh": "而我有一個單元會更深入那個，但我也會給你看我使用的基本設定"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 84.36,
          "end": 89.97,
          "en": "right in this lecture. Now for testing and seeing our code in action,",
          "zh": "就在這一堂。現在說到測試並看程式碼實際運作，"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 89.97,
          "end": 91.78999999999999,
          "en": "we also need a browser and there,",
          "zh": "我們也需要瀏覽器，而在那裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 91.83,
          "end": 93.74000000000001,
          "en": "I recommend using Google Chrome.",
          "zh": "我建議使用 Google Chrome。"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 93.9,
          "end": 97.22,
          "en": "Of course we will write code that runs in all browsers",
          "zh": "當然我們會寫在所有瀏覽器都能跑的程式碼"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 97.22,
          "end": 104.21000000000001,
          "en": "we want to support, more on that in the browser support module but for development, Chrome is really amazing,",
          "zh": "我們想支援的那些，瀏覽器支援單元會再談，但對開發來說，Chrome 真的很厲害，"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 104.22,
          "end": 107.34,
          "en": "It has a lot of features that make development easier",
          "zh": "它有很多讓開發更輕鬆的功能"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 107.34,
          "end": 112.53,
          "en": "and my strong recommendation therefore is to use Chrome for development even if you normally use a different",
          "zh": "因此我強烈建議開發時使用 Chrome，即使你平常用不同的"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 112.53,
          "end": 113.06,
          "en": "browser.",
          "zh": "瀏覽器。"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 113.1,
          "end": 118.59,
          "en": "Really use Chrome to have the same result as I do here and to follow along smoothly. Again,",
          "zh": "真的用 Chrome，才能得到和我這裡一樣的結果，並順利跟著做。再次，"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 118.59,
          "end": 123.88,
          "en": "later you will learn how to make sure that the code runs in all browsers where it needs to run.",
          "zh": "稍後你會學到怎麼確保程式碼在所有需要執行的瀏覽器裡都能跑。"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 124.14,
          "end": 130.32,
          "en": "Now in Chrome, we will also use the developer tools which are built into Chrome, to have a look at our code,",
          "zh": "現在在 Chrome 裡，我們也會使用內建在 Chrome 的開發者工具，來看看我們的程式碼、"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 130.35,
          "end": 133.74,
          "en": "debug it and so on and I'll also have a look at that",
          "zh": "除錯等等，而我也會看那個"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 133.74,
          "end": 137.34,
          "en": "in the development and debugging section later in the course.",
          "zh": "在課程稍後的開發與除錯區段。"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 137.34,
          "end": 143.61,
          "en": "But with that, let's get started with the code editor, with the IDE, with Visual Studio Code. For that, you",
          "zh": "但就這樣，讓我們從程式碼編輯器開始，從 IDE，從 Visual Studio Code。為此，你"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 143.61,
          "end": 148.56,
          "en": "can simply google for Visual Studio Code and you should find this page, code.visualstudio.com,",
          "zh": "可以單純搜尋 Visual Studio Code，你應該會找到這個頁面，code.visualstudio.com，"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 148.86,
          "end": 154.95,
          "en": "there you can learn more about this code editor and you can always check out the docs if you're interested",
          "zh": "在那裡你可以更了解這個程式碼編輯器，如果你有興趣"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 154.95,
          "end": 160.2,
          "en": "in diving deeper and of course you can also download an installer. Here it should already pick the right one",
          "zh": "深入，隨時可以看文件，當然你也可以下載安裝程式。這裡它應該已經選好正確的"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 160.2,
          "end": 166.17000000000002,
          "en": "for your operating system, otherwise choose one from the dropdown, Visual Studio Code is available for",
          "zh": "給你的作業系統，否則從下拉選一個，Visual Studio Code 可用於"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 166.17000000000002,
          "end": 172.92000000000002,
          "en": "Mac, for Windows, for Linux. Simply download the installer from this page where you then also see some",
          "zh": "Mac、Windows、Linux。只要從這個頁面下載安裝程式，那裡你也會看到一些"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 172.92000000000002,
          "end": 179.54,
          "en": "getting started instructions and run through the installation process once you did so. It's a straightforward",
          "zh": "入門說明，下載之後跑完安裝流程。這是直截了當的"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 179.63,
          "end": 185.09,
          "en": "installation process, nothing fancy about that, you can just go through the download and installer and install",
          "zh": "安裝流程，沒什麼花俏的，你只要完成下載和安裝程式，並把"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 185.09,
          "end": 192.22,
          "en": "Visual Studio Code on your system. Once you did that, you can open the editor and it should look something",
          "zh": "Visual Studio Code 裝到你的系統上。一旦你做完，你可以打開編輯器，它看起來應該"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 192.22,
          "end": 193.24,
          "en": "like this.",
          "zh": "像這樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 193.24,
          "end": 199.39,
          "en": "Now if it doesn't have this dark mode look here, you can change the theme by going to your options here,",
          "zh": "現在如果它這裡沒有這個深色模式外觀，你可以改主題，到這裡的選項、"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 199.9,
          "end": 207.01,
          "en": "preferences and then color theme or using the shortcuts you see there, under windows you will find the",
          "zh": "偏好設定，然後色彩主題，或用你在那裡看到的快捷鍵，在 Windows 你會在"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 207.02,
          "end": 212.59,
          "en": "preferences under file. When you choose color theme, you can pick a theme and you see a bunch of themes",
          "zh": "檔案下面找到偏好設定。當你選擇色彩主題，你可以挑一個主題，你會看到一堆主題"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 212.59,
          "end": 218.89,
          "en": "available. You can simply cycle through these themes with the arrow keys and check out which theme you",
          "zh": "可用。你可以用方向鍵輪流看這些主題，看看你"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 218.89,
          "end": 219.6,
          "en": "want to use.",
          "zh": "想用哪一個。"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 219.61,
          "end": 225.76,
          "en": "Now I like this dark plus theme but of course you can go with the theme you like. You also see a",
          "zh": "現在我喜歡這個 Dark+ 主題，但當然你可以用你喜歡的主題。你也會看到"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 225.76,
          "end": 228.49,
          "en": "bunch of elements here at the start,",
          "zh": "一開始這裡有一堆元素，"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 228.49,
          "end": 233.2,
          "en": "you can also customize this under view, appearance and there for example, you could get rid of that status",
          "zh": "你也可以在檢視、外觀底下自訂這個，例如你可以拿掉底部那個狀態"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 233.2,
          "end": 235.71,
          "en": "bar at the bottom if you wanted to.",
          "zh": "列，如果你想的話。"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 235.72,
          "end": 240.7,
          "en": "Now I will add it back but you can tweak this to your likings to make sure that you see the information",
          "zh": "現在我會把它加回來，但你可以依自己的喜好調整，確保你看到"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 240.7,
          "end": 241.95,
          "en": "you want to see.",
          "zh": "你想看的資訊。"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 242.26,
          "end": 249.61,
          "en": "Now as you see, we don't see our code here, so we can click open folder here or choose file open and then",
          "zh": "現在如你所見，我們這裡看不到程式碼，所以我們可以點這裡的開啟資料夾，或選檔案、開啟，然後"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 249.61,
          "end": 251.72,
          "en": "choose the folder you do want to open",
          "zh": "選擇你想開啟的資料夾"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 251.74,
          "end": 257.17,
          "en": "and here, I chose the folder with the starting code we saw earlier in this course, you'll find it",
          "zh": "而這裡，我選了這門課稍早看到的起始程式碼資料夾，你會發現它"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 257.17,
          "end": 263.74,
          "en": "attached to this lecture again. Simply open the whole folder and now this will load this project into",
          "zh": "再次附在這一堂。只要開啟整個資料夾，現在這會把這個專案載入"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 263.74,
          "end": 265.94,
          "en": "Visual Studio Code here.",
          "zh": "這裡的 Visual Studio Code。"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 265.99,
          "end": 268.48,
          "en": "Now the colors of these files might look different,",
          "zh": "現在這些檔案的顏色可能看起來不一樣，"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 268.48,
          "end": 271.36,
          "en": "that has something to do with version control,",
          "zh": "那和版本控制有關，"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 271.36,
          "end": 275.89,
          "en": "something we don't have to worry about right now but you should see these files and folders here.",
          "zh": "我們現在不必擔心，但你應該會在這裡看到這些檔案和資料夾。"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 275.89,
          "end": 278.88,
          "en": "Again you won't see the gitignore and vscode file here,",
          "zh": "再次，你不會在這裡看到 .gitignore 和 .vscode 檔案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 278.95,
          "end": 282.03,
          "en": "these are folders and files only I have here for my configuration,",
          "zh": "這些是只有我這裡有的資料夾和檔案，為了我的設定，"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 282.13,
          "end": 286.75,
          "en": "you should see the assets, info and index.html folders and file though.",
          "zh": "不過你應該會看到 assets、info 和 index.html 這些資料夾和檔案。"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 286.76,
          "end": 292.08,
          "en": "Now what might also be different for you however is the icons you see here.",
          "zh": "現在對你來說也可能不一樣的是你在這裡看到的圖示。"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 292.15,
          "end": 297.46,
          "en": "Now that's coming from a so-called extension I added, extensions are plugins you can add into your editor",
          "zh": "現在那來自我加的所謂擴充功能，擴充功能是你可以加進編輯器的外掛"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 297.46,
          "end": 300.37,
          "en": "to change it and tweak it to your likings.",
          "zh": "用來改變它、依你的喜好調整。"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 300.49,
          "end": 305.06,
          "en": "You can add plugins and extensions by going here to these extensions part,",
          "zh": "你可以到這裡這個擴充功能區來加外掛和擴充功能，"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 305.23,
          "end": 309.04,
          "en": "you can also get there by clicking on view extensions",
          "zh": "你也可以點檢視、擴充功能到那裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 309.04,
          "end": 314.89,
          "en": "and that's actually how I will navigate and I will remove that activity bar here on the left and just",
          "zh": "而那其實是我會用來導覽的方式，我會拿掉左邊這裡的活動列，只"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 314.89,
          "end": 316.54,
          "en": "navigate around with view",
          "zh": "用檢視來四處導覽"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 316.54,
          "end": 318.9,
          "en": "and then here, these shortcuts or these options",
          "zh": "然後這裡，這些快捷鍵或這些選項"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 318.97,
          "end": 320.78,
          "en": "and now we're on the extensions part.",
          "zh": "而現在我們在擴充功能區。"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 320.78,
          "end": 326.23,
          "en": "Now I already got a bunch of extensions installed, most of them are not required here for this development",
          "zh": "現在我已經裝了一堆擴充功能，其中大多數在這個開發裡不是必要的"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 326.29,
          "end": 330.61,
          "en": "but there are some which I do recommend using and one is the material",
          "zh": "但有一些我確實建議使用，其中一個是 Material"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 330.61,
          "end": 335.02,
          "en": "icon extension. You can just search for material icon and you should find the material",
          "zh": "Icon 擴充功能。你可以搜尋 material icon，你應該會找到 Material"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 335.02,
          "end": 336.49,
          "en": "icon theme package.",
          "zh": "Icon Theme 套件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 336.58,
          "end": 342.01,
          "en": "Now this is totally optional but you can install it, you will have an install button here to get the same",
          "zh": "現在這完全是選擇性的，但你可以安裝它，這裡會有安裝按鈕，來得到和我一樣的"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 342.01,
          "end": 343.42,
          "en": "file icons as I do,",
          "zh": "檔案圖示，"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 343.42,
          "end": 351.04,
          "en": "so you can install it and then load the extension with the buttons you see here too add the same icons.",
          "zh": "所以你可以安裝它，然後用你在這裡看到的按鈕載入擴充功能，加上同樣的圖示。"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 351.04,
          "end": 352,
          "en": "Another extension",
          "zh": "另一個擴充功能"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 352,
          "end": 355.09000000000003,
          "en": "I recommend using is prettier.",
          "zh": "我建議使用的是 Prettier。"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 355.09000000000003,
          "end": 360.68,
          "en": "You can search for prettier, written like this and install and enable this extension,",
          "zh": "你可以搜尋 prettier，寫法像這樣，然後安裝並啟用這個擴充功能，"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 360.73,
          "end": 364.6,
          "en": "this is an extension which helps us with code formatting.",
          "zh": "這是一個幫助我們做程式碼格式化的擴充功能。"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 364.6,
          "end": 370.39,
          "en": "Now code formatting allows us to write clean and well-readable code because as you will see, a lot of",
          "zh": "現在程式碼格式化讓我們能寫乾淨、好讀的程式碼，因為如你將看到的，很多"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 370.39,
          "end": 375.1,
          "en": "code is valid from a technical perspective but can be hard to read,",
          "zh": "程式碼從技術角度是有效的，但可能很難讀，"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 375.1,
          "end": 377.8,
          "en": "I'll show you an example in a second.",
          "zh": "我等一下會給你看一個例子。"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 377.89,
          "end": 380.2,
          "en": "With that, we have all the core extensions",
          "zh": "這樣，我們就有所有核心擴充功能"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 380.2,
          "end": 381.52,
          "en": "I would recommend here,",
          "zh": "我會在這裡建議的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 381.61,
          "end": 386.6,
          "en": "you don't need the other extensions I have here, they are not even related Javascript development necessarily",
          "zh": "你不需要我這裡的其他擴充功能，它們甚至不一定和 JavaScript 開發有關"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 386.8,
          "end": 389.33,
          "en": "and therefore we should be good here.",
          "zh": "因此我們這裡應該就夠了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 389.38,
          "end": 394.15,
          "en": "You can now go back to the explorer view here to see your files again",
          "zh": "你現在可以回到這裡的檔案總管檢視，再次看到你的檔案"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 394.15,
          "end": 400.48,
          "en": "and now let me show you how you should basically configure your project and what this code formatting",
          "zh": "現在讓我給你看你基本上該怎麼設定專案，以及這個程式碼格式化"
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 400.48,
          "end": 401.27,
          "en": "is all about.",
          "zh": "是怎麼回事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 401.29,
          "end": 406.9,
          "en": "For that, let's open the assets folder, scripts in there, app.js and there you see the script I'm giving to",
          "zh": "為此，讓我們打開 assets 資料夾，裡面的 scripts、app.js，那裡你看到我給"
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 406.9,
          "end": 407.9,
          "en": "you. Now",
          "zh": "你的腳本。現在"
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 408.15999999999997,
          "end": 415.57,
          "en": "you already see here why we're using a code editor, this and also in the HTML file is much more readable",
          "zh": "你已經在這裡看到為什麼我們用程式碼編輯器，這個以及 HTML 檔案都好讀得多"
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 415.69,
          "end": 416.9,
          "en": "than this here,",
          "zh": "比這裡這個，"
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 416.95,
          "end": 417.53,
          "en": "right.",
          "zh": "對吧。"
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 417.55,
          "end": 418.78,
          "en": "It's much more readable,",
          "zh": "它好讀得多，"
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 418.78,
          "end": 421.03,
          "en": "keywords are highlighted,",
          "zh": "關鍵字有醒目提示，"
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 421.06,
          "end": 429.04,
          "en": "we also get information if we hover over something, we get useful auto completion if we type and so on",
          "zh": "如果我們把游標停在某樣東西上也會得到資訊，打字時會得到有用的自動完成等等"
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 429.06,
          "end": 433.15,
          "en": "and you'll see all of that throughout this course as we write code.",
          "zh": "而你會在整門課寫程式碼時看到這一切。"
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 433.15,
          "end": 437.38,
          "en": "You don't need to understand this code here of course, we'll learn all about that throughout this course",
          "zh": "你當然不必理解這裡這段程式碼，我們會在整門課學到那一切"
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 437.38,
          "end": 442.35,
          "en": "but I want to show you this auto formatting. Let's say here in line 6,",
          "zh": "但我想給你看這個自動格式化。假設這裡在第 6 行，"
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 442.51,
          "end": 447.3,
          "en": "I don't have this whitespace at the beginning or I even have code like that.",
          "zh": "我開頭沒有這個空白，或我甚至有像那樣的程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 447.34,
          "end": 452.65,
          "en": "Technically this is valid code, I can already tell you that, Javascript is able to understand and execute",
          "zh": "技術上這是有效的程式碼，我現在就可以告訴你，JavaScript 能夠理解並執行"
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 452.65,
          "end": 459.44,
          "en": "this code but to us humans, it's a bit harder to read and that's where we can use so-called auto formatting.",
          "zh": "這段程式碼，但對我們人類來說，它比較難讀，而那就是我們可以使用所謂自動格式化的地方。"
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 459.67,
          "end": 468.85,
          "en": "If you go to code, preferences, keyboard shortcuts and there you search for format document, you will find",
          "zh": "如果你到程式碼、偏好設定、鍵盤快捷鍵，然後搜尋 format document，你會找到"
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 468.85,
          "end": 473.74,
          "en": "this shortcut with a certain shortcut attached to it, if you don't have one here, you can right click",
          "zh": "這個快捷鍵，上面綁了某個快捷鍵，如果這裡沒有，你可以右鍵"
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 473.74,
          "end": 477.94,
          "en": "on this and change the key binding to assign a shortcut",
          "zh": "點這個並改變按鍵繫結，指定一個快捷鍵"
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 477.94,
          "end": 483.91,
          "en": "and this is a shortcut you can then press to auto format your code. You saw that, the code magically",
          "zh": "而這是你之後可以按來自動格式化程式碼的快捷鍵。你看到了，程式碼神奇地"
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 483.91,
          "end": 485.93,
          "en": "changed to a more readable version,",
          "zh": "變成更好讀的版本，"
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 485.94,
          "end": 493.63,
          "en": "this is something where prettier helps us. Now in general of course, you can tweak your keyboard shortcuts",
          "zh": "這是 Prettier 幫助我們的地方。現在一般來說當然，你可以在這裡調整鍵盤快捷鍵"
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 493.63,
          "end": 499.1,
          "en": "here, not just the format document but any shortcut you might be using here in these settings",
          "zh": "不只是 format document，而是你在這些設定裡可能會用到的任何快捷鍵"
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 499.11,
          "end": 503.56,
          "en": "and you got a lot of shortcuts can use, of course you can use the official documentation to learn all",
          "zh": "而你有很多可以用的快捷鍵，當然你可以用官方文件來學"
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 503.56,
          "end": 506.32,
          "en": "about Visual Studio Code already if you want to.",
          "zh": "所有關於 Visual Studio Code 的事，如果你想的話。"
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 506.32,
          "end": 511.93,
          "en": "I will also share some useful hints with you in the development and debugging section later in the course.",
          "zh": "我也會在課程稍後的開發與除錯區段跟你分享一些有用的提示。"
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 512.59,
          "end": 517.48,
          "en": "One thing which I would recommend that you do is that you also dive into preferences settings right now",
          "zh": "我建議你現在也做的一件事，是現在就深入偏好設定"
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 517.48,
          "end": 521.59,
          "en": "though and there, you can switch between user and workspace settings.",
          "zh": "不過，而在那裡，你可以在使用者設定和工作區設定之間切換。"
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 521.68,
          "end": 527.8,
          "en": "Basically user settings are settings that apply to all projects you manage with Visual Studio Code, workspace",
          "zh": "基本上使用者設定是套用到你用 Visual Studio Code 管理的所有專案，工作區"
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 527.86,
          "end": 530.22,
          "en": "settings only apply to this project,",
          "zh": "設定只套用到這個專案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 530.29,
          "end": 535.2,
          "en": "for example here I got a workspace setting and that's where this .vscode folder is coming from, where",
          "zh": "例如這裡我有一個工作區設定，而那就是這個 .vscode 資料夾的來源，在那裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 535.26,
          "end": 539.18,
          "en": "I set the zoom level to 6 so that this is more readable to you,",
          "zh": "我把縮放層級設成 6，讓這個對你更好讀，"
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 539.23,
          "end": 541.4,
          "en": "that's all I have in there. Now",
          "zh": "我在那裡面只有這些。現在"
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 541.42,
          "end": 548.44,
          "en": "under preferences settings, you can tweak your user or your project specific settings and there for example,",
          "zh": "在偏好設定底下，你可以調整使用者或專案專屬設定，而在那裡例如，"
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 548.44,
          "end": 554.61,
          "en": "you can search for prettier and configure prettier here as you see and the various options it offers",
          "zh": "你可以搜尋 prettier 並在這裡設定 Prettier，如你所見，以及它提供的各種選項"
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 554.61,
          "end": 558.1,
          "en": "to you to format code as you want,",
          "zh": "讓你依你想要的方式格式化程式碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 558.1,
          "end": 564.47,
          "en": "for example some things I have set up there is that I want to add semicolons at the end of every line,",
          "zh": "例如我在那裡設定的一些東西是，我想在每一行結尾加分號，"
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 564.48,
          "end": 565.53,
          "en": "I have this checked.",
          "zh": "我有勾選這個。"
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 565.53,
          "end": 571.57,
          "en": "I have single quote check to use single quotes for text and I have a tab width of two.",
          "zh": "我有勾選單引號，文字用單引號，而我的 tab 寬度是 2。"
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 571.62,
          "end": 572.97,
          "en": "Now this is not something you have to do,",
          "zh": "現在這不是你必須做的事，"
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 572.97,
          "end": 577.77,
          "en": "these are just my settings in case you want to have the same code output as I have it here.",
          "zh": "這些只是我的設定，以防你想要和我這裡一樣的程式碼輸出。"
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 577.92,
          "end": 584.91,
          "en": "And with that, we have a basic editor setup which we can use to write our code throughout this course.",
          "zh": "就這樣，我們有一個基本的編輯器設定，可以用來在整門課寫程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 584.91,
          "end": 586.48,
          "en": "Now let's come back to the browser.",
          "zh": "現在讓我們回到瀏覽器。"
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 586.59,
          "end": 592.38,
          "en": "As I said, I recommend that you use Chrome there and you might want to use incognito mode to avoid any",
          "zh": "如我說的，我建議你在那裡用 Chrome，而你可能想用無痕模式，避免任何"
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 592.38,
          "end": 598.11,
          "en": "distractions by any Chrome extensions you might have installed which might interfere with your web page",
          "zh": "你可能安裝的 Chrome 擴充功能造成干擾，那些可能干擾你的網頁"
        },
        {
          "id": 136,
          "start": 598.41,
          "end": 604.95,
          "en": "and maybe do something which is not caused by your code but by some extension. Also important in Chrome",
          "zh": "也許做了一些不是你的程式碼造成、而是某個擴充功能造成的事。在 Chrome 裡同樣重要的"
        },
        {
          "id": 137,
          "start": 605.04,
          "end": 611.49,
          "en": "are the developer tools. You can get there by using view, developer, developer tools or the shortcut which",
          "zh": "是開發者工具。你可以透過檢視、開發人員、開發人員工具，或快捷鍵過去，那個"
        },
        {
          "id": 138,
          "start": 611.49,
          "end": 617.33,
          "en": "is shown there and these are the developer tools we'll also spend a lot of time in, I'll zoom in a bit",
          "zh": "顯示在那裡，而這些就是我們也會花很多時間的開發者工具，我會放大一點"
        },
        {
          "id": 139,
          "start": 617.33,
          "end": 623.52,
          "en": "here to make it bit bigger and there for example, we have this console where we can output some development",
          "zh": "這裡讓它大一點，而在那裡例如，我們有這個主控台，可以輸出一些開發"
        },
        {
          "id": 140,
          "start": 623.52,
          "end": 628.59,
          "en": "log messages, something we'll do throughout the course. We have the elements tab where we can see the",
          "zh": "日誌訊息，整門課我們都會做。我們有元素分頁，可以看到"
        },
        {
          "id": 141,
          "start": 628.59,
          "end": 631.2,
          "en": "rendered HTML content and so on.",
          "zh": "渲染出來的 HTML 內容等等。"
        },
        {
          "id": 142,
          "start": 631.2,
          "end": 635.64,
          "en": "Now one important setting I want you to make here in the developer tools to also have the same output",
          "zh": "現在我想讓你在開發者工具裡做的一個重要設定，好讓這裡的輸出"
        },
        {
          "id": 143,
          "start": 635.64,
          "end": 639.42,
          "en": "and behavior here as I have it, in a console area",
          "zh": "和行為也和我的一樣，在主控台區域"
        },
        {
          "id": 144,
          "start": 639.42,
          "end": 643.12,
          "en": "if you click on the gear icon here, make sure preserve log is not check.",
          "zh": "如果你點這裡的齒輪圖示，確認 preserve log 沒有勾選。"
        },
        {
          "id": 145,
          "start": 643.14,
          "end": 647.76,
          "en": "This simply makes sure that whenever you reload the page, this log will be emptied and we see a new",
          "zh": "這只是確保每當你重新載入頁面，這個日誌會被清空，而我們看到"
        },
        {
          "id": 146,
          "start": 647.76,
          "end": 650.21,
          "en": "log output for the currently running page,",
          "zh": "目前正在跑的頁面的新日誌輸出，"
        },
        {
          "id": 147,
          "start": 650.26,
          "end": 654.79,
          "en": "now that's all. Now we'll have a close look at the developer tools in a separate module,",
          "zh": "現在就這樣。現在我們會在單獨的單元仔細看開發者工具，"
        },
        {
          "id": 148,
          "start": 654.84,
          "end": 660.72,
          "en": "I just already want you to be aware of them and I want you to make sure that you use Chrome and have a",
          "zh": "我只是已經想讓你知道它們，而且我想確保你使用 Chrome，並有"
        },
        {
          "id": 149,
          "start": 660.72,
          "end": 664.65,
          "en": "properly setup editor and with that, we're all set,",
          "zh": "正確設定好的編輯器，就這樣，我們都準備好了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 150,
          "start": 664.77,
          "end": 670.62,
          "en": "we can now dive into Javascript, its basics and get started learning this amazing language.",
          "zh": "我們現在可以深入 JavaScript、它的基礎，並開始學這個很棒的語言。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "15853188",
      "title": "Module Introduction",
      "lectureOrder": 15,
      "videoOrder": 12,
      "sourceHash": "cedbb6b35e21a844b291c4e03a9127d0b42d10a7a1883d6c9837503b7e9b73d2",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.31,
          "end": 9.09,
          "en": "So let's dive right into Javascript, into its core syntax and some core features which you'll need in",
          "zh": "那麼讓我們直接深入 JavaScript，深入它的核心語法，以及一些你在"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 9.21,
          "end": 15.2,
          "en": "any Javascript program you're going to write, specifically in this course module,",
          "zh": "任何你要寫的 JavaScript 程式裡都會需要的核心功能，具體在這個課程單元，"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 15.3,
          "end": 18.6,
          "en": "we'll have a look at the core syntax, so how you write",
          "zh": "我們會看核心語法，也就是你怎麼寫"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 18.6,
          "end": 26.52,
          "en": "valid Javascript code. We'll explore variables and understand what we use them for, how we create them,",
          "zh": "有效的 JavaScript 程式碼。我們會探索變數，並理解我們用它們做什麼、怎麼建立它們、"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 26.52,
          "end": 32.83,
          "en": "how we use them in our program and with which kind of data we can work in our program.",
          "zh": "怎麼在程式裡使用它們，以及我們能在程式裡處理哪種資料。"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 32.92,
          "end": 35.09,
          "en": "We'll have a look at operators,",
          "zh": "我們會看運算子，"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 35.13,
          "end": 42.27,
          "en": "so how we can actually run calculations and execute some code by combining values and by doing something",
          "zh": "也就是我們實際上怎麼做計算，並透過組合值、做某件事來執行一些程式碼"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 42.27,
          "end": 43.36,
          "en": "useful",
          "zh": "有用的"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 43.5,
          "end": 51.06,
          "en": "and we'll also explore and use functions, an important language construct which you'll find in actually",
          "zh": "我們也會探索並使用函式，一個重要的語言構造，你其實會在"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 51.06,
          "end": 54.24,
          "en": "pretty much any programming language you can work with",
          "zh": "幾乎任何你能用的程式語言裡找到"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 54.33,
          "end": 56.5,
          "en": "and therefore it's also part of Javascript and",
          "zh": "因此它也是 JavaScript 的一部分，而"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 56.5,
          "end": 62.4,
          "en": "here we'll have a look at what functions are, why we use them and how we use them and we'll do all",
          "zh": "這裡我們會看函式是什麼、為什麼用它們、怎麼用它們，而我們會做這"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 62.4,
          "end": 63.11,
          "en": "of that,",
          "zh": "一切，"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 63.21,
          "end": 69.69,
          "en": "all these things in the context of a basic application we're working on where we can also see something",
          "zh": "所有這些事都在我們正在做的一個基本應用程式的脈絡裡，在那裡我們也能在"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 69.69,
          "end": 74.97,
          "en": "on the screen and where we see these things come together in a real life example.",
          "zh": "螢幕上看到東西，並在一個真實例子裡看到這些東西湊在一起。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "15853192",
      "title": "Setting Up the Project",
      "lectureOrder": 16,
      "videoOrder": 13,
      "sourceHash": "984c80c1d682821ad493a2f7a90ab52b85aed4baf6cdb8841d89480119ee8424",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.26,
          "end": 9.27,
          "en": "Now for that, we need a basic website where we can use Javascript and I'm using a website here",
          "zh": "現在為此，我們需要一個基本網站，能在上面使用 JavaScript，而我這裡用的是一個網站"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 9.28,
          "end": 15.94,
          "en": "and I'm not running Javascript on the server as I also mentioned in the first course module because",
          "zh": "而且我不是在伺服器上跑 JavaScript，就像我在第一個課程單元也提到的，因為"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 15.94,
          "end": 21.7,
          "en": "I find it more interesting to learn Javascript if you can see something visual on the screen and a website",
          "zh": "我覺得如果你能在螢幕上看到視覺的東西，學 JavaScript 更有趣，而網站"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 21.7,
          "end": 23.26,
          "en": "is something visual",
          "zh": "是視覺的東西"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 23.26,
          "end": 30.82,
          "en": "which is why I'll use that. Now for that, for this basic website, attached you'll find a starting project,",
          "zh": "所以我會用那個。現在為此，為了這個基本網站，附件裡你會找到起始專案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 30.82,
          "end": 37.36,
          "en": "the starting code which you should download and extract and then pull into a folder which you then open",
          "zh": "起始程式碼，你應該下載並解壓縮，然後放進一個資料夾，然後你再打開"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 37.36,
          "end": 40.38,
          "en": "with your favorite IDE or a code editor,",
          "zh": "用你喜歡的 IDE 或程式碼編輯器，"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 40.45,
          "end": 47.37,
          "en": "in my case I'm using Visual Studio Code which is the tool I explained in the first course module set up",
          "zh": "以我來說我用 Visual Studio Code，那是我在第一個課程單元解釋的工具，設定"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 47.53,
          "end": 48.63,
          "en": "as I explained there,",
          "zh": "如我在那裡解釋的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 48.64,
          "end": 54.07,
          "en": "so I'm just using the set up and that tool I explained in the first course module.",
          "zh": "所以我只是用第一個課程單元解釋的那個設定和工具。"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 54.43,
          "end": 62.62,
          "en": "So open the extracted attachment with that tool here by going to file open and you should then find",
          "zh": "所以用那個工具打開解壓縮的附件，到檔案、開啟，然後你應該會找到"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 62.98,
          "end": 65.37,
          "en": "a folder structure that looks like this.",
          "zh": "看起來像這樣的資料夾結構。"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 65.38,
          "end": 70.36,
          "en": "Now one important note, the .vscode folder might not be there in your setup,",
          "zh": "現在一個重要注意，你的設定裡可能沒有 .vscode 資料夾，"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 70.36,
          "end": 76.78,
          "en": "this is just a folder created by my IDE, by Visual Studio Code to manage some settings, in this case",
          "zh": "這只是我的 IDE、Visual Studio Code 建立的資料夾，用來管理一些設定，在這個例子"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 76.78999999999999,
          "end": 82.09,
          "en": "the zoom level which I set so that you can clearly see all the code I write, so that's not something you",
          "zh": "是縮放層級，我設定它好讓你能清楚看到我寫的所有程式碼，所以那不是你"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 82.09,
          "end": 84.28999999999999,
          "en": "have typically and gitignore,",
          "zh": "通常會有的，還有 .gitignore，"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 84.31,
          "end": 87.45,
          "en": "I have this because I am also working with Git",
          "zh": "我有這個是因為我也在用 Git"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 87.46000000000001,
          "end": 93.64,
          "en": "which is a source control management system and you don't need to use that, you don't even need to know",
          "zh": "那是原始碼控制管理系統，而你不必用那個，你甚至不必知道"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 93.64,
          "end": 97.33,
          "en": "what that is to follow along, it has nothing to do with Javascript,",
          "zh": "那是什麼也能跟著做，它和 JavaScript 無關，"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 97.39,
          "end": 102.7,
          "en": "after this lecture you find a basic introduction to it but you can also skip this for now and come back",
          "zh": "這一堂之後你會找到它的基本介紹，但你現在也可以先跳過，稍後再回來"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 102.7,
          "end": 103.53,
          "en": "to it later,",
          "zh": "看它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 103.57,
          "end": 106.99000000000001,
          "en": "it's not required, not directly related to Javascript.",
          "zh": "它不是必要的，和 JavaScript 沒有直接關係。"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 107.11,
          "end": 113.44,
          "en": "So what you should have in here is this index.html file with a basic HTML skeleton,",
          "zh": "所以你這裡應該有的是這個 index.html 檔案，有基本的 HTML 骨架，"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 113.44,
          "end": 115.12,
          "en": "nothing too fancy in there,",
          "zh": "裡面沒什麼太花俏的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 115.16,
          "end": 120.79,
          "en": "I'm pulling in some fonts linking to the stylesheet which you'll find in the assets folder in the style",
          "zh": "我引入一些字型，連結到樣式表，你會在 assets 資料夾的 style"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 120.79,
          "end": 128.23,
          "en": "subfolder and then we have this basic skeleton down there and in the script section, you find one starting",
          "zh": "子資料夾找到，然後我們下面有這個基本骨架，而在 script 區段，你會找到一個起始"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 128.23,
          "end": 134.62,
          "en": "script. You can look into it and there's a bunch of code which probably won't tell you much, which I provide",
          "zh": "腳本。你可以看進去，裡面有一堆程式碼，可能對你來說意義不大，我提供"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 134.62,
          "end": 141.46,
          "en": "to you because this script actually includes some features which we don't really know yet, which we also",
          "zh": "給你是因為這個腳本其實包含一些我們還不太知道的功能，而我們到"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 141.46,
          "end": 147.7,
          "en": "won't fully understand by the end of this module which is why I provide it instead of writing it together",
          "zh": "這個單元結束也不會完全理解，所以我提供它，而不是和你一起寫"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 147.7,
          "end": 153.25,
          "en": "with you but which we'll of course be able to understand later in the course but we need that to get",
          "zh": "但我們當然稍後在課程裡會能理解，但我們需要那個才能在"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 153.25,
          "end": 158.23,
          "en": "something out on the screen and see something on the screen and not just have a boring application where",
          "zh": "螢幕上得到東西、在螢幕上看到東西，而不是只有一個無聊的應用程式，什麼都"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 158.23,
          "end": 159.32999999999998,
          "en": "nothing changes.",
          "zh": "不變。"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 159.34,
          "end": 164.2,
          "en": "Hence I provide this to you, for the moment you can just ignore this. take it for granted and this will",
          "zh": "因此我把這個提供給你，目前你可以先忽略它。把它當成既定的，而這會"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 164.2,
          "end": 170.72,
          "en": "all make sense a bit more by the end of this module and ultimately way more later down into the course",
          "zh": "在這個單元結束時更有一點意義，最終在課程更後面會更有意義"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 170.77,
          "end": 172.75,
          "en": "but of course we'll learn more than just that,",
          "zh": "但當然我們會學的不只那個，"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 172.81,
          "end": 174.97,
          "en": "this is just some starting script which we need.",
          "zh": "這只是我們需要的某個起始腳本。"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 175.39,
          "end": 176.42000000000002,
          "en": "So that's what we got,",
          "zh": "所以那就是我們有的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 176.44,
          "end": 183.4,
          "en": "now you can double click that file here, not in the IDE though but instead in your normal windows explorer",
          "zh": "現在你可以在這裡雙擊那個檔案，不過不是在 IDE 裡，而是在你平常的 Windows 檔案總管"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 183.46,
          "end": 190.97,
          "en": "or Mac finder. So there, simply double click that index.html file and it will open up a brand new",
          "zh": "或 Mac Finder。所以在那裡，只要雙擊那個 index.html 檔案，它會打開一個全新的"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 190.97,
          "end": 196.73,
          "en": "window in the browser which should actually yield this interface.",
          "zh": "瀏覽器視窗，實際上應該會呈現這個介面。"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 196.73,
          "end": 204.82999999999998,
          "en": "Now, this is a basic calculator which will work a bit different than most calculators you're used to",
          "zh": "現在，這是一個基本計算機，運作方式會和你習慣的大多數計算機有點不同"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 204.86,
          "end": 208.1,
          "en": "but nonetheless which we'll work on throughout this module.",
          "zh": "但儘管如此，我們會在整個單元裡做它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 208.1,
          "end": 212.13,
          "en": "Now for the moment, you can type and hit what enter you want,",
          "zh": "現在目前，你可以打字並按你想按的 Enter，"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 212.15,
          "end": 218.66,
          "en": "nothing happens here because we'll write this logic together and by writing this logic or whilst writing",
          "zh": "這裡什麼都不會發生，因為我們會一起寫這個邏輯，而藉由寫這個邏輯，或在寫"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 218.66,
          "end": 226.31,
          "en": "it, we'll dive into the basic Javascript features. So that is what we'll build, this calculator here and",
          "zh": "它的時候，我們會深入基本的 JavaScript 功能。所以那就是我們要做的，這裡這個計算機，而"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 226.31,
          "end": 227.77,
          "en": "now to build it,",
          "zh": "現在要做它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 228.38,
          "end": 235.07,
          "en": "let's start writing some Javascript code because we need some logic that runs here with that page being",
          "zh": "讓我們開始寫一些 JavaScript 程式碼，因為我們需要一些在這裡跑的邏輯，可以說是在那個頁面"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 235.07,
          "end": 241.07,
          "en": "loaded in the background so to say to interact when the user presses one of the buttons and to update",
          "zh": "在背景被載入時，好在使用者按其中一個按鈕時互動，並更新"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 241.07,
          "end": 245.78,
          "en": "the result which we see down there and so on and that's what we need Javascript for",
          "zh": "我們在下面看到的結果等等，而那就是我們需要 JavaScript 的原因"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 245.78,
          "end": 247.09,
          "en": "because with just HTML",
          "zh": "因為只靠 HTML"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 247.1,
          "end": 248.29,
          "en": "and CSS,",
          "zh": "和 CSS，"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 248.39,
          "end": 252.52,
          "en": "we can't add this in the browser dynamic logic.",
          "zh": "我們沒辦法在瀏覽器裡加上這種動態邏輯。"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 252.74,
          "end": 259.61,
          "en": "As you learned in the first course module, you need Javascript for dynamic features or for dynamic actions",
          "zh": "如你在第一個課程單元學到的，動態功能或動態動作需要 JavaScript"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 259.61,
          "end": 262.94,
          "en": "like this and that's exactly what we'll dive into in this module",
          "zh": "像這樣，而那正是我們在這個單元要深入的"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 262.94,
          "end": 263.39,
          "en": "therefore.",
          "zh": "因此。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "15853196",
      "title": "Adding JavaScript to the Website",
      "lectureOrder": 18,
      "videoOrder": 14,
      "sourceHash": "534ca547c6a01695c248be9c69868c5a4f7fddc83e2552f4a6e31f58fc9f5e9e",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.06,
          "end": 3.83,
          "en": "So we want to write some script code",
          "zh": "所以我們想寫一些腳本程式碼"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.96,
          "end": 8.64,
          "en": "and as I mentioned already, you got the vendor.js file which you could name however you want,",
          "zh": "而如我已經提到的，你有 vendor.js 檔案，你可以隨便命名，"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.64,
          "end": 13.77,
          "en": "I just named it like this to make it clear that I provide this to you and you don't really need to care",
          "zh": "我只是這樣命名，好讓你清楚這是我提供給你的，而你其實不必在意"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 13.77,
          "end": 14.48,
          "en": "about it.",
          "zh": "它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 14.64,
          "end": 18.6,
          "en": "So we could add our code in that file but actually, we won't",
          "zh": "所以我們可以把程式碼加進那個檔案，但實際上我們不會"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 18.81,
          "end": 23.67,
          "en": "and instead I'll create a separate brand new file next to it which I'll name app.js",
          "zh": "相對地，我會在它旁邊建立一個全新的獨立檔案，我會命名為 app.js"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 23.69,
          "end": 26.94,
          "en": "Now you can also name this file however you want,",
          "zh": "現在你也可以隨便命名這個檔案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 26.94,
          "end": 33.78,
          "en": "I'll name it app.js because it will drive our simple front-end browser based application we're building",
          "zh": "我會把它命名為 app.js，因為它會驅動我們正在建立的這個簡單前端、瀏覽器端應用程式"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 33.78,
          "end": 34.23,
          "en": "here",
          "zh": "在這裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 34.23,
          "end": 41.43,
          "en": "but you could name it my-script.js or just script.js or whatever you want.",
          "zh": "但你可以把它命名為 my-script.js，或只是 script.js，或任何你想要的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 41.43,
          "end": 46.86,
          "en": "The only thing that matters here is the file extension which should of course be .js because it will",
          "zh": "這裡唯一要緊的是副檔名，當然應該是 .js，因為它會"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 46.86,
          "end": 49.39,
          "en": "hold Javascript code.",
          "zh": "存放 JavaScript 程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 49.56,
          "end": 57.45,
          "en": "Now that's the script file we'll work on and that's the file where we will add our calculator logic.",
          "zh": "現在那就是我們要處理的腳本檔，也是我們要加入計算機邏輯的檔案。"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 57.75,
          "end": 64.53,
          "en": "Now to get started and see that this works, let's start very simple and simply add in an alert where",
          "zh": "現在要開始並看到這能運作，讓我們從非常簡單開始，單純加一個 alert，在那裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 64.53,
          "end": 66.44,
          "en": "we say this works.",
          "zh": "我們說 this works。"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 66.51,
          "end": 71.49,
          "en": "Now you might not fully understand what's happening here, what this alert thing means, what these parentheses",
          "zh": "現在你可能不完全理解這裡發生什麼、這個 alert 是什麼意思、這些括號"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 71.49,
          "end": 77.16,
          "en": "mean, what the single quotes here mean and we'll explore all of that throughout this module but just enter",
          "zh": "是什麼意思、這裡的單引號是什麼意思，而我們會在整個單元探索這一切，但目前只要輸入"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 77.16,
          "end": 86.49,
          "en": "this for the moment and then go back to your page and reload and what you'll see is that nothing happens.",
          "zh": "這個，然後回到你的頁面並重新載入，你會看到什麼都沒發生。"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 86.64,
          "end": 93,
          "en": "Well the reason for that is that of course I added my script file here but the default behavior of the",
          "zh": "嗯原因是，我當然在這裡加了我的腳本檔，但瀏覽器的預設行為"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 93,
          "end": 101.22,
          "en": "browser is not to scan all subfolders next to my HTML file which I loaded for scripts which",
          "zh": "不是去掃描我載入的 HTML 檔旁邊的所有子資料夾，找它可以"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 101.22,
          "end": 102.45,
          "en": "it could execute,",
          "zh": "執行的腳本，"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 102.45,
          "end": 108.6,
          "en": "that would be a horrible default behavior because it would mean that we can't control when which of",
          "zh": "那會是很糟的預設行為，因為那表示我們無法控制何時、我們的哪一個"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 108.6,
          "end": 112.05,
          "en": "our scripts runs and we want to control that,",
          "zh": "腳本會跑，而我們想控制那個，"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 112.05,
          "end": 116.91,
          "en": "So of course it's good that the browser doesn't load and execute our script by default",
          "zh": "所以瀏覽器預設不載入並執行我們的腳本當然是好的"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 117.03,
          "end": 122.77,
          "en": "but how can we tell the browser that it should load and execute that script? There are a couple of ways",
          "zh": "但我們怎麼告訴瀏覽器它應該載入並執行那個腳本？有幾種方式"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 122.77,
          "end": 125.13,
          "en": "of importing Javascript, now",
          "zh": "可以引入 JavaScript，現在"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 125.14,
          "end": 132.2,
          "en": "the first way of importing it is to go to the HTML file and in there, like here in the head section",
          "zh": "第一種引入方式是到 HTML 檔，在裡面，像這裡在 head 區段"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 132.21,
          "end": 139.12,
          "en": "let's say, you can add a script opening and closing tag and you can add Javascript between those script",
          "zh": "假設，你可以加一組 script 開始和結束標籤，並在那些 script"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 139.12,
          "end": 141.06,
          "en": "tags. So we could write alert,",
          "zh": "標籤之間加 JavaScript。所以我們可以寫 alert，"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 141.1,
          "end": 146.82999999999998,
          "en": "this works between script tags in here, so the alert function",
          "zh": "this works 在這裡的 script 標籤之間，所以是 alert 函式"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 146.82999999999998,
          "end": 149.95,
          "en": "just as I used it in app.js but not in",
          "zh": "就像我在 app.js 裡用的，但不是在"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 149.95,
          "end": 150.32999999999998,
          "en": "app.js",
          "zh": "app.js"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 150.36,
          "end": 152.77,
          "en": "between the script tags here.",
          "zh": "這裡的 script 標籤之間。"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 152.86,
          "end": 159.4,
          "en": "If we do that and I reload this page, you see before the page loads, I already see that alert indeed and",
          "zh": "如果我們這樣做並重新載入這個頁面，你看到在頁面載入之前，我已經確實看到那個 alert，而"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 159.4,
          "end": 164.03,
          "en": "I can click OK and confirm this and now the rest of the page loads.",
          "zh": "我可以點 OK 確認這個，然後頁面的其餘部分才載入。"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 164.05,
          "end": 166.01,
          "en": "Now that's one way of doing it.",
          "zh": "現在那是其中一種做法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 166.06,
          "end": 172.57,
          "en": "Now you can of course throw in some script code here into your HTML file but the downside with that",
          "zh": "現在你當然可以把一些腳本程式碼丟進你的 HTML 檔，但那樣的缺點"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 172.57,
          "end": 180.1,
          "en": "is that the longer your script gets, the longer this HTML file gets and this is not necessarily a",
          "zh": "是你的腳本越長，這個 HTML 檔就越長，而這不一定是"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 180.16,
          "end": 187.21,
          "en": "technical issue but one issue it might be is that for you, it gets harder to manage your",
          "zh": "技術問題，但它可能是一個問題，對你來說，會變得更難管理你的"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 187.21,
          "end": 187.75,
          "en": "website.",
          "zh": "網站。"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 187.81,
          "end": 192.94,
          "en": "If all your script and all your HTML is in one file, then this file gets very big and if you then",
          "zh": "如果所有腳本和所有 HTML 都在一個檔案裡，這個檔案會變得很大，而如果你之後"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 192.94,
          "end": 197.73,
          "en": "ever need to change something in there, be that Javascript or be that HTML,",
          "zh": "需要改裡面的某樣東西，不管是 JavaScript 還是 HTML，"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 197.74,
          "end": 202.12,
          "en": "you need to scroll through all the content here and find the part you want to change.",
          "zh": "你都得在這裡捲過所有內容，找到你想改的部分。"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 202.18,
          "end": 209.2,
          "en": "So putting your scripts in there is typically not the best idea unless it's a very short script,",
          "zh": "所以把腳本放在那裡通常不是最好的主意，除非它是非常短的腳本，"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 209.23,
          "end": 216.37,
          "en": "instead you typically want to import your script and therefore you add a source attribute, src to",
          "zh": "相對地，你通常想引入你的腳本，因此你加上來源屬性 src，加到"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 216.37,
          "end": 222.52,
          "en": "the script tags and then between double quotes typically, single quotes or no quotes at all would also",
          "zh": "script 標籤上，然後通常在雙引號之間，單引號或完全不加引號在某種程度上也"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 222.52,
          "end": 225.4,
          "en": "work to some extent but typically use double quotes,",
          "zh": "行得通，但通常用雙引號，"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 225.4,
          "end": 228.65,
          "en": "you point at the location of your script file.",
          "zh": "你指向腳本檔的位置。"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 228.7,
          "end": 235.09,
          "en": "So in my case here, I point that the assets folder by adding assets, then a slash to kind of go into that",
          "zh": "所以以我這裡來說，我指向 assets 資料夾，加上 assets，然後一個斜線，算是進入那個"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 235.09,
          "end": 240.73,
          "en": "folder or to tell the browser to look into that folder and then there, we want to go into the scripts",
          "zh": "資料夾，或告訴瀏覽器去看那個資料夾，然後在那裡，我們想進入 scripts"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 240.85,
          "end": 241.89,
          "en": "folder right",
          "zh": "資料夾，對吧"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 241.9,
          "end": 248.22,
          "en": "which is a folder we have in there and then go into that folder and then load the app.js file,",
          "zh": "那是我們在那裡面有的資料夾，然後進入那個資料夾，再載入 app.js 檔案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 248.23,
          "end": 253.54,
          "en": "that's what we want to tell the browser, it should go in there and load the app.js file.",
          "zh": "那就是我們想告訴瀏覽器的，它應該進到那裡並載入 app.js 檔案。"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 253.72,
          "end": 256.78,
          "en": "Now important, you still need a closing script tag here,",
          "zh": "現在重要的是，你這裡仍然需要結束的 script 標籤，"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 256.78,
          "end": 261.05,
          "en": "you must not have a self-closing script tag like you have it for the link,",
          "zh": "你不可以有自閉合的 script 標籤，像你在 link 上有的那樣，"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 261.13,
          "end": 265.99,
          "en": "that's not supported for script tags, you must have opening and closing separate",
          "zh": "script 標籤不支援那個，你必須有分開的開始和結束"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 265.99,
          "end": 267.1,
          "en": "script tag.",
          "zh": "script 標籤。"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 267.4,
          "end": 272.98,
          "en": "And now with that indeed, you should see that when I reload the page again we see just this works from",
          "zh": "而現在這樣做之後，你確實應該看到，當我再次重新載入頁面，我們只看到來自 this works"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 272.98,
          "end": 274.15,
          "en": "this file,",
          "zh": "這個檔案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 274.15,
          "end": 278.4,
          "en": "so if I go back and reload this page indeed we see this works",
          "zh": "所以如果我回去並重新載入這個頁面，我們確實看到 this works"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 278.56,
          "end": 281.90999999999997,
          "en": "and if I confirm this, the rest of the page loads.",
          "zh": "而如果我確認這個，頁面的其餘部分就載入了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 282.13,
          "end": 285.01,
          "en": "So that's how we can import a script.",
          "zh": "所以那就是我們可以引入腳本的方式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 285.01,
          "end": 291.7,
          "en": "One problem we're facing here is that this blocks the rendering of the page until the script is done",
          "zh": "我們這裡面對的一個問題是，這會擋住頁面的渲染，直到腳本完成"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 291.7,
          "end": 296.56,
          "en": "and in the case of an alert, the script is really only done when the user confirmed the alert,",
          "zh": "而在 alert 的情況，腳本真的只有在使用者確認 alert 時才完成，"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 296.59000000000003,
          "end": 302.32,
          "en": "so when we close the alert. To make sure that the page loads first, we can do one simple thing -",
          "zh": "也就是當我們關掉 alert。為了確保頁面先載入，我們可以做一件簡單的事，"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 302.47,
          "end": 308.35,
          "en": "we can take the script, take it out of the head here and move it to the end of the body so that the browser",
          "zh": "我們可以把腳本從這裡的 head 拿出來，移到 body 的結尾，這樣瀏覽器"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 308.35,
          "end": 315.25,
          "en": "has a chance of first parsing all the HTML code and finishing that rendering before it executes our script",
          "zh": "才有機會先解析所有 HTML 程式碼、完成那個渲染，然後才執行我們的腳本"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 315.64,
          "end": 319.23,
          "en": "and later, I'll show you an alternative strategy to that as well",
          "zh": "而稍後，我也會給你看另一種替代策略"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 319.24,
          "end": 323.02,
          "en": "but for the moment we can do that. If I now save this and we now reload,",
          "zh": "但目前我們可以這樣做。如果我現在存檔，而我們現在重新載入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 323.02,
          "end": 327.7,
          "en": "you see first everything renders, then we can click OK and then it finishes.",
          "zh": "你看到先是一切都渲染了，然後我們可以點 OK，然後它才完成。"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 327.7,
          "end": 332.27,
          "en": "Now actually, the font only came in after but that's something we can work on later,",
          "zh": "現在其實，字型是之後才進來的，但那是我們稍後可以處理的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 332.38,
          "end": 337.48,
          "en": "for the moment, this is better than what we had before because at least a majority of this file is now",
          "zh": "目前，這比我們之前的好，因為至少這個檔案的大部分現在"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 337.48,
          "end": 343.68,
          "en": "done loading before the script executes and blocks the browser from finishing this up.",
          "zh": "在腳本執行、並擋住瀏覽器完成這個之前，就已經載入完了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 343.87,
          "end": 346.06,
          "en": "So that's the basic setup we'll work with,",
          "zh": "所以那就是我們會用的基本設定，"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 346.15,
          "end": 353.32,
          "en": "now we will also depend on the code I run here in the vendor.js file and therefore you should import",
          "zh": "現在我們也會依賴我在這裡 vendor.js 檔案裡跑的程式碼，因此你也應該引入"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 353.32,
          "end": 359.8,
          "en": "that as well and you should import it before you import the app.js file because the code you write",
          "zh": "那個，而且你應該在引入 app.js 檔案之前引入它，因為你在"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 359.83,
          "end": 366.94,
          "en": "in the app.js file will depend on the code in the vendor.js file and the order does matter in Javascript,",
          "zh": "app.js 檔案裡寫的程式碼會依賴 vendor.js 檔案裡的程式碼，而順序在 JavaScript 裡很重要，"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 367.33,
          "end": 371.99,
          "en": "so we have to import the thing we depend on before we use it.",
          "zh": "所以我們必須在使用之前，先引入我們依賴的東西。"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 372.04,
          "end": 379.93,
          "en": "So we first import, from our assets folder, scripts folder, vendor.js and then you have your import to",
          "zh": "所以我們先引入，從我們的 assets 資料夾、scripts 資料夾、vendor.js，然後你才有對"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 379.99,
          "end": 386.08,
          "en": "app.js so that in the app.js file, we can actually work with the things that are happening in here",
          "zh": "app.js 的引入，這樣在 app.js 檔案裡，我們才能實際使用這裡發生的那些東西"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 386.17,
          "end": 389.68,
          "en": "even though we don't fully understand what's happening in there yet.",
          "zh": "即使我們還沒完全理解那裡面發生什麼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 390.1,
          "end": 396.42,
          "en": "So that's the finished import setup we need, now with the importing done,",
          "zh": "所以那就是我們需要的完成引入設定，現在引入做完了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 396.43,
          "end": 400.33,
          "en": "we can dive into actually writing some Javascript code.",
          "zh": "我們可以深入實際寫一些 JavaScript 程式碼。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "15853198",
      "title": "Introducing Variables & Constants",
      "lectureOrder": 19,
      "videoOrder": 15,
      "sourceHash": "91d6f33f59aefd7736b91589eb75df046c4b16fadf0788fad3589a9a2c15651d",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.17,
          "end": 7.64,
          "en": "So it's time to write some Javascript code in this app.js file and for that, I'll first of all clear the alert",
          "zh": "所以是時候在這個 app.js 檔案裡寫一些 JavaScript 程式碼，為此，我首先會清掉 alert"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 7.66,
          "end": 8.6,
          "en": "code.",
          "zh": "程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.65,
          "end": 15.94,
          "en": "Now our goal is to write a very basic calculator here where we can enter a number here and add this",
          "zh": "現在我們的目標是在這裡寫一個非常基本的計算機，我們可以在這裡輸入一個數字，並把這個"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 15.94,
          "end": 18.25,
          "en": "to the last number we entered up there,",
          "zh": "加到我們上面輸入的上一個數字，"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 18.4,
          "end": 23.68,
          "en": "so basically a calculator where we can always work with two numbers add add a new number to the old",
          "zh": "所以基本上是一個計算機，我們永遠可以處理兩個數字，把一個新數字加到舊的"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 23.68,
          "end": 24.15,
          "en": "result",
          "zh": "結果"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 24.16,
          "end": 25.24,
          "en": "and so on.",
          "zh": "等等。"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 25.24,
          "end": 26.56,
          "en": "So that's the goal here,",
          "zh": "所以那就是這裡的目標，"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 26.56,
          "end": 28.03,
          "en": "such a basic calculator.",
          "zh": "這樣一個基本計算機。"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 28.03,
          "end": 33.66,
          "en": "Now for that, we'll need a couple of important pieces that will actually be found in most Javascript",
          "zh": "現在為此，我們會需要幾個重要的東西，它們其實會在大多數 JavaScript"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 33.67,
          "end": 38.02,
          "en": "programs, for example variables and constants,",
          "zh": "程式裡找到，例如變數和常數，"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 38.02,
          "end": 43.15,
          "en": "that's a core feature, not just of Javascript but of most programming languages.",
          "zh": "那是核心功能，不只是 JavaScript，也是大多數程式語言的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 43.16,
          "end": 47.2,
          "en": "Now what are variables and constants? In Javascript,",
          "zh": "現在什麼是變數和常數？在 JavaScript 裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 47.2,
          "end": 53.72,
          "en": "you define a variable like this and I'll dive into the exact meaning here in a second.",
          "zh": "你像這樣定義變數，而我等一下會深入這裡的確切意思。"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 53.74,
          "end": 58,
          "en": "Now what a variable is is it's a data container or data storage",
          "zh": "現在變數是什麼，它是一個資料容器或資料儲存"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 58,
          "end": 63.54,
          "en": "you could say. In most programs you're going to write, you're going to work with some data,",
          "zh": "可以說是這樣。在你要寫的大多數程式裡，你會處理一些資料，"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 63.67,
          "end": 68.99,
          "en": "be that a user name entered by the user which you then use to log the user in",
          "zh": "不管是使用者輸入的使用者名稱，然後你用來讓使用者登入"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 69.19,
          "end": 71.92,
          "en": "or as an example of our calculator,",
          "zh": "或就我們計算機的例子來說，"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 71.92,
          "end": 78.94,
          "en": "be that our last, our most recent result we have and the number the user just entered which we want to",
          "zh": "不管是我們上一個、我們最近的結果，以及使用者剛輸入的數字，我們想要"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 78.94,
          "end": 79.83,
          "en": "add.",
          "zh": "加上。"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 79.9,
          "end": 86.24,
          "en": "So that would be data that we want to store because our program needs that data to work correctly,",
          "zh": "所以那會是我們想儲存的資料，因為我們的程式需要那些資料才能正確運作，"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 86.26,
          "end": 92.03,
          "en": "for example in the calculator we need the old result and the number the user just entered,",
          "zh": "例如在計算機裡我們需要舊的結果，以及使用者剛輸入的數字，"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 92.05,
          "end": 96.49000000000001,
          "en": "so we need these two pieces of data to derive the new result.",
          "zh": "所以我們需要這兩份資料來得出新的結果。"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 96.49000000000001,
          "end": 101.74000000000001,
          "en": "So we need these two variables to get our new third variable, the current result.",
          "zh": "所以我們需要這兩個變數，才能得到我們的第三個新變數，目前的結果。"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 101.74000000000001,
          "end": 108.4,
          "en": "So a variable is a data container which holds some data and in Javascript, we create a variable by using",
          "zh": "所以變數是一個存放某些資料的資料容器，而在 JavaScript 裡，我們建立變數是用"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 108.4,
          "end": 115.78,
          "en": "the let keyword which you see here on the left, then a name of your choice with some naming rules in",
          "zh": "let 關鍵字，你在左邊這裡看到，然後一個你自選的名稱，心裡要有一些命名規則"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 115.78,
          "end": 117.77000000000001,
          "en": "mind which I'll dive into later,",
          "zh": "我稍後會深入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 118.03,
          "end": 122.38,
          "en": "then an equal sign and then the value you want to store in the variable.",
          "zh": "然後一個等號，然後你想存在變數裡的值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 122.38,
          "end": 128.08,
          "en": "Now with a variable created, you can also always reassign it and store a new value in there,",
          "zh": "現在變數建立之後，你也可以隨時重新指派它，並在那裡存一個新值，"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 128.08,
          "end": 134.11,
          "en": "so here I'm using the existing variable user name and I assign a new value to it.",
          "zh": "所以這裡我使用既有的變數 userName，並指派一個新值給它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 134.14,
          "end": 141.55,
          "en": "Now I only need the let keyword, which Javascript understands, if you introduce a variable for the first",
          "zh": "現在我只在第一次引入變數時，才需要 let 關鍵字，JavaScript 理解它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 141.55,
          "end": 142.48,
          "en": "time.",
          "zh": "第一次。"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 142.57,
          "end": 147.09,
          "en": "If you then assign a new value to it, you don't repeat that keyword,",
          "zh": "如果你之後指派一個新值給它，你不要重複那個關鍵字，"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 147.1,
          "end": 152.59,
          "en": "so you only need the let keyword to let Javascript know hey here's a brand new variable my program will",
          "zh": "所以你只需要 let 關鍵字，讓 JavaScript 知道嘿，這裡有一個全新的變數，我的程式會"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 152.59,
          "end": 153.14,
          "en": "need,",
          "zh": "需要，"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 153.25,
          "end": 158.59,
          "en": "if you then use that variable thereafter, you do that without let. So a variable is a data container",
          "zh": "如果你之後使用那個變數，你不要加 let。所以變數是一個資料容器"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 158.68,
          "end": 165.87,
          "en": "where the value can change, doesn't have to but often it will. Now you also have a special form of",
          "zh": "其中的值可以改變，不一定要，但常常會。現在你也有一種特殊形式"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 165.9,
          "end": 168.88,
          "en": "that variable you could say, you have constants,",
          "zh": "可以說是那種變數，你有常數，"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 169.2,
          "end": 174.76,
          "en": "for example let's say you have a total amount of users in your application which is kind of fixed.",
          "zh": "例如假設你的應用程式裡有使用者總數，那算是固定的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 174.96,
          "end": 181.17,
          "en": "Now that's still a data container but instead of with the let keyword, you create it with the const",
          "zh": "現在那仍然是資料容器，但不是用 let 關鍵字，你用 const"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 181.2,
          "end": 187.65,
          "en": "keyword, another keyword which is built into Javascript, which Javascript recognizes and understands.",
          "zh": "關鍵字建立它，另一個內建在 JavaScript 的關鍵字，JavaScript 認得也理解。"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 188.53,
          "end": 195.78,
          "en": "Now the special thing about constants created with the const keyword is that there, you can't change the",
          "zh": "現在用 const 關鍵字建立的常數，特別之處是那裡你不能改變"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 195.78,
          "end": 199.32999999999998,
          "en": "value, if you try to do that, you'll get an error.",
          "zh": "值，如果你試著那樣做，你會得到錯誤。"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 199.71,
          "end": 200.75,
          "en": "So there,",
          "zh": "所以在那裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 200.76,
          "end": 204.03,
          "en": "the values must not change.",
          "zh": "值不可以改變。"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 204.05,
          "end": 211.68,
          "en": "Now you might wonder why you would have some value stored in a variable if that's not really variable,",
          "zh": "現在你可能會想，如果那個值其實不是可變的，為什麼還要把某個值存在變數裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 211.68,
          "end": 213.57,
          "en": "if it can't really change",
          "zh": "如果它其實不能改變"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 213.69,
          "end": 220.53,
          "en": "and the answer is sometimes in your code, you have values which never change which you still want to",
          "zh": "而答案是，有時候在你的程式碼裡，你有永不改變的值，但你仍然想"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 220.53,
          "end": 225.14,
          "en": "store in such a data container so that you can initialize them in a central place,",
          "zh": "把它們存在這樣的資料容器裡，好讓你能在一個集中的地方初始化它們，"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 225.15,
          "end": 231.21,
          "en": "let's say at the beginning of your file and then use them throughout your program, maybe use the same constant",
          "zh": "假設在檔案開頭，然後在整個程式裡使用它們，也許在不同地方使用同一個常數"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 231.24,
          "end": 233.22,
          "en": "multiple times in different places",
          "zh": "多次"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 233.22,
          "end": 239.01,
          "en": "so you will always reference the same single constant and if you then ever, in code when writing your",
          "zh": "所以你永遠會參考同一個常數，而如果你之後，在寫程式碼時"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 239.01,
          "end": 244.77,
          "en": "code, you change that value, you change it in one place instead of ten different places but that will become",
          "zh": "你改變那個值，你在一個地方改，而不是十個不同地方，但那會"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 244.77,
          "end": 248.76,
          "en": "clearer once we start writing some code which we'll do in a second.",
          "zh": "在我們開始寫一些程式碼時變得更清楚，我們等一下就會做。"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 248.76,
          "end": 254.88,
          "en": "For now, just be aware of these two different ways of creating variables, with let and with const, where",
          "zh": "目前，只要知道這兩種建立變數的方式，用 let 和用 const，其中"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 254.97,
          "end": 261.6,
          "en": "variables with let can be changed, with const they can't be, the general syntax is keyword name",
          "zh": "用 let 的變數可以改變，用 const 的不行，一般語法是關鍵字、名稱"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 261.75,
          "end": 267.81,
          "en": "and then if you want to store a value right away, equal sign at the value and also one little hint right",
          "zh": "然後如果你想立刻存一個值，等號加上那個值，還有一個小提示立刻"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 267.81,
          "end": 268.47,
          "en": "away,",
          "zh": "說，"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 268.47,
          "end": 274.83,
          "en": "you typically want to use constants as often as possible, which might sound strange at first because",
          "zh": "你通常想盡可能常用常數，一開始可能聽起來奇怪，因為"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 274.86,
          "end": 277.65,
          "en": "they're restricted in what you can do with them, right?",
          "zh": "它們限制你能對它們做什麼，對吧？"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 277.65,
          "end": 283.11,
          "en": "You can't change them but that's exactly why you want to use them as often as possible,",
          "zh": "你不能改變它們，但那正是你想盡可能常用它們的原因，"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 283.14,
          "end": 288.75,
          "en": "it makes your intentions very clear. If you have a value which actually never changes throughout the",
          "zh": "它讓你的意圖非常清楚。如果你有一個值，在你的程式生命週期裡，或在你使用它的"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 288.75,
          "end": 295.47,
          "en": "lifecycle of your program or of the part of your code where you use it, well then you want to make that",
          "zh": "那段程式碼裡，其實永不改變，那麼你就想把那個"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 295.47,
          "end": 302.94,
          "en": "clear so that if any other developer ever reads your code quickly understands that this piece of data",
          "zh": "講清楚，這樣如果任何其他開發者讀你的程式碼，很快就理解這份資料"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 302.94,
          "end": 304.27,
          "en": "is never going to change,",
          "zh": "永遠不會改變，"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 304.29,
          "end": 311.33,
          "en": "it simply makes your code easier to understand for others. Now that was a lot of new and very theoretic",
          "zh": "這只是讓你的程式碼對其他人更容易理解。現在那是很多新的、非常理論的"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 311.42,
          "end": 312.32,
          "en": "knowledge,",
          "zh": "知識，"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 312.32,
          "end": 315.53,
          "en": "it will make more sense once we use it, so let's use it.",
          "zh": "一旦我們使用它就會更有意義，所以讓我們使用它。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "15853200",
      "title": "Declaring & Defining Variables",
      "lectureOrder": 20,
      "videoOrder": 16,
      "sourceHash": "241bb5fa54255c9df9c88a80a22e48ccdd3ed8746335e58b7b4926351e83b6ef",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.27,
          "end": 8.53,
          "en": "Back in our calculator, we can already start thinking about data containers we might need in there",
          "zh": "回到我們的計算機，我們已經可以開始想那裡面可能需要的資料容器"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 8.9,
          "end": 15.59,
          "en": "and there, one value that immediately comes to my mind when thinking about a calculator is the result.",
          "zh": "而在那裡，想到計算機時立刻浮現的一個值是結果。"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 15.95,
          "end": 19.67,
          "en": "So we can create as a result variable with let,",
          "zh": "所以我們可以用 let 建立一個 result 變數，"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 19.67,
          "end": 27.45,
          "en": "so with this special let keyword which Javascript understands and then give it any name you want, like result",
          "zh": "用這個 JavaScript 理解的特殊 let 關鍵字，然後給它任何你想要的名稱，像 result"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 27.74,
          "end": 31.19,
          "en": "or current result.",
          "zh": "或 currentResult。"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 31.19,
          "end": 37.76,
          "en": "Now regarding the name of your variable or constant, there are a couple of rules and recommendations",
          "zh": "現在關於你的變數或常數名稱，有一些規則和建議"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 37.76,
          "end": 39.64,
          "en": "you should keep in mind.",
          "zh": "你應該放在心上。"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 39.69,
          "end": 44.2,
          "en": "There are certain allowed and not allowed names, so allowed",
          "zh": "有某些允許和不允許的名稱，所以允許的"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 44.21,
          "end": 47.42,
          "en": "is this name for example, userName, written like this",
          "zh": "例如是這個名稱，userName，寫法像這樣"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 47.49,
          "end": 53.49,
          "en": "and it's a best practice to use this special naming convention which is called camel case, which means",
          "zh": "而最佳做法是使用這個叫做 camelCase 的特殊命名慣例，意思是"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 53.49,
          "end": 59.19,
          "en": "that your name starts with a lowercase character and is only one word,",
          "zh": "你的名稱以小寫字元開頭，而且只有一個詞，"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 59.22,
          "end": 66.33,
          "en": "so there are no blanks in there, no whitespace, that would actually be forbidden but every word inside",
          "zh": "所以裡面沒有空白、沒有空白字元，那其實是禁止的，但裡面的每個詞"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 66.33,
          "end": 73.74,
          "en": "of the word, like name here in userName starts with an upper case character to make that more readable.",
          "zh": "在這個詞裡，像這裡 userName 裡的 name，以大寫字元開頭，讓它更好讀。"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 73.74,
          "end": 76.64,
          "en": "So that would be a variable name which is allowed,",
          "zh": "所以那會是一個允許的變數名稱，"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 76.74,
          "end": 80.82,
          "en": "it also is a good name because it describes what's in the variable,",
          "zh": "它也是個好名稱，因為它描述變數裡有什麼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 80.82,
          "end": 83.78,
          "en": "so here we would probably store the name of a user,",
          "zh": "所以這裡我們大概會存使用者的名稱，"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 83.85,
          "end": 89.31,
          "en": "so that's a better name than what the user entered because it might not be clear if what the user entered",
          "zh": "所以那比 what the user entered 更好，因為可能不清楚使用者輸入的"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 89.31,
          "end": 91.05,
          "en": "should be a user name or a password,",
          "zh": "應該是使用者名稱還是密碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 91.05,
          "end": 96.50999999999999,
          "en": "so you want to give the variable a name that describes which kind of data you storing in there.",
          "zh": "所以你想給變數一個名稱，描述你存在那裡的是哪種資料。"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 96.50999999999999,
          "end": 102.38,
          "en": "By the way, also important, Javascript is case sensitive and this means that",
          "zh": "順帶一提，也很重要，JavaScript 區分大小寫，而這表示"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 102.42,
          "end": 107.02000000000001,
          "en": "it really matters whether a character is a capital character or not.",
          "zh": "一個字元是不是大寫真的有差。"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 107.07,
          "end": 112.35,
          "en": "So userName written the way it's written here on the left with a lowercase u at the beginning and",
          "zh": "所以 userName 照左邊這裡的寫法，開頭是小寫 u，而"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 112.35,
          "end": 118.25999999999999,
          "en": "then the uppercase N in there is not the same as if it were written with an upper case",
          "zh": "裡面的 N 是大寫，那和如果它寫成開頭是大寫"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 118.25999999999999,
          "end": 120.83,
          "en": "u at the beginning and otherwise the same.",
          "zh": "u、其他一樣，並不是同一個。"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 120.93,
          "end": 125.9,
          "en": "So the casing in the names you choose really matters and that's important to keep in mind.",
          "zh": "所以你選擇的名稱裡的大小寫真的有差，而那很重要，要放在心上。"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 126,
          "end": 128.47,
          "en": "Now also allowed would be a name like this,",
          "zh": "現在像這樣的名稱也會被允許，"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 128.49,
          "end": 133.98,
          "en": "It's basically similar to the first example but this also includes a digit because your variable names",
          "zh": "它基本上和第一個例子類似，但這也包含一個數字，因為你的變數名稱"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 133.98,
          "end": 137.4,
          "en": "can be made up of any letters or digits.",
          "zh": "可以由任何字母或數字組成。"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 137.43,
          "end": 143.25,
          "en": "You can also use the dollar sign special character and your variable name can even start with it,",
          "zh": "你也可以使用錢號這個特殊字元，而你的變數名稱甚至可以以它開頭，"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 143.25,
          "end": 146.55,
          "en": "you can use it anywhere in the variable name but it can even start with it.",
          "zh": "你可以在變數名稱的任何地方使用它，但它甚至可以以它開頭。"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 146.91,
          "end": 153.42000000000002,
          "en": "Similarly, you can also use the underscore character at the beginning of your variable name or anywhere",
          "zh": "同樣地，你也可以在變數名稱開頭或任何地方使用底線字元"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 153.42000000000002,
          "end": 154.14,
          "en": "inside of it,",
          "zh": "在它裡面，"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 154.14,
          "end": 156.18,
          "en": "so that's also allowed.",
          "zh": "所以那也是允許的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 156.36,
          "end": 161.82,
          "en": "Now there are a couple of names which are not allowed or not recommended, for example userName like",
          "zh": "現在有一些名稱是不允許或不建議的，例如像這樣的 userName"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 161.82,
          "end": 162.27,
          "en": "this.",
          "zh": "這個。"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 162.27,
          "end": 165.71,
          "en": "This is actually allowed but it's a bad practice,",
          "zh": "這其實是允許的，但這是不好的做法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 165.78,
          "end": 172.89,
          "en": "You should use this camel case notation on the left with lowercase starting character, one word and each",
          "zh": "你應該用左邊這種 camelCase 記法，以小寫開頭、一個詞，而每個"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 172.89,
          "end": 176.29,
          "en": "word instead of the words starting with an uppercase character.",
          "zh": "詞則以大寫字元開頭。"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 176.31,
          "end": 181.77,
          "en": "So here, what you see there is actually another convention called snake case which you have in some",
          "zh": "所以這裡，你在那裡看到的其實是另一種叫做 snake_case 的慣例，你在一些"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 181.77,
          "end": 185.46,
          "en": "other programming languages like Python but not in Javascript.",
          "zh": "其他程式語言像 Python 裡會有，但 JavaScript 裡沒有。"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 185.49,
          "end": 190.41,
          "en": "So whilst this technically would be a valid name, you can use the underscore here, whilst this would be a",
          "zh": "所以雖然這技術上會是有效名稱，你可以在這裡用底線，雖然這會是"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 190.41,
          "end": 192.02,
          "en": "valid name, it's not recommended",
          "zh": "有效名稱，但不建議"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 192.03,
          "end": 194.93,
          "en": "instead use the version on the left.",
          "zh": "相對地用左邊的版本。"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 195,
          "end": 201.72,
          "en": "Now what's not recommended but more importantly, not allowed is for example a variable name like this.",
          "zh": "現在不建議、但更重要的是不允許的，例如像這樣的變數名稱。"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 202.64,
          "end": 207.06,
          "en": "Whilst I did say that you can use any name that uses letters or digits,",
          "zh": "雖然我確實說過你可以用任何使用字母或數字的名稱，"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 207.26,
          "end": 214.7,
          "en": "you must not start with a digit, so your variable name or your constant name and everything I explained",
          "zh": "你不可以以數字開頭，所以你的變數名稱或常數名稱，而我在這裡解釋的一切"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 214.7,
          "end": 219.51,
          "en": "here is true for constants created with the const keyword as well, these",
          "zh": "對用 const 關鍵字建立的常數也成立，這些"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 219.52,
          "end": 226.29,
          "en": "variables and constants must not start with a digit. Now there also are special rules when it comes to",
          "zh": "變數和常數不可以以數字開頭。現在說到特殊字元也有特別規則，"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 226.29,
          "end": 232.5,
          "en": "special characters, you can use dollar sign and underscore at the beginning of your variable or anywhere",
          "zh": "你可以在變數開頭或任何地方使用錢號和底線"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 232.59,
          "end": 239.07,
          "en": "in your variable but you must not use other special characters, neither at the beginning of your variable",
          "zh": "在你的變數裡，但你不可以使用其他特殊字元，不管是在變數開頭"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 239.13,
          "end": 240.43,
          "en": "nor anywhere else,",
          "zh": "還是其他任何地方，"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 240.48,
          "end": 244.68,
          "en": "so dashes or whitespace is not allowed.",
          "zh": "所以破折號或空白是不允許的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 244.68,
          "end": 250.83,
          "en": "The underscore is allowed as mentioned on the left but other special characters are not allowed no matter",
          "zh": "底線如左邊提到的是允許的，但其他特殊字元不允許，不管"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 250.83,
          "end": 257.09,
          "en": "where you plan on using them. And the last important thing you should keep in mind, in this course you",
          "zh": "你打算在哪裡使用它們。而你應該放在心上的最後一件重要的事，在這門課你"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 257.09,
          "end": 263.45,
          "en": "will learn about a couple of keywords like let and const and using these keywords as names is also",
          "zh": "會學到一些關鍵字，像 let 和 const，而把這些關鍵字當名稱使用也"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 263.45,
          "end": 269.57,
          "en": "not allowed because how would Javascript be able to find out whether you want to use the keyword here",
          "zh": "不允許，因為 JavaScript 怎麼能判斷你這裡是想用關鍵字"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 269.69,
          "end": 271.07,
          "en": "or your variable,",
          "zh": "還是你的變數，"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 271.07,
          "end": 271.45,
          "en": "right?",
          "zh": "對吧？"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 271.46,
          "end": 274.04,
          "en": "It wouldn't and therefore this is not allowed.",
          "zh": "它沒辦法，因此這是不允許的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 274.04,
          "end": 277.28,
          "en": "So now that we know what's allowed and what's not allowed,",
          "zh": "所以現在我們知道什麼允許、什麼不允許，"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 277.4,
          "end": 279.68,
          "en": "let's go back to our code and write some good code.",
          "zh": "讓我們回到程式碼，寫一些好的程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 280.15999999999997,
          "end": 285.6,
          "en": "So I got the current result variable and now we could write the variable just like this.",
          "zh": "所以我有 currentResult 變數，現在我們可以就像這樣寫這個變數。"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 285.74,
          "end": 292.4,
          "en": "Now in Javascript, you don't have to initialize this variable with a value, so you can leave it like this",
          "zh": "現在在 JavaScript 裡，你不必用一個值初始化這個變數，所以你可以讓它像這樣"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 292.4,
          "end": 295.22,
          "en": "and now it's an uninitialized variable.",
          "zh": "而現在它是一個未初始化的變數。"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 295.22,
          "end": 300.43,
          "en": "You could also say and that's a term you will hear in other programming languages as well,",
          "zh": "你也可以說，而那是你在其他程式語言裡也會聽到的術語，"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 300.44,
          "end": 304.15,
          "en": "this variable is now declared, the program",
          "zh": "這個變數現在被宣告了，程式"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 304.16,
          "end": 310.68,
          "en": "Javascript is now aware of its existence but it's not initialized or defined yet,",
          "zh": "JavaScript 現在知道它存在，但它還沒被初始化或定義，"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 310.7,
          "end": 319.28,
          "en": "it has no value yet or no value set by you. So you can leave it like this and sometimes this is just",
          "zh": "它還沒有值，或沒有你設定的值。所以你可以讓它像這樣，而有時候這正是"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 319.31,
          "end": 320.02,
          "en": "what you need,",
          "zh": "你需要的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 320.03,
          "end": 326.84,
          "en": "sometimes you have certain variables where you don't really need a starting value. For the result",
          "zh": "有時候你有某些變數，你其實不需要起始值。對 result 來說"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 326.84,
          "end": 333.02,
          "en": "however, I'd like to have one and therefore I'll add an equal sign and then set an initial value which",
          "zh": "不過，我想要一個，因此我會加一個等號，然後設定一個初始值，這裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 333.02,
          "end": 339.53,
          "en": "could be zero here, the number zero and I'm using a number here because of course, I want to use this",
          "zh": "可以是零，數字零，而我這裡用數字，因為當然，我想在"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 339.53,
          "end": 343.06,
          "en": "variable in some calculations later and add numbers,",
          "zh": "稍後的一些計算裡使用這個變數並加上數字，"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 343.07,
          "end": 348.86,
          "en": "the dec numbers and so on and therefore having a number here with which we can do mathematical operations",
          "zh": "小數等等，因此這裡有一個我們可以做數學運算的數字"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 348.98,
          "end": 354.96,
          "en": "makes a lot of sense. Now to conclude our first line of good Javascript code we write,",
          "zh": "很有道理。現在來為我們寫的第一行好的 JavaScript 程式碼做結，"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 354.96,
          "end": 356.74,
          "en": "let's see how we end this line.",
          "zh": "讓我們看看我們怎麼結束這一行。"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 356.76,
          "end": 362.49,
          "en": "We could end it like this and just go to the next line to write the next piece of code but you'll also",
          "zh": "我們可以像這樣結束它，然後直接到下一行寫下一段程式碼，但你也"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 362.49,
          "end": 366.51,
          "en": "often see code where we use a semicolon to finish off this line.",
          "zh": "常常會看到程式碼用分號來結束這一行。"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 366.69,
          "end": 371.16,
          "en": "Now in Javascript, using the semicolon is generally optional,",
          "zh": "現在在 JavaScript 裡，使用分號一般是選擇性的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 371.16,
          "end": 378.69,
          "en": "I'm saying generally because there are some very rare niche cases where it's not optional but you can",
          "zh": "我說一般是因為有一些非常少見的特殊情況它不是選擇性的，但你通常可以"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 378.69,
          "end": 384.03,
          "en": "avoid these cases typically and hence you can write Javascript code without semicolons and you'll",
          "zh": "避開這些情況，因此你可以寫不加分號的 JavaScript 程式碼，而你會"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 384.03,
          "end": 389.76,
          "en": "see certain tutorials or guides which actually recommend that you don't add a semicolon.",
          "zh": "看到某些教學或指南其實建議你不要加分號。"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 389.76,
          "end": 396,
          "en": "Ultimately, it's up to you whether you want to end each line of code and that's not just the case for variable",
          "zh": "最終，由你決定是否要結束每一行程式碼，而且那不只是變數"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 396,
          "end": 401.43,
          "en": "definitions but for any code you write basically, whether you want to end these lines with semicolons",
          "zh": "定義的情況，基本上是你寫的任何程式碼，你是否想用分號結束這些行"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 401.43,
          "end": 402.34000000000003,
          "en": "or not.",
          "zh": "或不要。"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 402.36,
          "end": 407.58,
          "en": "I personally like to do it, also because there are many other programming languages where it's",
          "zh": "我個人喜歡這樣做，也因為有很多其他程式語言，使用分號是"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 407.58,
          "end": 413.37,
          "en": "mandatory to use a semicolon and it's easier to switch to those if you're used to adding it but you",
          "zh": "強制的，而如果你習慣加上它，切換到那些會比較容易，但你"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 413.37,
          "end": 419.07,
          "en": "can also avoid it and just use a new line to write a new expression.",
          "zh": "也可以避開它，只用新的一行來寫一個新的運算式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 419.07,
          "end": 420.91,
          "en": "It's up to you, just whatever you use,",
          "zh": "由你決定，不管你用什麼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 421.02,
          "end": 423.22,
          "en": "you should then stick to it and be consistent.",
          "zh": "你之後就應該堅持它，並保持一致。"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 423.24,
          "end": 426.98,
          "en": "So I will go with semicolons, not just here but throughout the rest of the course",
          "zh": "所以我會用分號，不只是這裡，整門課剩下的部分也是"
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 427.05,
          "end": 428.07,
          "en": "but it is up to you.",
          "zh": "但那由你決定。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "15853204",
      "title": "Working with Variables & Operators",
      "lectureOrder": 21,
      "videoOrder": 17,
      "sourceHash": "303e58f3bf604b26403288d6c3b6967f076172d64aa8a552bbf8cef46d6acf73",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.25,
          "end": 7.71,
          "en": "So we wrote to our first line of code and we're setting a variable here and this variable of course",
          "zh": "所以我們寫了第一行程式碼，我們在這裡設定一個變數，而這個變數當然"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 7.89,
          "end": 9.84,
          "en": "doesn't do anything yet.",
          "zh": "還沒做任何事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 9.84,
          "end": 11.61,
          "en": "Now let's do something simple,",
          "zh": "現在讓我們做一件簡單的事，"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 11.61,
          "end": 18.63,
          "en": "let's for the moment not care about what the user enters here but let's make sure that we actually right",
          "zh": "目前先不要管使用者在這裡輸入什麼，但讓我們確保我們其實立刻"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 18.63,
          "end": 26.22,
          "en": "away have a simple mathematical operation where we output the result down here in the result part of",
          "zh": "有一個簡單的數學運算，我們把結果輸出到這裡下方、這個畫面的結果區"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 26.22,
          "end": 34.37,
          "en": "this screen and therefore, I want to set current result to a new value and that new value will later",
          "zh": "因此，我想把 currentResult 設成一個新值，而那個新值稍後"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 34.37,
          "end": 35.38,
          "en": "be the user input",
          "zh": "會是使用者輸入"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 35.39,
          "end": 40.1,
          "en": "but since we don't really fetch this yet, I'll use a dummy value here, let's say 10",
          "zh": "但既然我們還沒真正取得這個，我會在這裡用一個假值，假設 10"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 40.1,
          "end": 49.47,
          "en": "but you can use any number you want and add this to the current result, so let's say current result plus",
          "zh": "但你可以用任何你想要的數字，並把這個加到 currentResult，所以假設 currentResult 加"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 49.47,
          "end": 54,
          "en": "10 and then store this value back in current result.",
          "zh": "10，然後把這個值存回 currentResult。"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 54,
          "end": 56.64,
          "en": "So here a couple of things are happening,",
          "zh": "所以這裡有幾件事在發生，"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 56.7,
          "end": 61.8,
          "en": "I am again referring to the current result variable here on the left side of the equal sign and on the",
          "zh": "我再次在等號左邊這裡指到 currentResult 變數，而在"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 61.8,
          "end": 63.39,
          "en": "right side",
          "zh": "右邊"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 63.57,
          "end": 69.84,
          "en": "and if we start on the right side, I'm using the current value stored in current result and I'm adding",
          "zh": "如果我們從右邊開始，我使用存在 currentResult 裡的目前值，並加上"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 69.99,
          "end": 72.15,
          "en": "a value to it, in this case 10,",
          "zh": "一個值，在這個例子是 10，"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 72.27,
          "end": 75.48,
          "en": "I'm adding by using this plus operator.",
          "zh": "我用這個加號運算子來加。"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 75.48,
          "end": 78.05,
          "en": "Now operators are something we haven't heard about yet,",
          "zh": "現在運算子是我們還沒聽過的東西，"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 78.06,
          "end": 87.05,
          "en": "what are operators? Operators are syntax features or a syntax feature in Javascript that allows us to",
          "zh": "什麼是運算子？運算子是 JavaScript 裡的語法功能，讓我們能"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 87.47,
          "end": 89.09,
          "en": "manipulate values",
          "zh": "操作值"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 89.09,
          "end": 95.25999999999999,
          "en": "you could say and there are the typical mathematical operators you're used to - plus, minus,",
          "zh": "可以說是這樣，而有你習慣的典型數學運算子：加、減，"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 95.3,
          "end": 101.69,
          "en": "then the asterisk operator, the asterisk character here to multiply two numbers and the slash to divide",
          "zh": "然後星號運算子，這裡的星號字元，用來把兩個數字相乘，以及斜線用來除"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 101.69,
          "end": 103.34,
          "en": "two numbers.",
          "zh": "兩個數字。"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 103.34,
          "end": 109.19,
          "en": "There also is a modulus operator, the percentage sign which divides two numbers but doesn't return the",
          "zh": "也有餘數運算子，百分比符號，它把兩個數字相除，但不回傳"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 109.19,
          "end": 110.22999999999999,
          "en": "result of the division",
          "zh": "除法的結果"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 110.24000000000001,
          "end": 111.24000000000001,
          "en": "but the remainder,",
          "zh": "而是餘數，"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 111.25999999999999,
          "end": 119.87,
          "en": "so the part that remains if clean division without a decimal value as a result isn't possible and there",
          "zh": "所以如果無法得到沒有小數的乾淨除法結果，剩下的那一部分，而那裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 119.93,
          "end": 127.96,
          "en": "also is the exponentiation operator which allows you to use exponentiation on a number.",
          "zh": "也有指數運算子，讓你對一個數字做指數運算。"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 127.99,
          "end": 133.25,
          "en": "Now these are the mathematical operators which you typically also know from math,",
          "zh": "現在這些是你通常也從數學知道的數學運算子，"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 133.27,
          "end": 139.15,
          "en": "there also are other operators in Javascript, like the assignment operator which we already use to assign",
          "zh": "JavaScript 裡也有其他運算子，像指派運算子，我們已經用它來把"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 139.24,
          "end": 146.21,
          "en": "a value to a variable, the equal sign. So here in this line of code, we're using two operators, the plus",
          "zh": "一個值指派給變數，等號。所以在這行程式碼裡，我們使用兩個運算子，加號"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 146.21,
          "end": 148.73,
          "en": "operator to combine two numbers",
          "zh": "運算子用來組合兩個數字"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 148.73,
          "end": 155.45,
          "en": "and now this combination, this operator yields the result of this mathematical operation and we then",
          "zh": "而現在這個組合、這個運算子產生這個數學運算的結果，然後我們"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 155.93,
          "end": 162.98,
          "en": "assign this result we're getting here with the equal sign to the value on the left or to the variable",
          "zh": "用等號把我們在這裡得到的結果指派給左邊的值，或給變數"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 163.1,
          "end": 164.05,
          "en": "on the left.",
          "zh": "在左邊。"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 164.06,
          "end": 169.98,
          "en": "So here, current result gets overwritten with the result of this operation",
          "zh": "所以這裡，currentResult 被這個運算的結果覆寫"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 170.15,
          "end": 172.79,
          "en": "and now we use current result on both sides of the equal sign",
          "zh": "而現在我們在等號兩邊都使用 currentResult"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 172.79,
          "end": 175.06,
          "en": "but the right side will execute first,",
          "zh": "但右邊會先執行，"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 175.1,
          "end": 176.85,
          "en": "that's something you can just keep in mind",
          "zh": "那是你可以放在心上的事"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 176.96,
          "end": 177.62,
          "en": "and therefore",
          "zh": "因此"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 177.62,
          "end": 185.75,
          "en": "we'll use the old result 0 here, add 10 and therefore we now have 10 as a total result",
          "zh": "我們會在這裡使用舊的結果 0，加上 10，因此我們現在總結果是 10"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 185.75,
          "end": 188.08,
          "en": "and then we overwrite current result with it.",
          "zh": "然後我們用它覆寫 currentResult。"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 188.09,
          "end": 193.39,
          "en": "So we only overwrite it after we're done with this calculation, so that we don't try to overwrite it with",
          "zh": "所以我們只有在算完之後才覆寫它，這樣我們就不會試著用"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 193.39,
          "end": 196.76,
          "en": "a value we depend on or anything like that.",
          "zh": "一個我們依賴的值或類似的東西來覆寫它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 196.76,
          "end": 203.18,
          "en": "So now current result, after this line was executed, will store of value of 10. Now to output this, we can",
          "zh": "所以現在 currentResult，在這一行執行之後，會存值 10。現在要輸出這個，我們可以"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 203.18,
          "end": 210.19,
          "en": "use one of the things I'm providing here in vendor and we'll learn what exactly that is in just a second,",
          "zh": "使用我在 vendor 裡提供的其中一個東西，而我們等一下就會學那到底是什麼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 210.26,
          "end": 217.07,
          "en": "for now we'll use this output result thing by simply writing output result here and then adding parentheses,",
          "zh": "目前我們會用這個 outputResult，只要在這裡寫 outputResult，然後加括號，"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 217.07,
          "end": 226.25,
          "en": "opening and closing and in there, you can pass in current result, just like this, also add a comma and",
          "zh": "開始和結束，在裡面你可以傳入 currentResult，就像這樣，也加一個逗號，而"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 226.25,
          "end": 230.35,
          "en": "thereafter two single quotes with nothing in between.",
          "zh": "之後是兩個單引號，中間什麼都沒有。"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 230.36,
          "end": 233.41,
          "en": "Again, I'll come back to what this is and what this does",
          "zh": "再次，我等一下會回來談這是什麼、這做什麼"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 233.42000000000002,
          "end": 240.59,
          "en": "in just a second. If you do that and you now reload your page, you should now see result 10 down there and",
          "zh": "就等一下。如果你這樣做並現在重新載入頁面，你現在應該會在下面看到結果 10，而"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 240.71,
          "end": 244.6,
          "en": "that's just a result of our code which executed here.",
          "zh": "那只是我們在這裡執行的程式碼的結果。"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 244.8,
          "end": 247.93,
          "en": "We're calculating this result, storing it here",
          "zh": "我們在計算這個結果，把它存在這裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 247.97,
          "end": 251.27,
          "en": "and then what this thing here which we're getting from the vendor file,",
          "zh": "然後這裡這個我們從 vendor 檔案得到的東西，"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 251.27,
          "end": 257.45,
          "en": "well what this does is actually it just takes whatever we pass in here and outputs this in this part",
          "zh": "嗯它做的其實只是拿我們在這裡傳入的任何東西，並把它輸出到這個部分"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 257.45,
          "end": 262.88,
          "en": "of the HTML page and throughout the course, it will become clearer how this works, for the moment you can just",
          "zh": "HTML 頁面的，而在整門課裡，這怎麼運作會變得更清楚，目前你可以就"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 262.88,
          "end": 271.15,
          "en": "take it for granted. So we had a first basic look at a variable, at an operation and then at this thing",
          "zh": "把它當成既定的。所以我們初步看了一個變數、一個運算，然後這個東西"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 271.15,
          "end": 273.14,
          "en": "here which we don't really understand,",
          "zh": "在這裡，我們其實還不太理解，"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 273.15999999999997,
          "end": 275.18,
          "en": "let me come back to that operation. Here",
          "zh": "讓我回到那個運算。這裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 275.26,
          "end": 281.44,
          "en": "we use two operators but as I mentioned, there are a couple of operators available, actually more than",
          "zh": "我們使用兩個運算子，但如我提到的，有好幾個運算子可用，其實更多，比起"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 281.44,
          "end": 282.46,
          "en": "the ones I just showed",
          "zh": "我剛給你看的那些"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 282.46,
          "end": 289.33,
          "en": "but even with those which I did show, all these basic mathematical operators, you can do a bunch of things",
          "zh": "但即使是我確實給你看的那些，所有這些基本數學運算子，你可以做很多事"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 289.75,
          "end": 294.33,
          "en": "and you're not limited to two operators per line or to one,",
          "zh": "而你不限於每行兩個運算子，或一個，"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 294.37,
          "end": 301.81,
          "en": "you can also add the asterisk here, the multiplication operator and multiply this by three and Javascript",
          "zh": "你也可以在這裡加星號，乘法運算子，把這個乘以三，而 JavaScript"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 301.81,
          "end": 308.89,
          "en": "by default follows normal mathematical rules where it will now first execute 10 times 3 and then",
          "zh": "預設遵循一般數學規則，它現在會先執行 10 乘 3，然後"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 308.98,
          "end": 310.88,
          "en": "add this to current result.",
          "zh": "把這個加到 currentResult。"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 311.11,
          "end": 317.44,
          "en": "You could change that order however by adding parentheses, just like you do it in math. If I add parentheses",
          "zh": "不過你可以改變那個順序，加上括號，就像你在數學裡做的。如果我加上括號"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 317.44,
          "end": 318.15,
          "en": "around that,",
          "zh": "圍住那個，"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 318.16,
          "end": 325.3,
          "en": "now Javascript will first add ten to current result and then multiply the result of this with three",
          "zh": "現在 JavaScript 會先把 10 加到 currentResult，然後把這個結果乘以三"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 325.45,
          "end": 330.65,
          "en": "and of course we can then also divide this by two and subtract one or whatever you want,",
          "zh": "而當然我們也可以再把這個除以二、減一，或任何你想要的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 330.7,
          "end": 337.65999999999997,
          "en": "you can have any mathematical equation here, any mathematical operation here as long as it should be",
          "zh": "你可以在這裡有任何數學方程式、任何數學運算，只要它應該"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 337.75,
          "end": 343.27,
          "en": "where you can use parentheses to group the different mathematical calculations together if you need",
          "zh": "你可以用括號把不同的數學計算分組，如果你需要"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 343.27,
          "end": 344.64,
          "en": "to do that.",
          "zh": "那樣做。"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 344.65,
          "end": 354.37,
          "en": "So now if I would run this for example, I got a result of 14 because we have 0 plus 10 times 3 divided",
          "zh": "所以現在如果我例如執行這個，我得到結果 14，因為我們有 0 加 10 乘 3 除以"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 354.37,
          "end": 357.65999999999997,
          "en": "by 2 is 15 minus 1 is 14,",
          "zh": "2 是 15，減 1 是 14，"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 357.67,
          "end": 364.9,
          "en": "so that makes sense. Now with that out of the way, let's think a bit more about the that values we're",
          "zh": "所以那說得通。現在那個先放一邊，讓我們多想一點我們實際上在處理的那些值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 364.9,
          "end": 371.59,
          "en": "actually working with. I added a number here but numbers are not the only values you can use in Javascript",
          "zh": "我在這裡加了一個數字，但數字不是你在 JavaScript 能用的唯一值"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 371.8,
          "end": 375.19,
          "en": "and actually in all other modern programming languages.",
          "zh": "而其實在所有其他現代程式語言裡也是。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "15853210",
      "title": "Understanding the Starting Code",
      "lectureOrder": 22,
      "videoOrder": 18,
      "sourceHash": "1d87e9f9ff64eed1690e3a3a67a98468a5ec6cd8c2851f63b3f036be1c61968e",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.27,
          "end": 6.77,
          "en": "Now let me also make clear what output result really does here,",
          "zh": "現在讓我也說清楚 outputResult 在這裡真正做什麼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 6.96,
          "end": 12.87,
          "en": "this does something which is called call a function, which I'll dive into later so we can ignore this",
          "zh": "這做的是一件叫做呼叫函式的事，我稍後會深入，所以我們目前可以忽略這個"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 12.87,
          "end": 13.65,
          "en": "for now,",
          "zh": "現在，"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 13.65,
          "end": 20.22,
          "en": "in the end it triggers some code which I defined here in vendor.js and this code uses two pieces",
          "zh": "最後它觸發一些我在這裡 vendor.js 定義的程式碼，而這段程式碼使用兩份"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 20.22,
          "end": 22.96,
          "en": "of information which I kind of forward to it.",
          "zh": "資訊，我算是轉交給它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 23.01,
          "end": 27.99,
          "en": "Again we'll figure out the details of what this is and how we use it later because we'll write our",
          "zh": "再次，我們稍後會弄清這是什麼、我們怎麼用它的細節，因為那時我們會寫我們"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 28.11,
          "end": 35.56,
          "en": "own functions then but in the end, I push this data to this thing in vendor.",
          "zh": "自己的函式，但最後，我把這份資料推進 vendor 裡的這個東西。"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 35.61,
          "end": 42.15,
          "en": "What this does is it takes these two pieces of information it gets and writes them into my HTML",
          "zh": "它做的是拿它得到的這兩份資訊，並把它們寫進我的 HTML"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 42.15,
          "end": 42.63,
          "en": "code",
          "zh": "程式碼"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 42.63,
          "end": 48.76,
          "en": "you could say because ultimately what that code does, without diving into the details which we'll also",
          "zh": "可以說是這樣，因為最終那段程式碼做的，先不深入細節，那些我們也會"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 48.77,
          "end": 56.49,
          "en": "cover later in the course because it's a bit more advanced, what this code does is it targets two places,",
          "zh": "在課程稍後涵蓋，因為它比較進階，這段程式碼做的是對準兩個地方，"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 56.49,
          "end": 59.19,
          "en": "two pieces of our HTML code,",
          "zh": "我們 HTML 程式碼的兩段，"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 59.19,
          "end": 66.69,
          "en": "these two lines essentially and overwrites the data which is hardcoded in there with a dynamically derived",
          "zh": "基本上是這兩行，並覆寫那裡寫死的資料，換成動態得出的"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 66.69,
          "end": 67.32,
          "en": "data",
          "zh": "資料"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 67.32,
          "end": 70.58,
          "en": "with the data you are forwarding here,",
          "zh": "用你在這裡轉交的資料，"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 70.68,
          "end": 76.17,
          "en": "so with your result and with this empty string, that's what's happening here.",
          "zh": "所以用你的結果，以及這個空字串，那就是這裡發生的事。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "15853214",
      "title": "Data Types: Numbers & Strings (Text)",
      "lectureOrder": 23,
      "videoOrder": 19,
      "sourceHash": "d0382587969b2f7b9e0dd5009b2fffbde87e621ecd1d0d6e1b9b910ef4876f0a",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.34,
          "end": 5.28,
          "en": "So which data types are available for you to use?",
          "zh": "所以你可以使用哪些資料型別？"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.61,
          "end": 8.03,
          "en": "Well there are numbers which I just used",
          "zh": "嗯有數字，我剛剛用過"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.13,
          "end": 14.82,
          "en": "and of course not just positive, non-decimal numbers but also negative numbers like -3 or numbers",
          "zh": "而當然不只正數、非小數的數字，也有負數像 -3，或"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 14.82,
          "end": 18.66,
          "en": "with decimal places like 22.956",
          "zh": "有小數位的數字像 22.956"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 18.72,
          "end": 22.5,
          "en": "and important here, numbers with decimal places,",
          "zh": "而這裡重要的是，有小數位的數字，"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 22.5,
          "end": 27.8,
          "en": "so like 22.956 are called floats or floating point numbers,",
          "zh": "所以像 22.956 叫做 floats，或浮點數，"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 27.96,
          "end": 34.41,
          "en": "numbers without decimal places like here, 2 or -3, are called integers.",
          "zh": "沒有小數位的數字，像這裡的 2 或 -3，叫做整數。"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 34.41,
          "end": 39.6,
          "en": "Now you of course use numbers for any code where you need to calculate something or where you just need",
          "zh": "現在你當然在任何需要計算某件事的程式碼裡使用數字，或你只是需要"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 39.6,
          "end": 41.67,
          "en": "to work with a number",
          "zh": "處理一個數字"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 41.67,
          "end": 47.37,
          "en": "and of course typically that's a lot of code, whether you're having a calculator like we're writing it",
          "zh": "而當然通常那是很多程式碼，不管你有一個計算機，像我們正在寫的"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 47.37,
          "end": 51.88,
          "en": "or you're working with some prices or something like that,",
          "zh": "或你在處理一些價格或類似的東西，"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 51.96,
          "end": 55.14,
          "en": "you would typically work with numbers of course.",
          "zh": "你通常當然會用數字。"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 55.43,
          "end": 57.85,
          "en": "Now you don't just have numbers in code",
          "zh": "現在你在程式碼裡不只有數字"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 57.86,
          "end": 60.31,
          "en": "however, sometimes you also need text,",
          "zh": "不過，有時候你也需要文字，"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 60.35,
          "end": 64.01,
          "en": "let's say you're working with the name of a user who logged in",
          "zh": "假設你在處理登入使用者的名稱"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 64.01,
          "end": 70.88,
          "en": "or you want to show a message to the user, then you're working with text or also called strings and",
          "zh": "或你想給使用者顯示一則訊息，那麼你在處理文字，也叫做字串，而"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 70.91,
          "end": 75.31,
          "en": "it's not just called strings in Javascript but in other programming languages as well,",
          "zh": "不只是 JavaScript 叫它們字串，其他程式語言也是，"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 75.32,
          "end": 79.93,
          "en": "so if I say a string, I mean a text type.",
          "zh": "所以如果我說一個字串，我指的是文字型別。"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 80,
          "end": 87.38,
          "en": "Now you can actually create a string by wrapping your text between single quotes, double quotes or these",
          "zh": "現在你其實可以建立字串，把文字包在單引號、雙引號，或這些"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 87.38,
          "end": 90.36,
          "en": "back ticks here which you find on your keyboard,",
          "zh": "反引號之間，你在鍵盤上找得到，"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 90.59,
          "end": 92.78999999999999,
          "en": "all three creates a valid string.",
          "zh": "這三種都會建立有效的字串。"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 92.96000000000001,
          "end": 96.09,
          "en": "You can use whatever you want, you just should be consistent though",
          "zh": "你可以用任何你想要的，你只是應該保持一致"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 96.13,
          "end": 98.28999999999999,
          "en": "the third option here, the back ticks,",
          "zh": "這裡第三個選項，反引號，"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 98.36,
          "end": 99.84,
          "en": "that's kind of special,",
          "zh": "那有點特別，"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 99.86,
          "end": 102.61,
          "en": "I'll come back to what's special here later, for the moment,",
          "zh": "我稍後會回來談這裡特別的地方，目前，"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 102.62,
          "end": 109.22999999999999,
          "en": "use either single quotes or double quotes and then again, be consistent and always use that.",
          "zh": "用單引號或雙引號，然後再次，保持一致並永遠用那個。"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 109.25,
          "end": 114.89,
          "en": "So that would be important for outputting results, for gathering user input, for showing messages, things",
          "zh": "所以那對輸出結果、收集使用者輸入、顯示訊息這類事情會很重要"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 114.89,
          "end": 116.39,
          "en": "like that.",
          "zh": "像那樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 116.45,
          "end": 120.67,
          "en": "Now we can see both types in action here in our program,",
          "zh": "現在我們可以在這裡的程式裡看到兩種型別實際運作，"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 120.71,
          "end": 123.33,
          "en": "got a number here, we've got a bunch of numbers here",
          "zh": "這裡有一個數字，我們這裡有一堆數字"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 123.5,
          "end": 126.1,
          "en": "and this thing here, this actually is a string,",
          "zh": "而這裡這個東西，這其實是一個字串，"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 126.14,
          "end": 131.33,
          "en": "it just happens to be an empty string. Now with empty string,",
          "zh": "它剛好是一個空字串。現在說到空字串，"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 131.33,
          "end": 135.83,
          "en": "I mean that this is just an opening and closing single quote and I could have used double quotes as I",
          "zh": "我的意思是這只是一組開始和結束的單引號，而我也可以用雙引號，如我"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 135.83,
          "end": 138.26,
          "en": "mentioned but there's nothing in between",
          "zh": "提到的，但中間什麼都沒有"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 138.44,
          "end": 145.68,
          "en": "because this output result thing here actually is responsible for writing to two places in my webpage",
          "zh": "因為這裡這個 outputResult 其實負責寫到我網頁上的兩個地方"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 145.97,
          "end": 149.77,
          "en": "and for now I'm only interested in writing to this place here and output my number,",
          "zh": "而目前我只想寫到這裡這個地方，並輸出我的數字，"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 149.87,
          "end": 154.73,
          "en": "I'm not interested in writing to the other place and therefore I tell it to write nothing to that other",
          "zh": "我沒興趣寫到另一個地方，因此我告訴它什麼都不寫到那個另一個"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 154.73,
          "end": 155.92000000000002,
          "en": "place.",
          "zh": "地方。"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 155.93,
          "end": 162.77,
          "en": "Now we could actually write our log here to the other place and that could be done by creating a new",
          "zh": "現在我們其實可以把我們的計算寫到另一個地方，做法是建立一個新的"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 162.82999999999998,
          "end": 172.63,
          "en": "variable, let's say calculation description and you can use any name you want here, I just try to describe",
          "zh": "變數，假設 calculationDescription，而你在這裡可以用任何你想要的名稱，我只是試著描述"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 172.63,
          "end": 177.7,
          "en": "what I'll store it in this variable and what I will store here is a description of the calculation we",
          "zh": "我會存在這個變數裡的東西，而我在這裡要存的是我們這個計算的描述，我們"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 177.7,
          "end": 178.95,
          "en": "just ran",
          "zh": "剛跑的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 179.35,
          "end": 183.94,
          "en": "and that would be that we had 0 plus 10 in quotes",
          "zh": "而那會是我們有 0 加 10，在引號裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 187.3,
          "end": 188.32,
          "en": "times 3",
          "zh": "乘以 3"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 188.32,
          "end": 189.84,
          "en": "divided by 2 minus 1.",
          "zh": "除以 2 減 1。"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 189.85,
          "end": 195.94,
          "en": "Now the important thing here is, this is now not a mathematical equation which will be executed by Javascript,",
          "zh": "現在這裡重要的是，這現在不是 JavaScript 會執行的數學方程式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 195.97,
          "end": 202.51,
          "en": "this is treated as text and therefore Javascript won't even try to execute it in a mathematical way,",
          "zh": "這被當成文字，因此 JavaScript 甚至不會試著用數學方式執行它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 202.51,
          "end": 210.19,
          "en": "instead we can now pass calculation description to this output result thing, so I'm referring to this description",
          "zh": "相對地，我們現在可以把 calculationDescription 傳給這個 outputResult，所以我指的是這個描述"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 210.19,
          "end": 211.09,
          "en": "here",
          "zh": "在這裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 211.3,
          "end": 216.88,
          "en": "and what will now happen is that you see this text here once you reload this page. Again,",
          "zh": "而現在會發生的是，你重新載入這個頁面後會看到這裡這段文字。再次，"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 216.97,
          "end": 219.24,
          "en": "this is just the text I just entered,",
          "zh": "這只是我剛輸入的文字，"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 219.25,
          "end": 225.16,
          "en": "it looks like some mathematical equation which should be executed but since I'm not using numbers here",
          "zh": "它看起來像某個應該被執行的數學方程式，但既然我這裡不是用數字"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 225.19,
          "end": 226.99,
          "en": "but I'm wrapping this in quotes,",
          "zh": "而是把這個包在引號裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 226.99,
          "end": 233.76,
          "en": "I'm telling Javascript, this is some static text don't touch it, don't try to execute it, take it as text.",
          "zh": "我在告訴 JavaScript，這是一些靜態文字，不要碰它，不要試著執行它，把它當成文字。"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 233.92000000000002,
          "end": 235.97,
          "en": "I could be saying Hi there",
          "zh": "我也可以在這裡說 Hi there"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 236.02,
          "end": 241.47,
          "en": "in here as well and if I would do that, then we would see Hi there here.",
          "zh": "同樣，而如果我那樣做，那麼我們會在這裡看到 Hi there。"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 241.6,
          "end": 248.08,
          "en": "But of course I just want to, in this case, in this application, log my calculation which I effectively",
          "zh": "但當然我只是想，在這個例子、這個應用程式裡，紀錄我實際上"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 248.08,
          "end": 255.01,
          "en": "have up there and therefore this is what I use here. If I would use current result in here, Javascript",
          "zh": "在上面有的計算，因此這就是我在這裡用的。如果我在這裡使用 currentResult，JavaScript"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 255.07,
          "end": 260.68,
          "en": "also wouldn't try to look into this variable, instead it would take this as part of the string and",
          "zh": "也不會試著去看這個變數，相對地它會把這個當成字串的一部分，而"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 260.68,
          "end": 266.86,
          "en": "hence if I now reload, it would say well this here, it would not give us the value which is inside of",
          "zh": "因此如果我現在重新載入，它會說嗯這裡這個，它不會給我們存在裡面的值"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 266.86,
          "end": 267.91,
          "en": "current result,",
          "zh": "currentResult，"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 267.91,
          "end": 275.14,
          "en": "instead it would just take this as some text which it should output. If you would want to use the value",
          "zh": "相對地它只會把這個當成某段它應該輸出的文字。如果你想在這裡使用那個值"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 275.14,
          "end": 275.7,
          "en": "here,",
          "zh": "這裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 275.86,
          "end": 282.37,
          "en": "you would have to do something which is called string concatenation which is you build a string from",
          "zh": "你必須做一件叫做字串串接的事，也就是你組出一個字串，從"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 282.37,
          "end": 284.54,
          "en": "multiple substrings.",
          "zh": "多個子字串。"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 284.68,
          "end": 289.75,
          "en": "So here, we could say this opening bracket, the opening parentheses here,",
          "zh": "所以這裡，我們可以說這個開始括號，這裡的開始圓括號，"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 289.84000000000003,
          "end": 297.58,
          "en": "that's in a string, then with the plus operator, we add current result, now not between quotes but just",
          "zh": "那在一個字串裡，然後用加號運算子，我們加上 currentResult，現在不是在引號之間，而只是"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 297.58,
          "end": 298.29,
          "en": "like this",
          "zh": "像這樣"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 298.33,
          "end": 306.25,
          "en": "and therefore Javascript will now go ahead and look into this variable and then I will concatenate this",
          "zh": "因此 JavaScript 現在會去看這個變數，然後我會串接這個"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 306.31,
          "end": 306.85,
          "en": "string.",
          "zh": "字串。"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 306.97,
          "end": 309.16,
          "en": "So now again between quotes is this string,",
          "zh": "所以現在再次，引號之間是這個字串，"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 309.16,
          "end": 315.73,
          "en": "the pluses here are also not between quotes because I don't want to treat the plus operators here as",
          "zh": "這裡的加號也不在引號之間，因為我不想把這裡的加號運算子當成"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 315.76,
          "end": 319.09,
          "en": "strings but instead as normal operators.",
          "zh": "字串，而是當成一般運算子。"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 319.09,
          "end": 322,
          "en": "Now we use plus before with numbers,",
          "zh": "現在我們之前對數字使用加號，"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 322.06,
          "end": 327.79,
          "en": "Javascript actually can also work with plus if you're using it with strings, then it will not try to",
          "zh": "JavaScript 其實也能在你對字串使用加號時處理加號，那時它不會試著"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 327.79,
          "end": 330.14,
          "en": "use plus in a mathematical way,",
          "zh": "用數學方式使用加號，"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 330.16,
          "end": 337.13,
          "en": "instead it will just combine multiple strings, so multiple text pieces, to a longer text piece and",
          "zh": "相對地它只會把多個字串、所以多段文字，組合成更長的一段文字，而"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 337.19,
          "end": 338.46,
          "en": "that's what's happening here.",
          "zh": "那就是這裡發生的事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 338.5,
          "end": 344.53,
          "en": "We're combining this parentheses with the actual value that lives in current result and then with this",
          "zh": "我們把這個括號和實際存在 currentResult 裡的值組合，然後和這裡這個"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 344.53,
          "end": 347.11,
          "en": "part here, to a longer string and",
          "zh": "部分，組成一個更長的字串，而"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 347.12,
          "end": 354.79,
          "en": "actually here, you should add some whitespace so that in the final text which is created,  you have some",
          "zh": "其實這裡，你應該加一些空白，這樣在最後產生的文字裡，你有一些"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 354.88,
          "end": 358.78,
          "en": "empty space between the plus and the value that's stored in current result.",
          "zh": "空白在加號和存在 currentResult 裡的值之間。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "15853216",
      "title": "Using Constants",
      "lectureOrder": 24,
      "videoOrder": 20,
      "sourceHash": "7a194453124ecaac998e295a1d2f17de9e6bb5f42cd1554e835b9964ba016d47",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.25,
          "end": 7.23,
          "en": "Now the output you'll get if you reload might not exactly be what you want because it actually yields",
          "zh": "現在如果你重新載入，你得到的輸出可能不完全是你想要的，因為它其實得到"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 7.23,
          "end": 10.25,
          "en": "14 here instead of 0",
          "zh": "這裡是 14，而不是 0"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 10.26,
          "end": 15.87,
          "en": "but if you take a closer look at your code, that makes sense because current result is 0 here",
          "zh": "但如果你更仔細看你的程式碼，那就說得通，因為 currentResult 在這裡是 0"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 16.11,
          "end": 18.77,
          "en": "but then we calculate a new current result.",
          "zh": "但然後我們計算一個新的 currentResult。"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 18.9,
          "end": 25.95,
          "en": "So if I then use current result here, I of course take this current result and not the one I had up here.",
          "zh": "所以如果我之後在這裡使用 currentResult，我當然拿的是這個 currentResult，而不是我上面有的那個。"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 26,
          "end": 27.59,
          "en": "The reason for that is simple,",
          "zh": "原因很簡單，"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 27.59,
          "end": 31.19,
          "en": "your Javascript code gets executed from top to bottom,",
          "zh": "你的 JavaScript 程式碼從上到下執行，"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 31.22,
          "end": 35.51,
          "en": "actually your HTML file gets parsed from top to bottom by the browser",
          "zh": "其實你的 HTML 檔案被瀏覽器從上到下解析"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 35.63,
          "end": 41.39,
          "en": "and if you then import some Javascript in there, that file gets evaluated and executed by the browser",
          "zh": "而如果你之後在那裡引入一些 JavaScript，那個檔案被瀏覽器評估並執行"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 41.69,
          "end": 45.95,
          "en": "and the code in there also gets executed from top to bottom and",
          "zh": "而裡面的程式碼也從上到下執行，而"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 46.07,
          "end": 51.59,
          "en": "that's the default Javascript behavior and hence of course if you do something in this line and then you",
          "zh": "那是 JavaScript 的預設行為，因此當然如果你在這一行做某件事，然後你"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 51.59,
          "end": 57.03,
          "en": "use it in the line thereafter, you get the result from this line and not the result from the first line.",
          "zh": "在後面那一行使用它，你得到的是這一行的結果，而不是第一行的結果。"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 57.08,
          "end": 61.7,
          "en": "It would be pretty bad if that would be the case because then you could never do anything in your code.",
          "zh": "如果是那樣就很糟，因為那樣你在程式碼裡就永遠做不了任何事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 62.57,
          "end": 70.46000000000001,
          "en": "So to print zero here, we would either have to do this before we execute this line or store this initial",
          "zh": "所以要在這裡印出零，我們要嘛必須在執行這一行之前做這個，或把這個初始"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 70.46000000000001,
          "end": 72.8,
          "en": "value in another variable",
          "zh": "值存在另一個變數"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 73.03,
          "end": 79.38,
          "en": "and that's actually where we could use a constant. Let's say we're writing a program here where we want",
          "zh": "而那其實是我們可以使用常數的地方。假設我們在這裡寫一個程式，我們想"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 79.38,
          "end": 87.58,
          "en": "to initialize our current result with a default result value and I'm naming this constant here default",
          "zh": "用一個預設結果值初始化我們的 currentResult，而我把這個常數命名為 default"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 87.58,
          "end": 88.11,
          "en": "result,",
          "zh": "Result，"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 88.11,
          "end": 89.57,
          "en": "you could pick any name you want.",
          "zh": "你可以挑任何你想要的名稱。"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 89.7,
          "end": 95.4,
          "en": "Now I'm using the const keyword to indicate that the value I store in here will never change and I store",
          "zh": "現在我使用 const 關鍵字，表示我存在這裡的值永不改變，而我在這裡存"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 95.43,
          "end": 97.08,
          "en": "zero in here.",
          "zh": "零。"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 97.08,
          "end": 101.28,
          "en": "Now we can use the default result here to initialize the variable,",
          "zh": "現在我們可以在這裡用 defaultResult 來初始化變數，"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 101.28,
          "end": 106.83,
          "en": "yes you can initialize a variable with the value of another variable or of another constant and",
          "zh": "對，你可以用另一個變數的值，或另一個常數的值來初始化一個變數，而"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 106.86,
          "end": 109.14,
          "en": "that's exactly what I'm doing here.",
          "zh": "那正是我在這裡做的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 109.17,
          "end": 114.3,
          "en": "The result of that is if we now change current result, we can do that because that's a variable created",
          "zh": "那樣的結果是，如果我們現在改變 currentResult，我們可以那樣做，因為那是用"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 114.3,
          "end": 117.78,
          "en": "with let, we couldn't change default result,",
          "zh": "let 建立的變數，我們不能改變 defaultResult，"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 117.78,
          "end": 124.35,
          "en": "so if I would try to do that here and I now save this, you will actually see zero here because our",
          "zh": "所以如果我試著在這裡那樣做，而我現在存檔，你其實會在這裡看到零，因為我們的"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 124.35,
          "end": 127.77,
          "en": "script broke and you can see that in an even better way",
          "zh": "腳本壞了，而你可以用更好的方式看到那個"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 127.86,
          "end": 133.86,
          "en": "if you go to the developer tools here in Chrome which I recommend that you use, you'll find those in the",
          "zh": "如果你到 Chrome 裡這裡的開發者工具，我建議你使用，你會在"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 133.86,
          "end": 139.02,
          "en": "view menu and then developer, developer tools or by using the shortcut you see there.",
          "zh": "檢視選單找到那些，然後開發人員、開發人員工具，或用你在那裡看到的快捷鍵。"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 139.02,
          "end": 141.12,
          "en": "Now what are these developer tools?",
          "zh": "現在這些開發者工具是什麼？"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 141.12,
          "end": 146.1,
          "en": "I'll have a whole module after this module where we dive deeper into them and what you can do with them,",
          "zh": "這個單元之後我會有一整個單元，我們更深入它們，以及你能用它們做什麼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 146.1,
          "end": 151.47,
          "en": "in general that's simply a tool built into the browser which you don't typically see or use if you're",
          "zh": "一般來說那只是內建在瀏覽器的工具，如果你"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 151.47,
          "end": 157.8,
          "en": "using the browser as a normal user but as a developer, this is a special feature built into the",
          "zh": "以一般使用者使用瀏覽器，通常不會看到或使用，但身為開發者，這是內建在"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 157.8,
          "end": 165.69,
          "en": "browser that helps us understand our code, look behind the scenes, have some insights in how our code",
          "zh": "瀏覽器裡的特殊功能，幫助我們理解程式碼、看幕後、對我們的程式碼怎麼"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 165.78,
          "end": 174.03,
          "en": "executes, trace and fix possible errors and also see error messages or info messages being output here.",
          "zh": "執行有一些洞察、追蹤並修正可能的錯誤，也看到這裡輸出的錯誤訊息或資訊訊息。"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 174.03,
          "end": 180.9,
          "en": "So these are the developer tools, a crucial feature which do not just exist in Chrome, Firefox and Edge",
          "zh": "所以這些是開發者工具，一個關鍵功能，不只存在於 Chrome，Firefox 和 Edge"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 180.96,
          "end": 186.57,
          "en": "also have developer tools built-in, Chrome just has very good ones and therefore that will be",
          "zh": "也有內建的開發者工具，Chrome 的只是非常好，因此那會是"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 186.57,
          "end": 192.24,
          "en": "the browser I use in this course but again, I'll have a whole module where we dive a bit deeper into",
          "zh": "我在這門課使用的瀏覽器，但再次，我會有一整個單元，我們更深入一點"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 192.24,
          "end": 194.61,
          "en": "developer tools and what we can do with them",
          "zh": "開發者工具，以及我們能用它們做什麼"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 194.73,
          "end": 201.74,
          "en": "after this module. And in these tools if you go to the console here, so to console, you should see an error,",
          "zh": "在這個單元之後。而在這些工具裡，如果你到這裡的主控台，所以到 console，你應該看到一個錯誤，"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 201.92000000000002,
          "end": 203.75,
          "en": "assignment constant variable.",
          "zh": "Assignment to constant variable。"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 203.75,
          "end": 205.64,
          "en": "That's a problem,",
          "zh": "那是一個問題，"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 205.64,
          "end": 209.06,
          "en": "your browser complains about it because that's not allowed.",
          "zh": "你的瀏覽器在抱怨它，因為那是不允許的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 209.06,
          "end": 212.95,
          "en": "So that's not allowed but assigning to current result is allowed because that's a variable",
          "zh": "所以那是不允許的，但指派給 currentResult 是允許的，因為那是一個變數"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 213.07999999999998,
          "end": 219.44,
          "en": "but since I now store this default result which I then use to initialize current result, I can also refer",
          "zh": "但既然我現在存這個 defaultResult，然後用它初始化 currentResult，我也可以在"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 219.44,
          "end": 227.07999999999998,
          "en": "to this down there when I output my text or when I generate my text. We can refer to it here and here,",
          "zh": "下面輸出文字或產生文字時指到這個。我們可以在這裡和這裡指到它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 227.09,
          "end": 229.91,
          "en": "so I'm referring to default result in two places of my code,",
          "zh": "所以我在程式碼的兩個地方指到 defaultResult，"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 229.91,
          "end": 233.15,
          "en": "I'm never changing it though because that wouldn't be allowed.",
          "zh": "不過我從不改變它，因為那是不允許的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 233.77,
          "end": 240.46,
          "en": "Now we introduced a constant and you might be wondering if we're not implicitly still changing the constant",
          "zh": "現在我們介紹了常數，而你可能會想，我們是不是仍然隱含地在用程式碼改變常數"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 240.46,
          "end": 247.14,
          "en": "with our code because I initialize current result with the value which is stored in my constant and",
          "zh": "因為我用存在常數裡的值初始化 currentResult，而"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 247.15,
          "end": 253.42,
          "en": "since I thereafter change current result, you could think that implicitly we also change the constant, right,",
          "zh": "既然我之後改變 currentResult，你可能會想我們也隱含地改變了常數，對吧，"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 253.45,
          "end": 256.57,
          "en": "because we set those equal in this line",
          "zh": "因為我們在這一行把它們設成相等"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 256.57,
          "end": 263.86,
          "en": "but it's important to understand that indeed we are not changing the constant here because here, we are",
          "zh": "但重要的是理解，我們這裡確實沒有改變常數，因為這裡，我們是"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 263.86,
          "end": 268.93,
          "en": "copying the value that's in a constant into this brand new variable.",
          "zh": "把常數裡的值複製進這個全新的變數。"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 268.93,
          "end": 275.92,
          "en": "So if we thereafter change the variable, we're changing the copy, the original constant and its value are",
          "zh": "所以如果我們之後改變變數，我們改變的是複本，原本的常數和它的值"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 275.98,
          "end": 276.63,
          "en": "untouched",
          "zh": "沒被碰過"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 276.64,
          "end": 282.85,
          "en": "if we then change the variable, that's something important to keep in mind here or to understand. And",
          "zh": "如果我們之後改變變數，那是這裡要放在心上、或要理解的重要事情。而"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 282.85,
          "end": 284.3,
          "en": "therefore now if I reload,",
          "zh": "因此現在如果我重新載入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 284.51,
          "end": 291.37,
          "en": "we see this result and we see the correct text representation of this calculation because we're now",
          "zh": "我們看到這個結果，也看到這個計算的正確文字呈現，因為我們現在"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 291.46,
          "end": 297.07,
          "en": "using this correctly and we're building a text with our default value which never changes.",
          "zh": "正確地使用這個，而我們用永不改變的預設值組出一段文字。"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 297.1,
          "end": 300.22,
          "en": "So this shows us constants and variables in action,",
          "zh": "所以這讓我們看到常數和變數實際運作，"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 300.28,
          "end": 306.97,
          "en": "it shows us operators both used with numbers and also with text and we get something on the screen, not",
          "zh": "它讓我們看到運算子，既用在數字上也用在文字上，而我們在螢幕上得到東西，對"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 306.97,
          "end": 308.62,
          "en": "too bad to get started with.",
          "zh": "起步來說還不錯。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "15853218",
      "title": "More on Strings",
      "lectureOrder": 25,
      "videoOrder": 21,
      "sourceHash": "b4c101ef146510ee52f5ac18da801c62df4b5d1f099b0d612cffc4773573e09b",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.33,
          "end": 7.14,
          "en": "Now let me have a closer look at our text here, at our string which we're combining from a couple of",
          "zh": "現在讓我更仔細看這裡的文字，看我們正在組合的字串，它來自幾個"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 7.14,
          "end": 8.52,
          "en": "substrings.",
          "zh": "子字串。"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.52,
          "end": 14.01,
          "en": "Now for one I mentioned that you can use single or double quotes and the decision is really up to you,",
          "zh": "現在首先，我提到你可以使用單引號或雙引號，決定真的由你，"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 14.01,
          "end": 16.71,
          "en": "you can go for either of the two solutions,",
          "zh": "你可以選兩種做法的其中一種，"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 16.71,
          "end": 22.44,
          "en": "I will use single quotes throughout the course but that's just my personal preference, not something you",
          "zh": "我整門課會使用單引號，但那只是我的個人偏好，不是你"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 22.44,
          "end": 23.32,
          "en": "have to use.",
          "zh": "必須使用的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 23.34,
          "end": 27.46,
          "en": "However, you should be consistent and stick to your choice thereafter.",
          "zh": "不過，你應該保持一致，並在之後堅持你的選擇。"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 27.69,
          "end": 35.67,
          "en": "What you can't do is mix your characters, so you can't open a string with a double quote and try to close",
          "zh": "你不能做的是混用字元，所以你不能用雙引號開啟字串，然後試著用"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 35.67,
          "end": 37.03,
          "en": "it with a single quote,",
          "zh": "單引號關閉它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 37.05,
          "end": 37.89,
          "en": "this will not work,",
          "zh": "這不會運作，"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 37.89,
          "end": 41.3,
          "en": "you always have to close a string with the character,",
          "zh": "你永遠必須用那個字元關閉字串，"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 41.3,
          "end": 44.58,
          "en": "so with double quote or single quote with which you opened it.",
          "zh": "所以用你開啟它的雙引號或單引號。"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 44.88,
          "end": 50.33,
          "en": "So this string here for example is opened with a double quote and then I have no other double quote,",
          "zh": "所以這裡這個字串例如是用雙引號開啟，然後我沒有其他雙引號，"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 50.34,
          "end": 52.55,
          "en": "therefore this string never gets closed,",
          "zh": "因此這個字串永遠不會被關閉，"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 52.62,
          "end": 59.25,
          "en": "that actually therefore is invalid Javascript code and hence my IDE already complains here that",
          "zh": "那實際上因此是無效的 JavaScript 程式碼，所以我的 IDE 已經在這裡抱怨"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 59.25,
          "end": 64.37,
          "en": "this is an unterminated string literal so that this string has no end",
          "zh": "這是未結束的字串字面值，所以這個字串沒有結尾"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 64.44,
          "end": 68.64,
          "en": "and if we would try to run this code and reload our page,",
          "zh": "而如果我們試著執行這段程式碼並重新載入頁面，"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 68.64,
          "end": 74.28,
          "en": "indeed if you look into the developer tools again, you'll get an error.",
          "zh": "確實，如果你再次看開發者工具，你會得到一個錯誤。"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 74.28999999999999,
          "end": 77.88,
          "en": "Now the interesting thing actually is if I do close it with a double quote,",
          "zh": "現在有趣的事實際上是，如果我用雙引號關閉它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 77.98,
          "end": 82.53999999999999,
          "en": "now everything in between will be treated as one text.",
          "zh": "現在中間的一切會被當成一段文字。"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 82.53999999999999,
          "end": 88,
          "en": "So when you open something with single or double quotes, everything in between the opening and closing",
          "zh": "所以當你用單引號或雙引號開啟某物，開啟與關閉之間的一切"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 88.12,
          "end": 93.31,
          "en": "single or double quotes will be one piece of text, which makes sense if you think about it.",
          "zh": "單引號或雙引號會是一段文字，如果你想想，這說得通。"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 93.34,
          "end": 97.08,
          "en": "How would Javascript know whether you want to create a new string there,",
          "zh": "JavaScript 怎麼知道你是否想在那裡建立新字串，"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 97.07,
          "end": 100.44,
          "en": "there also is nothing like a string inside of a string?",
          "zh": "也沒有字串裡面的字串這種東西？"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 100.53999999999999,
          "end": 107.52000000000001,
          "en": "Instead if we now reload the page, we got rid of our error but now our whole we want to create a string",
          "zh": "相反，如果我們現在重新載入頁面，我們擺脫了錯誤，但現在我們整個想建立字串的"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 107.53,
          "end": 114.1,
          "en": "code is actually treated as one piece of text and therefore output as such here.",
          "zh": "程式碼實際上被當成一段文字，因此在這裡被這樣輸出。"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 114.13,
          "end": 119.47,
          "en": "So you always have to close your string with what you opened it and everything in between will be treated",
          "zh": "所以你永遠必須用你開啟它的東西關閉字串，而中間的一切會被當成"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 119.47,
          "end": 120.75,
          "en": "as text.",
          "zh": "文字。"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 120.76,
          "end": 127.21,
          "en": "Now you can take advantage of this if you for example want to print this single quote character because",
          "zh": "現在你可以善用這個，例如如果你想印出這個單引號字元，因為"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 127.21,
          "end": 132.52,
          "en": "right now if I use just single quotes and no double quotes and the same would be true if you were just",
          "zh": "現在如果我只用單引號、沒有雙引號，而如果你只用"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 132.52,
          "end": 138.27,
          "en": "using double quotes and no single quotes, if I reload, we get the output we saw before",
          "zh": "雙引號、沒有單引號，也會一樣，如果我重新載入，我們得到之前看到的輸出"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 138.49,
          "end": 144.01,
          "en": "but what if I actually did want to output a single quote character here?",
          "zh": "但如果我實際上想在這裡輸出一個單引號字元呢？"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 144.06,
          "end": 148.82999999999998,
          "en": "Well then, you could try to add a single quote inside of a single quote but this won't work, instead",
          "zh": "嗯，那麼，你可以試著在單引號裡面加一個單引號，但這不會運作，相反"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 148.82999999999998,
          "end": 155.57999999999998,
          "en": "what now happens is that Javascript creates a string here and creates a string here and in between, it",
          "zh": "現在發生的是 JavaScript 在這裡建立一個字串，並在這裡建立一個字串，而中間，它"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 155.57999999999998,
          "end": 161.76,
          "en": "has this bracket which actually leads to some invalid Javascript code overall here because we're not",
          "zh": "有這個括號，實際上導致這裡整體有些無效的 JavaScript 程式碼，因為我們沒有"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 161.76,
          "end": 167.94,
          "en": "using any operators that would try to concatenate that and even if we would, a single opening bracket",
          "zh": "使用任何會試著串接那個的運算子，而即使我們會，像這樣的單一開啟括號"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 167.94,
          "end": 171.18,
          "en": "like this is not valid Javascript code.",
          "zh": "不是有效的 JavaScript 程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 171.3,
          "end": 177.03,
          "en": "So if you want to output the single quote character, you can actually take advantage of the double quotes",
          "zh": "所以如果你想輸出單引號字元，你實際上可以善用雙引號"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 177.03,
          "end": 183.82,
          "en": "and for example wrap your code, your string that contains the single quote which you want to output, between",
          "zh": "並例如把你的程式碼、你想輸出的包含單引號的字串，包在"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 183.82,
          "end": 189.28,
          "en": "double quotes because now we use double quotes to create the string, everything in between the treated",
          "zh": "雙引號之間，因為現在我們用雙引號建立字串，中間的一切被當成"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 189.28,
          "end": 192.85,
          "en": "as text and therefore if we save that and we reload,",
          "zh": "文字，因此如果我們存檔並重新載入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 192.85,
          "end": 196.09,
          "en": "now we see the single quotes here as well.",
          "zh": "現在我們在這裡也看到單引號。"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 196.09,
          "end": 202.15,
          "en": "So that's one way of outputting single quotes if you wanted to, you could deviate from the rule of sticking",
          "zh": "所以那是輸出單引號的一種方式，如果你想要，你可以偏離堅持"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 202.15,
          "end": 207.75,
          "en": "to either a single or double quotes and make an exception if you really want to output the single or",
          "zh": "單引號或雙引號的規則，並做例外，如果你真的想輸出你"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 207.76,
          "end": 211.68,
          "en": "double quotes you otherwise use as your string delimiters.",
          "zh": "否則用來當字串分隔符的單引號或雙引號。"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 211.72,
          "end": 216.4,
          "en": "Here of course, I don't really want to print my single quotes so I don't need to do that.",
          "zh": "這裡當然，我並不是真的想印出我的單引號，所以我不需要做那個。"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 216.49,
          "end": 220.72,
          "en": "Now we'll dive into strings again and again throughout the course because there are more things you can do",
          "zh": "現在我們會在整門課一再深入字串，因為有更多你能對它們做的事"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 220.72,
          "end": 221.5,
          "en": "with them,",
          "zh": "用它們，"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 221.5,
          "end": 225.54,
          "en": "one thing I want to do right away is restructure this string.",
          "zh": "我現在立刻想做的一件事是重組這個字串。"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 225.55,
          "end": 232.57,
          "en": "We're building our string here with three pieces of text you could say, with the opening parentheses,",
          "zh": "我們在這裡用三段文字建立字串，你可以說，用開啟括號、"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 232.57,
          "end": 239.07999999999998,
          "en": "with this code thereafter or with this text thereafter and with the value that's stored in default result.",
          "zh": "用之後這段程式碼，或用之後這段文字，以及存在 defaultResult 的值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 239.07999999999998,
          "end": 246.19,
          "en": "Now in such cases, you can actually also use back ticks instead of single quotes.",
          "zh": "現在在這種情況，你實際上也可以使用反引號，而不是單引號。"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 246.19,
          "end": 247.62,
          "en": "So this is now not a single quote,",
          "zh": "所以這現在不是單引號，"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 247.63,
          "end": 253.19,
          "en": "this is the back tick character which you'll find on your keyboard, get rid of all other single quotes",
          "zh": "這是你會在鍵盤上找到的反引號字元，去掉所有其他你實際上有的單引號"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 253.2,
          "end": 258.75,
          "en": "you actually have and get rid of these pluses you used to combine your strings, only keep the plus which",
          "zh": "並去掉你用來組合字串的這些加號，只保留你"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 258.75,
          "end": 262.86,
          "en": "you want to output on the page and replace the closing single quote",
          "zh": "想在頁面上輸出的加號，並把關閉的單引號換成"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 262.86,
          "end": 265.83,
          "en": "also with the closing back tick or with the back tick.",
          "zh": "關閉的反引號，或換成反引號。"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 265.92,
          "end": 272.82,
          "en": "So now I got two back ticks which surround my text and therefore now if I save this, unsurprisingly here",
          "zh": "所以現在我有兩個反引號包圍我的文字，因此現在如果我存檔這個，毫不意外，這裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 272.82,
          "end": 279.37,
          "en": "I say default result instead of the value which is actually stored in that default result constant",
          "zh": "我說 defaultResult，而不是實際存在那個 defaultResult 常數裡的值"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 279.54,
          "end": 283.15,
          "en": "but now back ticks give you access to a special syntax.",
          "zh": "但現在反引號讓你能用一種特殊語法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 283.38,
          "end": 289.71,
          "en": "You can now use a dollar sign in here and then an opening and closing curly brace and now you can put",
          "zh": "你現在可以在這裡使用錢字號，然後一個開啟與關閉的大括號，而現在你可以放"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 289.71,
          "end": 296.67,
          "en": "your variable or any expression which yields some result, which can be output as text,",
          "zh": "你的變數，或任何產生某個結果、可以被輸出成文字的運算式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 296.79,
          "end": 302.04,
          "en": "so you could also have a calculation like one plus one in here, so you can put that between your opening",
          "zh": "所以你也可以在這裡有像一加一的計算，所以你可以把它放在開啟"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 302.04,
          "end": 303.35,
          "en": "and closing curly braces",
          "zh": "與關閉大括號之間"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 303.37,
          "end": 311.34,
          "en": "now and what this does is it tells Javascript to output the value that's in this constant in this case in",
          "zh": "現在，而這做的是告訴 JavaScript 在這個情況輸出這個常數裡的值，在"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 311.34,
          "end": 317.63,
          "en": "this place of your text. So it will not output the dollar sign or the curly brace,",
          "zh": "你文字的這個位置。所以它不會輸出錢字號或大括號，"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 317.76,
          "end": 322.89,
          "en": "instead it will output the value of the expression as it's called,",
          "zh": "相反它會輸出所謂運算式的值，"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 322.89,
          "end": 329.32,
          "en": "so in this case of the constant you have between the opening and closing curly brace. So if you now save",
          "zh": "所以在這個情況是你放在開啟與關閉大括號之間的常數。所以如果你現在存檔"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 329.36,
          "end": 335.09000000000003,
          "en": "that file and you reload, you'll see zero here which indeed is the value we have in default",
          "zh": "那個檔案並重新載入，你會在這裡看到零，那確實是我們在 default"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 335.09000000000003,
          "end": 341.07,
          "en": "result. This only works with back ticks, if you used single or double quotes,",
          "zh": "Result 裡的值。這只在反引號下運作，如果你使用單引號或雙引號，"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 341.11,
          "end": 347.62,
          "en": "this dollar sign curly brace thing would be treated as regular text and therefore output as such as you",
          "zh": "這個錢字號大括號的東西會被當成一般文字，因此被這樣輸出，如你"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 347.62,
          "end": 348.98,
          "en": "can see.",
          "zh": "可以看到。"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 349.18,
          "end": 354.58,
          "en": "So this is a really nice feature, using these back tics with this dollar sign curly brace thing,",
          "zh": "所以這是真的很好的功能，使用這些反引號搭配這個錢字號大括號的東西，"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 354.94,
          "end": 361.66,
          "en": "if you have some text in which you want to embed or inject some dynamic value, so the result of some",
          "zh": "如果你有某段文字，想在裡面嵌入或注入某個動態值，所以某個"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 361.66,
          "end": 369.22,
          "en": "calculation or the value that's stored in a variable or a constant, then this is simply shorter, it saves",
          "zh": "計算的結果，或存在變數或常數裡的值，那麼這單純更短，它省下"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 369.22,
          "end": 375.88,
          "en": "you the manual string concatenation which we previously had to do where we combined multiple strings with",
          "zh": "你手動的字串串接，那是我們先前必須做的，我們在那裡組合多個字串，用"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 375.88,
          "end": 377.14,
          "en": "the plus operator,",
          "zh": "加號運算子，"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 377.14,
          "end": 383.35,
          "en": "this is simply a bit shorter and therefore how you typically would build a string that includes dynamic",
          "zh": "這單純短一點，因此是你通常會建立字串的方式，字串包含動態"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 383.35,
          "end": 384.32,
          "en": "values.",
          "zh": "值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 384.34,
          "end": 392.35,
          "en": "This overall construct here is called a template literal, so if you ever Google for Javascript template",
          "zh": "這裡這個整體結構叫做模板字面值，所以如果你曾經搜尋 JavaScript template"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 392.35,
          "end": 396.03,
          "en": "literal, you'll find exactly this piece of syntax.",
          "zh": "literal，你會找到正好這段語法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 396.04,
          "end": 400.05,
          "en": "Now there's actually more to it and we'll dive deeper into it throughout this course",
          "zh": "現在實際上還有更多，而我們會在這門課裡更深入它"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 400.12,
          "end": 406.3,
          "en": "but this is the most basic and I would say most important form of using it because that's the form",
          "zh": "但這是最基本、我會說最重要的使用形式，因為那是"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 406.33,
          "end": 413.29,
          "en": "where you will work with it most often to have some text into which you inject or embed some dynamic",
          "zh": "你最常和它工作的形式，有某段文字，你注入或嵌入某個動態"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 413.29,
          "end": 414.02,
          "en": "value.",
          "zh": "值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 414.25,
          "end": 419.62,
          "en": "Now some additional information about strings and template literals as we have it here.",
          "zh": "現在一些關於字串和我們這裡的模板字面值的額外資訊。"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 419.83,
          "end": 427.12,
          "en": "One convenient thing about template literals is that you can easily write multiline strings there. Now",
          "zh": "模板字面值一件方便的事是你可以輕易在那裡寫多行字串。現在"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 427.15,
          "end": 432.91,
          "en": "with multiline strings, I mean strings which really do have a line break in them.",
          "zh": "說多行字串，我指的是真的裡面有換行的字串。"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 432.97,
          "end": 439.84,
          "en": "So let's say here in front of the asterisk character, I add a couple of line breaks and hence this string",
          "zh": "所以假設這裡在星號字元前面，我加幾個換行，因此這個字串"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 439.84,
          "end": 444.66,
          "en": "looks like that might look a bit strange at first but this is valid Javascript syntax,",
          "zh": "看起來像那樣，一開始可能看起來有點怪，但這是有效的 JavaScript 語法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 444.67,
          "end": 450.46,
          "en": "we opened a string here, we close it here and since it is a template literal with back ticks, this is",
          "zh": "我們在這裡開啟字串，我們在這裡關閉它，而因為它是用反引號的模板字面值，這是"
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 450.46,
          "end": 455.62,
          "en": "allowed. For a normal string with single or double quotes, this would not be allowed but I will come back",
          "zh": "被允許的。對一般用單引號或雙引號的字串，這不會被允許，但我會回來"
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 455.62,
          "end": 461.47,
          "en": "to that. Now if you save that and you reload this in the browser, you'll not see a difference, though if",
          "zh": "那個。現在如果你存檔並在瀏覽器重新載入這個，你不會看到差異，不過如果"
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 461.47,
          "end": 465.81,
          "en": "you have the developer tools opened which you can always open with view",
          "zh": "你開著開發者工具，你永遠可以用檢視"
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 465.97,
          "end": 473.5,
          "en": "developer, developer tools and you then click on this select icon there and you select this part of",
          "zh": "開發者、開發者工具開啟它，然後你點這個選取圖示，並選取網頁的這個部分，"
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 473.5,
          "end": 479.75,
          "en": "your webpage, you will see that indeed the whitespace is considered here,",
          "zh": "你會看到空白確實在這裡被考慮，"
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 479.8,
          "end": 485.66,
          "en": "it's just the browser and the default behavior of the browser and the h2 element that basically strips",
          "zh": "只是瀏覽器、瀏覽器的預設行為，以及 h2 元素基本上去掉"
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 485.66,
          "end": 491.89,
          "en": "this redundant whitespace but it's output there and depending on where you output this, in which element",
          "zh": "這個多餘空白，但它被輸出在那裡，而取決於你在哪裡輸出這個、在哪個元素"
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 491.89,
          "end": 499.54,
          "en": "and how that element is styled, you might also get that whitespace or the extra line break here in your",
          "zh": "以及那個元素如何被樣式化，你也可能在網頁裡得到那個空白或額外換行"
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 499.54,
          "end": 500.35,
          "en": "webpage.",
          "zh": "網頁。"
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 500.35,
          "end": 505.48,
          "en": "So the fact that we don't see the line break here in the middle is really just due to how this is styled",
          "zh": "所以我們在這裡中間看不到換行這個事實，真的只是因為這如何被樣式化"
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 505.51,
          "end": 506.83,
          "en": "and rendered.",
          "zh": "並被呈現。"
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 506.83,
          "end": 512.95,
          "en": "If you go down here to the elements style of the h2 element which is selected and you add whitespace",
          "zh": "如果你往下到被選取的 h2 元素的元素樣式，並例如加上 white-space"
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 513.01,
          "end": 519.28,
          "en": "pre for example, then you will see the whitespace here as well because this is some CSS styling",
          "zh": "pre，那麼你也會在這裡看到空白，因為這是某種 CSS 樣式"
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 519.28,
          "end": 525.22,
          "en": "which does not omit the extra whitespace but instead render it, here in this case that means it renders",
          "zh": "它不會省略額外空白，而是呈現它，這裡這個情況意味著它呈現"
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 525.22,
          "end": 532.57,
          "en": "this extra line break. So you can easily add line breaks here when using the template literal syntax,",
          "zh": "這個額外換行。所以使用模板字面值語法時，你可以輕易在這裡加換行，"
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 532.93,
          "end": 538.87,
          "en": "this can help you with readability because you might be able to read long strings easier or better here",
          "zh": "這可以幫助可讀性，因為你也許能在這裡更容易或更好地讀長字串"
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 538.87,
          "end": 544.42,
          "en": "in the IDE if you add line breaks but you should always keep in mind that this is not just a visual",
          "zh": "在 IDE 裡，如果你加換行，但你應該永遠記住，這不只是視覺"
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 544.42,
          "end": 549.78,
          "en": "thing for you in the IDE but that the line breaks really are part of the string.",
          "zh": "上給你在 IDE 裡的東西，而是換行真的是字串的一部分。"
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 549.82,
          "end": 554.89,
          "en": "The same is true if you indent this, for example you could think that if you write it like this, it's",
          "zh": "如果你縮排這個，也一樣，例如你可以想，如果你這樣寫，它是"
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 554.89,
          "end": 558.27,
          "en": "a normal string but it's more readable to you as a developer.",
          "zh": "一般字串，但對身為開發者的你更可讀。"
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 558.31,
          "end": 565.03,
          "en": "Well if you save that and you reload, our styling will be lost because we reloaded but here on the right",
          "zh": "嗯，如果你存檔並重新載入，我們的樣式會消失，因為我們重新載入了，但這裡右邊"
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 565.03,
          "end": 567.58,
          "en": "you can see this extra whitespace,",
          "zh": "你可以看到這個額外空白，"
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 567.61,
          "end": 574.63,
          "en": "it really is part of the string and if we re-add this style here to our h2 element here in the developer",
          "zh": "它真的是字串的一部分，而如果我們在開發者工具裡對這裡的 h2 元素重新加上這個樣式"
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 574.63,
          "end": 581.14,
          "en": "tools by setting whitespace to pre, you see we really do have the line break and the extra whitespace",
          "zh": "藉由把 white-space 設成 pre，你看到我們真的有換行和額外空白"
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 581.14,
          "end": 588.09,
          "en": "in here. So be careful when you use that and really only use the line break or extra whitespace feature",
          "zh": "在這裡。所以使用那個時要小心，並真的只在這裡使用換行或額外空白功能"
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 588.09,
          "end": 588.41,
          "en": "here",
          "zh": "這裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 588.52,
          "end": 594.16,
          "en": "if you want to build a string that has the extra whitespace or that has the line break, don't do it just",
          "zh": "如果你想建立有額外空白或有換行的字串，不要只"
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 594.16,
          "end": 596.37,
          "en": "for readability.",
          "zh": "為了可讀性而做。"
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 596.38,
          "end": 599.65,
          "en": "Now if I come back to normal strings, there",
          "zh": "現在如果我回到一般字串，那裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 599.65,
          "end": 606.5,
          "en": "let's say we have an error message which we don't need for this app or for this website here but just",
          "zh": "假設我們有一個錯誤訊息，這個應用程式或這個網站不需要，但只是"
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 606.5,
          "end": 611.83,
          "en": "to demonstrate how we work with normal, which means non-template literal strings,",
          "zh": "為了示範我們如何和一般、也就是非模板字面值字串工作，"
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 611.83,
          "end": 618.94,
          "en": "then of course you use single or double quotes and you might have a message like an error occurred, something",
          "zh": "那麼你當然使用單引號或雙引號，而你可能有像發生錯誤這樣的訊息，"
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 618.94,
          "end": 620.38,
          "en": "like this.",
          "zh": "像這樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 620.38,
          "end": 626.2,
          "en": "If you would want to split this across multiple lines, you have two options - you can close the string",
          "zh": "如果你想把這個拆到多行，你有兩個選項——你可以在這裡關閉字串"
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 626.2,
          "end": 632.62,
          "en": "here by adding a single quote and then reopen a new one and combine them with a plus and then add a",
          "zh": "藉由加一個單引號，然後重新開啟一個新的，並用加號組合它們，然後加一個"
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 632.62,
          "end": 633.8,
          "en": "line break,",
          "zh": "換行，"
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 633.82,
          "end": 640.4,
          "en": "this is valid Javascript code, you can span expressions that use operators across multiple lines,",
          "zh": "這是有效的 JavaScript 程式碼，你可以讓使用運算子的運算式跨多行，"
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 640.54,
          "end": 645.97,
          "en": "that would be possible here for mathematical operations just as it is possible for concatenating strings",
          "zh": "那在這裡對數學運算會是可能的，就像串接字串也是可能的"
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 645.97,
          "end": 647.68,
          "en": "with the plus operator",
          "zh": "用加號運算子"
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 647.71,
          "end": 653.62,
          "en": "and here you can also indent. If you do this and you would output this somewhere on the webpage,",
          "zh": "而這裡你也可以縮排。如果你這樣做，並在網頁某處輸出這個，"
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 653.65,
          "end": 659.59,
          "en": "this indeed would not include a line break and also not extra whitespace because this is really just",
          "zh": "這確實不會包含換行，也不會有額外空白，因為這真的只是"
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 659.59,
          "end": 665.74,
          "en": "something we do for us here in the IDE to make this more readable. The string that's getting constructed",
          "zh": "我們在 IDE 裡為自己做的事，讓這個更可讀。被建構的字串"
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 665.8,
          "end": 672.43,
          "en": "only consists of these characters between the single quotes, so there's no line break in there and there",
          "zh": "只由單引號之間的這些字元組成，所以那裡面沒有換行，也"
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 672.43,
          "end": 675.34,
          "en": "is also no extra whitespace.",
          "zh": "沒有額外空白。"
        },
        {
          "id": 136,
          "start": 675.64,
          "end": 681.09,
          "en": "Now if you would want to add a real line break here in a string enclosed by single or double quotes,",
          "zh": "現在如果你想在被單引號或雙引號包圍的字串裡加真正的換行，"
        },
        {
          "id": 137,
          "start": 681.1,
          "end": 688.75,
          "en": "that is possible with a special character or a special combination of characters - you add a backslash",
          "zh": "那可以用特殊字元或特殊字元組合——你加一個反斜線"
        },
        {
          "id": 138,
          "start": 688.87,
          "end": 696.31,
          "en": "and then n. What this will do if it would be rendered to the screen is it will not output \\n",
          "zh": "然後 n。如果這會被呈現到畫面上，這會做的是它不會輸出 \\n"
        },
        {
          "id": 139,
          "start": 696.43,
          "end": 700.65,
          "en": "there but instead it will treat this as a line break. To show this,",
          "zh": "在那裡，而是把它當成換行。為了顯示這個，"
        },
        {
          "id": 140,
          "start": 700.65,
          "end": 706.39,
          "en": "let's temporarily output the error message here instead of the calculation description, just temporarily",
          "zh": "讓我們暫時在這裡輸出錯誤訊息，而不是計算描述，只是暫時"
        },
        {
          "id": 141,
          "start": 706.39,
          "end": 707.87,
          "en": "so that we can see that.",
          "zh": "好讓我們能看到那個。"
        },
        {
          "id": 142,
          "start": 708.13,
          "end": 714.34,
          "en": "Now with that if you reload here, we see an error occurred and if we go back and add our good old style",
          "zh": "現在有了那個，如果你在這裡重新載入，我們看到發生了錯誤，而如果我們回去並加上我們熟悉的樣式"
        },
        {
          "id": 143,
          "start": 714.34,
          "end": 720.13,
          "en": "here to the h2 element right in developer tools down there by setting whitespace to pre, you see the",
          "zh": "這裡到 h2 元素，就在下面開發者工具裡，藉由把 white-space 設成 pre，你看到"
        },
        {
          "id": 144,
          "start": 720.13,
          "end": 723.05,
          "en": "line break here as well and you can also see it here,",
          "zh": "這裡也有換行，而你也可以在這裡看到它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 145,
          "start": 723.25,
          "end": 725.69,
          "en": "there is a line break after error.",
          "zh": "error 之後有一個換行。"
        },
        {
          "id": 146,
          "start": 726.01,
          "end": 731.2,
          "en": "So with this \\n, you can add a line break in a string no matter if you use single or double",
          "zh": "所以用這個 \\n，你可以在字串裡加換行，不管你用單引號或雙"
        },
        {
          "id": 147,
          "start": 731.2,
          "end": 734.98,
          "en": "quotes, you could also use this here in the template literal by the way,",
          "zh": "引號，你也可以在模板字面值裡使用這個，順帶一提，"
        },
        {
          "id": 148,
          "start": 734.98,
          "end": 740.62,
          "en": "it's also supported there but there you don't need it because there you can just add a normal line break",
          "zh": "那裡也支援，但那裡你不需要它，因為那裡你可以只加一般換行"
        },
        {
          "id": 149,
          "start": 740.74,
          "end": 744.44,
          "en": "and since you're in a template literal, that will add a line break to the string as well.",
          "zh": "而因為你在模板字面值裡，那也會把換行加到字串。"
        },
        {
          "id": 150,
          "start": 744.49,
          "end": 749.92,
          "en": "So there, this is available, here in a normal string with single or double quotes, you need that \\n",
          "zh": "所以那裡，這個可用，這裡在用單引號或雙引號的一般字串，你需要那個 \\n"
        },
        {
          "id": 151,
          "start": 750.04,
          "end": 750.54,
          "en": "thing.",
          "zh": "東西。"
        },
        {
          "id": 152,
          "start": 751.6,
          "end": 757.84,
          "en": "And by the way, using a backslash in a string has a special meaning, it escapes the character that comes",
          "zh": "而順帶一提，在字串裡使用反斜線有特殊意義，它跳脫反斜線之後的字元，"
        },
        {
          "id": 153,
          "start": 757.93,
          "end": 764.47,
          "en": "after the backslash, which means the character after the backslash is not treated as a normal character",
          "zh": "意思是反斜線之後的字元不被當成一般字元"
        },
        {
          "id": 154,
          "start": 764.5,
          "end": 770.24,
          "en": "with its normal meaning but instead combined with the backslash, it gets a special meaning.",
          "zh": "帶著它的一般意義，而是和反斜線結合，它得到特殊意義。"
        },
        {
          "id": 155,
          "start": 770.32,
          "end": 776.41,
          "en": "In this case here, we escaped the n and therefore we don't just output n here but instead backslash",
          "zh": "在這裡這個情況，我們跳脫了 n，因此我們不只是在這裡輸出 n，而是反斜線"
        },
        {
          "id": 156,
          "start": 776.41,
          "end": 779.11,
          "en": "and n combined mean line break.",
          "zh": "和 n 合起來意味換行。"
        },
        {
          "id": 157,
          "start": 779.23,
          "end": 785.44,
          "en": "You have more such combinations and attached, you will find a list of available shortcuts or combinations",
          "zh": "你有更多這樣的組合，而在附件裡，你會找到可用捷徑或組合的清單"
        },
        {
          "id": 158,
          "start": 785.44,
          "end": 792.28,
          "en": "here in your strings. One other important combination for example is backslash and then a single quote.",
          "zh": "在你的字串裡。另一個重要組合例如是反斜線然後一個單引號。"
        },
        {
          "id": 159,
          "start": 792.34,
          "end": 798.48,
          "en": "This is helpful if you want to output a single quote in your string, especially if your string is enclosed",
          "zh": "這很有幫助，如果你想在字串裡輸出單引號，尤其如果你的字串被"
        },
        {
          "id": 160,
          "start": 798.49,
          "end": 803.89,
          "en": "by single quotes. Without the backslash, we would have a syntax error here because what happens is we",
          "zh": "單引號包圍。沒有反斜線，我們會在這裡有語法錯誤，因為發生的是我們"
        },
        {
          "id": 161,
          "start": 803.89,
          "end": 809.17,
          "en": "open a string with a single quote, here we then close it and then here in this case, we have a redundant",
          "zh": "用單引號開啟字串，這裡我們接著關閉它，然後在這個情況這裡，我們有一個多餘的"
        },
        {
          "id": 162,
          "start": 809.17,
          "end": 813.91,
          "en": "single quote that tries to open a new string which then never gets closed.",
          "zh": "單引號，試著開啟一個新字串，然後永遠不會被關閉。"
        },
        {
          "id": 163,
          "start": 813.91,
          "end": 820.42,
          "en": "So we have to tell Javascript that this single quote should not be used as it normally uses single quotes,",
          "zh": "所以我們必須告訴 JavaScript，這個單引號不應該被像它通常使用單引號那樣使用，"
        },
        {
          "id": 164,
          "start": 820.54,
          "end": 826.99,
          "en": "i.e. to close that string but instead that we want to output this single quote here as a normal character",
          "zh": "也就是關閉那個字串，而是我們想把這裡這個單引號當成一般字元輸出"
        },
        {
          "id": 165,
          "start": 826.99,
          "end": 833.05,
          "en": "in our text and adding a backslash in front of it escapes the meaning the single quote would otherwise",
          "zh": "在我們的文字裡，而在它前面加反斜線會跳脫單引號否則會有的意義"
        },
        {
          "id": 166,
          "start": 833.05,
          "end": 838.9,
          "en": "have and therefore allows us to do that, and of course an alternative always is to use double quotes",
          "zh": "因此允許我們做那個，而當然一個替代方案永遠是使用雙引號"
        },
        {
          "id": 167,
          "start": 838.99,
          "end": 845.13,
          "en": "to surround the string instead of single quotes and then you can use single quotes in the double quoted",
          "zh": "來包圍字串，而不是單引號，然後你可以在雙引號包圍的"
        },
        {
          "id": 168,
          "start": 845.13,
          "end": 850.95,
          "en": "string without issues and without escaping it because it then won't have that special meaning of finishing",
          "zh": "字串裡使用單引號，沒有問題，也不用跳脫它，因為它那時不會有結束"
        },
        {
          "id": 169,
          "start": 850.95,
          "end": 856.35,
          "en": "your string or closing your string because you can only close a string with the character with which",
          "zh": "你的字串或關閉你的字串的特殊意義，因為你只能用那個字元關閉字串，而你用它"
        },
        {
          "id": 170,
          "start": 856.35,
          "end": 857.2,
          "en": "you opened it",
          "zh": "開啟它"
        },
        {
          "id": 171,
          "start": 857.25,
          "end": 862.77,
          "en": "and since here, we opened a string with a double quote character, we can only close it with such and Javascript",
          "zh": "而因為這裡，我們用雙引號字元開啟字串，我們只能用那樣關閉它，而 JavaScript"
        },
        {
          "id": 172,
          "start": 862.77,
          "end": 867.66,
          "en": "won't interpret a single quote as please close my string character,",
          "zh": "不會把單引號解讀成請關閉我的字串字元，"
        },
        {
          "id": 173,
          "start": 867.66,
          "end": 873.12,
          "en": "still useful to know that you could escape it like this. By the way if you want to output a backslash",
          "zh": "仍然有用，知道你可以像這樣跳脫它。順帶一提，如果你想輸出反斜線"
        },
        {
          "id": 174,
          "start": 873.12,
          "end": 878.55,
          "en": "in the string, you need to escape this as well because otherwise, a single backslash always tells Javascript",
          "zh": "在字串裡，你也需要跳脫這個，因為否則，單一反斜線永遠告訴 JavaScript"
        },
        {
          "id": 175,
          "start": 878.58,
          "end": 883.01,
          "en": "that the character after the backslash should be considered or should be escaped.",
          "zh": "反斜線之後的字元應該被考慮或應該被跳脫。"
        },
        {
          "id": 176,
          "start": 883.08,
          "end": 888.6,
          "en": "So if you want to output just a backslash, you put another backslash in front of it to tell Javascript",
          "zh": "所以如果你想只輸出一個反斜線，你在它前面再放一個反斜線，告訴 JavaScript"
        },
        {
          "id": 177,
          "start": 888.9,
          "end": 895.08,
          "en": "hey the character after this backslash has a special meaning and double backslash then in fact tells",
          "zh": "嘿，這個反斜線之後的字元有特殊意義，而雙反斜線事實上告訴"
        },
        {
          "id": 178,
          "start": 895.08,
          "end": 901.95,
          "en": "Javascript I want to output a single backslash here as part of my string. So these are some of the useful",
          "zh": "JavaScript 我想在這裡輸出單一反斜線，當成我字串的一部分。所以這些是一些有用的"
        },
        {
          "id": 179,
          "start": 901.95,
          "end": 904.04,
          "en": "things that you should know about strings,",
          "zh": "你應該知道的關於字串的事，"
        },
        {
          "id": 180,
          "start": 904.17,
          "end": 906.09,
          "en": "you will encounter them throughout this course",
          "zh": "你會在這門課裡遇到它們"
        },
        {
          "id": 181,
          "start": 906.09,
          "end": 910.38,
          "en": "and throughout your career as a developer. You don't need to learn all these things by heart,",
          "zh": "也在你身為開發者的職涯裡。你不需要把這些全部背起來，"
        },
        {
          "id": 182,
          "start": 910.38,
          "end": 916.98,
          "en": "the attached list of escapable characters might be useful, though \\n, \\\\",
          "zh": "附件裡可跳脫字元的清單可能有用，不過 \\n、\\\\"
        },
        {
          "id": 183,
          "start": 917.01,
          "end": 921.96,
          "en": "and backslash single quote are the most important ones I would argue, the ones you typically use most",
          "zh": "和反斜線單引號是我會說最重要的，你通常最常使用的那些"
        },
        {
          "id": 184,
          "start": 922.02,
          "end": 922.96,
          "en": "often.",
          "zh": "常常。"
        },
        {
          "id": 185,
          "start": 923.16,
          "end": 928.26,
          "en": "And being aware of the template literal, that you can interpolate content here and that you can easily",
          "zh": "而知道模板字面值，你可以在這裡插值內容，並且你可以輕易"
        },
        {
          "id": 186,
          "start": 928.26,
          "end": 930.42,
          "en": "add line breaks and whitespace in here,",
          "zh": "在這裡加換行和空白，"
        },
        {
          "id": 187,
          "start": 930.42,
          "end": 932.63,
          "en": "that's also something which is good to know I guess.",
          "zh": "那也是我猜值得知道的事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 188,
          "start": 935,
          "end": 940.53,
          "en": "And with that, I reverted all of that, again I'm sending a calculation description to output result and",
          "zh": "而有了那個，我把那些全部還原了，再次我把計算描述送到 outputResult，而"
        },
        {
          "id": 189,
          "start": 940.53,
          "end": 944.64,
          "en": "I deleted the extra error message variable because we don't need it here to continue,",
          "zh": "我刪掉額外的錯誤訊息變數，因為我們在這裡不需要它才能繼續，"
        },
        {
          "id": 190,
          "start": 944.66,
          "end": 948.88,
          "en": "I just wanted to dive into some of these string specialties and things you should know.",
          "zh": "我只是想深入一些這些字串特性，以及你應該知道的事。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "15853220",
      "title": "Introducing Functions",
      "lectureOrder": 26,
      "videoOrder": 22,
      "sourceHash": "468c733b49a351cf0a4d5c9993e4108e7cf04e577690de361a285d944ff1c009",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.29,
          "end": 9.35,
          "en": "So now we got some core basics out of the way, we're able to work with some basic Javascript, with variables,",
          "zh": "所以現在我們把一些核心基礎處理完了，我們能用一些基本 JavaScript，用變數、"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 9.44,
          "end": 15.38,
          "en": "constants, operators, numbers and strings and we're outputting that here on the screen",
          "zh": "常數、運算子、數字和字串，而我們在這裡把那個輸出到畫面上"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 15.38,
          "end": 18.35,
          "en": "but the calculator of course is not very responsive,",
          "zh": "但計算機當然不是很有反應，"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 18.35,
          "end": 22.24,
          "en": "all that's getting output here is kind of hardcoded into the script here,",
          "zh": "這裡被輸出的一切有點被寫死在這裡的腳本裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 22.25,
          "end": 28.34,
          "en": "we're not using any user input, we're not really doing something when the user presses buttons",
          "zh": "我們沒有使用任何使用者輸入，我們沒有真的在使用者按下按鈕時做某件事"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 28.34,
          "end": 31.28,
          "en": "here and therefore this is not really a dynamic script,",
          "zh": "在這裡，因此這不是真的動態的腳本，"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 31.28,
          "end": 36.62,
          "en": "instead it just runs from top to bottom when we load the page and therefore it immediately runs when",
          "zh": "相反它只是在我們載入頁面時從上到下執行，因此它立刻執行，當"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 36.62,
          "end": 37.96,
          "en": "the page gets loaded",
          "zh": "頁面被載入"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 37.96,
          "end": 43.73,
          "en": "and it then does all these steps and outputs the result here, which is nice but again, which isn't",
          "zh": "而它接著做所有這些步驟並在這裡輸出結果，這很好，但再次，那不是"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 43.73,
          "end": 46.63,
          "en": "really something interactive or dynamic.",
          "zh": "真的互動或動態的東西。"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 46.67,
          "end": 48.4,
          "en": "So it's time to change that",
          "zh": "所以是時候改變那個"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 48.65,
          "end": 54.47,
          "en": "and for that, we need a brand new language feature which I haven't talked about before and that would",
          "zh": "而為了那個，我們需要一個全新的語言功能，我之前沒談過，而那會是"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 54.47,
          "end": 61.83,
          "en": "be functions. I like to refer to functions as code on demand,",
          "zh": "函式。我喜歡把函式說成隨需程式碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 61.84,
          "end": 63.9,
          "en": "now what do I mean with that?",
          "zh": "現在我那樣是什麼意思？"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 63.94,
          "end": 69.73,
          "en": "A function is a language construct which you don't just have in Javascript but also in other programming",
          "zh": "函式是一種語言結構，你不只在 JavaScript 裡有，在其他程式"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 69.73,
          "end": 76.57,
          "en": "languages, which basically allows you to define some code which you then execute at a later point of",
          "zh": "語言裡也有，它基本上允許你定義一些程式碼，然後你在稍後某個"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 76.57,
          "end": 77.1,
          "en": "time.",
          "zh": "時間點執行。"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 77.17,
          "end": 79.71000000000001,
          "en": "You define the code in Javascript like this,",
          "zh": "你在 JavaScript 裡像這樣定義程式碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 79.78,
          "end": 86.92,
          "en": "you use that function keyword, then you use any name you want for that function, then your function can",
          "zh": "你使用那個 function 關鍵字，然後你為那個函式使用任何你想要的名稱，然後你的函式可以"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 86.92,
          "end": 89.52,
          "en": "take something which is called parameters,",
          "zh": "接受叫做參數的東西，"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 89.56,
          "end": 95.2,
          "en": "so some input to the function if you will and then you have the so-called function body between curly",
          "zh": "所以算是函式的某個輸入，然後你在大括號之間有所謂的函式主體"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 95.2,
          "end": 99.19,
          "en": "braces which is the code you want to execute eventually.",
          "zh": "那是你最終想執行的程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 99.19,
          "end": 102.72,
          "en": "Now as I said, this function can have these parameters,",
          "zh": "現在如我所說，這個函式可以有這些參數，"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 102.75999999999999,
          "end": 108.85,
          "en": "so name in this example would be a parameter and it can also return something which this example function",
          "zh": "所以這個例子裡的 name 會是一個參數，而它也可以回傳某物，這個例子函式"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 108.85,
          "end": 112.84,
          "en": "here doesn't but which we'll see an action in this module.",
          "zh": "這裡沒有，但我們會在這個模組看到它實際運作。"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 112.84,
          "end": 118.24000000000001,
          "en": "Now when you have a function defined, the interesting thing here is that the code in there doesn't run",
          "zh": "現在當你定義了函式，這裡有趣的是裡面的程式碼不會"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 118.27000000000001,
          "end": 124.99,
          "en": "immediately when your script gets first executed, instead Javascript just sees that function and kind",
          "zh": "在你的腳本第一次被執行時立刻執行，相反 JavaScript 只看到那個函式，並有點"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 124.99,
          "end": 127.75,
          "en": "of registers it, stores it in memory",
          "zh": "註冊它、把它存在記憶體"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 127.75,
          "end": 135.88,
          "en": "you could say, you then execute the code in the function by calling that function. You call a function by",
          "zh": "你可以說，然後你藉由呼叫那個函式來執行函式裡的程式碼。你呼叫函式藉由"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 135.88,
          "end": 137.16,
          "en": "using its name",
          "zh": "使用它的名稱"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 137.35,
          "end": 143.53,
          "en": "and then you add parentheses and if that function takes any parameters, any input which this function",
          "zh": "然後你加小括號，而如果那個函式接受任何參數、任何輸入，這個函式"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 143.53,
          "end": 149.49,
          "en": "does and you can have more than one parameter separated by commas by the way but you'll also see that,",
          "zh": "確實接受，而你可以有超過一個參數，用逗號分隔，順帶一提，但你也會看到那個，"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 149.53,
          "end": 156.49,
          "en": "so if a function takes parameters, you pass in a value for these parameters. Then this code gets executed",
          "zh": "所以如果函式接受參數，你為這些參數傳入一個值。然後這段程式碼被執行"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 156.82,
          "end": 164.14,
          "en": "with the data you entered as parameters and you can call such a function as often as you want, where",
          "zh": "用你當成參數輸入的資料，而你可以隨你想要的次數呼叫這樣的函式，在"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 164.23,
          "end": 168.52,
          "en": "ever you want in your code with different parameters",
          "zh": "你程式碼裡任何你想要的地方，用不同參數"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 168.52,
          "end": 176.03,
          "en": "if it takes parameters. So every function execution then runs independent from the other previous function",
          "zh": "如果它接受參數。所以每次函式執行都獨立於其他先前的函式"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 176.03,
          "end": 182.3,
          "en": "executions you might have had in your code and the great thing about functions is that this now gives",
          "zh": "執行，你可能在程式碼裡有過的，而函式很棒的地方是這現在給"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 182.3,
          "end": 188.72,
          "en": "you way more flexibility because thus far with all the code we write here, we basically write code which",
          "zh": "你多很多彈性，因為到目前為止，我們在這裡寫的所有程式碼，我們基本上寫的程式碼"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 188.78,
          "end": 193.85,
          "en": "always executes from top to bottom when the script is loaded which is the case when the page is loaded",
          "zh": "永遠在腳本被載入時從上到下執行，那是頁面被載入時的情況"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 194.3,
          "end": 196.61,
          "en": "and therefore all this code runs immediately.",
          "zh": "因此所有這段程式碼立刻執行。"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 196.61,
          "end": 204.05,
          "en": "Now with functions, we can define code that should run later and we can then take such a function and",
          "zh": "現在有了函式，我們可以定義應該稍後執行的程式碼，然後我們可以拿這樣的函式並"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 204.05,
          "end": 209.93,
          "en": "actually attach it to the buttons here to make sure that only when a button is pressed, the function",
          "zh": "實際上把它接到這裡的按鈕，以確保只有按鈕被按下時，函式"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 209.93,
          "end": 210.59,
          "en": "runs",
          "zh": "才執行"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 210.71,
          "end": 217.13,
          "en": "and this then allows us to write code which doesn't run immediately but which allows us to provide some",
          "zh": "而這接著允許我們寫不會立刻執行的程式碼，但允許我們提供一些"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 217.13,
          "end": 222.19,
          "en": "interaction to our website, to only run some code when something happens for example",
          "zh": "對我們網站的互動，例如只在某件事發生時執行一些程式碼"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 222.23,
          "end": 227.66,
          "en": "and of course you're not limited to only running functions when a button is pressed, you can run functions",
          "zh": "而當然你不限於只在按鈕被按下時執行函式，你可以執行函式"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 227.96,
          "end": 235.06,
          "en": "based on a broad variety of events or manually call them in your code whenever you need to do that",
          "zh": "基於很廣泛的各種事件，或在你需要時在程式碼裡手動呼叫它們"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 235.13,
          "end": 238.6,
          "en": "and actually here, we are calling a function.",
          "zh": "而實際上這裡，我們正在呼叫一個函式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 238.79,
          "end": 244.94,
          "en": "I haven't really had a closer look at this yet but output result is a function I provide to you because",
          "zh": "我還沒真的更仔細看這個，但 outputResult 是我提供給你的函式，因為"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 244.94,
          "end": 250.28,
          "en": "it's defined here in the vendor.js file with the function keyword, then the name of the function,",
          "zh": "它在這裡的 vendor.js 檔案裡被定義，用 function 關鍵字，然後函式名稱，"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 250.28,
          "end": 256.13,
          "en": "then in this case to parameters and then some code which is executed when the function is called,",
          "zh": "然後在這個情況是兩個參數，然後一些程式碼，在函式被呼叫時被執行，"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 256.16,
          "end": 262.25,
          "en": "in this case this code here simply reaches out to our HTML page you could say, to our webpage and",
          "zh": "在這個情況，這裡這段程式碼單純接觸我們的 HTML 頁面，你可以說，接觸我們的網頁並"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 262.25,
          "end": 263.73,
          "en": "changes some text there,",
          "zh": "在那裡改變一些文字，"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 263.87,
          "end": 268.61,
          "en": "it displays the result of the calculation and this calculation text.",
          "zh": "它顯示計算的結果和這段計算文字。"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 268.61,
          "end": 272.57,
          "en": "So these two pieces here which are changed in our webpage,",
          "zh": "所以這裡這兩塊在我們網頁裡被改變的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 272.57,
          "end": 278.18,
          "en": "that's done by this function effectively because this function communicates with that part of the HTML",
          "zh": "那實際上是由這個函式完成的，因為這個函式和 HTML 的那個部分溝通"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 278.19,
          "end": 283.3,
          "en": "page with the help of these constants which in turn set up connections to these places in the",
          "zh": "藉由這些常數的幫助，而那些常數接著建立連線到這些地方，在"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 283.31,
          "end": 285.29,
          "en": "HTML code you could say.",
          "zh": "HTML 程式碼裡，你可以說。"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 285.29,
          "end": 291.5,
          "en": "So this function is registered here and we can call it from that file because we import this file after",
          "zh": "所以這個函式在這裡被註冊，而我們可以從那個檔案呼叫它，因為我們在"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 291.5,
          "end": 294.47,
          "en": "the other file, right, and the order matters of course,",
          "zh": "另一個檔案之後匯入這個檔案，對吧，而順序當然重要，"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 294.5,
          "end": 297.8,
          "en": "and we have access to that function and I'm calling that function here",
          "zh": "而我們能存取那個函式，而我在這裡呼叫那個函式"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 297.98,
          "end": 304.16,
          "en": "as I explained on the slide by repeating its name, then adding parentheses and between the parentheses,",
          "zh": "如我在投影片上解釋的，藉由重複它的名稱，然後加小括號，而在括號之間，"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 304.34,
          "end": 309.61,
          "en": "I pass in the values to the function which this function can use.",
          "zh": "我把值傳進函式，這個函式可以使用那些值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 309.62,
          "end": 315.92,
          "en": "So here I pass in current result and calculation description, so I pass in the values that are stored",
          "zh": "所以這裡我傳入 currentResult 和 calculationDescription，所以我傳入存在"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 315.92,
          "end": 321.03,
          "en": "in these variables and therefore, this function receives these values",
          "zh": "這些變數裡的值，因此這個函式收到這些值"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 321.08,
          "end": 325.71,
          "en": "and that's important, it receives the values, not the variable names or anything like that,",
          "zh": "而那很重要，它收到值，不是變數名稱或類似那樣的東西，"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 325.79,
          "end": 331.55,
          "en": "it receives the values stored in the variables and therefore in this function, we can then use these",
          "zh": "它收到存在變數裡的值，因此在這個函式裡，我們接著可以使用這些"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 331.76,
          "end": 336.83,
          "en": "values to, in this case, output it in our HTML page",
          "zh": "值，在這個情況，把它輸出在我們的 HTML 頁面"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 337.04,
          "end": 340.9,
          "en": "but you could do whatever you want with these values.",
          "zh": "但你可以用這些值做任何你想做的事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 341.24,
          "end": 343.1,
          "en": "So let's write our own function then",
          "zh": "所以讓我們接著寫我們自己的函式"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 343.19,
          "end": 348.05,
          "en": "so that we get a better feeling and understanding for how functions work and what we can do with them.",
          "zh": "好讓我們對函式如何運作、以及我們能用它們做什麼，有更好的感覺和理解。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "15853222",
      "title": "Adding A Custom Function",
      "lectureOrder": 27,
      "videoOrder": 23,
      "sourceHash": "8997d0de4303ee4b404196398e8fcecedcff03be74356f57429ec3597fee72ca",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.19,
          "end": 3.95,
          "en": "So which function could we write?",
          "zh": "所以我們可以寫哪個函式？"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.03,
          "end": 9.49,
          "en": "Well let's say we want to make sure that at some point of time in this module, we can click the plus",
          "zh": "嗯，假設我們想確保在這個模組的某個時間點，我們可以點加號"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 9.49,
          "end": 15.55,
          "en": "button and add whatever we entered here to our current result which initially is zero",
          "zh": "按鈕，並把我們在這裡輸入的任何東西加到我們目前的結果，一開始是零"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 15.55,
          "end": 19.42,
          "en": "and then if we type five here and click plus, we want to get five.",
          "zh": "然後如果我們在這裡輸入五並點加號，我們想得到五。"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 19.42,
          "end": 24.43,
          "en": "So the new result is then five, if I thereafter type 10 and I click plus, we would get 15,",
          "zh": "所以新結果那時是五，如果我之後輸入 10 並點加號，我們會得到 15，"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 24.46,
          "end": 24.7,
          "en": "right?",
          "zh": "對吧？"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 24.7,
          "end": 26.81,
          "en": "So that would be an idea to get started with",
          "zh": "所以那會是一個開始的想法"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 27.07,
          "end": 33.14,
          "en": "and for that, we need a function or we could add a function that does just that, that adds two numbers.",
          "zh": "而為了那個，我們需要一個函式，或我們可以加一個函式，就做那個，把兩個數字相加。"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 33.79,
          "end": 36.06,
          "en": "So for that we can define a function",
          "zh": "所以為了那個，我們可以定義一個函式"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 36.28,
          "end": 38.23,
          "en": "and it's up to you where you do that,",
          "zh": "而你在哪裡做由你決定，"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 38.23,
          "end": 41.67,
          "en": "you can actually do it kind of at the start of your script,",
          "zh": "你實際上可以有點在腳本開頭做，"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 41.67,
          "end": 48.04,
          "en": "maybe below your variable definitions or you can actually also do it at the end of your script and Javascript",
          "zh": "也許在你的變數定義下面，或你實際上也可以在腳本結尾做，而 JavaScript"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 48.04,
          "end": 54.4,
          "en": "is smart enough to kind of read your entire file before it executes it and it will therefore find any",
          "zh": "夠聰明，有點在執行前讀你整個檔案，因此它會找到任何"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 54.4,
          "end": 55.59,
          "en": "functions you use",
          "zh": "你使用的函式"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 55.63,
          "end": 61.48,
          "en": "so that it then automatically pulls these functions to the top so to say, so that if you define a function",
          "zh": "好讓它接著自動把這些函式拉到頂端，可以這麼說，所以如果你在"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 61.48,
          "end": 65.68,
          "en": "down there but you then use it somewhere above its definition,",
          "zh": "下面定義函式，但你接著在它的定義上面某處使用它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 65.68,
          "end": 71.44,
          "en": "you can still execute that code without an error, something which by the way is not possible for variables",
          "zh": "你仍然可以執行那段程式碼而不出錯，這件事順帶一提對變數"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 71.44,
          "end": 77.77,
          "en": "and constants you defined with let and const but I'll come back to this in a second. For now, let's just add a",
          "zh": "和你用 let 與 const 定義的常數是不可能的，但我等一下會回來這個。現在，讓我們就在這裡加一個"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 77.77,
          "end": 82.91,
          "en": "function here let's say and let's name it add and you can pick any name you want here,",
          "zh": "函式，假設，並讓我們把它命名為 add，而你可以在這裡挑任何你想要的名稱，"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 83.02,
          "end": 87.45,
          "en": "the idea for the name here just should be that it describes the action",
          "zh": "這裡名稱的想法只應該是它描述動作"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 87.46000000000001,
          "end": 94.21000000000001,
          "en": "this function will perform. So if its a function that adds two numbers, something like add or add numbers",
          "zh": "這個函式會執行的。所以如果它是把兩個數字相加的函式，像 add 或 addNumbers"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 94.24000000000001,
          "end": 101.32,
          "en": "makes sense instead of give me two numbers which describes what it wants to get as an input but not",
          "zh": "說得通，而不是 giveMeTwoNumbers，那描述它想得到什麼當輸入，但不是"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 101.32,
          "end": 110.07,
          "en": "what it does. You also don't want to have something like result as a name because what does this function",
          "zh": "它做什麼。你也不想要像 result 這樣的名稱，因為這個函式"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 110.07,
          "end": 110.39,
          "en": "do,",
          "zh": "做什麼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 110.39,
          "end": 111.69,
          "en": "it doesn't tell us anything,",
          "zh": "它沒告訴我們任何事，"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 111.72,
          "end": 113.16,
          "en": "it gives us some results,",
          "zh": "它給我們一些結果，"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 113.16,
          "end": 115.74000000000001,
          "en": "sure but for which operation?",
          "zh": "當然，但為了哪個運算？"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 115.74000000000001,
          "end": 120.9,
          "en": "So here, add sounds like a fitting name, it makes it clear that this is a function which will do some",
          "zh": "所以這裡，add 聽起來像合適的名稱，它說清楚這是一個會做一些"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 120.99,
          "end": 127.39,
          "en": "addition and then as I said, a function can but doesn't have to take parameters.",
          "zh": "加法的函式，然後如我所說，函式可以、但不必接受參數。"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 127.39,
          "end": 132.67,
          "en": "Now in Javascript and you'll see that throughout the course of course, there are functions which work",
          "zh": "現在在 JavaScript，而你當然會在整門課看到，有函式運作"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 132.76,
          "end": 134.23,
          "en": "without any input,",
          "zh": "沒有任何輸入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 134.26,
          "end": 140.29,
          "en": "let's say you have a function which kind of reads something from the HTML page.",
          "zh": "假設你有一個函式，有點從 HTML 頁面讀某物。"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 140.29,
          "end": 145.54,
          "en": "This probably doesn't take any input because inside of the function, you have all the information you",
          "zh": "這大概不接受任何輸入，因為在函式裡面，你有所有資訊，你"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 145.54,
          "end": 150.01,
          "en": "need to kind of reach out to the HTML page and get some data from there.",
          "zh": "需要有點去接觸 HTML 頁面並從那裡取得一些資料。"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 150.01,
          "end": 155.53,
          "en": "On the other hand, a function which should add two numbers probably needs these two numbers which it",
          "zh": "另一方面，應該把兩個數字相加的函式大概需要這兩個數字，它"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 155.53,
          "end": 156.2,
          "en": "should add,",
          "zh": "應該相加的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 156.52,
          "end": 162.61,
          "en": "so we should provide two parameters here and you can give these parameters any name you want.",
          "zh": "所以我們應該在這裡提供兩個參數，而你可以給這些參數任何你想要的名稱。"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 162.61,
          "end": 168.7,
          "en": "So I will go with num1 and num2 but you could go with a and b or with number1 and number2",
          "zh": "所以我會用 num1 和 num2，但你可以用 a 和 b，或用 number1 和 number2"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 168.7,
          "end": 175.63,
          "en": "or whatever you want. These parameters which you define here are then available in the so-called function",
          "zh": "或任何你想要的。你在這裡定義的這些參數接著在所謂的函式"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 175.63,
          "end": 178.82999999999998,
          "en": "body which is the last missing piece on this function.",
          "zh": "主體裡可用，那是這個函式最後缺少的一塊。"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 179.05,
          "end": 185.11,
          "en": "You add the function body by adding curly braces here, like this",
          "zh": "你藉由在這裡加大括號來加函式主體，像這樣"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 185.11,
          "end": 189.19,
          "en": "and now important, after the function you don't have a semicolon.",
          "zh": "而現在重要的是，函式之後你沒有分號。"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 189.19,
          "end": 192.31,
          "en": "Now you could add one but typically, you don't do that.",
          "zh": "現在你可以加一個，但通常你不那樣做。"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 192.31,
          "end": 196.86,
          "en": "You add a semicolon after all these one-line expressions here",
          "zh": "你在這裡所有這些一行運算式之後加分號"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 197.17000000000002,
          "end": 203.81,
          "en": "but after a statement as this is called, which includes such curly braces like this one does here,",
          "zh": "但在所謂的陳述之後，它包含像這裡這個這樣的大括號，"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 203.82999999999998,
          "end": 205.79,
          "en": "you don't add a semicolon.",
          "zh": "你不加分號。"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 205.81,
          "end": 211.6,
          "en": "You can just keep this in mind, whenever you have some curly braces with some code, some executable code",
          "zh": "你可以只記住這個，每當你有一些大括號，中間有一些程式碼、一些可執行程式碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 211.6,
          "end": 217.93,
          "en": "in between, you don't have a semicolon after the curly braces. Whenever you have these short expressions",
          "zh": "你在大括號之後沒有分號。每當你有這些短運算式"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 217.93,
          "end": 227.15,
          "en": "here, you have a semicolon at the end. So here, we have a function, keyword, name, parameters which are optional",
          "zh": "在這裡，你在結尾有分號。所以這裡，我們有函式、關鍵字、名稱、可選的參數"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 227.24,
          "end": 228.37,
          "en": "and then the function body",
          "zh": "然後函式主體"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 228.44,
          "end": 231.49,
          "en": "and now in the function body, you can do all kinds of things,",
          "zh": "而現在在函式主體裡，你可以做各種事，"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 231.53,
          "end": 239.42000000000002,
          "en": "for example we can define a constant in here as well, maybe name this result and just add num1 and num2",
          "zh": "例如我們也可以在這裡定義一個常數，也許把這個命名為 result，並只把 num1 和 num2 相加"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 239.42000000000002,
          "end": 244.94,
          "en": "here. Now num1 and num2 are like variables, though they're never defined with the let or",
          "zh": "在這裡。現在 num1 和 num2 像變數，雖然它們從不用 let 或"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 244.94,
          "end": 250.66,
          "en": "const keyword but they're automatically defined by Javascript but they're only available inside of",
          "zh": "const 關鍵字定義，但它們被 JavaScript 自動定義，但它們只在"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 250.67,
          "end": 252.86,
          "en": "this function body, not outside.",
          "zh": "這個函式主體裡可用，不在外面。"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 252.86,
          "end": 259.19,
          "en": "So if I would try to do something with num1 here after the function definition, this would not work",
          "zh": "所以如果我試著在函式定義之後在這裡對 num1 做某件事，這不會運作"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 259.22,
          "end": 264.83,
          "en": "because num1 and num2 are variables only available inside of the function body.",
          "zh": "因為 num1 和 num2 是只在函式主體裡可用的變數。"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 264.86,
          "end": 270.38,
          "en": "Now I used them here to add them together because I expect this function to be called such that whatever",
          "zh": "現在我在這裡使用它們把它們加在一起，因為我預期這個函式被這樣呼叫，不管"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 270.38,
          "end": 277.82,
          "en": "I get here on num1 and num2 are numbers and therefore, adding them works and I store the result in a new",
          "zh": "我在這裡的 num1 和 num2 得到什麼都是數字，因此把它們相加能運作，而我把結果存在一個新"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 277.82,
          "end": 278.78,
          "en": "constant.",
          "zh": "常數。"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 278.78,
          "end": 284.81,
          "en": "Now the interesting thing here is that this constant is defined inside of the function, not at the top",
          "zh": "現在這裡有趣的是這個常數被定義在函式裡面，不是在"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 284.81,
          "end": 286.25,
          "en": "level of our script",
          "zh": "我們腳本的頂層"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 286.37,
          "end": 290.84000000000003,
          "en": "and that's something you can do in Javascript and that is actually quite normal.",
          "zh": "而那是你在 JavaScript 裡可以做的事，而那實際上相當正常。"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 290.87,
          "end": 295.47,
          "en": "You can have variables and constants here at the top level of your script,",
          "zh": "你可以在腳本的頂層這裡有變數和常數，"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 295.49,
          "end": 302.34,
          "en": "this is also called in the global scope but you can also have them inside of your function",
          "zh": "這也被叫做在全域作用域，但你也可以在函式裡面有它們"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 302.48,
          "end": 307.91,
          "en": "and it's actually important where you define that and I'll come back to that. For now, I want to calculate",
          "zh": "而你在哪裡定義那個實際上很重要，而我會回來那個。現在，我想計算"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 307.91,
          "end": 313.94,
          "en": "a result which I only use inside of the function and therefore we can declare and define this variable",
          "zh": "一個我只在函式裡面使用的結果，因此我們可以宣告並定義這個變數"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 314.12,
          "end": 317.69,
          "en": "or this constant actually inside of that function.",
          "zh": "或這個常數，實際上在那個函式裡面。"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 317.69,
          "end": 323.87,
          "en": "Now inside of the function body, you see that my IDE automatically indents the code, which means it's",
          "zh": "現在在函式主體裡面，你看到我的 IDE 自動縮排程式碼，意思是它"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 323.87,
          "end": 326.75,
          "en": "not totally on the left here but there is some empty space.",
          "zh": "在這裡不是完全靠左，而是有一些空白。"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 326.75,
          "end": 328.67,
          "en": "This is done for readability,",
          "zh": "這是為了可讀性而做的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 328.67,
          "end": 330.29,
          "en": "technically this is not required,",
          "zh": "技術上這不是必要的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 330.29,
          "end": 333.74,
          "en": "your code would run even if this would all be written in one line,",
          "zh": "你的程式碼即使這全部寫在一行也會執行，"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 333.74,
          "end": 338.81,
          "en": "so if you would move that right next to the curly braces and have that all defined in one line but having",
          "zh": "所以如果你把那個移到緊鄰大括號，並把那個全部定義在一行，但把"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 338.81,
          "end": 345.02,
          "en": "the functions split out across multiple lines and having this indentation, this empty space simply helps with",
          "zh": "函式拆到多行，並有這個縮排、這個空白，單純幫助"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 345.05,
          "end": 347.33,
          "en": "reading or understanding your function.",
          "zh": "閱讀或理解你的函式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 347.33,
          "end": 352.52,
          "en": "Now regarding the amount of empty space you have to the left, you can find a lot of discussions about",
          "zh": "現在關於你左邊有多少空白，你可以找到很多關於那個的討論"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 352.52,
          "end": 353.65,
          "en": "that on the Internet.",
          "zh": "在網際網路上。"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 353.69,
          "end": 358.57,
          "en": "Now here, I indent it by four blanks so to say, so four whitespaces,",
          "zh": "現在這裡，我把它縮排四個空白，可以這麼說，所以四個空白，"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 358.58,
          "end": 362.93,
          "en": "now you'll find discussions on the Internet whether you want to use four or two, whether you want to use",
          "zh": "現在你會在網際網路上找到討論，你想用四個還是兩個，你想用"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 362.93,
          "end": 364.97,
          "en": "tabs or whitespace,",
          "zh": "tab 還是空白，"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 364.97,
          "end": 371.21,
          "en": "I'm a fan of whitespace and I'll typically use two also later when I do autoformat my document,",
          "zh": "我是空白的支持者，而我通常也會用兩個，稍後當我自動格式化文件時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 371.21,
          "end": 375.7,
          "en": "it's configured to use two whitespaces here instead of four as I have it right now.",
          "zh": "它被設定在這裡使用兩個空白，而不是我現在有的四個。"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 375.71,
          "end": 378.29,
          "en": "You can go with whichever approach you want,",
          "zh": "你可以採用任何你想要的做法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 378.3,
          "end": 385.25,
          "en": "you then should just stick to it and be consistent and you can also configure your code styling, your code",
          "zh": "然後你應該只堅持它並保持一致，而你也可以設定你的程式碼樣式、你的程式碼"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 385.46,
          "end": 391.78,
          "en": "formatting plugin for the IDE you're using to format your code according to your preferences.",
          "zh": "格式化外掛，給你正在使用的 IDE，依你的偏好格式化程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 391.79,
          "end": 397.21,
          "en": "Again my tool will later change this to two blanks here instead of four as I have it right now,",
          "zh": "再次，我的工具稍後會把這個改成這裡兩個空白，而不是我現在有的四個，"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 397.31,
          "end": 401.58,
          "en": "you can go for either of that, you just should write readable code in the end.",
          "zh": "你可以選其中任一，你最後只應該寫可讀的程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 401.72,
          "end": 405.6,
          "en": "So this will now hold the result of num1 and num2 added together",
          "zh": "所以這個現在會保存 num1 和 num2 加在一起的結果"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 405.65,
          "end": 411.65,
          "en": "and now what can we do with the result? Well we can for example output it with the alert function.",
          "zh": "而現在我們能對結果做什麼？嗯，我們可以例如用 alert 函式輸出它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 411.68,
          "end": 418.64,
          "en": "This is a function built into Javascript or built into the browser and provided to you in Javascript",
          "zh": "這是內建在 JavaScript 裡的函式，或內建在瀏覽器裡，並在 JavaScript 裡提供給你"
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 418.73,
          "end": 420.76,
          "en": "executed in the browser.",
          "zh": "在瀏覽器裡執行時。"
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 420.92,
          "end": 424.76,
          "en": "So we don't need to define this function on our own to call it,",
          "zh": "所以我們不需要自己定義這個函式才能呼叫它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 424.76,
          "end": 425.62,
          "en": "it's available,",
          "zh": "它可用，"
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 425.69,
          "end": 427.88,
          "en": "it's one of the built-in functions",
          "zh": "它是內建函式之一"
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 427.88,
          "end": 431.3,
          "en": "and there are a couple of built-in functions in Javascript,",
          "zh": "而 JavaScript 裡有幾個內建函式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 431.3,
          "end": 435.97,
          "en": "it depends on whether you're running Javascript in the browser or outside of the browser",
          "zh": "它取決於你是在瀏覽器裡執行 JavaScript，還是在瀏覽器外面"
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 436.01,
          "end": 441.05,
          "en": "but here we're in the browser and there we have something like the alert function which is built",
          "zh": "但這裡我們在瀏覽器裡，而那裡我們有像 alert 函式這樣的東西，它被內建"
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 441.05,
          "end": 443.27,
          "en": "in, made available by the browser.",
          "zh": "進去，由瀏覽器提供。"
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 443.27,
          "end": 446.04,
          "en": "So alert then allows us to output a message and",
          "zh": "所以 alert 接著允許我們輸出一個訊息，而"
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 446.12,
          "end": 452.81,
          "en": "We could say the result is and then this is a string of course, add result here",
          "zh": "我們可以說結果是，然後這當然是字串，在這裡加上 result"
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 452.9,
          "end": 458.15,
          "en": "and of course you could have also used the back ticks notation with this dollar sign curly brace embedding",
          "zh": "而當然你也可以使用反引號寫法，用這個錢字號大括號嵌入"
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 458.15,
          "end": 466.76,
          "en": "here. Now I do create a string here where I concatenate my result because alert actually wants",
          "zh": "在這裡。現在我在這裡建立一個字串，我在那裡串接我的結果，因為 alert 實際上想要"
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 466.79,
          "end": 471.71,
          "en": "a message as a parameter and you can see this if you hover over alert in Visual Studio Code.",
          "zh": "一個訊息當參數，而你可以在 Visual Studio Code 裡把游標停在 alert 上看到這個。"
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 471.71,
          "end": 476.74,
          "en": "You see this is a function, again provided by Javascript or by the browser",
          "zh": "你看到這是一個函式，再次由 JavaScript 或瀏覽器提供"
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 476.87,
          "end": 479.81,
          "en": "and this wants a message parameter, you can ignore",
          "zh": "而這個想要一個 message 參數，你可以忽略"
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 479.87,
          "end": 480.94,
          "en": "the question mark for now,",
          "zh": "問號，現在，"
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 480.95,
          "end": 484.1,
          "en": "that simply means that providing this message is optional",
          "zh": "那單純意味提供這個訊息是選用的"
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 484.11,
          "end": 488.66,
          "en": "so you could throw an alert without a message which is kind of pointless though and message here is",
          "zh": "所以你可以丟一個沒有訊息的 alert，不過那有點沒意義，而這裡的 message 是"
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 488.66,
          "end": 494.21,
          "en": "a parameter which actually should be a string because you want to output some text typically.",
          "zh": "一個參數，實際上應該是字串，因為你通常想輸出一些文字。"
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 494.93,
          "end": 498.35,
          "en": "So now I'm outputting this text here, this alert.",
          "zh": "所以現在我在這裡輸出這段文字、這個 alert。"
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 498.35,
          "end": 504.26,
          "en": "Now if I save this and we reload, nothing happens, we see no alert",
          "zh": "現在如果我存檔這個而我們重新載入，什麼都沒發生，我們看不到 alert"
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 504.35,
          "end": 507.68,
          "en": "and the reason for that is that we're not calling this function yet.",
          "zh": "而原因是我們還沒呼叫這個函式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 507.68,
          "end": 513.32,
          "en": "As I mentioned, you need to call a function in order for it to be executed.",
          "zh": "如我提到的，你需要呼叫函式，它才會被執行。"
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 513.32,
          "end": 515.55,
          "en": "Now how do you call a function?",
          "zh": "現在你如何呼叫函式？"
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 515.57,
          "end": 517.99,
          "en": "Well you can just use the function name,",
          "zh": "嗯，你可以只使用函式名稱，"
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 518,
          "end": 523.1,
          "en": "so in this case add and if you picked a different name, you have to pick a different name here and then",
          "zh": "所以在這個情況是 add，而如果你挑了不同名稱，你必須在這裡挑不同名稱，然後"
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 523.1,
          "end": 524.57,
          "en": "add parentheses like this.",
          "zh": "像這樣加小括號。"
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 525.08,
          "end": 530.18,
          "en": "So a bit like you defined it here but without the function keyword and without the body because this",
          "zh": "所以有點像你在這裡定義它，但沒有 function 關鍵字、也沒有主體，因為這"
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 530.18,
          "end": 533.91,
          "en": "defines what's inside of the function, how it works,",
          "zh": "定義函式裡面是什麼、它如何運作，"
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 533.93,
          "end": 540.35,
          "en": "this now calls the function and here I add a semicolon again because here I don't have the curly braces,",
          "zh": "這個現在呼叫函式，而這裡我再次加分號，因為這裡我沒有大括號，"
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 540.38,
          "end": 545.29,
          "en": "I don't define the function here, I just execute this as a so-called expression,",
          "zh": "我沒有在這裡定義函式，我只是把這個當成所謂的運算式執行，"
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 545.29,
          "end": 547.75,
          "en": "so I just have this line of code which is executed.",
          "zh": "所以我只是有這行程式碼被執行。"
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 547.88,
          "end": 552.89,
          "en": "This line of code is also executed but it's executed such that this code is registered and stored by",
          "zh": "這行程式碼也被執行，但它被這樣執行，以致這段程式碼被註冊並被儲存，由"
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 552.89,
          "end": 553.8,
          "en": "Javascript,",
          "zh": "JavaScript，"
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 553.88,
          "end": 556.99,
          "en": "so it kind of is made aware of this function,",
          "zh": "所以它有點被讓這個函式被知道，"
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 557.03,
          "end": 561.23,
          "en": "this line then executes and calls that function,",
          "zh": "這行接著執行並呼叫那個函式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 561.23,
          "end": 563.34,
          "en": "it runs that function.",
          "zh": "它執行那個函式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 563.36,
          "end": 569.75,
          "en": "Now this function to work correctly needs two parameters, also called arguments.",
          "zh": "現在這個函式要正確運作需要兩個參數，也被叫做引數。"
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 569.75,
          "end": 571.96,
          "en": "It needs a number one and a number two",
          "zh": "它需要一個數字一和一個數字二"
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 572.06,
          "end": 577.52,
          "en": "and now here of course you don't provide num1 or num2, so you don't repeat these names,",
          "zh": "而現在這裡你當然不提供 num1 或 num2，所以你不重複這些名稱，"
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 577.52,
          "end": 581.74,
          "en": "these are just internal names for these automatically created variables",
          "zh": "這些只是這些被自動建立的變數的內部名稱"
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 581.75,
          "end": 587.6,
          "en": "you can use inside of the function, instead here you now provide the concrete values that the function",
          "zh": "你可以在函式裡面使用，相反這裡你現在提供具體值，函式"
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 587.6,
          "end": 589.03,
          "en": "should use for running,",
          "zh": "執行時應該使用的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 589.07,
          "end": 593.21,
          "en": "so something like 1 and 2 if you want to add 1 and 2 together.",
          "zh": "所以像 1 和 2，如果你想把 1 和 2 加在一起。"
        },
        {
          "id": 136,
          "start": 593.27,
          "end": 600.98,
          "en": "So now, num1 would be set to 1 and num2 would be set to 2 for this function execution",
          "zh": "所以現在，對這次函式執行，num1 會被設成 1，而 num2 會被設成 2"
        },
        {
          "id": 137,
          "start": 600.98,
          "end": 607.49,
          "en": "and as I said we can now run a function multiple times by executing it again with 5 and 5 for example.",
          "zh": "而如我所說，我們現在可以藉由再次執行它來多次執行函式，例如用 5 和 5。"
        },
        {
          "id": 138,
          "start": 607.49,
          "end": 614.41,
          "en": "Now we would execute the function two times - one with a value of 1 for num1 and the value of 2 for",
          "zh": "現在我們會執行函式兩次——一次 num1 的值是 1，而值是 2 給"
        },
        {
          "id": 139,
          "start": 614.41,
          "end": 615.06,
          "en": "num2",
          "zh": "num2"
        },
        {
          "id": 140,
          "start": 615.2,
          "end": 622.76,
          "en": "and then the second time we run it, we pass in a value of 5 for num1 and the value of 5 for num2.",
          "zh": "然後第二次我們執行它，我們傳入 num1 的值 5，以及 num2 的值 5。"
        },
        {
          "id": 141,
          "start": 622.76,
          "end": 630.02,
          "en": "And now if we save that and we reload this file, you see since this script runs right away, we get the",
          "zh": "而現在如果我們存檔那個並重新載入這個檔案，你看到因為這個腳本立刻執行，我們得到"
        },
        {
          "id": 142,
          "start": 630.02,
          "end": 636.86,
          "en": "alert with the result is 3 because here I am calling this function with 1 and 2 and if I click",
          "zh": "alert，結果是 3，因為這裡我用 1 和 2 呼叫這個函式，而如果我點"
        },
        {
          "id": 143,
          "start": 636.92,
          "end": 637.76,
          "en": "OK,",
          "zh": "確定，"
        },
        {
          "id": 144,
          "start": 637.93,
          "end": 643.64,
          "en": "I right away get another alert because we're running this function twice and script execution is kind",
          "zh": "我立刻得到另一個 alert，因為我們執行這個函式兩次，而腳本執行有點"
        },
        {
          "id": 145,
          "start": 643.64,
          "end": 649.44,
          "en": "of blocked by the alert which is why the second alert waits until we dismiss the first alert and then",
          "zh": "被 alert 擋住，這就是為什麼第二個 alert 等到我們關掉第一個 alert，然後"
        },
        {
          "id": 146,
          "start": 649.44,
          "end": 650.23,
          "en": "in that second alert,",
          "zh": "在那個第二個 alert 裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 147,
          "start": 650.27,
          "end": 654.37,
          "en": "I see the result is 10 because I call this function with 5 and 5",
          "zh": "我看到結果是 10，因為我用 5 和 5 呼叫這個函式"
        },
        {
          "id": 148,
          "start": 654.92,
          "end": 661.4,
          "en": "and if I dismiss, then we see that page being rendered. So this is how we define a function and how",
          "zh": "而如果我關掉，然後我們看到那個頁面被呈現。所以這是我們如何定義函式，以及如何"
        },
        {
          "id": 149,
          "start": 661.4,
          "end": 663.38,
          "en": "we call it in Javascript.",
          "zh": "在 JavaScript 裡呼叫它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 150,
          "start": 663.38,
          "end": 669.53,
          "en": "Now I will emphasize again that a function can have as many parameters as it needs if it needs to have",
          "zh": "現在我會再次強調，函式可以有它需要的那麼多參數，如果它需要有"
        },
        {
          "id": 151,
          "start": 669.53,
          "end": 669.98,
          "en": "some,",
          "zh": "一些，"
        },
        {
          "id": 152,
          "start": 670.07,
          "end": 672.64,
          "en": "you can have one parameter, two as we have it here,",
          "zh": "你可以有一個參數，兩個如我們這裡有的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 153,
          "start": 672.66,
          "end": 678.99,
          "en": "three, five, four, as many as you want and a function can also do one other thing which we're not doing here,",
          "zh": "三個、五個、四個，隨你想要的那麼多，而函式也可以做另一件事，我們這裡沒在做，"
        },
        {
          "id": 154,
          "start": 679.04,
          "end": 680.39,
          "en": "it can return something.",
          "zh": "它可以回傳某物。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "15853228",
      "title": "Returning Values",
      "lectureOrder": 29,
      "videoOrder": 24,
      "sourceHash": "40cdc52ca21fbdb93a315a1989e8522dbeb67a50f5306365b9e796f31f5b1eb8",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.59,
          "end": 6.01,
          "en": "This function here executes the code which is in there",
          "zh": "這裡這個函式執行裡面的程式碼"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 6.01,
          "end": 12.13,
          "en": "and in this case, this then throws this alert or shows this alert box by calling the built-in alert function.",
          "zh": "而在這個情況，這接著丟出這個 alert，或顯示這個 alert 方塊，藉由呼叫內建的 alert 函式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 12.13,
          "end": 17.59,
          "en": "Now that's something you can do in other scenarios which we'll also cover later in the course of course,",
          "zh": "現在那是你可以在其他情境做的事，我們當然也會在課程稍後涵蓋，"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 17.95,
          "end": 23.55,
          "en": "you might want to send a HTTP request to a server and store some data there for example",
          "zh": "你也許想送一個 HTTP 請求到伺服器，並例如在那裡存一些資料"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 23.83,
          "end": 29.62,
          "en": "but sometimes you also have functions which you just use to outsource some code, maybe code which you",
          "zh": "但有時你也有函式，你只是用來把一些程式碼外包出去，也許你"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 29.62,
          "end": 35.08,
          "en": "need to run multiple times and therefore normally, you would have to copy and paste it around which never",
          "zh": "需要執行多次的程式碼，因此通常你必須把它複製貼上到處放，那從來不是"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 35.08,
          "end": 36.41,
          "en": "is a great idea.",
          "zh": "好主意。"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 36.46,
          "end": 38.52,
          "en": "As a programmer, you want to be lazy,",
          "zh": "身為程式設計師，你想要懶，"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 38.53,
          "end": 40.36,
          "en": "you don't want to repeat yourself,",
          "zh": "你不想重複自己，"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 40.39,
          "end": 45.43,
          "en": "you want to write code once and then rather execute it multiple times by referring to the function it's",
          "zh": "你想寫一次程式碼，然後寧可藉由參照它被寫進去的函式來執行多次"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 45.61,
          "end": 51.21,
          "en": "coded in and therefore you could have a function which is simply there to outsource some functionality,",
          "zh": "因此你可以有一個函式，單純在那裡把一些功能外包出去，"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 51.22,
          "end": 57.04,
          "en": "in this case a function that adds two pieces of information together which adds two numbers together.",
          "zh": "在這個情況是一個把兩份資訊加在一起的函式，把兩個數字加在一起。"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 57.07,
          "end": 63.58,
          "en": "So in that case, you might not want to alert or do something inside of the function, you maybe just want",
          "zh": "所以在那個情況，你也許不想在函式裡面 alert 或做某件事，你也許只想"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 63.58,
          "end": 65.6,
          "en": "to return the result and",
          "zh": "回傳結果，而"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 65.74,
          "end": 70.82,
          "en": "that's something you can do with the return keyword which is built into Javascript.",
          "zh": "那是你可以用 return 關鍵字做的事，它內建在 JavaScript 裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 70.9,
          "end": 74.38,
          "en": "So now we saw a couple of keywords - const, let, function",
          "zh": "所以現在我們看到幾個關鍵字——const、let、function"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 74.38,
          "end": 79.2,
          "en": "and now also return and return does what the name implies.",
          "zh": "而現在也有 return，而 return 做名稱暗示的事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 79.21000000000001,
          "end": 86.38,
          "en": "This function now returns the value that's stored in result as a result of this function call.",
          "zh": "這個函式現在回傳存在 result 裡的值，當成這次函式呼叫的結果。"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 86.38,
          "end": 91.53999999999999,
          "en": "This means that when we now execute add like this, nothing will happen,",
          "zh": "這意味當我們現在像這樣執行 add，什麼都不會發生，"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 91.55,
          "end": 98.39,
          "en": "if I reload the page, you see nothing happens, we don't see anything because now the function itself doesn't",
          "zh": "如果我重新載入頁面，你看到什麼都沒發生，我們什麼都看不到，因為現在函式本身沒有"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 98.39,
          "end": 100.78999999999999,
          "en": "do anything that has a visual impact,",
          "zh": "做任何有視覺影響的事，"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 100.78999999999999,
          "end": 103.09,
          "en": "instead it returns a value.",
          "zh": "相反它回傳一個值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 103.13,
          "end": 110.09,
          "en": "So that means that add now gives us a value, just like the plus operator or the multiplication operator gave",
          "zh": "所以那意味 add 現在給我們一個值，就像加號運算子或乘法運算子給"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 110.09,
          "end": 112.78999999999999,
          "en": "us a value. If we add two numbers together,",
          "zh": "我們一個值。如果我們把兩個數字加在一起，"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 112.78999999999999,
          "end": 116.67,
          "en": "this gives us a value and we store that value in a constant.",
          "zh": "這給我們一個值，而我們把那個值存在常數裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 116.69,
          "end": 123.53,
          "en": "So now calling our function gives us a value and that means we can store this in a variable for example.",
          "zh": "所以現在呼叫我們的函式給我們一個值，而那意味我們可以例如把它存在變數裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 123.53,
          "end": 132.83,
          "en": "So here we could say I want to have my addition result, and you can pick any name you want, stored in",
          "zh": "所以這裡我們可以說我想要我的 additionResult，而你可以挑任何你想要的名稱，存在"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 132.83,
          "end": 133.82,
          "en": "this constant",
          "zh": "這個常數裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 133.94,
          "end": 140,
          "en": "and I'm using a constant here, just as I do it here in my function because I never assign a new value",
          "zh": "而我在這裡使用常數，就像我在函式裡這裡做的，因為我從不指派新值"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 140.06,
          "end": 143.42000000000002,
          "en": "to the addition result or here to the internal result,",
          "zh": "給 additionResult，或這裡給內部的 result，"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 143.45,
          "end": 146.72,
          "en": "I never assign a new value with the equal sign again",
          "zh": "我從不再用等號指派新值"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 146.72,
          "end": 151.85,
          "en": "and if you never assign a new value, then this effectively is a constant and then you should mark it",
          "zh": "而如果你從不指派新值，那麼這實際上是常數，然後你應該把它標記"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 151.85,
          "end": 154.68,
          "en": "as such to make it clear that this will never change,",
          "zh": "成那樣，讓人清楚這永遠不會改變，"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 154.73,
          "end": 158.9,
          "en": "makes it easier to understand your code for other developers.",
          "zh": "讓其他開發者更容易理解你的程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 158.9,
          "end": 163.28,
          "en": "So now the result of this function call is stored in addition result",
          "zh": "所以現在這次函式呼叫的結果存在 additionResult"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 163.28,
          "end": 166.27,
          "en": "and this means that we can now use it anywhere in the code,",
          "zh": "而這意味我們現在可以在程式碼任何地方使用它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 166.4,
          "end": 174.89,
          "en": "for example we could now use addition result to set our current result equal to it, like this. Of",
          "zh": "例如我們現在可以用 additionResult 把我們的 currentResult 設成等於它，像這樣。當"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 174.89,
          "end": 176.81,
          "en": "course this is now kind of redundant,",
          "zh": "然這現在有點多餘，"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 176.84,
          "end": 182.96,
          "en": "we store the result of this function call in a new constant just to take the constant or the value stored",
          "zh": "我們把這次函式呼叫的結果存在一個新常數，只為了拿常數、或存在"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 182.96,
          "end": 186.71,
          "en": "in a constant and then set it equal to current result, to our variable.",
          "zh": "常數裡的值，然後把它設成等於 currentResult，等於我們的變數。"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 186.71,
          "end": 192.17,
          "en": "Of course we can kind of shorten this and just set current result equal to the result of our function",
          "zh": "當然我們可以有點縮短這個，並只把 currentResult 設成等於我們函式"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 192.17,
          "end": 199.46,
          "en": "call and get rid of that other line and now current result is the result of this calculation.",
          "zh": "呼叫的結果，並去掉那另一行，而現在 currentResult 是這次計算的結果。"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 199.46,
          "end": 207.59,
          "en": "So that means of course that if I now reload this, we see three down there for the result because I have",
          "zh": "所以那當然意味如果我現在重新載入這個，我們在下面看到結果是三，因為我有"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 207.71,
          "end": 213.77,
          "en": "add with one and two, the result of this is three, the result gets stored here and then we use current",
          "zh": "add 用一和二，這個的結果是三，結果被存在這裡，然後我們使用 current"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 213.77,
          "end": 220.01,
          "en": "result to pass it to this output result function which is provided in the vendor.js file which will",
          "zh": "Result 把它傳給這個 outputResult 函式，它在 vendor.js 檔案裡被提供，會"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 220.01,
          "end": 225.66,
          "en": "in the end output the calculation result in this place of our HTML document.",
          "zh": "最後在我們 HTML 文件的這個位置輸出計算結果。"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 225.77,
          "end": 227.77,
          "en": "Of course this is now incorrect,",
          "zh": "當然這現在不正確，"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 227.77,
          "end": 232.13,
          "en": "this is now not the correct description of what we did.",
          "zh": "這現在不是我們做了什麼的正確描述。"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 232.16,
          "end": 241.69,
          "en": "So this is how we can define our own functions with or without parameters, with or without the return",
          "zh": "所以這是我們如何定義自己的函式，有或沒有參數，有或沒有 return"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 241.69,
          "end": 244.45,
          "en": "statement and how we can call them.",
          "zh": "陳述，以及我們如何呼叫它們。"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 244.51,
          "end": 249.96,
          "en": "Now of course, we're still calling this immediately when this code runs,",
          "zh": "現在當然，我們仍然在這段程式碼執行時立刻呼叫這個，"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 250.03,
          "end": 256.06,
          "en": "so ultimately the goal will be to connect this to the button which I'll do in a second but not before",
          "zh": "所以最終目標會是把這個連到按鈕，我等一下會做，但不是在"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 256.27,
          "end": 260.32,
          "en": "diving into the order in which you can define things here",
          "zh": "深入你可以在這裡定義事物的順序之前"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 260.41,
          "end": 266.53,
          "en": "and also the implication it has when you define a variable or a constant inside of a function",
          "zh": "以及當你在函式裡面定義變數或常數時它有的含義"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 266.71,
          "end": 268.66,
          "en": "versus outside of a function.",
          "zh": "相對於在函式外面。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "15853230",
      "title": "The (Un)Importance of Code Order",
      "lectureOrder": 30,
      "videoOrder": 25,
      "sourceHash": "d40dec98ce104c50aad20cccc0ff8bc6ea2a37b43fa70e108b808f3172392122",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.27,
          "end": 4.88,
          "en": "Let's have a look at the order. Here,",
          "zh": "讓我們看一下順序。這裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.88,
          "end": 8.11,
          "en": "I'm defining my constant and my variable before I use it,",
          "zh": "我在使用之前定義我的常數和我的變數，"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.18,
          "end": 8.45,
          "en": "right?",
          "zh": "對吧？"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.45,
          "end": 13.73,
          "en": "I define current result right at the top of the script file and then here's the first time where I try",
          "zh": "我在腳本檔案最上方定義 currentResult，然後這裡是我第一次試著"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.73,
          "end": 19,
          "en": "to use it because I try to assign a new value to it and then I also use it down there when I forward",
          "zh": "使用它，因為我試著指派一個新值給它，然後我也在下面使用它，當我轉交"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 19,
          "end": 23.65,
          "en": "it or when I pass the value that stored inside of it to output result.",
          "zh": "它，或當我把存在它裡面的值傳給 outputResult。"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 23.72,
          "end": 28.26,
          "en": "Now our code would break if I would move that all the way to the bottom of the script,",
          "zh": "現在如果我把那個全部移到腳本最底部，我們的程式碼會壞掉，"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 28.28,
          "end": 35.43,
          "en": "so if I declare my variable here. Now if we reload this page, you see zero everywhere",
          "zh": "所以如果我在這裡宣告我的變數。現在如果我們重新載入這個頁面，你看到到處都是零"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 35.43,
          "end": 37.26,
          "en": "and if you open the developer tools again,",
          "zh": "而如果你再次打開開發者工具，"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 40.66,
          "end": 46.15,
          "en": "in the console you'll see an error, cannot access current result before initialization.",
          "zh": "在主控台你會看到一個錯誤，cannot access currentResult before initialization。"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 46.15,
          "end": 50.5,
          "en": "Now this error message which the browser throws at us is pretty clear,",
          "zh": "現在瀏覽器丟給我們的這個錯誤訊息相當清楚，"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 50.71,
          "end": 53.59,
          "en": "we're trying to use it here",
          "zh": "我們試著在這裡使用它"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 53.83,
          "end": 58.19,
          "en": "and actually the error message even gives us the line number of where this error occurred,",
          "zh": "而實際上錯誤訊息甚至給我們這個錯誤發生處的行號，"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 58.21,
          "end": 60.98,
          "en": "it's this number you see here, eight.",
          "zh": "就是你在這裡看到的這個數字，八。"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 61,
          "end": 65.28,
          "en": "So you see in line number eight and indeed that's the problematic number here,",
          "zh": "所以你看到在行號八，而確實那是這裡有問題的數字，"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 65.56,
          "end": 71.28999999999999,
          "en": "we're getting an error because we're trying to assign something to the current result variable without",
          "zh": "我們得到錯誤，因為我們試著指派某物給 currentResult 變數，卻沒有"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 71.28999999999999,
          "end": 73.26,
          "en": "defining it first.",
          "zh": "先定義它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 73.27,
          "end": 79.75,
          "en": "So in Javascript, when using the let or the const keyword which you should use, you need to declare",
          "zh": "所以在 JavaScript，使用 let 或 const 關鍵字時，你應該使用它們，你需要宣告"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 79.87,
          "end": 87.13,
          "en": "your variables and constants before you use them and declare is the part where you create the variable",
          "zh": "你的變數和常數，在你使用它們之前，而宣告是你建立變數的部分"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 87.13,
          "end": 88.47,
          "en": "with let or const.",
          "zh": "用 let 或 const。"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 88.53999999999999,
          "end": 92.56,
          "en": "Then as mentioned for the same name, you must only declare it once,",
          "zh": "然後如對相同名稱所提到的，你必須只宣告一次，"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 92.56,
          "end": 97.72,
          "en": "you can always reassign a value but with let and const, you only declare it once and you need to do",
          "zh": "你永遠可以重新指派值，但用 let 和 const，你只宣告一次，而你需要"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 97.72,
          "end": 103,
          "en": "that declaration before you first try to read from it or assign a value to it.",
          "zh": "在你第一次試著讀它或指派值給它之前做那個宣告。"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 103.03,
          "end": 107.03999999999999,
          "en": "You don't need to define it, so you don't need to initialize it with a value,",
          "zh": "你不需要定義它，所以你不需要用一個值初始化它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 107.11,
          "end": 113.59,
          "en": "if I just set up current result like this, this would actually be valid, if I now tried to execute it,",
          "zh": "如果我只像這樣設定 currentResult，這實際上會是有效的，如果我現在試著執行它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 113.59,
          "end": 117.87,
          "en": "you see this runs because I declared a variable before I then use it",
          "zh": "你看到這能執行，因為我在接著使用它之前宣告了變數"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 117.97,
          "end": 123.44,
          "en": "and since I use it by initializing it with a value here anyways or by assigning a value here anyways,",
          "zh": "而因為我反正在這裡用一個值初始化它來使用它，或反正在這裡指派一個值，"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 123.97,
          "end": 126.74,
          "en": "I don't need to initialize and define it up there.",
          "zh": "我不需要在上面初始化並定義它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 126.76,
          "end": 131.68,
          "en": "So doing this up here is totally optional, we don't really need to do that because I'm assigning a value",
          "zh": "所以在上面做這個完全是選用的，我們並不真的需要做那個，因為我反正指派一個值"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 131.71,
          "end": 132.45,
          "en": "down there anyways",
          "zh": "在下面"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 132.73,
          "end": 135.91,
          "en": "but you need to declare it with the let keyword.",
          "zh": "但你需要用 let 關鍵字宣告它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 135.91,
          "end": 138.26,
          "en": "Now for functions, that's actually a bit different.",
          "zh": "現在對函式，那實際上有點不同。"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 138.37,
          "end": 144.91,
          "en": "I could grab this function and move it to the bottom of this file and if I do this, please keep in mind",
          "zh": "我可以抓住這個函式並把它移到這個檔案底部，而如果我這樣做，請記住"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 144.91,
          "end": 146.95,
          "en": "that I do call it up here,",
          "zh": "我確實在上面呼叫它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 147.01,
          "end": 154.93,
          "en": "so technically before I define it. Still if I now reload this page, we get the same result as before and",
          "zh": "所以技術上在我定義它之前。儘管如此，如果我現在重新載入這個頁面，我們得到和之前相同的結果，而"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 154.93,
          "end": 160.4,
          "en": "if we have a look into the developer tools, you see no new error here.",
          "zh": "如果我們看開發者工具，你看到這裡沒有新錯誤。"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 160.51,
          "end": 167.68,
          "en": "The reason for that is that for functions, we have a special behavior in Javascript. What Javascript actually",
          "zh": "原因是對函式，我們在 JavaScript 有特殊行為。JavaScript 實際上"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 167.68,
          "end": 173.62,
          "en": "does or what the browser actually does is that when it loads your script , it runs through it from top",
          "zh": "做的，或瀏覽器實際上做的，是當它載入你的腳本，它從上"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 173.62,
          "end": 180.19,
          "en": "to bottom, it parses the entire script and actually it doesn't execute it right away, instead it just reads",
          "zh": "到下跑過它，它解析整個腳本，而實際上它不會立刻執行，相反它只是讀"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 180.19,
          "end": 187.78,
          "en": "it from top to bottom and will take any functions it finds in there and automatically pull them to the",
          "zh": "它從上到下，並會拿它在裡面找到的任何函式，並自動把它們拉到"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 187.78,
          "end": 189.75,
          "en": "top and be aware of them",
          "zh": "頂端並知道它們"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 189.76,
          "end": 196.78,
          "en": "so to say. So it automatically registers all functions before it then really executes your script and",
          "zh": "可以這麼說。所以它自動註冊所有函式，然後才真正執行你的腳本，而"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 196.78,
          "end": 199.65,
          "en": "that's just the special behavior Javascript has there.",
          "zh": "那只是 JavaScript 在那裡有的特殊行為。"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 200.35,
          "end": 207.57999999999998,
          "en": "Therefore it's up to you whether you prefer to have your functions at the bottom of your script or towards",
          "zh": "因此由你決定，你偏好把函式放在腳本底部，或朝向"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 207.57999999999998,
          "end": 210.21,
          "en": "the beginning or is somewhere in between,",
          "zh": "開頭，或在中間某處，"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 210.25,
          "end": 214.3,
          "en": "you just should try to find some consistent code style.",
          "zh": "你只應該試著找到某種一致的程式碼風格。"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 214.39,
          "end": 221.26,
          "en": "Now I personally like to have my functions towards the beginning of the file in most cases because I",
          "zh": "現在我個人在大多數情況喜歡把函式放在檔案開頭附近，因為我"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 221.26,
          "end": 226.12,
          "en": "think if you then read the file as a developer, you kind of see what's in there and if you then",
          "zh": "想，如果你接著身為開發者讀這個檔案，你有點看到裡面有什麼，而如果你接著"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 226.12,
          "end": 231.49,
          "en": "later see that I call add, you recall that you did see that function definition above and you don't need",
          "zh": "稍後看到我呼叫 add，你記得你在上面看過那個函式定義，而你不需要"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 231.49,
          "end": 233.9,
          "en": "to scroll to the bottom of the file to find it",
          "zh": "捲到檔案底部去找它"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 234.13,
          "end": 238.72,
          "en": "but there also are developers who prefer to have their function definitions at the bottom of the file",
          "zh": "但也有開發者偏好把函式定義放在檔案底部"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 239.29,
          "end": 245.11,
          "en": "and ultimately, there is no wrong or right is up to you but you should find one approach and then kind",
          "zh": "而最終，沒有錯或對，由你決定，但你應該找到一種做法，然後有點"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 245.11,
          "end": 247.92,
          "en": "of stick to it for this program you're writing.",
          "zh": "為你正在寫的這個程式堅持它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 247.99,
          "end": 253.6,
          "en": "Of course, you can switch anytime in new applications you're creating or refactor your existing code",
          "zh": "當然，你可以隨時在你建立的新應用程式切換，或重構你現有的程式碼"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 253.6,
          "end": 255.87,
          "en": "and move your functions to the bottom or to the top",
          "zh": "並把你的函式移到底部或頂部"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 255.94,
          "end": 262.45,
          "en": "if you kind of decide to go the opposite direction whilst in the project. Here again I'll have it towards",
          "zh": "如果你有點決定在專案裡走相反方向。這裡我再次會把它放在"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 262.45,
          "end": 270.37,
          "en": "the beginning but this is up to you. You also reformat that which I did with the autoformatting functionality",
          "zh": "開頭附近，但這由你決定。你也可以重新格式化那個，我用自動格式化功能做的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 270.37,
          "end": 272.32,
          "en": "I showed you in the first course module.",
          "zh": "我在第一個課程模組展示給你的。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "15853236",
      "title": "An Introduction to Global & Local Scope",
      "lectureOrder": 31,
      "videoOrder": 26,
      "sourceHash": "b2428b3896d47772bbf5b763a4b820704ff2eeb6e41152029871405a36843f83",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.61,
          "end": 6.48,
          "en": "So the order matters for variables and constants,",
          "zh": "所以順序對變數和常數重要，"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 6.48,
          "end": 7.37,
          "en": "it does not",
          "zh": "它不"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.37,
          "end": 12.81,
          "en": "for functions. There is one more interesting thing in our code here and that's that we have a constant",
          "zh": "對函式重要。我們這裡的程式碼還有一件更有趣的事，那就是我們在函式裡有一個常數"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 12.81,
          "end": 17.79,
          "en": "here in the function and we have a variable and a constant outside of the function.",
          "zh": "在這裡，而我們在函式外面有一個變數和一個常數。"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 17.79,
          "end": 20.14,
          "en": "Now when should you use what",
          "zh": "現在你何時該用什麼"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 20.14,
          "end": 21.51,
          "en": "and what's the difference?",
          "zh": "而差別是什麼？"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 21.51,
          "end": 22.74,
          "en": "Is there a difference?",
          "zh": "有差別嗎？"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 22.74,
          "end": 23.79,
          "en": "Well there is a difference",
          "zh": "嗯，有差別"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 24.15,
          "end": 30.09,
          "en": "and generally, if you use some data only in the function, like this result which I use in the function,",
          "zh": "而一般來說，如果你只在函式裡使用某些資料，像我在函式裡使用的這個 result，"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 30.21,
          "end": 31.53,
          "en": "I return it here,",
          "zh": "我在這裡回傳它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 31.53,
          "end": 34.62,
          "en": "then you want to define it in the function.",
          "zh": "那麼你想在函式裡定義它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 34.62,
          "end": 43.02,
          "en": "I could have said let result here and then just assign a new value here and then we could even do something",
          "zh": "我可以在這裡說 let result，然後只在這裡指派一個新值，然後我們甚至可以做某件"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 43.02,
          "end": 49.86,
          "en": "strange, we could say add like this and set current result equal to result.",
          "zh": "奇怪的事，我們可以像這樣說 add，並把 currentResult 設成等於 result。"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 49.92,
          "end": 56.37,
          "en": "This code would technically work because what I'm doing here is I'm defining this result variable globally,",
          "zh": "這段程式碼技術上會運作，因為我在這裡做的是全域定義這個 result 變數，"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 56.4,
          "end": 60.9,
          "en": "so in my script, then I assign a new value to it in a function",
          "zh": "所以在我的腳本裡，然後我在函式裡指派一個新值給它"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 60.9,
          "end": 67.14,
          "en": "because in your functions and that's one important thing to keep in mind, you can access any variable",
          "zh": "因為在你的函式裡，而那是要記住的一件重要的事，你可以存取任何"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 67.14,
          "end": 73.87,
          "en": "or constant defined outside of the function, so you can read variables or constants defined globally,",
          "zh": "在函式外面定義的變數或常數，所以你可以讀全域定義的變數或常數，"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 73.92,
          "end": 78.35,
          "en": "so we can interact with this result variable and I'm assigning a new value to it",
          "zh": "所以我們可以和這個 result 變數互動，而我指派一個新值給它"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 78.51,
          "end": 83.85,
          "en": "and therefore when I thereafter call the function, I actually don't care about the return value, I let",
          "zh": "因此當我之後呼叫函式，我實際上不在乎回傳值，我讓"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 83.85,
          "end": 85.28,
          "en": "that go into the void",
          "zh": "那個進到空無"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 85.5,
          "end": 92.88,
          "en": "but since inside of the function, I assigned a new value to result, I can use that global variable and",
          "zh": "但因為在函式裡面，我指派了新值給 result，我可以使用那個全域變數並"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 92.88,
          "end": 96.14,
          "en": "store it in another global variable or use it anywhere else,",
          "zh": "把它存在另一個全域變數，或在其他任何地方使用它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 96.15,
          "end": 102.84,
          "en": "whatever you want to do. This however would not be very good code because we have a function that manipulates",
          "zh": "不管你想做什麼。不過這不會是很好的程式碼，因為我們有一個函式操縱"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 102.84,
          "end": 109.44,
          "en": "a global variable, that's sometimes something you want to do but often that makes your functions harder",
          "zh": "一個全域變數，那有時是你想做的事，但常常那讓你的函式更難"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 109.44,
          "end": 116.78,
          "en": "to understand and harder to predict what they're going to do and in addition, that we return this",
          "zh": "理解，也更難預測它們會做什麼，此外，我們在這裡回傳這個"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 116.9,
          "end": 118.67,
          "en": "value here is totally redundant,",
          "zh": "值完全是多餘的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 118.67,
          "end": 121.43,
          "en": "so not the best code we could write.",
          "zh": "所以不是我們能寫的最好程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 121.58,
          "end": 128.18,
          "en": "Instead it's way better if we go with the setup we had before, where we have our contained constant here,",
          "zh": "相反，如果我們用之前的設定會好很多，我們在這裡有被包住的常數，"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 128.18,
          "end": 131.83,
          "en": "we returned this and the function therefore works standalone.",
          "zh": "我們回傳這個，因此函式獨立運作。"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 132.02,
          "end": 135.2,
          "en": "It doesn't magically change our global variables,",
          "zh": "它不會神奇地改變我們的全域變數，"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 135.2,
          "end": 137.39,
          "en": "instead we know when we call the function,",
          "zh": "相反我們知道當我們呼叫函式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 137.39,
          "end": 141.47,
          "en": "this function will not alter anything, not anything global,",
          "zh": "這個函式不會改任何東西，不會改任何全域的東西，"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 141.47,
          "end": 144.74,
          "en": "instead it will only work with its internal data and then return us.",
          "zh": "相反它只會用它的內部資料工作，然後回傳給我們。"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 144.92000000000002,
          "end": 146.74,
          "en": "This is called a pure function,",
          "zh": "這叫做純函式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 146.78,
          "end": 150.26,
          "en": "it gets some input, returns an output, for the same input",
          "zh": "它得到一些輸入，回傳一個輸出，對相同輸入"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 150.26,
          "end": 157.76,
          "en": "it always returns the same output and it doesn't manipulate anything global but it is worth noting that",
          "zh": "它永遠回傳相同輸出，而它不操縱任何全域的東西，但值得注意的是"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 157.76,
          "end": 160.57,
          "en": "functions can access global variables,",
          "zh": "函式可以存取全域變數，"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 160.61,
          "end": 166.22,
          "en": "they can also access other functions you might have defined, so you can call a function from inside a function",
          "zh": "它們也可以存取你可能定義的其他函式，所以你可以從函式裡面呼叫函式"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 167.03,
          "end": 168.74,
          "en": "and that is built into Javascript",
          "zh": "而那內建在 JavaScript"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 168.74,
          "end": 172.59,
          "en": "and it's a good thing which we'll also use from time to time.",
          "zh": "而那是好事，我們也會不時使用。"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 172.7,
          "end": 179.3,
          "en": "Now the other way around won't work though, if you define a constant or a variable inside of a function,",
          "zh": "現在反過來則不會運作，如果你在函式裡面定義常數或變數，"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 179.66,
          "end": 186.89,
          "en": "then this has a so-called local or block scope which means it's available inside of this block, the block",
          "zh": "那麼這有所謂的區域或區塊作用域，意思是它在這個區塊裡面可用，區塊"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 186.89,
          "end": 192.8,
          "en": "is surrounded or marked by these curly braces and we can use it anywhere in this block but we can't",
          "zh": "被這些大括號包圍或標記，而我們可以在這個區塊任何地方使用它，但我們不能"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 192.8,
          "end": 194.24,
          "en": "use it outside of there.",
          "zh": "在那外面使用它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 194.24,
          "end": 199.6,
          "en": "So if I try to throw an alert where I want to output the value that's stored in result here",
          "zh": "所以如果我試著丟一個 alert，我想輸出存在這裡 result 裡的值"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 199.73,
          "end": 206.75,
          "en": "after defining the function, you will see that if I reload this, nothing happens. You see we seem to have",
          "zh": "在定義函式之後，你會看到如果我重新載入這個，什麼都沒發生。你看到我們似乎有"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 206.75,
          "end": 213.02,
          "en": "an error and indeed if I open my console in the developer tools again, I get a reference error that result",
          "zh": "一個錯誤，而確實如果我再次在開發者工具打開主控台，我得到參考錯誤，result"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 213.07999999999998,
          "end": 219.37,
          "en": "is not defined because I'm trying to use a variable here in line 9,",
          "zh": "未被定義，因為我試著在第 9 行這裡使用一個變數，"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 219.38,
          "end": 227.06,
          "en": "so in this line here, which wasn't defined because as I just explained, you can use global variables and",
          "zh": "所以在這裡這行，它沒被定義，因為如我剛解釋的，你可以在函式裡面使用全域變數和"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 227.06,
          "end": 234.14,
          "en": "constants and functions inside of functions but you can't use local variables or constants or functions,",
          "zh": "常數和函式，但你不能使用區域變數或常數或函式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 234.32,
          "end": 238.71,
          "en": "so variables or constants or functions defined inside of functions",
          "zh": "所以在函式裡面定義的變數或常數或函式"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 238.76,
          "end": 244.37,
          "en": "and yes you can define functions inside of functions, something I'll dive in later, you can use those",
          "zh": "而沒錯，你可以在函式裡面定義函式，我稍後會深入的事，你不能使用那些"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 244.52,
          "end": 247.61,
          "en": "from outside of the function.",
          "zh": "從函式外面。"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 247.61,
          "end": 253.94,
          "en": "So using result outside of the function won't work because this is a constant defined inside of the",
          "zh": "所以在函式外面使用 result 不會運作，因為這是在"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 253.94,
          "end": 259.64,
          "en": "function and it won't work no matter if we use it here or here after we call the function because you",
          "zh": "函式裡面定義的常數，而不管我們在這裡使用它，或在我們呼叫函式之後這裡使用它，都不會運作，因為你"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 259.64,
          "end": 262.27,
          "en": "could think we only called a function here,",
          "zh": "可能想我們只在這裡呼叫了函式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 262.31,
          "end": 266.27,
          "en": "so thereafter result has to be defined and now it should be available.",
          "zh": "所以之後 result 必須已被定義，而現在它應該可用。"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 266.45,
          "end": 271.51,
          "en": "Well actually as it turns out, if you now reload, you still get the same error here,",
          "zh": "嗯，實際上結果是，如果你現在重新載入，你仍然在這裡得到相同錯誤，"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 271.52,
          "end": 277.01,
          "en": "now in line 11 instead of line 9 because I moved that code but still, result it's not available",
          "zh": "現在在第 11 行而不是第 9 行，因為我移動了那段程式碼，但仍然，result 在"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 277.15999999999997,
          "end": 283.7,
          "en": "outside of the function and that's one important thing you need to understand with Javascript. Functions",
          "zh": "函式外面不可用，而那是你需要用 JavaScript 理解的一件重要的事。函式"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 283.79,
          "end": 291.74,
          "en": "have full access to their surrounding context, so to all the variables and so on that are defined above",
          "zh": "對它們周圍的情境有完整存取，所以對所有在它們上面定義的變數等等"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 291.74,
          "end": 293.48,
          "en": "them or outside of them",
          "zh": "或在它們外面的"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 293.48,
          "end": 297.37,
          "en": "but what you define inside of a function is only available in there,",
          "zh": "但你在函式裡面定義的只在那裡面可用，"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 297.44,
          "end": 302.69,
          "en": "the only way of kind of getting it out is by returning it.",
          "zh": "有點把它拿出來的唯一方式是回傳它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 302.69,
          "end": 310.16,
          "en": "Now at this point you might also wonder, what if a variable is defined globally and then we try to create",
          "zh": "現在在這個點你也許也會想，如果變數被全域定義，然後我們試著"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 310.16,
          "end": 312.56,
          "en": "it locally in a function as well?",
          "zh": "也在函式裡區域建立它呢？"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 312.56,
          "end": 317.87,
          "en": "So we have it declared with let or const globally and then we want to do the same with let or",
          "zh": "所以我們全域用 let 或 const 宣告它，然後我們想用 let 或 const"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 317.87,
          "end": 319.37,
          "en": "const in the function,",
          "zh": "在函式裡做同樣的事，"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 319.37,
          "end": 322.61,
          "en": "so not overwrite the existing one but create a new one,",
          "zh": "所以不是覆寫現有的那個，而是建立一個新的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 322.61,
          "end": 323.93,
          "en": "is that possible?",
          "zh": "那可能嗎？"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 323.96,
          "end": 328.22,
          "en": "And the answer would be yes, this is a process called shadowing and in the lecture after this one,",
          "zh": "而答案會是可以，這是叫做遮蔽的過程，而在這堂之後的那堂，"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 328.25,
          "end": 329.6,
          "en": "I'll dive a bit deeper into this.",
          "zh": "我會更深入這個一點。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "15853238",
      "title": "More about the \"return\" Statement",
      "lectureOrder": 33,
      "videoOrder": 27,
      "sourceHash": "c6d7f27f5ab88aeb460c4787379bc2479e46bbd1b543f7a46b3eec4cf49add9b",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.43,
          "end": 6.98,
          "en": "So the return statement is useful for getting data out of the function,",
          "zh": "所以 return 陳述對把資料拿出函式很有用，"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 6.99,
          "end": 11.25,
          "en": "there are a couple of important things to know about the return statement. For one,",
          "zh": "關於 return 陳述有幾件重要的事要知道。首先，"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 11.34,
          "end": 19.38,
          "en": "any code that you have thereafter, like this alert won't execute. You see my IDE even kind of grays it",
          "zh": "你在那之後有的任何程式碼，像這個 alert，不會執行。你看到我的 IDE 甚至有點把它變灰"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 19.38,
          "end": 20.22,
          "en": "out a bit",
          "zh": "一點"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 20.22,
          "end": 27.03,
          "en": "and indeed if I reload the screen, you'll see everything works but I never see that alert. In the developer",
          "zh": "而確實如果我重新載入畫面，你會看到一切都運作，但我從未看到那個 alert。在開發者"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 27.03,
          "end": 31.79,
          "en": "tools, you'll also not see an error though because the app didn't crash,",
          "zh": "工具裡，你也不會看到錯誤，因為應用程式沒有當掉，"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 31.8,
          "end": 33.18,
          "en": "we don't have an error,",
          "zh": "我們沒有錯誤，"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 33.36,
          "end": 40.7,
          "en": "the return statement just ends the function execution, which means code thereafter isn't executed.",
          "zh": "return 陳述只是結束函式執行，意思是之後的程式碼不被執行。"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 41.19,
          "end": 44.44,
          "en": "You by the way also can return nothing,",
          "zh": "你順帶一提也可以什麼都不回傳，"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 44.46,
          "end": 50.67,
          "en": "you might wonder why you might want to do that, for this function it makes absolutely no sense but you",
          "zh": "你也許會想為什麼你可能想那樣做，對這個函式它完全沒有意義，但你"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 50.67,
          "end": 57.15,
          "en": "will later encounter scenarios where a function does something, let's say it does some calculation and",
          "zh": "稍後會遇到情境，函式做某件事，假設它做一些計算，並"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 57.15,
          "end": 64.8,
          "en": "then sends that with a HTTP request to some server to store it there and then you want to quit",
          "zh": "然後用 HTTP 請求把那個送到某個伺服器，在那裡儲存它，然後你想退出"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 64.8,
          "end": 71.07,
          "en": "function execution, maybe conditionally with something we'll dive into later, with an if statement which",
          "zh": "函式執行，也許有條件地，用我們稍後會深入的東西，用 if 陳述，它"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 71.07,
          "end": 77.73,
          "en": "allows us to check for some condition and then exit the function if that condition is true and only",
          "zh": "允許我們檢查某個條件，然後如果那個條件為真就離開函式，並只在"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 77.73,
          "end": 79.37,
          "en": "continue if it is not true,",
          "zh": "它不為真時繼續，"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 79.38,
          "end": 85.26,
          "en": "so in such cases you could return from a function and you would return nothing just to cancel function",
          "zh": "所以在這種情況你可以從函式回傳，而你會什麼都不回傳，只為了取消函式"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 85.26,
          "end": 86.84,
          "en": "execution. Here",
          "zh": "執行。這裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 86.88,
          "end": 91.59,
          "en": "again, that doesn't make any sense because the function would be over after this line anyways",
          "zh": "再次，那沒有任何意義，因為函式反正會在這行之後結束"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 91.59,
          "end": 97.71000000000001,
          "en": "but it's important to understand that return finishes the function execution, in case you had more code",
          "zh": "但理解 return 結束函式執行很重要，如果你在這之後有更多程式碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 97.71000000000001,
          "end": 103.89,
          "en": "after this, which as mentioned only makes sense if you have some kind of conditional logic in your code.",
          "zh": "如提到的，那只在你的程式碼有某種條件邏輯時說得通。"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 103.89,
          "end": 104.97,
          "en": "Right now we don't have that,",
          "zh": "現在我們沒有那個，"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 105.15,
          "end": 107.06,
          "en": "so it makes no sense.",
          "zh": "所以它沒有意義。"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 107.1,
          "end": 112.36,
          "en": "You also must only have one return statement here or actually you could have a second one",
          "zh": "你也必須在這裡只有一個 return 陳述，或實際上你可以有第二個"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 112.44,
          "end": 120,
          "en": "but because the function execution stops after the first one it finds, having a second one makes no sense.",
          "zh": "但因為函式執行在它找到的第一個之後停止，有第二個沒有意義。"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 120.15,
          "end": 127.92,
          "en": "So it's not a technical error to have more than one but you can't return more than one thing here. If",
          "zh": "所以有超過一個不是技術錯誤，但你不能在這裡回傳超過一個東西。如果"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 127.92,
          "end": 130.67,
          "en": "you need to return more than one piece of data",
          "zh": "你需要回傳超過一份資料"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 130.68,
          "end": 133.53,
          "en": "actually, we'll find a solution for that later,",
          "zh": "實際上，我們稍後會找到那個的解法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 133.53,
          "end": 139.05,
          "en": "for now we'll just use it like this but we'll dive into other data constructs which allow us to return",
          "zh": "現在我們就會像這樣使用它，但我們會深入其他資料結構，允許我們回傳"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 139.05,
          "end": 142.26,
          "en": "or contain more than one piece of data later in this module.",
          "zh": "或包含超過一份資料，在這個模組稍後。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "15853240",
      "title": "Executing Functions \"Indirectly\"",
      "lectureOrder": 34,
      "videoOrder": 28,
      "sourceHash": "f1f66f191d2c6f9761f619b518da67998b2df3dd21a73ef1f67dfd94bf2a074f",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.32,
          "end": 7.69,
          "en": "So that was a lot of talking about functions and variables and constants but these are some core things",
          "zh": "所以那是很多關於函式、變數和常數的談論，但這些是一些核心的事"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 7.69,
          "end": 13.32,
          "en": "you've got to understand with Javascript regarding how code executes and how code is related.",
          "zh": "你必須用 JavaScript 理解的，關於程式碼如何執行，以及程式碼如何相關。"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 13.36,
          "end": 19.18,
          "en": "Now our goal was to make sure that when we click the plus button, we actually take whatever the user",
          "zh": "現在我們的目標是確保當我們點加號按鈕，我們實際上拿使用者"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 19.21,
          "end": 27.7,
          "en": "entered here and we then use that in this addition and generate a new result which we then output.",
          "zh": "在這裡輸入的任何東西，然後我們在這個加法裡使用那個，並產生一個新結果，然後我們輸出。"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 27.7,
          "end": 30.75,
          "en": "Now for that, we need to add an event listener to this button",
          "zh": "現在為了那個，我們需要對這個按鈕加一個事件監聽器"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 30.77,
          "end": 36.16,
          "en": "and now that's something we haven't learned at all, we don't really know how to interact with the HTML page",
          "zh": "而現在那是我們完全還沒學的事，我們並不真的知道如何和 HTML 頁面互動"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 36.55,
          "end": 41.32,
          "en": "because that's a bit more complex and I'll have a whole module where we dive into all the depths of",
          "zh": "因為那有點更複雜，而我會有一整個模組，我們在那裡深入這一切的"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 41.32,
          "end": 45.46,
          "en": "this. For now we can take something from the vendor.js file,",
          "zh": "深度。現在我們可以從 vendor.js 檔案拿某物，"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 45.46,
          "end": 54.7,
          "en": "we can take this add button which the end is a reference, a pointer at this plus button we have here. So",
          "zh": "我們可以拿這個 addBtn，它最終是一個參考、一個指標，指向我們這裡有的這個加號按鈕。所以"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 54.7,
          "end": 64.03,
          "en": "in app.js, we can use that, replace this code here with add button and then add a dot here which is",
          "zh": "在 app.js，我們可以使用那個，把這裡這段程式碼換成 addBtn，然後在這裡加一個點，那是"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 64.24,
          "end": 66.87,
          "en": "strange, we have never seen that before here,",
          "zh": "奇怪的，我們之前在這裡從未看過那個，"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 66.88,
          "end": 73.53999999999999,
          "en": "let's ignore it for now and then type addEventListener, written like this.",
          "zh": "讓我們現在忽略它，然後輸入 addEventListener，像這樣寫。"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 73.57,
          "end": 81.73,
          "en": "This is actually a function built into the browser you could say which is tied to this button which",
          "zh": "這實際上是內建在瀏覽器裡的函式，你可以說，它被綁到這個按鈕，"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 81.73,
          "end": 87.63,
          "en": "is why we have this dot in between and we'll dive a bit deeper into what this dot means in just a while.",
          "zh": "這就是為什麼我們在中間有這個點，而我們等一下會更深入這個點意味什麼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 87.64,
          "end": 94.38,
          "en": "So for now, let's just write this and now this is a function that takes two parameters or two arguments",
          "zh": "所以現在，讓我們就寫這個，而現在這是一個接受兩個參數或兩個引數的函式"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 94.39,
          "end": 100.97999999999999,
          "en": "and the first parameter is actually a string which identifies the event to which we want to listen.",
          "zh": "而第一個參數實際上是字串，它識別我們想監聽的事件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 101.06,
          "end": 105.67,
          "en": "Now there are a bunch of available events and I'll walk you through them and where to find them all",
          "zh": "現在有一堆可用的事件，而我會帶你走過它們，以及在哪裡找到全部"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 105.97,
          "end": 108.03999999999999,
          "en": "in the dedicated module,",
          "zh": "在專門的模組裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 108.03999999999999,
          "end": 110.32,
          "en": "for now we can add click here.",
          "zh": "現在我們可以在這裡加 click。"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 110.35,
          "end": 116.22999999999999,
          "en": "Now as a string between single or double quotes or back ticks, though back ticks don't make a lot of",
          "zh": "現在作為字串，在單引號或雙引號或反引號之間，不過反引號在這裡不太"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 116.22999999999999,
          "end": 122.64,
          "en": "sense here because we don't need to embed anything dynamic here. So that's the first parameter,",
          "zh": "有意義，因為我們不需要在這裡嵌入任何動態的東西。所以那是第一個參數，"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 122.82,
          "end": 128.8,
          "en": "the second parameter and that's now the strange thing actually should be a function.",
          "zh": "第二個參數，而那現在是奇怪的事，實際上應該是一個函式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 128.85,
          "end": 134.87,
          "en": "It's not that strange if you think about it though since functions are a code on demand,",
          "zh": "如果你想想，那並沒那麼奇怪，因為函式是隨需程式碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 135,
          "end": 142.32,
          "en": "you want to make sure that you tell the browser, that you tell Javascript which function should be executed",
          "zh": "你想確保你告訴瀏覽器、你告訴 JavaScript 哪個函式應該被執行"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 142.41,
          "end": 145.07999999999998,
          "en": "if this button is clicked.",
          "zh": "如果這個按鈕被點擊。"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 145.13,
          "end": 148.62,
          "en": "So how do we now point at a function here?",
          "zh": "所以我們現在如何在這裡指向一個函式？"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 149.15,
          "end": 151.52,
          "en": "Well you could do something like add here,",
          "zh": "嗯，你可以做像這裡 add 這樣的事，"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 151.57999999999998,
          "end": 151.82,
          "en": "right,",
          "zh": "對吧，"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 151.82,
          "end": 154.71,
          "en": "you could execute your add function here.",
          "zh": "你可以在這裡執行你的 add 函式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 154.76,
          "end": 156.79,
          "en": "Now this would actually be wrong",
          "zh": "現在這實際上會是錯的"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 156.95,
          "end": 161.99,
          "en": "and this is one of the trickier things to understand in Javascript or in programming in general,",
          "zh": "而這是 JavaScript 裡、或一般程式設計裡較難理解的事之一，"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 161.99,
          "end": 164.16,
          "en": "it's not exclusive to Javascript.",
          "zh": "它不是 JavaScript 獨有的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 164.51,
          "end": 169.49,
          "en": "We want to tell the browser what to execute when a click occurs.",
          "zh": "我們想告訴瀏覽器，當點擊發生時要執行什麼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 169.49,
          "end": 175.61,
          "en": "Now if we execute add like this, no matter if we add arguments or not which we of course should theoretically",
          "zh": "現在如果我們像這樣執行 add，不管我們加不加引數，我們理論上當然應該"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 175.61,
          "end": 182.27,
          "en": "though, what happens is that this code gets parsed by the browser when it encounters our script and in",
          "zh": "加，發生的是這段程式碼在瀏覽器遇到我們的腳本時被解析，而在"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 182.27,
          "end": 186.47,
          "en": "the end after registering all functions and so on, it will go ahead,",
          "zh": "最後，在註冊所有函式等等之後，它會繼續，"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 186.47,
          "end": 192.8,
          "en": "it will add this event listener but then this here tells the browser call this function because we",
          "zh": "它會加這個事件監聽器，但然後這裡這個告訴瀏覽器呼叫這個函式，因為我們"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 192.8,
          "end": 198.55,
          "en": "have parentheses with arguments here. We want to tell the browser however or we want to tell the Javascript",
          "zh": "這裡有帶引數的小括號。然而我們想告訴瀏覽器，或我們想告訴 JavaScript"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 198.55,
          "end": 202.32999999999998,
          "en": "engine, don't execute this function right away,",
          "zh": "引擎，不要立刻執行這個函式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 202.32999999999998,
          "end": 211.26,
          "en": "instead keep in mind that this function should be executed when this button is clicked. The solution",
          "zh": "相反記住這個函式應該在這個按鈕被點擊時被執行。解法"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 211.26,
          "end": 219.44,
          "en": "therefore is to not pass the function here with parentheses but just the function name. By doing that,",
          "zh": "因此是不要在這裡用小括號傳函式，而只傳函式名稱。藉由那樣做，"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 219.44,
          "end": 224.36,
          "en": "you're telling the Javascript engine when this button is clicked,",
          "zh": "你告訴 JavaScript 引擎，當這個按鈕被點擊，"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 224.36,
          "end": 229.76,
          "en": "have a look at the function with this name and execute it for me.",
          "zh": "看一下這個名稱的函式，並為我執行它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 231.07,
          "end": 238.15,
          "en": "So before we manually called the function in our code because we the developer so to say, we're the",
          "zh": "所以之前我們在程式碼裡手動呼叫函式，因為我們，身為開發者可以這麼說，我們是"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 238.15,
          "end": 240.59,
          "en": "one executing the function,",
          "zh": "執行函式的人，"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 240.73,
          "end": 246.76,
          "en": "now we want to make sure that the browser can execute the function when the click occurs and we don't",
          "zh": "現在我們想確保瀏覽器可以在點擊發生時執行函式，而我們不"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 246.76,
          "end": 248.14,
          "en": "know when that will be the case,",
          "zh": "知道那何時會是情況，"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 248.17,
          "end": 253.7,
          "en": "so we want to give Javascript the name of the function which it should call for us,",
          "zh": "所以我們想給 JavaScript 它應該為我們呼叫的函式名稱，"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 253.72,
          "end": 257.26,
          "en": "we want to allow the browser to call that function for us.",
          "zh": "我們想允許瀏覽器為我們呼叫那個函式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 257.26,
          "end": 259.34,
          "en": "Here's a real life analogy,",
          "zh": "這裡有一個現實生活的類比，"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 259.42,
          "end": 267.22,
          "en": "you live in some flat and you have an address where you get your mail and so on.",
          "zh": "你住在某間公寓，而你有一個地址，你在那裡收到郵件等等。"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 267.22,
          "end": 271.99,
          "en": "Now of course, you can go down to your doorbell and ring it yourself,",
          "zh": "現在當然，你可以下樓到你的門鈴並自己按它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 272.02,
          "end": 276.02,
          "en": "you can do that because you know where you live and what your doorbell is,",
          "zh": "你可以那樣做，因為你知道你住哪裡，以及你的門鈴是什麼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 276.04,
          "end": 282.88,
          "en": "which button you need to press but you want to make sure that the mail service, the people delivering",
          "zh": "你需要按哪個按鈕，但你想確保郵件服務、送"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 282.88,
          "end": 287.59000000000003,
          "en": "your mail and your packages, that they know where to ring.",
          "zh": "你的郵件和包裹的人，他們知道要按哪裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 287.59000000000003,
          "end": 289.3,
          "en": "So you give them your address,",
          "zh": "所以你給他們你的地址，"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 289.48,
          "end": 295.21,
          "en": "you give them your address by providing it to Amazon or wherever you order your stuff.",
          "zh": "你藉由把它提供給 Amazon 或你訂東西的任何地方，給他們你的地址。"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 295.21,
          "end": 300.55,
          "en": "So now you basically tell them your address and in this case, the name of the function is the address so",
          "zh": "所以現在你基本上告訴他們你的地址，而在這個情況，函式的名稱是地址，可以"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 300.55,
          "end": 302.79,
          "en": "to say where they need to ring,",
          "zh": "這麼說，他們需要按鈴的地方，"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 303.37,
          "end": 308.95,
          "en": "so that when they are there with your package with which you ordered, they can ring that bell and",
          "zh": "所以當他們帶著你訂的包裹到那裡，他們可以按那個鈴，而"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 308.98,
          "end": 314.62,
          "en": "that's the same we're doing here, we're giving the browser the address, the name of the function which",
          "zh": "那和我們在這裡做的一樣，我們給瀏覽器地址、函式的名稱，它"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 314.62,
          "end": 318.53,
          "en": "it should call for us when the button is clicked.",
          "zh": "應該在按鈕被點擊時為我們呼叫。"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 318.55,
          "end": 325.36,
          "en": "So now this add function will be executed for us by the browser whenever a user clicks this add button.",
          "zh": "所以現在這個 add 函式會被瀏覽器為我們執行，每當使用者點這個加號按鈕。"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 325.36,
          "end": 325.99,
          "en": "The thing now",
          "zh": "現在的事"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 325.99,
          "end": 326.91,
          "en": "just is",
          "zh": "只是"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 326.92,
          "end": 330,
          "en": "what about these arguments which we want to get there,",
          "zh": "這些我們想在那裡得到的引數呢，"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 330,
          "end": 339.32,
          "en": "we don't know what to add here. Well in the end, what should be added here is is the current result and",
          "zh": "我們不知道要在這裡加什麼。嗯，最後，這裡應該被加的是目前結果，以及"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 339.32,
          "end": 340.88,
          "en": "then whatever the user entered.",
          "zh": "然後使用者輸入的任何東西。"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 341.36,
          "end": 346.94,
          "en": "So we need two additional pieces of information, we need to find out what the user entered and we need",
          "zh": "所以我們需要兩份額外資訊，我們需要找出使用者輸入了什麼，而我們需要"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 346.94,
          "end": 350.52,
          "en": "to get our current result. For that,",
          "zh": "取得我們的目前結果。為了那個，"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 350.53,
          "end": 356.77,
          "en": "we can restructure the function a bit and instead of getting arguments here, we can take advantage of",
          "zh": "我們可以稍微重組函式，而不是在這裡取得引數，我們可以善用"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 356.77,
          "end": 363.4,
          "en": "something which I mentioned earlier, a function can read from the globally available variables. So we",
          "zh": "我稍早提到的某件事，函式可以從全域可用的變數讀取。所以我們"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 363.4,
          "end": 369.25,
          "en": "know the current result of course, so we can use that here in a read-only way, so we're reading from",
          "zh": "當然知道目前結果，所以我們可以在這裡以唯讀方式使用那個，所以我們正在讀取"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 369.25,
          "end": 369.51,
          "en": "it,",
          "zh": "它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 369.55,
          "end": 374.62,
          "en": "we could of course also reassign a value to it but here I'm just reading from it and now I want to get",
          "zh": "我們當然也可以重新指派一個值給它，但這裡我只是從它讀取，而現在我想取得"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 374.62,
          "end": 376.37,
          "en": "the value the user entered here.",
          "zh": "使用者在這裡輸入的值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 376.6,
          "end": 380.66,
          "en": "Now for that, the vendor.js file again got us covered,",
          "zh": "現在為了那個，vendor.js 檔案再次幫我們處理了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 380.67,
          "end": 387.3,
          "en": "this user input constant which is added globally here, that in the end points at this input field here.",
          "zh": "這個全域加在這裡的 userInput 常數，最終指向這裡這個輸入欄。"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 388.05,
          "end": 390.11,
          "en": "So we can use user input here",
          "zh": "所以我們可以在這裡使用 userInput"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 390.12,
          "end": 395.47,
          "en": "but now that's just a pointer at the input field, again without diving into too many details here,",
          "zh": "但現在那只是指向輸入欄的指標，再次不在這裡深入太多細節，"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 395.55,
          "end": 401.90999999999997,
          "en": "you can add dot value here and that will actually give you the value of what the user entered",
          "zh": "你可以在這裡加 .value，而那實際上會給你使用者輸入的值"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 401.90999999999997,
          "end": 407.64,
          "en": "and now we get these two pieces of information from our globally available variables and constants,",
          "zh": "而現在我們從全域可用的變數和常數取得這兩份資訊，"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 407.64,
          "end": 409.1,
          "en": "we then derive that result,",
          "zh": "我們接著得出那個結果，"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 409.11,
          "end": 412.2,
          "en": "we return that result and of course that's another problem,",
          "zh": "我們回傳那個結果，而當然那是另一個問題，"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 412.23,
          "end": 416.32,
          "en": "we return the result but we don't really care about the return value here.",
          "zh": "我們回傳結果，但我們在這裡並不真的在乎回傳值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 416.37,
          "end": 420.55,
          "en": "We're telling the browser when the button is clicked, click the add function,",
          "zh": "我們告訴瀏覽器，當按鈕被點擊，呼叫 add 函式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 420.6,
          "end": 424.47,
          "en": "the browser however doesn't care about our result here,",
          "zh": "然而瀏覽器不在乎我們這裡的結果，"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 424.47,
          "end": 427.62,
          "en": "it just knows on a click, I execute this function,",
          "zh": "它只知道在點擊時，我執行這個函式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 427.68,
          "end": 430,
          "en": "I don't care whether you return something",
          "zh": "我不在乎你是否回傳某物"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 430.11,
          "end": 432.39,
          "en": "and if you do, what that would be.",
          "zh": "而如果你回傳，那會是什麼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 433.46,
          "end": 438.95,
          "en": "So we can actually change that too on that function and just make sure that we immediately change the",
          "zh": "所以我們實際上也可以在那個函式上改變那個，並只確保我們立刻改變"
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 438.95,
          "end": 440.55,
          "en": "current result",
          "zh": "目前結果"
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 440.6,
          "end": 446.87,
          "en": "and earlier, I mentioned that it's not the best idea for a function to kind of change something from",
          "zh": "而稍早，我提到函式有點改變某物不是最好的主意，從"
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 446.87,
          "end": 447.78,
          "en": "outside.",
          "zh": "外面。"
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 447.89,
          "end": 453.62,
          "en": "Well if it's a function like this which is very clear about that, which doesn't kind of mix some internal",
          "zh": "嗯，如果它是像這樣的函式，對那個非常清楚，它沒有有點混一些內部"
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 453.62,
          "end": 460.55,
          "en": "constant and some external global values but which clearly only works with global values and which we just",
          "zh": "常數和一些外部全域值，而是清楚地只和全域值工作，而我們只是"
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 460.55,
          "end": 464.07,
          "en": "use as event listener, that's kind of fine",
          "zh": "把它當事件監聽器使用，那還算可以"
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 464.09000000000003,
          "end": 466.37,
          "en": "and this might sound totally arbitrary",
          "zh": "而這也許聽起來完全任意"
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 466.37,
          "end": 470.15,
          "en": "right now, you'll get a feeling for this throughout the course, promised.",
          "zh": "現在，你會在整門課對這個有感覺，保證。"
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 470.15,
          "end": 475.25,
          "en": "This is something which gets clearer the more you work with Javascript, you in the end just want to write clear",
          "zh": "這是你和 JavaScript 工作越多就越清楚的事，你最後只想寫清楚的"
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 475.25,
          "end": 482.36,
          "en": "functions which might work with global constants and variables but which then shouldn't mix it too much",
          "zh": "函式，它們也許和全域常數與變數工作，但那時不應該把它混得太多"
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 482.36,
          "end": 490.1,
          "en": "with internally managed data and then some return value even though they're also manipulating some global",
          "zh": "和內部管理的資料，然後某個回傳值，即使它們也在操縱某個全域"
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 490.1,
          "end": 492.59,
          "en": "value. As a general rule of thumb,",
          "zh": "值。作為一般經驗法則，"
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 492.65,
          "end": 498.83,
          "en": "you can have a function that manipulates some global variable but then this function maybe also shouldn't",
          "zh": "你可以有一個函式操縱某個全域變數，但那時這個函式也許也不應該"
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 498.83,
          "end": 505.13,
          "en": "return something because if a function returns something, it kind of signals hey I do something and I",
          "zh": "回傳某物，因為如果函式回傳某物，它有點示意嘿我做某件事，而我"
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 505.13,
          "end": 508.09,
          "en": "give you the result of that, I don't do anything else than that.",
          "zh": "給你那個的結果，我除此之外不做任何事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 508.13,
          "end": 511.12,
          "en": "If that function then starts changing something else too,",
          "zh": "如果那個函式接著也開始改變其他某物，"
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 511.22,
          "end": 512.87,
          "en": "that's the confusing part.",
          "zh": "那是令人困惑的部分。"
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 512.87,
          "end": 517.64,
          "en": "If you have a function without a return statement as we have it here, this function doesn't give us the",
          "zh": "如果你有一個沒有 return 陳述的函式，如我們這裡有的，這個函式沒有給我們"
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 517.64,
          "end": 520.61,
          "en": "illusion that it would return its result,",
          "zh": "它會回傳它的結果的錯覺，"
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 520.64,
          "end": 526.82,
          "en": "it probably instead starts editing the global variables right away which it does and then this is clear",
          "zh": "它大概相反立刻開始編輯全域變數，它確實那樣做，然後這對"
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 526.82,
          "end": 530.03,
          "en": "to us as a developer if we read that code as well,",
          "zh": "我們身為開發者是清楚的，如果我們也讀那段程式碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 530.03,
          "end": 536.55,
          "en": "so this now again make sense. Now that was a lot of talking but we now should have a setup where",
          "zh": "所以這現在再次說得通。現在那是很多談論，但我們現在應該有一個設定，"
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 536.55,
          "end": 541.62,
          "en": "we actually are able to change the current result when that button is pressed.",
          "zh": "我們實際上能在那個按鈕被按下時改變目前結果。"
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 541.8,
          "end": 551.21,
          "en": "So if we now save that and we reload here and I enter a five and I click plus, ha nothing changes,",
          "zh": "所以如果我們現在存檔那個並在這裡重新載入，而我輸入五並點加號，哈，什麼都沒變，"
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 551.24,
          "end": 556.38,
          "en": "now why is that? Well we're almost there",
          "zh": "現在為什麼那樣？嗯，我們幾乎到了"
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 556.73,
          "end": 563.06,
          "en": "but keep in mind that we're calling output result here at the end of our script. Now as I mentioned before,",
          "zh": "但記住我們在腳本結尾這裡呼叫 outputResult。現在如我之前提到的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 563.33,
          "end": 566.86,
          "en": "the script runs from top to bottom right,",
          "zh": "腳本從上到下執行，對吧，"
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 566.87,
          "end": 572.5,
          "en": "so that of course means that after that, it's done and it doesn't run again.",
          "zh": "所以那當然意味在那之後，它完成了，而它不會再執行。"
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 572.51,
          "end": 577.54,
          "en": "The only thing that runs again is this function whenever we press that button because we, when the script",
          "zh": "唯一再次執行的是這個函式，每當我們按那個按鈕，因為我們在腳本"
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 577.66,
          "end": 583.31,
          "en": "executed, told the browser to be aware of that click listener and it then registers the click listener",
          "zh": "執行時，告訴瀏覽器要注意那個點擊監聽器，然後它註冊點擊監聽器"
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 583.64,
          "end": 589.07,
          "en": "and it will, even after the script completed, then always execute this function because it stored that",
          "zh": "而它會，即使在腳本完成之後，然後永遠執行這個函式，因為它把那個存在"
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 589.07,
          "end": 593.79,
          "en": "in memory and all the surrounding data it needs whenever the button is clicked.",
          "zh": "記憶體，以及它在按鈕被點擊時需要的所有周圍資料。"
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 593.9,
          "end": 597.55,
          "en": "Output result however is not executed when the button is clicked",
          "zh": "然而 outputResult 不是在按鈕被點擊時被執行"
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 597.56,
          "end": 599.69,
          "en": "but when the script first executes.",
          "zh": "而是在腳本第一次執行時。"
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 599.69,
          "end": 608.23,
          "en": "So what we do here is we try to write to our page but we don't do that whenever the button is clicked",
          "zh": "所以我們在這裡做的是我們試著寫到我們的頁面，但我們不是每當按鈕被點擊時做那個"
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 608.24,
          "end": 612.17,
          "en": "and therefore when our current result changes but only when the script initially runs.",
          "zh": "因此當我們的目前結果改變時，而只在腳本最初執行時。"
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 612.8,
          "end": 618.74,
          "en": "So the solution is to grab that piece of code and also add it into the add function so that now here,",
          "zh": "所以解法是抓住那段程式碼，也把它加進 add 函式，好讓現在這裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 619.04,
          "end": 621.5,
          "en": "we output our result",
          "zh": "我們輸出我們的結果"
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 621.5,
          "end": 627.14,
          "en": "and now we can also soon start adding a calculation description again,",
          "zh": "而現在我們也可以很快再開始加計算描述，"
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 627.14,
          "end": 629.39,
          "en": "for now I'll just replace it with an empty string",
          "zh": "現在我會只把它換成空字串"
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 629.39,
          "end": 635.06,
          "en": "but the more important thing is that now it uses this current result here and it now outputs that into",
          "zh": "但更重要的是現在它使用這裡這個目前結果，而它現在把那個輸出到"
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 635.06,
          "end": 635.83,
          "en": "our webpage",
          "zh": "我們的網頁"
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 635.94,
          "end": 638.18,
          "en": "whenever the add function runs.",
          "zh": "每當 add 函式執行。"
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 638.39,
          "end": 647.75,
          "en": "So if we now save this and I reload and I enter five and then I press plus, you see result 05,",
          "zh": "所以如果我們現在存檔這個，而我重新載入，我輸入五然後按加號，你看到結果 05，"
        },
        {
          "id": 136,
          "start": 647.75,
          "end": 651.14,
          "en": "let's add a 10 here, this gets stranger and stranger,",
          "zh": "讓我們在這裡加一個 10，這變得越來越奇怪，"
        },
        {
          "id": 137,
          "start": 651.14,
          "end": 653.89,
          "en": "this is clearly not a valid calculator.",
          "zh": "這顯然不是有效的計算機。"
        },
        {
          "id": 138,
          "start": 654.08,
          "end": 657.65,
          "en": "So the good thing is, receiving the output here",
          "zh": "所以好事是，在這裡收到輸出"
        },
        {
          "id": 139,
          "start": 657.65,
          "end": 664.55,
          "en": "so generally our setup with the functions on seems to work but we're clearly not doing some mathematically",
          "zh": "所以一般來說我們用函式的設定似乎能運作，但我們顯然沒有在做一些數學上正確的"
        },
        {
          "id": 140,
          "start": 664.55,
          "end": 666.56,
          "en": "correct calculations here.",
          "zh": "這裡的計算。"
        },
        {
          "id": 141,
          "start": 666.56,
          "end": 667.57,
          "en": "So what's the problem?",
          "zh": "所以問題是什麼？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "15853246",
      "title": "Converting Data Types",
      "lectureOrder": 36,
      "videoOrder": 29,
      "sourceHash": "95d1fe845ff312857d644b2eabfd2308ebcf98858dfad68a7a1f8674f4f7682f",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.67,
          "end": 7.06,
          "en": "The problem is the type of the value we're using here.",
          "zh": "問題是我們在這裡使用的值的型別。"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 7.07,
          "end": 9.54,
          "en": "Current result in the end is a number right,",
          "zh": "目前結果最後是數字，對吧，"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 9.54,
          "end": 11.85,
          "en": "we start with zero here.",
          "zh": "我們在這裡從零開始。"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 11.85,
          "end": 16.47,
          "en": "Now what we add to current result here however and that's something you've just got to know which is why",
          "zh": "現在我們在這裡加到目前結果的，然而，而那是你必須知道的事，這就是為什麼"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 16.47,
          "end": 20.9,
          "en": "I tell you, is a string because I'm getting this from this user input",
          "zh": "我告訴你，是字串，因為我從這個使用者輸入取得這個"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 20.94,
          "end": 27.22,
          "en": "and even though I entered a number here and even though this user input actually even is of type number",
          "zh": "而即使我在這裡輸入了數字，即使這個使用者輸入實際上甚至是 number 型別"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 27.24,
          "end": 35.49,
          "en": "here in the HTML code, whatever you get from a user, from a HTML input in your Javascript code will",
          "zh": "在這裡的 HTML 程式碼裡，你從使用者、從 HTML 輸入在你的 JavaScript 程式碼裡得到的任何東西，會"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 35.61,
          "end": 40.96,
          "en": "always be a string, just something you can memorize. An input element,",
          "zh": "永遠是字串，只是你可以記住的事。一個 input 元素，"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 41.01,
          "end": 43.95,
          "en": "if you read its value, will give you a string,",
          "zh": "如果你讀它的值，會給你一個字串，"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 43.95,
          "end": 46.38,
          "en": "that's how Javascript in the browser works.",
          "zh": "那是瀏覽器裡的 JavaScript 如何運作。"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 46.5,
          "end": 53.21,
          "en": "It doesn't try to be smart and check whether that should be a number or not, it doesn't make any assumptions,",
          "zh": "它不試著變聰明並檢查那是否應該是數字，它不做任何假設，"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 53.25,
          "end": 60.58,
          "en": "It just gives you a string, text and therefore what happens here is that we have a number and we have",
          "zh": "它只給你一個字串、文字，因此這裡發生的是我們有一個數字，而我們有"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 60.58,
          "end": 64.18,
          "en": "some text and now Javascript is in",
          "zh": "一些文字，而現在 JavaScript 處於"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 64.59,
          "end": 71.23,
          "en": "it has a problem because we're trying to combine a string and a number and how would it do that?",
          "zh": "它有問題，因為我們試著組合字串和數字，而它會怎麼做？"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 71.23,
          "end": 76.24,
          "en": "Well we saw how it does that earlier when we built this calculation description. There,",
          "zh": "嗯，我們稍早看到它怎麼做，當我們建立這個計算描述。那裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 76.27,
          "end": 84.52,
          "en": "we also combined text with a number because the default result we use there was just a number and",
          "zh": "我們也把文字和數字組合，因為我們在那裡使用的預設結果只是數字，而"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 84.52,
          "end": 88.4,
          "en": "Javascript concatenated that to one long string",
          "zh": "JavaScript 把那個串接成一個長字串"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 88.4,
          "end": 89.5,
          "en": "and it's the same here.",
          "zh": "而這裡也一樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 89.5,
          "end": 94.72,
          "en": "It got a number and the string, instead of converting both to a number and doing a calculation,",
          "zh": "它得到一個數字和字串，而不是把兩者都轉成數字並做計算，"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 94.72,
          "end": 100.33,
          "en": "it does the safer thing because it doesn't know where what you entered here as a string could be treated",
          "zh": "它做較安全的事，因為它不知道你在這裡輸入的字串哪裡可以被當成"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 100.33,
          "end": 101.72,
          "en": "as a number or not",
          "zh": "數字或不"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 101.95,
          "end": 107.41,
          "en": "and it therefore simply converts it to a string and concatenates it to a string and that's what we see",
          "zh": "因此它單純把它轉成字串，並把它串接成字串，而那是我們看到的"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 107.41,
          "end": 108.14,
          "en": "here.",
          "zh": "在這裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 108.16,
          "end": 110.4,
          "en": "We started with an initial value of zero,",
          "zh": "我們從初始值零開始，"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 110.47,
          "end": 112.03999999999999,
          "en": "it concatenated 5,",
          "zh": "它串接了 5，"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 112.15,
          "end": 115,
          "en": "then we had 05, it added 10,",
          "zh": "然後我們有 05，它加了 10，"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 115,
          "end": 117.64,
          "en": "so this is now that one long string which we got",
          "zh": "所以這現在是我們得到的那個長字串"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 117.97,
          "end": 123.52,
          "en": "and again it does so because it doesn't know whether what you entered here can be used as a number or",
          "zh": "而再次它那樣做，因為它不知道你在這裡輸入的是否可以被當成數字使用，或"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 123.52,
          "end": 127.78,
          "en": "whether it just is some character which it can't use as a number,",
          "zh": "它是否只是某個它不能當成數字使用的字元，"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 127.8,
          "end": 131.02,
          "en": "therefore the default is that it builds a string here.",
          "zh": "因此預設是它在這裡建立字串。"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 131.02,
          "end": 136.51,
          "en": "Now of course we want to build a number here however and we know that whatever the user enters here",
          "zh": "現在當然我們想在這裡建立數字，而我們知道使用者在這裡輸入的任何東西"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 136.69,
          "end": 141.46,
          "en": "should be a number so that it can be used in mathematical equations.",
          "zh": "應該是數字，好讓它可以用在數學算式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 141.46,
          "end": 146.35,
          "en": "Now how can we convert this value to a number then to tell Javascript that we have a number and a",
          "zh": "現在我們如何把這個值轉成數字，以告訴 JavaScript 我們有一個數字和一個"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 146.35,
          "end": 153.82999999999998,
          "en": "number and it should therefore do a mathematical calculation instead of string concatenation? To convert this",
          "zh": "數字，因此它應該做數學計算，而不是字串串接？要把這個轉換"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 153.88,
          "end": 154.81,
          "en": "to a number,",
          "zh": "成數字，"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 154.81,
          "end": 161.35,
          "en": "you have a function built into the browser or built into Javascript, a bit like the alert function you",
          "zh": "你有一個內建在瀏覽器或內建在 JavaScript 的函式，有點像你"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 161.35,
          "end": 166.07,
          "en": "used earlier which is called parseInt.",
          "zh": "稍早使用的 alert 函式，它叫做 parseInt。"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 166.45,
          "end": 174.37,
          "en": "You also have parseFloat, the difference is that parseInt will try to parse some text, so a string, as",
          "zh": "你也有 parseFloat，差別是 parseInt 會試著解析一些文字，所以一個字串，當成"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 174.84,
          "end": 181.7,
          "en": "number without decimal places and parseFloat will do the same with decimal places.",
          "zh": "沒有小數位的數字，而 parseFloat 會對有小數位的做同樣的事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 181.72,
          "end": 184.38,
          "en": "So with parseFloat if you entered 10 here,",
          "zh": "所以用 parseFloat，如果你在這裡輸入 10，"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 184.39,
          "end": 191.53,
          "en": "this will be parsed as 10.0, with parseInt if you entered 10.1 here which actually this input",
          "zh": "這會被解析成 10.0，用 parseInt，如果你在這裡輸入 10.1，實際上這個輸入"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 191.53,
          "end": 192.16,
          "en": "doesn't allow",
          "zh": "不允許"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 192.19,
          "end": 200.44,
          "en": "but if you would do that, it would give you 10. So parseInt and parseFloat are functions built into Javascript",
          "zh": "但如果你會那樣做，它會給你 10。所以 parseInt 和 parseFloat 是內建在 JavaScript 的函式"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 200.82999999999998,
          "end": 208.6,
          "en": "that will in the end take a string as an input, take a string as a parameter you pass in and will then",
          "zh": "它們最後會拿字串當輸入，拿你傳入的字串當參數，然後會"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 208.87,
          "end": 212.8,
          "en": "convert this text into a number.",
          "zh": "把這段文字轉成數字。"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 212.8,
          "end": 219.37,
          "en": "Now of course that can fail, if you had some text here like hi which again I can't enter here because",
          "zh": "現在當然那可以失敗，如果你在這裡有一些文字像 hi，我再次不能在這裡輸入，因為"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 219.37,
          "end": 225.85,
          "en": "this is configured to take a number but if you would have hi here, parseInt would actually of course",
          "zh": "這被設定成接受數字，但如果你在這裡會有 hi，parseInt 實際上當然"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 225.85,
          "end": 228.4,
          "en": "not be able to convert this to a number,",
          "zh": "不能把這個轉成數字，"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 228.4,
          "end": 232.32999999999998,
          "en": "instead it would convert it to a special value which I'll show you later.",
          "zh": "相反它會把它轉成一個特殊值，我稍後會展示給你。"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 232.32999999999998,
          "end": 236.32,
          "en": "For now, we know we get valid numbers and therefore we'll be able to parse it,",
          "zh": "現在，我們知道我們得到有效數字，因此我們會能夠解析它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 236.32,
          "end": 241.94,
          "en": "I also only work with non-decimal numbers here, so only with integers as it's called,",
          "zh": "我也只在這裡和非小數數字工作，所以只和所謂的整數，"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 241.96,
          "end": 250.49,
          "en": "so numbers without decimal places and therefore parseInt will work. So now if I save this, we're doing a",
          "zh": "所以沒有小數位的數字，因此 parseInt 會運作。所以現在如果我存檔這個，我們在做"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 250.49,
          "end": 256.28,
          "en": "calculation here with a number and a number and hence if we reload and I enter 10 here and I then click",
          "zh": "這裡用數字和數字的計算，因此如果我們重新載入，而我在這裡輸入 10，然後我點"
