        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 256.28,
          "end": 260.9,
          "en": "plus, we see 10 here and this is now not 010,",
          "zh": "加號，我們在這裡看到 10，而這現在不是 010，"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 260.9,
          "end": 267.83,
          "en": "so not some concatenated string, instead if I enter a 5 and I click plus again, I see 15,",
          "zh": "所以不是某個被串接的字串，相反如果我輸入 5 並再次點加號，我看到 15，"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 267.89,
          "end": 277.01,
          "en": "so this is now a real number. Now instead of parseInt, you can also use a plus here by the way, even without",
          "zh": "所以這現在是真正的數字。現在除了 parseInt，你也可以在這裡用加號，順帶一提，甚至沒有"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 277.07,
          "end": 278,
          "en": "parentheses.",
          "zh": "小括號。"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 278,
          "end": 279.14,
          "en": "So we have a plus here,",
          "zh": "所以我們在這裡有一個加號，"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 279.14,
          "end": 284.72,
          "en": "that's the operator, another plus in front of the string will then also convert the string to a",
          "zh": "那是運算子，字串前面另一個加號接著也會把字串轉成"
