        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 346.69,
          "end": 351.78,
          "en": "because as you saw earlier, the default of Javascript was to concatenate two strings,",
          "zh": "因為如你稍早看到的，JavaScript 的預設是串接兩個字串，"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 351.92,
          "end": 357.64,
          "en": "so we had that default behavior of treating this here or using this number here in a string",
          "zh": "所以我們有那個預設行為，把這裡這個、或在字串裡使用這裡這個數字"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 357.65,
          "end": 364.23,
          "en": "anyways. So with that out of the way, we're doing that conversion correctly and the add function is working",
          "zh": "反正。所以有了那個處理完，我們正確地做那個轉換，而 add 函式因此"
