        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 137.57,
          "end": 140.42000000000002,
          "en": "is, we have a bit of code repetition.",
          "zh": "是，我們有一點程式碼重複。"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 140.42000000000002,
          "end": 147.92000000000002,
          "en": "Now in general, as a programmer, you want to avoid code repetition as good as you can, as much as you can",
          "zh": "現在一般來說，身為程式設計師，你想盡你所能、盡你所能避免程式碼重複"
