        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 148.49,
          "end": 155.24,
          "en": "because if you repeat code, you write too much and that takes time and you want to save time",
          "zh": "因為如果你重複程式碼，你寫太多，而那花時間，而你想省時間"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 155.24,
          "end": 161.15,
          "en": "and in addition, if you ever need to change something about that piece of code, about that logic you wrote",
          "zh": "此外，如果你曾經需要改變那段程式碼的某件事、你在"
