          "id": 30,
          "start": 161.15,
          "end": 168.88,
          "en": "there, chances are that you need to change it in a couple of different places. So therefore, you want to",
          "zh": "那裡寫的那個邏輯，很可能你需要在幾個不同地方改變它。所以因此，你想"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 168.98,
          "end": 173.95,
          "en": "avoid repeating yourselves, so that whenever you need to change that piece of code you wrote, you'll",
          "zh": "避免重複自己，好讓每當你需要改變你寫的那段程式碼，你會"
