          "start": 173.96,
          "end": 178.84,
          "en": "only need to change it in one place, instead of 10 places or something like that.",
          "zh": "只需要在一個地方改變它，而不是 10 個地方或類似那樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 178.85,
          "end": 182.26,
          "en": "So here for example, extracting that user input value,",
          "zh": "所以這裡例如，抽出那個使用者輸入值，"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 182.36,
          "end": 187.41,
          "en": "let's say we renamed this user input constant here to usr input,",
          "zh": "假設我們把這裡這個 userInput 常數重新命名成 usrInput，"
