        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 188.03,
          "end": 193.21,
          "en": "well then I have to change it in two places, usr input, usr input.",
          "zh": "嗯，那麼我必須在兩個地方改變它，usrInput、usrInput。"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 193.37,
          "end": 199.16,
          "en": "Of course that's not too bad but imagine that this would be a longer script, would be very annoying.",
          "zh": "當然那還不算太糟，但想像這會是更長的腳本，會非常煩人。"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 199.16,
          "end": 206.3,
          "en": "So it's better to then create a new constant, since I never plan on reassigning a value, which I could",
          "zh": "所以那時建立一個新常數比較好，因為我從不打算重新指派值，我可以"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 206.3,
          "end": 215.09,
          "en": "name user number or better maybe, entered number and that could be this code snippet here.",
          "zh": "把它命名為 userNumber，或也許更好，enteredNumber，而那可以是這裡這個程式碼片段。"
