          "id": 39,
          "start": 215.09,
          "end": 223.94,
          "en": "So where I get the user input and parse it as an integer and now we can use entered number here because",
          "zh": "所以我在那裡取得使用者輸入並把它解析成整數，而現在我們可以在這裡使用 enteredNumber，因為"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 223.94,
          "end": 230.68,
          "en": "that string interpolation or embedding syntax here doesn't care whether that's a string or a number,",
          "zh": "那個字串插值或這裡的嵌入語法不在乎那是字串還是數字，"
