          "start": 240.47,
          "end": 243.8,
          "en": "only need to change it here and not in these two places.",
          "zh": "只需要在這裡改變它，而不是在這兩個地方。"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 243.8,
          "end": 249.83,
          "en": "So even though I added a new line of code now, we actually did something good because we're now more",
          "zh": "所以即使我現在加了一行新程式碼，我們實際上做了好事，因為我們現在更"
