        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 249.83,
          "end": 252.99,
          "en": "flexible and we don't repeat ourselves.",
          "zh": "有彈性，而我們不重複自己。"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 253.01,
          "end": 257.84,
          "en": "Well of course, we repeat that name of the constant but that's something we can't change,",
