          "start": 266.63,
          "end": 270.48,
          "en": "you would therefore even save more repetition.",
          "zh": "你因此甚至會省下更多重複。"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 270.5,
          "end": 277.6,
          "en": "You could also take it one step further and add a brand new function, get user input for example.",
          "zh": "你也可以再進一步，並加一個全新的函式，例如 getUserInput。"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 277.7,
          "end": 281.6,
          "en": "Again I name this function like this because I want to describe what the function does",
          "zh": "再次我像這樣命名這個函式，因為我想描述函式做什麼"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 281.6,
          "end": 289.01,
          "en": "and this is a function which should actually give me the user input as a number, so we could also name",
          "zh": "而這是一個實際上應該給我使用者輸入當數字的函式，所以我們也可以把它命名為"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 289.01,
          "end": 294.53,
          "en": "it get user input number or get user number input",
          "zh": "getUserInputNumber 或 getUserNumberInput"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 294.53,
          "end": 301.07,
          "en": "if you want to be very clear but in the end, you want to give a clear idea of what this function does. Well",
          "zh": "如果你想非常清楚，但最後，你想給一個清楚的想法，這個函式做什麼。嗯"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 301.07,
          "end": 309.86,
          "en": "and in there, I want to return this logic here where I get that user input and parse it as an integer",
          "zh": "而在那裡面，我想回傳這裡這個邏輯，我在那裡取得那個使用者輸入並把它解析成整數"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 310.35,
          "end": 315.68,
          "en": "so that here I can just call get user number input as a function.",
          "zh": "好讓這裡我可以只呼叫 getUserNumberInput 當函式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 315.68,
          "end": 321.47,
          "en": "So here I now call that manually instead of adding it to an event listener because whenever this function",
          "zh": "所以這裡我現在手動呼叫那個，而不是把它加到事件監聽器，因為每當這個函式"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 321.47,
          "end": 327.04,
          "en": "runs, I want to run this function as well which I now use to outsource this logic,",
          "zh": "執行，我也想執行這個函式，我現在用它把這個邏輯外包出去，"
        },
        {
