    {
      "id": "15853252",
      "title": "Connecting all Buttons to Functions",
      "lectureOrder": 39,
      "videoOrder": 31,
      "sourceHash": "6817cde4cbcd837d084ad92171e0028140135785e6055725c4e654df2beea982",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.31,
          "end": 8.04,
          "en": "So let's make sure we can also press the other buttons and for that, the thing we can do is we can add",
          "zh": "所以讓我們確定我們也能按下其他按鈕，而為此，我們能做的是我們可以加"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 8.04,
          "end": 12.87,
          "en": "more functions. We can add another function which could be called subtract because that's what it",
          "zh": "更多函式。我們可以加另一個函式，可以叫 subtract，因為那是它"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 12.87,
          "end": 14.1,
          "en": "should do.",
          "zh": "該做的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 14.1,
          "end": 16.23,
          "en": "We can add another function which should in the end",
          "zh": "我們可以加另一個函式，它最後應該"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 16.29,
          "end": 25.8,
          "en": "multiply values and a fourth function for this which is called divide which does just that.",
          "zh": "把值相乘，以及第四個函式，叫 divide，它就做那個。"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 25.83,
          "end": 28.64,
          "en": "Now we have all these functions which of course are empty right now,",
          "zh": "現在我們有所有這些函式，它們現在當然是空的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 28.65,
          "end": 31.82,
          "en": "there is nothing in the function body but they are defined",
          "zh": "函式本體裡什麼都沒有，但它們已定義，"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 31.89,
          "end": 33.99,
          "en": "and now let's add logic.",
          "zh": "而現在讓我們加邏輯。"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 33.99,
          "end": 37,
          "en": "Now the logic is generally the same as in the add function,",
          "zh": "現在邏輯大致和 add 函式裡一樣，"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 37.02,
          "end": 39.08,
          "en": "so I'll copy that and adjust it.",
          "zh": "所以我會複製那個並調整它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 39.18,
          "end": 45.9,
          "en": "I want to get the entered number and here by the way, I can reuse that constant name because as you learned,",
          "zh": "我想取得輸入的數字，而這裡順便說，我可以重複使用那個常數名稱，因為如你學過的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 46.32,
          "end": 53.82,
          "en": "this constant or any variable or constant which you define inside of a function belongs to this single",
          "zh": "這個常數，或你在函式裡面定義的任何變數或常數，屬於這一個"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 53.82,
          "end": 58.83,
          "en": "function and therefore you can use the same name in another function because these two are totally",
          "zh": "函式，因此你可以在另一個函式裡使用同一個名稱，因為這兩個完全"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 58.83,
          "end": 60.33,
          "en": "detached from each other.",
          "zh": "彼此分離。"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 60.42,
          "end": 65.11,
          "en": "This name is now not reused because it's not available outside of the function anyways,",
          "zh": "這個名稱現在沒有被重複使用，因為它反正在函式外面不可用，"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 65.22,
          "end": 72.03999999999999,
          "en": "hence we can use it in multiple functions. So here, I'm also getting the user input, then here my description",
          "zh": "因此我們可以在多個函式裡使用它。所以這裡，我也在取得使用者輸入，然後這裡我的描述"
