        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 73.03,
          "end": 74.67,
          "en": "I want to have a minus here",
          "zh": "我想在這裡有一個減號，"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 75.01,
          "end": 77.38,
          "en": "and the calculation also is different,",
          "zh": "而計算也不同，"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 77.38,
          "end": 84.36,
          "en": "I want to have my current result which is calculated with a minus instead of a plus.",
          "zh": "我想要我的目前結果，它用減號計算，而不是加號。"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 84.37,
          "end": 90.2,
          "en": "Now you see, there's still some code repetition we have here, still some code we need to copy,",
          "zh": "現在你看到，我們這裡仍然有一些程式碼重複，仍然有一些程式碼我們需要複製，"
