        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 90.46000000000001,
          "end": 95.14,
          "en": "there are some piece of code we we can't avoid copying or we can't avoid reusing, like here getting",
          "zh": "有一些程式碼我們無法避免複製，或我們無法避免重複使用，像這裡取得"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 95.14,
          "end": 96.7,
          "en": "access to the number input.",
          "zh": "對數字輸入的存取。"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 96.7,
          "end": 99.64,
          "en": "We don't necessarily need to store this in a brand new constant,",
          "zh": "我們不一定需要把這個存在一個全新的常數裡，"
