        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 99.64,
          "end": 103.74000000000001,
          "en": "we could use it directly in the places where we need that entered number like here",
          "zh": "我們可以在需要那個輸入數字的地方直接使用它，像這裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 104.28999999999999,
          "end": 108.43,
          "en": "but I'll find it a bit easier to read if we store it in a new content",
          "zh": "但我會覺得如果我們把它存在一個新常數裡，讀起來容易一點，"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 108.46000000000001,
          "end": 116.68,
          "en": "but for generating this log text and outputting this, this is actually something we can put into a function",
          "zh": "但對於產生這個紀錄文字並輸出這個，這實際上是我們可以放進一個函式的東西，"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 116.68,
          "end": 120.13,
          "en": "to share and reuse the code instead of copying it.",
          "zh": "來分享並重複使用程式碼，而不是複製它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 120.37,
          "end": 122.29,
          "en": "So I can add a new function up here",
          "zh": "所以我可以在上面這裡加一個新函式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 122.32,
          "end": 128.15,
          "en": "and again it's just my pattern that I like to use, that I define functions before I use them.",
          "zh": "而再次，這只是我喜歡用的模式，我在使用函式之前定義它們。"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 128.38,
          "end": 131.43,
          "en": "So if I use a function down there, I define it above",
          "zh": "所以如果我在下面那裡使用一個函式，我在上面定義它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 131.44,
          "end": 133.07,
          "en": "but that's up to you,",
          "zh": "但那由你決定，"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 133.12,
          "end": 135.91,
          "en": "the order does not matter as you learned.",
          "zh": "順序不重要，如你學過的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 136.06,
          "end": 143.89,
          "en": "So here I'll add a new function, name it createAndWriteLog or something like this which should write",
          "zh": "所以這裡我會加一個新函式，把它命名為 createAndWriteLog 或類似這樣，它應該寫出"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 143.91,
          "end": 148.1,
          "en": "that output or therefore create the write output maybe",
          "zh": "那個輸出，或因此也許建立並寫出輸出，"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 148.19,
          "end": 152.49,
          "en": "and now this function will need three operators to work the way I wanted to work.",
          "zh": "而現在這個函式需要三個參數，才能以我想要的方式運作。"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 152.56,
          "end": 156.13,
          "en": "I'm interested in the operator that was used in that function",
          "zh": "我有興趣的是那個函式裡使用的運算子，"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 156.13,
          "end": 160.6,
          "en": "and you can name this however you want, this should be some text which contains the plus, minus or so",
          "zh": "而你可以隨你高興命名這個，這應該是一些文字，包含加號、減號或諸如此"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 160.6,
          "end": 161.2,
          "en": "on,",
          "zh": "類，"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 161.2,
          "end": 167.26,
          "en": "not the real operator which we could use because you can't pass an operator as an argument but we can",
          "zh": "不是真正的運算子，我們不能用那個，因為你不能把運算子當引數傳入，但我們可以"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 167.26,
          "end": 177.24,
          "en": "parse a text which contains the operator so that we can output it. Then I need to result before calculation",
          "zh": "傳入包含運算子的文字，這樣我們可以輸出它。然後我需要計算前的結果，"
