        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 177.75,
          "end": 184.08,
          "en": "and the calculation number let's say, so the number which was used in the calculation. And then I can",
          "zh": "以及計算用的數字，讓我們說，所以計算裡使用的那個數字。然後我可以"
