          "start": 196.25,
          "end": 201.88,
          "en": "before calculation and the calc number, these are the three pieces which I combined together into",
          "zh": "計算前結果和 calcNumber，這是我組合在一起的三塊，成為"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 201.88,
          "end": 203.1,
          "en": "one text.",
          "zh": "一段文字。"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 203.2,
          "end": 204.57999999999998,
          "en": "So that's text here,",
          "zh": "所以這裡是文字，"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 204.57999999999998,
          "end": 208.59,
          "en": "it's not a mathematical equation which is executed by Javascript,",
          "zh": "它不是由 JavaScript 執行的數學方程式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 208.69,
          "end": 212.17000000000002,
          "en": "it's just some output text which I'm generating here",
          "zh": "它只是我在這裡產生的一些輸出文字，"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 212.59,
          "end": 216.74,
          "en": "and thereafter, I'll call output result here,",
          "zh": "然後之後，我會在這裡呼叫 outputResult，"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 216.85,
          "end": 223.69,
          "en": "I can refer to the current result because that's a global variable which gets changed and my calc description,",
          "zh": "我可以參考目前結果，因為那是一個會被改變的全域變數，而我的 calcDescription，"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 223.72,
          "end": 233.57,
          "en": "well that's this constant and now the idea is that here, I can actually run, create and write output,",
          "zh": "嗯，那是這個常數，而現在的想法是，這裡我實際上可以跑 createAndWriteLog，"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 233.57,
          "end": 239.93,
          "en": "the operator here was a plus and I need that to build that string correctly which describes the operation",
          "zh": "這裡的運算子是加號，而我需要那個來正確建立描述這個運算的字串，"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 239.93,
          "end": 243.37,
          "en": "which was performed. The result before calc",
          "zh": "那個被執行的運算。計算前的結果"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 243.41,
          "end": 248.37,
          "en": "which is my second parameter that is expected and the order does matter of course,",
          "zh": "是我預期的第二個參數，而順序當然重要，"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 248.39,
          "end": 254.49,
          "en": "so my second parameter here is the result before we ran this calculation,",
          "zh": "所以我這裡的第二個參數是我們跑這個計算之前的結果，"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 254.51,
          "end": 263.29,
          "en": "so here that's current result before we ran it. To store this, I can add a new constant, initial result",
          "zh": "所以這裡那是我們跑它之前的目前結果。要儲存這個，我可以加一個新常數，也許叫 initialResult，"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 263.32,
          "end": 266.78,
          "en": "maybe which is current result before we change it.",
          "zh": "它是我們改變它之前的目前結果。"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 266.86,
          "end": 270.37,
          "en": "Now since we copy that value, initial result won't change",
          "zh": "現在因為我們複製那個值，initialResult 不會改變，"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 270.43,
          "end": 273.96,
          "en": "if we then run this line, that's what I also explained earlier,",
          "zh": "如果我們接著跑這一行，那也是我稍早解釋過的，"
