        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 273.97,
          "end": 281.21,
          "en": "so now we can pass initial result here and the calc number of course is the entered number here.",
          "zh": "所以現在我們可以在這裡傳入 initialResult，而 calcNumber 當然是這裡輸入的數字。"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 281.26,
          "end": 287.34000000000003,
          "en": "So now we can use that, also down there and get rid of that line with output result and where we build",
          "zh": "所以現在我們可以使用那個，也在下面那裡，並去掉那行 outputResult，以及我們建立"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 287.39,
          "end": 291.19,
          "en": "the calc description and here instead, just forward that minus",
          "zh": "calcDescription 的地方，而這裡改為只轉送那個減號，"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 291.22,
          "end": 298.21,
          "en": "and yes we need to copy that initial result code. So still some copied code but the logic of building",
          "zh": "而對，我們需要複製那段 initialResult 程式碼。所以仍然有一些複製的程式碼，但建立"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 298.21,
          "end": 305.86,
          "en": "that string and of outputting it in our webpage, that is outsourced into a new function and all that",
          "zh": "那個字串並在我們網頁裡輸出它的邏輯，被外包到一個新函式，而所有那個"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 306.04,
          "end": 312.31,
          "en": "refactoring, as this process is called, where we move code around and try to write it in a more elegant",
          "zh": "重構，這個過程的名稱，我們把程式碼搬來搬去，並試著以更優雅的"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 312.31,
          "end": 314.95,
          "en": "way, is totally optional,",
          "zh": "方式寫它，完全是選擇性的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 314.95,
          "end": 321.49,
          "en": "I just want to get you used to it because it is something you will need in your life, in your day as",
          "zh": "我只是想讓你習慣它，因為這是你生活裡、你身為"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 321.49,
          "end": 323.37,
          "en": "a programmer, as a developer,",
          "zh": "程式設計師、身為開發者的一天會需要的東西，"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 323.38,
          "end": 328.6,
          "en": "you want to write elegant code where you don't repeat yourself and where you then try to split your",
          "zh": "你想寫優雅的程式碼，你不重複自己，然後你試著拆開你的"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 328.6,
          "end": 329.25,
          "en": "logic.",
          "zh": "邏輯。"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 329.41,
          "end": 335.08,
          "en": "There rarely is a single right or wrong way of doing it but getting started with it and thinking about",
          "zh": "很少有單一的對或錯做法，但開始做它並思考"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 335.08,
          "end": 337.40999999999997,
          "en": "it is always something you should do.",
          "zh": "它，永遠是你該做的事。"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 338.72,
          "end": 345.49,
          "en": "So now with that, let's actually copy that logic into multiply and there",
          "zh": "所以現在有了那個，讓我們實際上把那個邏輯複製進 multiply，而那裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 345.62,
          "end": 351.89,
          "en": "we need the star operator and here in the calculation of course also the asterisk here to multiply",
          "zh": "我們需要星號運算子，而這裡在計算裡當然也用星號來相乘"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 351.89,
          "end": 358.4,
          "en": "this and for dividing, here we need the slash which is the division operator and also output this here",
          "zh": "這個，而對於除法，這裡我們需要斜線，那是除法運算子，也在這裡輸出這個，"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 358.4,
          "end": 360.17,
          "en": "in our log",
          "zh": "在我們的紀錄裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 360.2,
          "end": 365.75,
          "en": "and now with that if we save all of that, we just need to register the event listeners for these buttons.",
          "zh": "而現在有了那個，如果我們存所有那些，我們只需要為這些按鈕註冊事件監聽器。"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 365.75,
          "end": 370.91,
          "en": "So just as we have an add button in the vendor file, we've got a subtract, multiply and divide button so",
          "zh": "所以就像我們在 vendor 檔案裡有一個 add 按鈕，我們有 subtract、multiply 和 divide 按鈕，所以"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 370.91,
          "end": 372.68,
          "en": "we can use these as well.",
          "zh": "我們也可以使用這些。"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 372.68,
          "end": 379.02,
          "en": "So here I'll add subtract button and then just copy this code here",
          "zh": "所以這裡我會加 subtract 按鈕，然後只複製這裡這段程式碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 379.02,
          "end": 385.74,
          "en": "but of course point at the subtract function here and then repeat that but of course now use the multiply",
          "zh": "但當然在這裡指向 subtract 函式，然後重複那個，但現在當然使用 multiply"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 385.77,
          "end": 387.53,
          "en": "and the divide button here,",
          "zh": "和 divide 按鈕，這裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 387.66,
          "end": 398.14,
          "en": "so multiply and divide button and point at multiply and add divide. Now with that if we save that and",
          "zh": "所以 multiply 和 divide 按鈕，並指向 multiply 和 divide。現在有了那個，如果我們存那個，而"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 398.14,
          "end": 403.12,
          "en": "we reload this page, if I add 5 with the plus, 0 plus 5,",
          "zh": "我們重新載入這個頁面，如果我用加號加 5，0 加 5，"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 403.21,
          "end": 408.19,
          "en": "now enter three and then click minus, five minus three and the calculator",
          "zh": "現在輸入 3，然後點減號，5 減 3，而計算機"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 408.19,
          "end": 412.9,
          "en": "now just works such that you need to enter the value and then press the button where you want to",
          "zh": "現在就這樣運作，你需要輸入值，然後按你想"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 412.9,
          "end": 414.88,
          "en": "use that value with the previous result,",
          "zh": "用那個值和先前結果一起使用的按鈕，"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 414.90999999999997,
          "end": 416.65,
          "en": "that's how this calculator works,",
          "zh": "那就是這個計算機運作的方式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 416.65,
          "end": 419.5,
          "en": "that's why it's the unconventional calculator.",
          "zh": "那就是為什麼它是非傳統的計算機。"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 419.5,
          "end": 421.94,
          "en": "So now let's add 10 and star,",
          "zh": "所以現在讓我們加 10 和星號，"
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 421.97,
          "end": 424.43,
          "en": "so we had two, so now it should be 2 times 10",
          "zh": "所以我們有 2，所以現在它應該是 2 乘 10，"
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 424.45,
          "end": 425.98,
          "en": "and that's the case",
          "zh": "而情況就是那樣，"
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 425.98,
          "end": 429.66,
          "en": "and finally divide by 4 maybe and we get 5.",
          "zh": "最後也許除以 4，而我們得到 5。"
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 430.33,
          "end": 432.34,
          "en": "So this all works,",
          "zh": "所以這全部有效，"
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 432.34,
          "end": 439.48,
          "en": "now we connected a couple of buttons to our functions and we also had a first look at code refactoring",
          "zh": "現在我們把一些按鈕連到我們的函式，而我們也第一次看了程式碼重構"
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 439.48,
          "end": 446.59,
          "en": "and code reusage, an art which you will master as you work as a developer and where you shouldn't",
          "zh": "和程式碼重複使用，一種你當開發者工作時會精通的技藝，而你不該"
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 446.59,
          "end": 450.06,
          "en": "worry if you're not totally sure how to split your code yet,",
          "zh": "擔心如果你還不完全確定怎麼拆你的程式碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 450.22,
          "end": 455.83,
          "en": "that is something that comes with experience and something you will also do a lot throughout this course.",
          "zh": "那是隨經驗而來的東西，也是你會在這整門課程裡做很多的東西。"
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 455.83,
          "end": 461.14,
          "en": "So by the end of the course, you'll already feel way more confident about that than you probably do right",
          "zh": "所以到課程結束時，你對那個會覺得有信心得多，比你可能覺得的"
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 461.14,
          "end": 461.47,
          "en": "now.",
          "zh": "現在。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "15853256",
      "title": "Working with Code Comments",
      "lectureOrder": 40,
      "videoOrder": 32,
      "sourceHash": "cc7d96793167710c6f65638fb6f67c5c24ba478b2910192939d9ad69aa203373",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.42,
          "end": 7.97,
          "en": "Now we wrote some code already, a feature which you can also use in Javascript and many other programming",
          "zh": "現在我們已經寫了一些程式碼，一個你也可以在 JavaScript 和許多其他程式"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 7.97,
          "end": 16.34,
          "en": "languages are comments. You can add comments to your code to make it more understandable to fellow developers",
          "zh": "語言裡使用的功能是註解。你可以在程式碼裡加註解，讓它對其他開發者更容易理解，"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 16.55,
          "end": 17.6,
          "en": "or to yourself",
          "zh": "或對你自己，"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 17.6,
          "end": 23.54,
          "en": "if you were coming back to your code after a couple of months of break or something like that. Now a comment",
          "zh": "如果你在休息幾個月或類似的情況之後回到你的程式碼。現在"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 23.54,
          "end": 26.05,
          "en": "in Javascript can be added in two ways,",
          "zh": "JavaScript 裡的註解可以用兩種方式加上，"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 26.15,
          "end": 30.83,
          "en": "you can add it here, like you add regular code by adding two forward slashes,",
          "zh": "你可以在這裡加它，就像你加一般程式碼，藉由加兩個斜線，"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 30.89,
          "end": 32.53,
          "en": "this is a comment",
          "zh": "這是一個註解，"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 32.54,
          "end": 38.71,
          "en": "now. This means that this is there for people to read but it has no effect on your code.",
          "zh": "現在。這表示這是給人讀的，但它對你的程式碼沒有作用。"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 38.75,
          "end": 42.2,
          "en": "If you reload, you don't see an error or anything like that,",
          "zh": "如果你重新載入，你不會看到錯誤或任何類似的東西，"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 42.23,
          "end": 48.65,
          "en": "it's not executed as code, instead this is just there to comment your code, to make it more understandable.",
          "zh": "它不被當程式碼執行，相反這只是在那裡註解你的程式碼，讓它更容易理解。"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 49.4,
          "end": 54.03,
          "en": "If you have a longer a comment to write which should be split across multiple lines,",
          "zh": "如果你有一段較長的註解要寫，它應該拆成多行，"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 54.05,
          "end": 60.35,
          "en": "you can of course add another line of comments here with two other forward slashes but you can also add a",
          "zh": "你當然可以在這裡用另外兩個斜線再加一行註解，但你也可以加一個"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 60.35,
          "end": 68.32,
          "en": "block comment by adding a forward slash and then a star and now you see everything is green down there",
          "zh": "區塊註解，藉由加一個斜線然後一個星號，而現在你看到下面那裡全部是綠色，"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 68.35,
          "end": 73.06,
          "en": "because now everything after that is treated as a comment,",
          "zh": "因為現在那之後的一切都被當成註解，"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 73.15,
          "end": 75.93,
          "en": "so this is also a comment",
          "zh": "所以這也是一個註解，"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 76.33,
          "end": 78.16,
          "en": "and this is",
          "zh": "而這是，"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 78.16,
          "end": 84.13,
          "en": "and now you have to close the comment with a star and another forward slash, so the opposite combination",
          "zh": "而現在你必須用一個星號和另一個斜線結束註解，所以是相反的組合，"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 84.13,
          "end": 85.82,
          "en": "we had here to open it.",
          "zh": "我們在這裡用來開啟它的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 85.84,
          "end": 91.66,
          "en": "So now this allows you to write a longer comment across multiple lines without starting every line with",
          "zh": "所以現在這讓你能跨多行寫一段較長的註解，而不用每一行都以"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 91.66,
          "end": 93.78,
          "en": "two forward slashes.",
          "zh": "兩個斜線開頭。"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 93.85,
          "end": 96.97,
          "en": "Now how will you use comments in your code?",
          "zh": "現在你會怎麼在程式碼裡使用註解？"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 96.97,
          "end": 99.91,
          "en": "You shouldn't comment the obvious,",
          "zh": "你不該註解明顯的事，"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 99.91,
          "end": 104.59,
          "en": "so if you comment this is a function that",
          "zh": "所以如果你註解這是一個函式，它"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 107.08,
          "end": 111.97999999999999,
          "en": "extracts the user input from the input field,",
          "zh": "從輸入欄位取出使用者輸入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 112.03,
          "end": 117.75999999999999,
          "en": "that's not the best comment because for one you don't want to write long text, you don't want to write",
          "zh": "那不是最好的註解，因為其一你不想寫長文字，你不想在這裡寫"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 117.88,
          "end": 119.22,
          "en": "essays here,",
          "zh": "文章，"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 119.22999999999999,
          "end": 125.98,
          "en": "instead you want to write short to-the-point comments that add some extra context or understanding that",
          "zh": "相反你想寫簡短、切中要點的註解，加上一些額外脈絡或理解，那些"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 126.1,
          "end": 128.97,
          "en": "isn't obvious from looking at the code.",
          "zh": "從看程式碼並不明顯。"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 128.98,
          "end": 135.79,
          "en": "So if I look at this code, it's pretty obvious at what it does, we could just add something like gets",
          "zh": "所以如果我看這段程式碼，它做什麼相當明顯，我們可以只加像「從輸入欄位取得"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 135.79,
          "end": 137.79,
          "en": "input from input field.",
          "zh": "輸入」這樣的東西。"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 137.82999999999998,
          "end": 138.97,
          "en": "Why is that useful?",
          "zh": "為什麼那有用？"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 138.97,
          "end": 144.97,
          "en": "Because it adds this extra context that this is coming from an input field because it might not be obvious,",
          "zh": "因為它加上這個額外脈絡，這來自一個輸入欄位，因為它可能不明顯，"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 144.97,
          "end": 151.15,
          "en": "by looking at the code, that user input refers to input field, so that could be something we could add",
          "zh": "藉由看程式碼，userInput 指的是輸入欄位，所以那可以是我們可以加的東西，"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 151.36,
          "end": 156.57999999999998,
          "en": "to make understanding that code a bit easier and simply save the developer who's looking at the code",
          "zh": "讓理解那段程式碼容易一點，並單純省下看程式碼的開發者"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 156.7,
          "end": 161.57,
          "en": "to time to kind of find out what user input is referring to.",
          "zh": "去找出 userInput 指的是什麼的時間。"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 161.71,
          "end": 170.45,
          "en": "Here we could add something like generates and writes calculation log, again",
          "zh": "這裡我們可以加像「產生並寫出計算紀錄」這樣的東西，再次，"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 170.46,
          "end": 175.86,
          "en": "this might not really be necessary because that's quite easy to see if you look at this but if you have",
          "zh": "這可能真的不必要，因為如果你看這個，那相當容易看出，但如果你"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 175.86,
          "end": 180.54,
          "en": "a first quick look at this, it could look daunting and then this makes it clear that this is in the end",
          "zh": "第一眼快速看這個，它可能看起來嚇人，然後這讓它清楚，這最後"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 180.55,
          "end": 188.51,
          "en": "just a helper function that outputs some information and generates that information as well. You can",
          "zh": "只是一個輔助函式，輸出一些資訊，也產生那個資訊。你可以"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 188.57,
          "end": 190.4,
          "en": "also add a comment inline,",
          "zh": "也內嵌加註解，"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 190.4,
          "end": 197.21,
          "en": "so after some code, like here, we could say from vendor file to make it clear that this function is not",
          "zh": "所以在一些程式碼之後，像這裡，我們可以說來自 vendor 檔案，讓它清楚這個函式不是"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 197.21,
          "end": 200.62,
          "en": "defined somewhere in this file but lives in the vendor file,",
          "zh": "在這個檔案裡某處定義的，而是住在 vendor 檔案裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 200.63,
          "end": 202.47,
          "en": "otherwise this might not be obvious",
          "zh": "否則這可能不明顯，"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 202.49,
          "end": 208.25,
          "en": "and again if someone wants to follow our code or understand it, this could help with understanding it.",
          "zh": "而再次，如果有人想跟隨我們的程式碼或理解它，這可以幫著理解它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 208.25,
          "end": 212.57999999999998,
          "en": "So adding such a short inline comment also sometimes can be useful.",
          "zh": "所以加這樣一個短的內嵌註解，有時也可以有用。"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 212.81,
          "end": 218.87,
          "en": "In general, you want to comment your code, especially if you share it with others but you don't want to",
          "zh": "一般來說，你想註解你的程式碼，尤其如果你和別人分享它，但你不想"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 218.96,
          "end": 219.86,
          "en": "overdo it,",
          "zh": "做得過度，"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 220.01,
          "end": 222.41,
          "en": "don't add redundant information,",
          "zh": "不要加多餘的資訊，"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 222.41,
          "end": 228.2,
          "en": "don't write too long comments because then people will not read them at all and they actually get less",
          "zh": "不要寫太長的註解，因為那時人們根本不會讀它們，而他們實際上從中得到的比"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 228.29,
          "end": 234.02,
          "en": "out of them than if there were no comments at all and you don't want to comment the obvious, instead",
          "zh": "如果完全沒有註解還少，而你不想註解明顯的事，相反"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 234.2,
          "end": 241.79,
          "en": "provide some extra context, extra information that can help understand your code faster or briefly share",
          "zh": "提供一些額外脈絡、額外資訊，可以幫更快理解你的程式碼，或簡短分享"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 241.82,
          "end": 244.51,
          "en": "your thoughts regarding the code you wrote here.",
          "zh": "你對你在這裡寫的程式碼的想法。"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 244.52,
          "end": 246.68,
          "en": "That's something you could add with comments.",
          "zh": "那是你可以用註解加上的東西。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "15853260",
      "title": "More Operators!",
      "lectureOrder": 41,
      "videoOrder": 33,
      "sourceHash": "1dcdc6d4a8d9333f40ce601818ad362323c69b38dfca295d66caeae3ea2e16c1",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.19,
          "end": 8.46,
          "en": "We got quite a nice application going here, at least for the basics into which we're diving.",
          "zh": "我們這裡有一個相當不錯的應用程式在跑，至少對我們正在深入的基礎來說。"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 8.46,
          "end": 13.74,
          "en": "Now I want to dig deeper into some of the core Javascript features you've got to know because you will",
          "zh": "現在我想更深入一些你必須知道的核心 JavaScript 功能，因為你會"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 13.74,
          "end": 20.55,
          "en": "need them in many of the projects or the applications you're going to create with Javascript",
          "zh": "在你要用 JavaScript 建立的許多專案或應用程式裡需要它們，"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 20.55,
          "end": 27.48,
          "en": "and one important feature if you want to call it like this is a special set of operators which you can",
          "zh": "而一個重要功能，如果你想這樣稱呼它，是一組特殊的運算子，你可以"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 27.48,
          "end": 29.91,
          "en": "also use in your Javascript code.",
          "zh": "也在你的 JavaScript 程式碼裡使用。"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 29.91,
          "end": 36.78,
          "en": "Now we already saw the assign operator, the plus, the minus, the multiplication and the division operator,",
          "zh": "現在我們已經看過指派運算子、加號、減號、乘法與除法運算子，"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 36.78,
          "end": 38.11,
          "en": "we used those,",
          "zh": "我們用過那些，"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 38.13,
          "end": 42.37,
          "en": "now there are a couple of shortcut operators if you want to call them like that.",
          "zh": "現在有一些捷徑運算子，如果你想那樣稱呼它們。"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 42.6,
          "end": 47.82,
          "en": "For example here, what we're doing and not just for adding but also for subtracting and so on, what we're",
          "zh": "例如這裡，我們在做的，不只是加法，還有減法等等，我們"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 47.82,
          "end": 56.04,
          "en": "doing is always we're assigning a new value to current result and that new value is based on the current",
          "zh": "在做的永遠是把一個新值指派給 currentResult，而那個新值基於目前"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 56.22,
          "end": 63.88,
          "en": "or the old value of current result plus, or minus and so on, a number.",
          "zh": "或 currentResult 的舊值，加上、或減去等等，一個數字。"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 63.9,
          "end": 68.27,
          "en": "Now if you have a calculation like this which is quite common, there is a shortcut,",
          "zh": "現在如果你有像這樣的計算，那相當常見，有一個捷徑，"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 68.31,
          "end": 77.55,
          "en": "you can absolutely write it like this but if you assign the result to the same variable you're using",
          "zh": "你絕對可以像這樣寫它，但如果你把結果指派給你在"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 77.55,
          "end": 79.44,
          "en": "on the right side of the equal sign,",
          "zh": "等號右邊使用的同一個變數，"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 79.68,
          "end": 86.91,
          "en": "you can omit that variable there on the right side, omit the operator and instead write plus equal,",
          "zh": "你可以省略右邊那裡的那個變數，省略運算子，改為寫加號等於，"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 87,
          "end": 90.01,
          "en": "so instead of a single equal sign, use plus equal",
          "zh": "所以不是單一個等號，使用加號等於，"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 90.09,
          "end": 95.33,
          "en": "and that's exactly the same as having, in this case here current result.",
          "zh": "而那和這個情況這裡的 currentResult 完全一樣，"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 95.37,
          "end": 97.66,
          "en": "equal to current result plus.",
          "zh": "等於 currentResult 加。"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 97.74000000000001,
          "end": 101.34,
          "en": "So you can remove that from the right side and add a plus here",
          "zh": "所以你可以從右邊移除那個，並在這裡加一個加號，"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 101.52000000000001,
          "end": 107.67,
          "en": "and as you will see if I now save this and I reload this, if I enter a five here and I click plus, that",
          "zh": "而如你會看到的，如果我現在存這個並重新載入這個，如果我在這裡輸入 5 並點加號，那"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 107.78999999999999,
          "end": 109.62,
          "en": "still works as before.",
          "zh": "仍然和之前一樣有效。"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 109.86,
          "end": 111.36,
          "en": "So that did not change,",
          "zh": "所以那沒有改變，"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 111.36,
          "end": 112.39,
          "en": "that still works",
          "zh": "那仍然有效，"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 112.44,
          "end": 115.62,
          "en": "but now we have a shorter code snippet here,",
          "zh": "但現在我們這裡有一段較短的程式碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 115.62,
          "end": 121.33,
          "en": "we have less code which we have to write. Now the same is available for all the other operators,",
          "zh": "我們有較少必須寫的程式碼。現在同樣的東西對所有其他運算子都可用，"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 121.35,
          "end": 129.33,
          "en": "so instead of this code here with the minus, we can also write minus equal and the same for the multiplication",
          "zh": "所以不是這裡這段有減號的程式碼，我們也可以寫減號等於，而乘法"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 129.36,
          "end": 130.11,
          "en": "and division.",
          "zh": "和除法也一樣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 130.11,
          "end": 137.79,
          "en": "So we can take this, multiply this here and also remove that division code here and use this shortcut",
          "zh": "所以我們可以拿這個，在這裡相乘這個，也移除這裡那段除法程式碼，並使用這個捷徑，"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 137.94,
          "end": 145.4,
          "en": "and with that if we save that, you'll see that now as I reload this, we can add, we can subtract,",
          "zh": "而有了那個，如果我們存那個，你會看到現在我重新載入這個，我們可以加、我們可以減、"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 145.59,
          "end": 151.26,
          "en": "we can multiply and we can also divide. This all works,",
          "zh": "我們可以乘，而我們也可以除。這全部有效，"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 151.26,
          "end": 159.31,
          "en": "now with this shorter code thanks to these shortcuts. Now there also are other shortcuts or other shorthand",
          "zh": "現在有了這些捷徑帶來的較短程式碼。現在也有其他捷徑，或其他簡寫"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 159.37,
          "end": 168.25,
          "en": "operators as they're also sometimes called, if you have let's say the case that you want to set a new",
          "zh": "運算子，它們有時也被這樣叫，如果你有，讓我們說，你想把一個新"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 168.25,
          "end": 174.61,
          "en": "value to a variable, let's say to current result and that is the current value plus one,",
          "zh": "值設給一個變數的情況，讓我們說給 currentResult，而那是目前的值加一，"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 174.61,
          "end": 178.31,
          "en": "so exactly plus one, which we of course don't need here",
          "zh": "所以正好加一，我們這裡當然不需要，"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 178.32999999999998,
          "end": 185.65,
          "en": "but imagine we had that case, then instead of writing this, you can also write current result plus",
          "zh": "但想像我們有那個情況，那時不是寫這個，你也可以寫 currentResult 加"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 185.65,
          "end": 188.74,
          "en": "plus. The same is available for minus,",
          "zh": "加。減號也有同樣的東西，"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 188.74,
          "end": 191.33,
          "en": "we can write current result minus minus.",
          "zh": "我們可以寫 currentResult 減減。"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 191.8,
          "end": 197.01,
          "en": "It's not available for multiplication or division because, what would that be,",
          "zh": "乘法或除法沒有，因為那會是什麼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 197.11,
          "end": 198.91,
          "en": "multiply the number with one?",
          "zh": "把數字乘以一？"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 199.15,
          "end": 202.05,
          "en": "Well that's the same number and the same for division, right?",
          "zh": "嗯，那是同一個數字，除法也一樣，對吧？"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 202.18,
          "end": 206.65,
          "en": "But adding one or subtracting one, that makes sense",
          "zh": "但加一或減一，那有道理，"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 206.8,
          "end": 214.81,
          "en": "and with this increment or decrement operator as it's called, that is possible in a very short way.",
          "zh": "而用這個遞增或遞減運算子，如它被稱呼的，那可以用非常短的方式做到。"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 214.81,
          "end": 220.63,
          "en": "So if we do that here and I comment out this line for the moment, this by the way is a common pattern, that",
          "zh": "所以如果我們在這裡那樣做，而我暫時把這一行註解掉，這順便說是一個常見模式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 220.63,
          "end": 227.32,
          "en": "you use comments to temporarily remove some code which you then can re-add later but since comments",
          "zh": "你用註解暫時移除一些程式碼，然後你可以稍後再加回來，但因為註解"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 227.35,
          "end": 233.5,
          "en": "are ignored, you can kind of temporarily remove code by commenting it out as it's called.",
          "zh": "被忽略，你可以藉由把它註解掉，如它被稱呼的，暫時移除程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 233.5,
          "end": 240.01,
          "en": "So if we do that and we therefore only reduce current result by one, if we click add, you will see that now",
          "zh": "所以如果我們那樣做，因此我們只把 currentResult 減一，如果我們點 add，你會看到現在"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 240.01,
          "end": 245.8,
          "en": "if I don't enter anything here because I'm not using the value anyways right now, if I add a plus, you",
          "zh": "如果我在這裡不輸入任何東西，因為我現在反正沒在用那個值，如果我按加號，你"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 245.8,
          "end": 250.93,
          "en": "have a result of minus one, we can ignore this NaN thing for now, here the result is the thing",
          "zh": "得到結果負一，我們目前可以忽略這個 NaN 的事，這裡結果才是"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 250.93,
          "end": 251.7,
          "en": "that matters.",
          "zh": "要緊的東西。"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 251.74,
          "end": 257.5,
          "en": "So this gets lower and lower, always by one each time I click the plus button because we're decrementing",
          "zh": "所以這個愈來愈低，每次我點加號按鈕都少一，因為我們在"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 257.57,
          "end": 265.66,
          "en": "this here. Little side note, you could also write minus minus or plus plus in front of the variable,",
          "zh": "這裡遞減這個。小小附帶一提，你也可以把減減或加加寫在變數前面，"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 265.96,
          "end": 270.71,
          "en": "and it will actually have a small impact or a small difference,",
          "zh": "而它實際上會有一點影響或一點差異，"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 270.79,
          "end": 276.34000000000003,
          "en": "not if you just use it like this to change the value but if you're interested in the return type of",
          "zh": "不是如果你只像這樣用它來改變值，而是如果你對回傳值有興趣，"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 276.37,
          "end": 277.54,
          "en": "this operation,",
          "zh": "這個運算的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 277.54,
          "end": 283.9,
          "en": "if you add plus plus in front of this, it will actually add it to current result by adding one, just as it",
          "zh": "如果你把加加放在這個前面，它實際上會藉由加一把它加到 currentResult，就像它"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 283.9,
          "end": 290.38,
          "en": "does if you add it thereafter. If you have plus plus or minus minus in front of this variable, then this",
          "zh": "如果加在後面那樣做的。如果你把加加或減減放在這個變數前面，那麼這個"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 290.38,
          "end": 300.49,
          "en": "operation returns the edited value, if you have it after the variable, well then this returns the value",
          "zh": "運算回傳編輯後的值，如果你把它放在變數後面，嗯，那麼這個回傳"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 300.49,
          "end": 303.25,
          "en": "of the variable before it was changed.",
          "zh": "變數被改變之前的值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 303.25,
          "end": 310.39,
          "en": "Now here we're not using the return value but if we would alert that return value, it still changes",
          "zh": "現在這裡我們沒在用回傳值，但如果我們會 alert 那個回傳值，它仍然以"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 310.39,
          "end": 313.68,
          "en": "current result always in the same way by adding one",
          "zh": "同樣的方式改變 currentResult，藉由加一，"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 313.72,
          "end": 319.12,
          "en": "but this operation returns a new value which you can or cannot use, depending on whether you want to use",
          "zh": "但這個運算回傳一個新值，你可以或可以不使用，取決於你是否想使用"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 319.12,
          "end": 319.75,
          "en": "it.",
          "zh": "它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 319.75,
          "end": 322.85,
          "en": "So here for example, I'm using it by outputting it with the alert",
          "zh": "所以這裡例如，我藉由用 alert 輸出它來使用它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 322.99,
          "end": 326.83,
          "en": "and if we do that and I reload here, you see I get one here,",
          "zh": "而如果我們那樣做，而我在這裡重新載入，你看到我這裡得到 1，"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 326.92,
          "end": 330.15,
          "en": "so I get the result after the change.",
          "zh": "所以我得到改變之後的結果。"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 330.37,
          "end": 339.07,
          "en": "If I add the pluses at the end here and I repeat here, save this and reload, then I get it before the",
          "zh": "如果我把加號加在這裡的結尾，而我在這裡重複，存這個並重新載入，那麼我得到改變之前的"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 339.07,
          "end": 344.83,
          "en": "change. So this plus plus and minus minus operator return something,",
          "zh": "它。所以這個加加和減減運算子回傳某樣東西，"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 344.83,
          "end": 350.9,
          "en": "it returns the value before or after the change depending on where you add the pluses and minuses.",
          "zh": "它回傳改變之前或之後的值，取決於你把加號和減號加在哪裡。"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 350.98,
          "end": 357.2,
          "en": "Again in many cases, that doesn't matter because the variable itself is always edited in the same way,",
          "zh": "再次，在很多情況那不重要，因為變數本身永遠以同樣的方式被編輯，"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 357.25,
          "end": 360.55,
          "en": "it just makes a difference regarding the value which is returned.",
          "zh": "它只是對被回傳的值造成差異。"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 360.7,
          "end": 365.52,
          "en": "Now of course here, I'm not interested in incrementing this so I'll just remove that line and comment",
          "zh": "現在這裡我當然對遞增這個沒興趣，所以我會只移除那一行，並把"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 365.55,
          "end": 369.4,
          "en": "this back in, by the way in case you're wondering how I did this so quickly,",
          "zh": "這個註解加回來，順便說，如果你在想我怎麼這麼快做到這個，"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 369.46,
          "end": 378.04,
          "en": "I use the shortcut here in my IDE, under edit, you can use toggle line comment to add or remove",
          "zh": "我在我的 IDE 裡使用這裡的捷徑，在編輯之下，你可以使用切換行註解，來加上或移除"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 378.04,
          "end": 381.82,
          "en": "a comment and to quickly comment code in or out.",
          "zh": "一個註解，並快速把程式碼註解進去或出來。"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 381.88,
          "end": 388.57,
          "en": "So these are some additional operators which I recommend that you keep in mind and that therefore completes",
          "zh": "所以這些是一些額外的運算子，我建議你記住，而那因此完成"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 388.63,
          "end": 395.08,
          "en": "our list of operators which we are aware of for now with these shorthand operators and the increment",
          "zh": "我們目前知道的運算子清單，有這些簡寫運算子，以及遞增"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 395.12,
          "end": 395.83,
          "en": "and decrement",
          "zh": "和遞減"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 395.86,
          "end": 396.46,
          "en": "operator.",
          "zh": "運算子。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "15853262",
      "title": "More Core Data Types!",
      "lectureOrder": 42,
      "videoOrder": 34,
      "sourceHash": "7a8c1dde413f03a2e8e6b43a3fce42520a4406dad2e4b85666a5ad8a3fdd3729",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.22,
          "end": 8.73,
          "en": "Those extra operators which you have are good to know because sometimes you can save some extra code",
          "zh": "那些你有的額外運算子值得知道，因為有時你可以省下一些額外程式碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 8.76,
          "end": 11.7,
          "en": "by using these shorthands, these abbreviations.",
          "zh": "藉由使用這些簡寫、這些縮寫。"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 11.79,
          "end": 16.38,
          "en": "Even more important than that however are other data types you can work with.",
          "zh": "然而比那個更重要的，是你可以一起工作的其他資料型別。"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 16.38,
          "end": 23.16,
          "en": "We learned about numbers where you have numbers with or without decimal places, numbers without decimal",
          "zh": "我們學過數字，你有有小數位或沒有小數位的數字，沒有小數"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 23.16,
          "end": 33.04,
          "en": "places are also called integers, numbers with decimal places are also called floats. Besides numbers and",
          "zh": "位的數字也叫整數，有小數位的數字也叫浮點數。除了數字和"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 33.04,
          "end": 35.47,
          "en": "text or strings as it's called,",
          "zh": "文字，或如它被稱呼的字串，"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 35.47,
          "end": 41.21,
          "en": "you also get other core data types which you have to know when working with Javascript,",
          "zh": "你也得到其他核心資料型別，用 JavaScript 工作時你必須知道，"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 41.26,
          "end": 48.73,
          "en": "for example there are booleans. Now booleans are a bit strange and a bit hard to understand right now but",
          "zh": "例如有布林。現在布林有點奇怪，現在有點難理解，但"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 48.73,
          "end": 50.26,
          "en": "they really shine",
          "zh": "它們真的會發光，"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 50.26,
          "end": 57.7,
          "en": "once we learn about controlled structures, if statements which we'll do in a separate module soon. Booleans",
          "zh": "一旦我們學到控制結構、if 陳述，我們很快會在一個分開的模組做。布林"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 57.79,
          "end": 64.84,
          "en": "are effectively values which have one of two possible values, true or false.",
          "zh": "實際上是具有兩個可能值之一的值，true 或 false。"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 64.84,
          "end": 71.47,
          "en": "So where you can, as a number, have any number or as a string, have any combination of characters,",
          "zh": "所以你可以，作為數字，有任何數字，或作為字串，有任何字元組合，"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 71.56,
          "end": 75.85,
          "en": "booleans are exactly one of two values, true or false.",
          "zh": "布林正好是兩個值之一，true 或 false。"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 76.78,
          "end": 83.47,
          "en": "Now you might wonder when you need such a restricted data type and the answer is quite often, because",
          "zh": "現在你可能想知道你何時需要這樣受限的資料型別，而答案是相當常常，因為"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 83.47,
          "end": 90.67,
          "en": "quite often in code, you have some condition, like is the user currently logged in, which is either true or",
          "zh": "在程式碼裡相當常常，你有某個條件，像使用者目前是否已登入，那不是 true 就是"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 90.67,
          "end": 95.8,
          "en": "false and then you want to run different code based on that condition maybe",
          "zh": "false，然後你也許想基於那個條件跑不同的程式碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 95.97,
          "end": 96.74000000000001,
          "en": "and that's what I meant,",
          "zh": "而那是我的意思，"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 96.72999999999999,
          "end": 102.4,
          "en": "booleans shine if you have conditional code and we haven't really learned about this yet but we will",
          "zh": "如果你有條件式程式碼，布林會發光，而我們還沒真正學過這個，但我們會"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 102.4,
          "end": 106.6,
          "en": "learn about this in a whole module as it's such a core feature.",
          "zh": "在一整個模組裡學這個，因為它是這樣的核心功能。"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 106.84,
          "end": 112.47999999999999,
          "en": "So already keep booleans in mind, we'll dive deeper into them a bit later and then very deeply though.",
          "zh": "所以已經把布林放在心上，我們稍後會更深入它們，然後非常深入。"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 113.38,
          "end": 116.02000000000001,
          "en": "More important and something we won't see right away",
          "zh": "更重要、而我們不會立刻看到的某樣東西，"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 116.08,
          "end": 125.77,
          "en": "are objects. Objects are an extremely important type in Javascript, maybe the most important type if you",
          "zh": "是物件。物件在 JavaScript 裡是極重要的型別，也許是最重要的型別，如果你"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 125.77,
          "end": 131.53,
          "en": "would have to choose one, of course you need all of them but objects are really important. Objects allow",
          "zh": "必須選一個，當然你需要全部，但物件真的重要。物件讓"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 131.53,
          "end": 134.82,
          "en": "you to group data you could say, something like this.",
          "zh": "你能把資料分組，你可以說，像這樣的東西。"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 134.95,
          "end": 140.95,
          "en": "Now you create object with curly braces and of course we already saw curly braces when we wrote a function",
          "zh": "現在你用大括號建立物件，而我們當然已經看過大括號，當我們寫函式時，"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 141.4,
          "end": 147.25,
          "en": "and that of course was not an object, that was the function body but without the function keyword and so",
          "zh": "而那當然不是物件，那是函式本體，但沒有 function 關鍵字等等，"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 147.25,
          "end": 150.59,
          "en": "on, in the place where you could also use a number or a text,",
          "zh": "在你也可以使用數字或文字的地方，"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 150.67000000000002,
          "end": 156.96,
          "en": "you can create an object by adding curly braces and then you have key-value pairs in there.",
          "zh": "你可以藉由加大括號建立一個物件，然後你在裡面有鍵值對。"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 157.01,
          "end": 163.63,
          "en": "Now as I said, you use that for grouping or relating data, let's say you have a little program where",
          "zh": "現在如我說的，你用那個來分組或關聯資料，讓我們說你有一個小程式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 163.63,
          "end": 170.03,
          "en": "you work with persons, where you have user data that you kind of need in your Javascript code.",
          "zh": "你在那裡處理人，你有使用者資料，你在 JavaScript 程式碼裡某種程度上需要的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 170.05,
          "end": 172.67000000000002,
          "en": "Now each user might have a name and an age,",
          "zh": "現在每個使用者可能有一個名字和一個年齡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 172.75,
          "end": 178.6,
          "en": "of course you could have standalone separate that variables for that but having an object makes it much",
          "zh": "當然你可以有獨立分開的變數，但有一個物件讓它容易"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 178.63,
          "end": 186.61,
          "en": "easier to understand that this data kind of belongs together, that it's related, that you use it as one",
          "zh": "得多去理解這份資料某種程度上屬於一起，它是相關的，你把它當一塊"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 186.61,
          "end": 190.72,
          "en": "piece of information if you will and therefore objects are really powerful,",
          "zh": "資訊使用，如果你願意，因此物件真的強大，"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 190.72,
          "end": 196.15,
          "en": "you can also do way more with them than just group data and we will do way more with them throughout",
          "zh": "你也可以用它們做比只是分組資料多得多的事，而我們會在整門"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 196.15,
          "end": 196.87,
          "en": "the course",
          "zh": "課程裡用它們做多得多的事，"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 196.87,
          "end": 202.9,
          "en": "but the data grouping functionality on its own is already pretty amazing and very important.",
          "zh": "但資料分組功能本身已經相當驚人，而且非常重要。"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 203.14,
          "end": 212.29,
          "en": "Now and speaking of kind of organized or grouped data, another core data type are arrays. Now arrays",
          "zh": "現在說到某種有組織或分組的資料，另一個核心資料型別是陣列。現在陣列"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 212.29,
          "end": 215.23,
          "en": "are created like this with the square brackets here,",
          "zh": "像這樣用這裡的方括號建立，"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 215.32,
          "end": 221.35,
          "en": "also in the same place where you would create numbers or text or whatever you need and an array is simply",
          "zh": "也在你會建立數字或文字或你需要的任何東西的同一個地方，而陣列單純是"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 221.44,
          "end": 222.91,
          "en": "a list of data.",
          "zh": "一份資料清單。"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 223.42000000000002,
          "end": 227.16,
          "en": "So arrays are always great if you need to store a list of data,",
          "zh": "所以如果你需要儲存一份資料清單，陣列永遠很棒，"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 227.17000000000002,
          "end": 234.52,
          "en": "let's say a list of transactions, a list of maybe calculations in our calculator and you can store any",
          "zh": "讓我們說一份交易清單、也許我們計算機裡的一份計算清單，而你可以在裡面儲存任何"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 234.52,
          "end": 235.2,
          "en": "data in there.",
          "zh": "資料。"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 235.21,
          "end": 241.3,
          "en": "It can be an array of integers, so of numbers without decimal places like in this example but it could",
          "zh": "它可以是整數的陣列，所以像這個例子裡沒有小數位的數字，但它可以"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 241.3,
          "end": 247.72,
          "en": "be an array of text, an array of floats, an array of objects, even an array of arrays is possible and you",
          "zh": "是文字的陣列、浮點數的陣列、物件的陣列，甚至陣列的陣列也是可能的，而你"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 247.72,
          "end": 249.46,
          "en": "can also mix data in there,",
          "zh": "也可以在裡面混合資料，"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 249.46,
          "end": 255.94,
          "en": "you can have an array that has numbers and text elements and so on. Elements in an array are separated",
          "zh": "你可以有一個陣列，它有數字和文字元素等等。陣列裡的元素被分隔，"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 255.94,
          "end": 260.08,
          "en": "by commas, as are the key-value pairs and objects",
          "zh": "用逗號，鍵值對和物件也是，"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 260.08,
          "end": 266.71,
          "en": "but I'd say it makes way more sense to understand and explore these objects and arrays by simply working",
          "zh": "但我會說，藉由單純和這些物件與陣列一起工作，來理解和探索它們，有道理得多，"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 266.71,
          "end": 267.07,
          "en": "with them,",
          "zh": "和它們一起，"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 267.07,
          "end": 269.14,
          "en": "so let's do that in the scope of our project.",
          "zh": "所以讓我們在我們專案的範圍裡那樣做。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "15853264",
      "title": "Using Arrays",
      "lectureOrder": 43,
      "videoOrder": 35,
      "sourceHash": "4a97ba88da9e74f71e0ba971a3ec49235849488951beae8527562e91391f6e06",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.4,
          "end": 5.79,
          "en": "How could we introduce arrays and objects here?",
          "zh": "我們可以怎麼在這裡介紹陣列和物件？"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.88,
          "end": 13.28,
          "en": "Well let's say we want to log every operation we do, so when we add, when we subtract,",
          "zh": "嗯，讓我們說我們想紀錄我們做的每個運算，所以當我們加、當我們減、"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 13.29,
          "end": 14.55,
          "en": "when we multiply,",
          "zh": "當我們乘，"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 14.55,
          "end": 21.45,
          "en": "we kind of want to log this, we want to store this in an internal log which we theoretically could send",
          "zh": "我們某種程度上想紀錄這個，我們想把這個存在一個內部紀錄裡，理論上我們可以把它送到"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 21.45,
          "end": 24.03,
          "en": "to a server or anything like that.",
          "zh": "一個伺服器或任何類似的東西。"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 24.03,
          "end": 24.45,
          "en": "In",
          "zh": "在"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 24.51,
          "end": 25.28,
          "en": "Node.js,",
          "zh": "Node.js，"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 25.29,
          "end": 27.66,
          "en": "we could write it to a file, in the browser",
          "zh": "我們可以把它寫進一個檔案，在瀏覽器裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 27.66,
          "end": 32.88,
          "en": "we can't because we don't have access to the filesystem there for security reasons but we might want",
          "zh": "我們不能，因為出於安全理由，我們在那裡沒有檔案系統的存取，但我們可能想"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 32.88,
          "end": 34.25,
          "en": "to keep track of that, right,",
          "zh": "追蹤那個，對吧，"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 34.26,
          "end": 38.49,
          "en": "because we want to store it on our own analytic server for example.",
          "zh": "因為我們想把它存在我們自己的分析伺服器上，例如。"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 38.49,
          "end": 45.21,
          "en": "Now in such a case, we want to keep track of a list of operations because we're not just interested in",
          "zh": "現在在這樣的情況，我們想追蹤一份運算清單，因為我們不只對"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 45.48,
          "end": 51.24,
          "en": "the first click on the add button but we want to store every click on every button and therefore we",
          "zh": "add 按鈕的第一次點擊有興趣，而是我們想儲存每個按鈕的每一次點擊，因此我們"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 51.24,
          "end": 56.9,
          "en": "need to have a list of data that gets bigger and bigger over time. For that,",
          "zh": "需要有一份資料清單，它隨時間愈來愈大。為此，"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 56.9,
          "end": 64.55,
          "en": "we can add a new global variable here and I will create it here with the let keyword and name it log",
          "zh": "我們可以在這裡加一個新的全域變數，而我會用 let 關鍵字在這裡建立它，並把它命名為 log"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 64.67,
          "end": 65.32,
          "en": "entries,",
          "zh": "Entries，"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 65.31,
          "end": 67.58,
          "en": "the name is totally up to you of course,",
          "zh": "名稱當然完全由你決定，"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 67.58,
          "end": 73.01,
          "en": "again it should be a name that kind of gives an idea of which kind of data you're going to store",
          "zh": "再次，它應該是一個名稱，某種程度上給出你要儲存哪種資料的概念，"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 73.01,
          "end": 78.38,
          "en": "and it's a plural name here because I'll have multiple elements in there because it should be such an",
          "zh": "而這裡是複數名稱，因為我會在裡面有多個元素，因為它應該是這樣一個"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 78.59,
          "end": 80.53999999999999,
          "en": "array as I mentioned.",
          "zh": "陣列，如我提到的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 80.53999999999999,
          "end": 86.6,
          "en": "Now you create an array by adding square brackets and it can either be an empty array or of course an",
          "zh": "現在你藉由加方括號建立一個陣列，而它可以是一個空陣列，或當然是一個"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 86.6,
          "end": 92.21000000000001,
          "en": "array with some initial data and there, each element is separated from the other elements by a comma.",
          "zh": "有一些初始資料的陣列，而那裡每個元素用逗號和其他元素分開。"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 92.21000000000001,
          "end": 96.35,
          "en": "Typically you also add a whitespace to improve readability but that's not required,",
          "zh": "通常你也加一個空白來改善可讀性，但那不是必須的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 96.38,
          "end": 98.59,
          "en": "the comma however is required.",
          "zh": "然而逗號是必須的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 98.87,
          "end": 103.85,
          "en": "Now here, I want to have an empty array though because initially we have no log entry, so therefore",
          "zh": "現在這裡我想要一個空陣列，因為一開始我們沒有紀錄項目，所以因此"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 103.85,
          "end": 106.64,
          "en": "we can create it just like this.",
          "zh": "我們可以就這樣建立它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 106.64,
          "end": 112.55,
          "en": "Now if we want to add a log entry, let's say when we click the add button here, we could say we go down",
          "zh": "現在如果我們想加一個紀錄項目，讓我們說當我們在這裡點 add 按鈕時，我們可以說我們往下"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 112.55,
          "end": 118.58,
          "en": "there and now we want to edit this array and add a new entry.",
          "zh": "到那裡，而現在我們想編輯這個陣列並加一個新項目。"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 118.65,
          "end": 120.47,
          "en": "Now how can we do that?",
          "zh": "現在我們怎麼做那個？"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 121.2,
          "end": 127.29,
          "en": "Well we can refer to log entries and now previously we always assign a new value by setting this equal",
          "zh": "嗯，我們可以參考 logEntries，而現在先前我們永遠指派一個新值，藉由把這個設成等於"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 127.29,
          "end": 128.4,
          "en": "to a new value.",
          "zh": "一個新值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 128.4,
          "end": 131.55,
          "en": "Now of course, we can set it equal to a new value here as well",
          "zh": "現在當然，我們也可以在這裡把它設成等於一個新值，"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 131.64,
          "end": 136.82999999999998,
          "en": "and here the new value would be a new array because I want to overwrite the existing empty array and",
          "zh": "而這裡新值會是一個新陣列，因為我想覆寫既有的空陣列，而"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 136.82999999999998,
          "end": 143.74,
          "en": "therefore of course we could also leave this uninitialized with a new array which now includes let's",
          "zh": "因此我們當然也可以把這個初始化成一個新陣列，它現在包含，讓我們"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 143.74,
          "end": 145.75,
          "en": "say the entered number,",
          "zh": "說，輸入的數字，"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 146.02,
          "end": 146.26,
          "en": "right?",
          "zh": "對吧？"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 146.26,
          "end": 154.6,
          "en": "So now, we set this to a new array, a new list of data with one element and that one element is this entered",
          "zh": "所以現在，我們把這個設成一個新陣列、一份有一個元素的新資料清單，而那一個元素是這個輸入的"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 154.6,
          "end": 159.01,
          "en": "number which we have. Now that's one way of editing an array,",
          "zh": "數字，我們有的。現在那是編輯陣列的一種方式，"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 159.05,
          "end": 164.66,
          "en": "we basically overwrite the array stored in the variable with a brand new array and sometimes that's",
          "zh": "我們基本上用一個全新的陣列覆寫存在變數裡的陣列，而有時那"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 164.66,
          "end": 169.18,
          "en": "just what you need but sometimes you also want to edit the existing one",
          "zh": "正是你需要的，但有時你也想編輯既有的那個，"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 169.46,
          "end": 173.76,
          "en": "and for that, let's reinitialize this to an empty array up there,",
          "zh": "而為此，讓我們在上面那裡把這個重新初始化成一個空陣列，"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 173.84,
          "end": 176.59,
          "en": "let's say we want to add a new element to this existing array,",
          "zh": "讓我們說我們想把一個新元素加到這個既有的陣列，"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 176.6,
          "end": 182.42,
          "en": "for that we can reach out to this array and not assign a new value with the equal sign but instead use",
          "zh": "為此我們可以連到這個陣列，而不是用等號指派一個新值，而是使用"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 182.42,
          "end": 189.74,
          "en": "a dot to use a function that belongs to the array so to say and there, there's a specific function built",
          "zh": "一個點，來使用一個屬於陣列的函式，可以說，而那裡有一個特定函式，內建"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 189.74,
          "end": 192.72,
          "en": "into Javascript and that's the push function.",
          "zh": "在 JavaScript 裡，而那是 push 函式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 192.71,
          "end": 198.35,
          "en": "Now actually, arrays have way more than just a push function and I have a whole module dedicated to arrays",
          "zh": "現在實際上，陣列有比只有一個 push 函式多得多的東西，而我有一整個模組專門講陣列，"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 198.56,
          "end": 204.05,
          "en": "where we dive way deeper into them, for now let's focus on the push function. The push function does what",
          "zh": "我們在那裡深入它們多得多，目前讓我們聚焦 push 函式。push 函式做"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 204.05,
          "end": 210.89,
          "en": "the name implies, it pushes a new element onto this array, so it adds a new element to the list and there",
          "zh": "名稱暗示的事，它把一個新元素推進這個陣列，所以它把一個新元素加到清單，而那裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 210.89,
          "end": 213.7,
          "en": "we could say that should be the entered number.",
          "zh": "我們可以說那應該是輸入的數字。"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 214.1,
          "end": 217.18,
          "en": "Now it would be kind of neat to see that array",
          "zh": "現在看到那個陣列會有點不錯，"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 217.4,
          "end": 221.79,
          "en": "and for now we can do something which you will often do during development,",
          "zh": "而目前我們可以做一件你在開發時常常會做的事，"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 221.99,
          "end": 229.49,
          "en": "you can add console log here and that's a built-in functionality built into Javascript, a built-in command",
          "zh": "你可以在這裡加 console.log，而那是內建在 JavaScript 裡的內建功能、一個內建指令，"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 229.52,
          "end": 236.69,
          "en": "which the browser understand which allows you to output something into that development console, into",
          "zh": "瀏覽器理解它，讓你能把某樣東西輸出到那個開發主控台，到"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 236.69,
          "end": 237.28,
          "en": "the console",
          "zh": "主控台，"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 237.29,
          "end": 241.93,
          "en": "which you see in the developer tools where we previously saw some errors.",
          "zh": "你在開發者工具裡看到的，我們先前在那裡看到一些錯誤。"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 241.93,
          "end": 246.36,
          "en": "Now here we're not outputting an error but an information log message",
          "zh": "現在這裡我們不是在輸出一個錯誤，而是一個資訊紀錄訊息，"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 246.44,
          "end": 253.13,
          "en": "and here we can for example log the log entries, so the value that's currently in that variable, which",
          "zh": "而這裡我們可以例如紀錄 logEntries，所以目前在那個變數裡的值，那"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 253.13,
          "end": 255.8,
          "en": "should be that array with one extra element",
          "zh": "應該是那個多一個元素的陣列，"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 255.86,
          "end": 260.48,
          "en": "if we run this for the first time and after the second click, it should have two elements because we",
          "zh": "如果我們第一次跑這個，而在第二次點擊之後，它應該有兩個元素，因為我們"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 260.54,
          "end": 263.06,
          "en": "always push a new one.",
          "zh": "永遠推進一個新的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 263.11,
          "end": 269.53,
          "en": "Let's see, let's save that, open the developer tools in your browser and go to the console there, reload",
          "zh": "讓我們看，讓我們存那個，在你的瀏覽器裡打開開發者工具，並到那裡的主控台，重新載入"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 269.53,
          "end": 274.7,
          "en": "the page and now enter any number you want and click on the plus",
          "zh": "頁面，而現在輸入任何你想要的數字並點加號，"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 274.81,
          "end": 276.88,
          "en": "and of course you see the result down there",
          "zh": "而你當然在下面那裡看到結果，"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 276.90999999999997,
          "end": 280.03,
          "en": "but more interesting than that, you see this thing on the right here,",
          "zh": "但比那個更有趣的是，你在右邊這裡看到這個東西，"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 280.06,
          "end": 281.83,
          "en": "that is your array",
          "zh": "那是你的陣列，"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 281.83,
          "end": 289.15,
          "en": "and if I add another value, so if I click the plus again, you see now this is the new log, this now is",
          "zh": "而如果我加另一個值，所以如果我再點加號，你現在看到這是新的紀錄，這現在是"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 289.15,
          "end": 292.96,
          "en": "a new array or the old array with an extra element to be precise.",
          "zh": "一個新陣列，或精確地說是多一個元素的舊陣列。"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 292.96,
          "end": 295.81,
          "en": "You see we have two elements and they're separated by commas,",
          "zh": "你看到我們有兩個元素，而它們用逗號分開，"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 295.81,
          "end": 297.15999999999997,
          "en": "in this case two numbers",
          "zh": "在這個情況是兩個數字，"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 297.18,
          "end": 302.14,
          "en": "but again you could store any data in the array and therefore that's what we have in there",
          "zh": "但再次，你可以在陣列裡儲存任何資料，因此那是我們在裡面有的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 302.23,
          "end": 309.01,
          "en": "and this is a great way of keeping track of multiple items, multiple pieces of data that are kind of",
          "zh": "而這是追蹤多個項目、多塊資料的好方式，它們某種程度上"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 309.01,
          "end": 317.28,
          "en": "belonging together and that should be managed as a list of data. Now if you want to read from the array",
          "zh": "屬於一起，而應該被當成一份資料清單管理。現在如果你想從陣列讀取，"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 317.59,
          "end": 323.29,
          "en": "in the sense of not logging it entirely but let's say you want to extract the first element that's in",
          "zh": "意思不是把整個紀錄下來，而是讓我們說你想取出在那裡的第一個元素，"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 323.29,
          "end": 323.68,
          "en": "there,",
          "zh": "那裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 323.68,
          "end": 326.59,
          "en": "so the five in this case,",
          "zh": "所以這個情況的 5，"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 326.59,
          "end": 333.03,
          "en": "well then you can also do that. If you want to access a specific element in the array,",
          "zh": "嗯，那麼你也可以那樣做。如果你想存取陣列裡的一個特定元素，"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 333.04,
          "end": 337.63,
          "en": "you do this by adding square brackets after the variable name",
          "zh": "你藉由在變數名稱之後加方括號來做這個，"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 337.63,
          "end": 344.3,
          "en": "if you access the variable, so in a place where you want to get or read the variable, you can also",
          "zh": "如果你存取變數，所以在你想取得或讀取變數的地方，你也可以"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 344.33,
          "end": 345.82,
          "en": "add square brackets thereafter",
          "zh": "在那之後加方括號，"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 345.84000000000003,
          "end": 354.29,
          "en": "and now in there, you add the index, so the position so to say, of the element you want to extract. Now",
          "zh": "而現在在裡面，你加索引，所以可以說位置，你想取出的元素的。現在"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 354.29,
          "end": 360.86,
          "en": "you could think that you add one here if you want to read the first value but this will actually not",
          "zh": "你可能想你在這裡加 1，如果你想讀第一個值，但這實際上不會"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 361.1,
          "end": 368.06,
          "en": "work because and that's just something you have to know but thankfully it's the case in pretty much all",
          "zh": "有效，因為，而那只是你必須知道的某樣東西，但幸好在幾乎所有"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 368.09,
          "end": 371.26,
          "en": "programming languages or in most programming languages,",
          "zh": "程式語言裡、或在大多數程式語言裡都是這樣，"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 371.45,
          "end": 381.35,
          "en": "arrays are zero-based or their index is zero-based, which means the first element in an array has",
          "zh": "陣列是從零開始的，或它們的索引是從零開始的，意思是陣列裡的第一個元素有"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 381.35,
          "end": 383.14,
          "en": "an index of zero.",
          "zh": "索引零。"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 383.15,
          "end": 389.72,
          "en": "So if you want to access specifically the first element, you want to retrieve that, to work with it, then",
          "zh": "所以如果你想專門存取第一個元素，你想取出那個、和它一起工作，那麼"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 389.72,
          "end": 397.32,
          "en": "you do this with this square bracket notation and then with index zero. Index one would refer to the",
          "zh": "你用這個方括號記法做這個，然後用索引零。索引一會指"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 397.32,
          "end": 402.21,
          "en": "second element, index two to the third, well and so on and index zero",
          "zh": "第二個元素，索引二指第三個，嗯，以此類推，而索引零"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 402.21,
          "end": 407.48,
          "en": "therefore to the first one, that's just how it works in many programming languages.",
          "zh": "因此指第一個，那只是它在許多程式語言裡運作的方式。"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 407.48,
          "end": 413.42,
          "en": "So now what we should see when we log this is that we don't log the entire array but a single value",
          "zh": "所以現在當我們紀錄這個時我們該看到的是，我們不是紀錄整個陣列，而是陣列的一個單一值，"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 413.42,
          "end": 415.34000000000003,
          "en": "of the array, to be precise",
          "zh": "精確地說，"
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 415.34000000000003,
          "end": 418.51,
          "en": "always the first element in the array.",
          "zh": "永遠是陣列裡的第一個元素。"
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 418.52,
          "end": 425.15,
          "en": "So if I now reload this and now I add let's say six here, you see a log six, not as an array so without",
          "zh": "所以如果我現在重新載入這個，而現在我在這裡加，讓我們說，6，你看到紀錄 6，不是作為陣列，所以沒有"
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 425.15,
          "end": 429.98,
          "en": "the square brackets but just a number because that's what we're retrieving and retrieving by the way",
          "zh": "方括號，而只是一個數字，因為那是我們在取出的，而取出順便說"
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 429.98,
          "end": 431.99,
          "en": "does not mean that we destroy the array,",
          "zh": "不表示我們毀掉陣列，"
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 432.05,
          "end": 434.39,
          "en": "it's still there, it's still managed in memory,",
          "zh": "它仍然在那裡，它仍然在記憶體裡被管理，"
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 434.39,
          "end": 439.49,
          "en": "I'm just reading a single value from there because that's also something you need quite often in programming,",
          "zh": "我只是從那裡讀一個單一值，因為那也是你在程式設計裡相當常常需要的某樣東西，"
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 439.62,
          "end": 441.05,
          "en": "that you have a list of data",
          "zh": "你有一份資料清單，"
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 441.08,
          "end": 446.17,
          "en": "but then for a specific operation, you want to work with one specific entry of that list",
          "zh": "但然後對一個特定運算，你想和那份清單的一個特定項目一起工作，"
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 446.21,
          "end": 451.06,
          "en": "and again as so often, we'll of course also see examples for that throughout the course.",
          "zh": "而再次，如常常那樣，我們當然也會在整門課程裡看到那個的例子。"
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 451.1,
          "end": 456.02,
          "en": "So that's how you can add a new element to an array, by the way if you would try to read the second",
          "zh": "所以那是你怎麼把一個新元素加到陣列，順便說，如果你會試著讀第二個"
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 456.02,
          "end": 456.4,
          "en": "element,",
          "zh": "元素，"
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 456.40999999999997,
          "end": 462.47,
          "en": "so the one with index one here, we would actually get an error here in this code because when I reload",
          "zh": "所以這裡索引一的那個，我們實際上會在這段程式碼裡得到一個錯誤，因為當我重新載入"
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 462.47,
          "end": 466.63,
          "en": "this, when I add a new element here, you see I now get undefined,",
          "zh": "這個，當我在這裡加一個新元素，你看到我現在得到 undefined，"
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 466.64,
          "end": 472.19,
          "en": "so not an error technically but also not the value we expected because of course this already fires,",
          "zh": "所以技術上不是錯誤，但也不是我們預期的值，因為這當然已經觸發，"
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 472.19,
          "end": 473.92,
          "en": "for the first element we add it,",
          "zh": "對我們加上的第一個元素，"
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 473.93,
          "end": 479.33,
          "en": "so when I clicked the button for the first time and there we simply have no second element in the array",
          "zh": "所以當我第一次點按鈕時，而那裡我們單純沒有陣列裡的第二個元素，"
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 479.33,
          "end": 483.42,
          "en": "yet because we only added one value, so we pushed one value into the array,",
          "zh": "還沒有，因為我們只加了一個值，所以我們把一個值推進陣列，"
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 483.47,
          "end": 485.25,
          "en": "so there only is one value in there",
          "zh": "所以那裡面只有一個值，"
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 485.3,
          "end": 492.17,
          "en": "and as you learned, that one value has the index of zero, only after the second button click, we have two",
          "zh": "而如你學過的，那一個值的索引是零，只有在第二次按鈕點擊之後，我們有兩個"
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 492.17,
          "end": 497.33,
          "en": "values in there and then we can retrieve a value with index one which is the second element.",
          "zh": "值在裡面，然後我們可以取出索引一的值，那是第二個元素。"
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 497.63,
          "end": 502.3,
          "en": "So now if I add another element here, now this gets logged and if I had a third one,",
          "zh": "所以現在如果我在這裡加另一個元素，現在這個被紀錄，而如果我有第三個，"
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 502.43,
          "end": 507.26,
          "en": "I of course still get eleven logged here because I still extract the second element and that's still",
          "zh": "我這裡當然仍然得到 11 被紀錄，因為我仍然取出第二個元素，而那仍然"
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 507.26,
          "end": 510.12,
          "en": "the element we added on the second click.",
          "zh": "是我們在第二次點擊加上的元素。"
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 510.14,
          "end": 513.12,
          "en": "So that's arrays, we can manage lists of data with them,",
          "zh": "所以那是陣列，我們可以用它們管理資料清單，"
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 513.14,
          "end": 517.83,
          "en": "there is way more we can do with them than just push and access single elements",
          "zh": "我們可以用它們做的比只是 push 和存取單一元素多得多，"
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 517.88,
          "end": 523.19,
          "en": "but again that's also something we'll gradually learn throughout the course because we also need some other",
          "zh": "但再次，那也是我們會在整門課程裡逐步學的某樣東西，因為我們也需要一些其他"
