          "en": "some other pieces of knowledge before we can fully unleash their power.",
          "zh": "一些其他知識，在我們能完全釋放它們的力量之前。"
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 527.61,
          "end": 531.14,
          "en": "There are already quite nice like this though to manage lists of data.",
          "zh": "不過它們像這樣已經相當不錯，用來管理資料清單。"
