      "sourceHash": "3380c47b28301fda218aafb4ba81ea8c90bc7f81c8104352bbd5cd62e3ba0ef5",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.49,
          "end": 4.08,
          "en": "So that's arrays,",
          "zh": "所以那是陣列，"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.08,
          "end": 6,
          "en": "what about objects?",
          "zh": "物件呢？"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6,
          "end": 12.78,
          "en": "As I mentioned, objects are great for grouping data together and you create objects with curly braces",
          "zh": "如我提到的，物件很適合把資料分組在一起，而你用大括號建立物件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 12.78,
          "end": 18.72,
          "en": "here and then you can have multiple key-value pairs separated by commas in them.",
          "zh": "這裡，然後你可以在裡面有多個用逗號分開的鍵值對。"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 18.72,
          "end": 24.96,
          "en": "So let's create an object, let's say we don't just want to add the number which we added to our log but",
          "zh": "所以讓我們建立一個物件，讓我們說我們不只想把我們加到紀錄的數字加上，而是"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 24.96,
          "end": 30.81,
          "en": "a more detailed log information package if you will because the number alone of course doesn't tell",
          "zh": "一份更詳細的紀錄資訊包，如果你願意，因為數字本身當然沒告訴"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 30.81,
          "end": 31.41,
          "en": "us much,",
          "zh": "我們太多，"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 31.41,
          "end": 35.34,
          "en": "it would be interesting to log the result before we added the number,",
          "zh": "紀錄我們加上數字之前的結果會很有趣，"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 35.34,
          "end": 41.52,
          "en": "the operation itself so that we can add items to the log not just here but on all these functions and",
          "zh": "運算本身，這樣我們不只在這裡、而是在所有這些函式上都能把項目加到紀錄，而"
