        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 41.52,
          "end": 47.91,
          "en": "we can then just attach the information, whether that was an addition or a subtraction operation and therefore,",
          "zh": "我們接著可以只附上資訊，那是加法還是減法運算，因此，"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 47.94,
          "end": 52.53,
          "en": "we need a more complex piece of data that we manage in the list.",
          "zh": "我們需要一塊更複雜的資料，我們在清單裡管理的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 52.53,
          "end": 59.49,
          "en": "This is a great scenario for objects because now we need to manage multiple pieces of data that are",
          "zh": "這是物件的好場景，因為現在我們需要管理多塊資料，它們"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 59.49,
          "end": 68.52,
          "en": "kind of related and these pieces of data then in turn are managed as a list of these pieces of data",
          "zh": "某種程度上相關，而這些資料塊接著被當成這些資料塊的清單管理，"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 68.55,
          "end": 71.03999999999999,
          "en": "because we have multiple such actions.",
          "zh": "因為我們有多個這樣的動作。"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 71.03999999999999,
          "end": 77.4,
          "en": "So here, we could add a new constant let's say because I never plan on editing this which I'll name log",
          "zh": "所以這裡，我們可以加一個新常數，讓我們說，因為我從不打算編輯這個，我會把它命名為 log"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 77.43,
          "end": 83.52,
          "en": "entry and this should hold such an object, which you as you learned create by adding opening and closing curly",
