          "start": 83.52,
          "end": 84.72,
          "en": "braces.",
          "zh": "號來建立。"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 84.72,
          "end": 90.66,
          "en": "Now of course we also use curly braces here for creating the function but that's different, here",
          "zh": "現在我們這裡當然也用大括號來建立函式，但那不同，這裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 90.84,
          "end": 95.64,
          "en": "we use that after the function keyword, after the name of the function and the list of parameters,",
