          "id": 20,
          "start": 95.64,
          "end": 98.69,
          "en": "this is a pattern Javascript detects which tells it",
          "zh": "這是 JavaScript 偵測到的一個模式，它告訴它"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 98.91,
          "end": 103.85,
          "en": "these curly braces should now hold the function body. On the other hand here,",
          "zh": "這些大括號現在應該持有函式本體。另一方面，這裡，"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 103.86,
          "end": 106.41,
          "en": "we have no function keyword and nothing like that.",
          "zh": "我們沒有 function 關鍵字，也沒有類似的東西。"
