        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 106.41,
          "end": 111.91,
          "en": "Therefore this tells Javascript, since it's on the right side of the equal sign where you always define",
          "zh": "因此這告訴 JavaScript，因為它在等號的右邊，你永遠在那裡定義"
