          "start": 116.16,
          "end": 119.43,
          "en": "this tells Javascript OK, you want to create an object.",
          "zh": "這告訴 JavaScript，好，你想建立一個物件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 119.43,
          "end": 125.25,
          "en": "Now you can create an object like this, an empty object but that's not too useful arguably.",
          "zh": "現在你可以像這樣建立一個物件，一個空物件，但那可以說不太有用。"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 125.76,
          "end": 132.93,
          "en": "Now what you can do instead of course is you can add key-value pairs, so pairs of identifiers and values",
