          "start": 132.99,
          "end": 135.94,
          "en": "which you store in these identifiers.",
          "zh": "你存在這些識別名稱裡的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 135.96,
          "end": 139.07,
          "en": "Now often you will write object across multiple lines,",
          "zh": "現在你常常會跨多行寫物件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 139.11,
          "end": 140.35,
          "en": "that's not required,",
          "zh": "那不是必須的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 140.37,
          "end": 143.76,
          "en": "you can do it all in one line just for readability sake,",
          "zh": "你可以全放在一行，只為了可讀性，"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 143.75,
          "end": 150.32,
          "en": "often you split it across multiple lines and then you can also of course indent to make it more readable",
          "zh": "常常你把它拆成多行，然後你當然也可以縮排，讓它更易讀，"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 150.32999999999998,
          "end": 157.11,
          "en": "and here you could for example add a let's say operation key, the key names are totally up to you,",
          "zh": "而這裡你例如可以加一個，讓我們說，operation 鍵，鍵名完全由你決定，"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 157.11,
          "end": 162.07999999999998,
          "en": "you could name this op or operation or whatever you want and then separated with a colon,",
          "zh": "你可以把它命名為 op 或 operation 或任何你想要的，然後用冒號分開，"
