          "id": 55,
          "start": 249.99,
          "end": 256.41,
          "en": "and here I would simply use current result because we change current result here which means two lines",
          "zh": "而這裡我會單純使用 currentResult，因為我們在這裡改變 currentResult，意思是兩行"
