          "end": 32.93,
          "en": "we call create and write output.",
          "zh": "我們呼叫 createAndWriteOutput。"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 32.94,
          "end": 38.96,
          "en": "Now why don't we create a similar function for creating our log?",
