          "start": 242.98,
          "end": 248.34,
          "en": "and of course do the same here for the division and add divide as an identifier",
          "zh": "而當然在這裡對除法做同樣的事，並加 divide 作為識別名稱，"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 248.5,
          "end": 255.7,
          "en": "and now we're reusing this write to log function to create our log object with different dynamic data",
          "zh": "而現在我們重複使用這個 writeToLog 函式，用不同的動態資料建立我們的紀錄物件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 255.73,
          "end": 261.88,
          "en": "which we add in which we get as parameters in the function, which we then use to build that object which",
          "zh": "我們加進去的、我們在函式裡當參數得到的，然後我們用那些來建立那個物件，那是"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 261.88,
          "end": 265.7,
          "en": "we then add to our array, which we then log to the console.",
          "zh": "我們接著加到我們陣列的，我們接著紀錄到主控台的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 266.38,
          "end": 267.51,
          "en": "So let's give that a try,",
          "zh": "所以讓我們試那個，"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 267.52,
          "end": 271.28,
          "en": "let's save that and reload and now deduct five,",
          "zh": "讓我們存那個並重新載入，而現在減 5，"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 271.31,
          "end": 277.47,
          "en": "so with minus five here we have an entry in the array and we see the operation was subtract, previous result",
          "zh": "所以這裡用減 5，我們在陣列裡有一個項目，而我們看到運算是 subtract，先前結果"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 277.48,
          "end": 279.18,
          "en": "was zero, number",
          "zh": "是零，數字"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 279.28,
          "end": 282.72,
          "en": "now is five or was five, result is minus five.",
          "zh": "現在是 5，或曾經是 5，結果是負 5。"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 283.24,
          "end": 288.04,
          "en": "If I try to multiply this with seven, we get a new entry in the array,",
          "zh": "如果我試著把這個乘以 7，我們在陣列裡得到一個新項目，"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 288.13,
          "end": 289.17,
          "en": "this one is it.",
          "zh": "這個就是。"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 289.39,
          "end": 291,
          "en": "Previous result minus five,",
          "zh": "先前結果負 5，"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 291.01,
          "end": 292.69,
          "en": "number seven, we multiplied it",
          "zh": "數字 7，我們把它相乘，"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 292.69,
          "end": 295.59000000000003,
          "en": "so the new result is minus 35",
          "zh": "所以新結果是負 35，"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 295.65,
          "end": 304.95,
          "en": "and now if I divide this by let's say 2, we got a new output here. Divide, number is two, previous result",
          "zh": "而現在如果我把這個除以，讓我們說，2，我們這裡得到一個新輸出。divide，數字是 2，先前結果"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 304.95,
          "end": 308.34,
          "en": "is minus 35,",
          "zh": "是負 35，"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 308.8,
          "end": 313.64,
          "en": "therefore the new result is therefore half of that minus 17.5.",
          "zh": "因此新結果因此是那個的一半，負 17.5。"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 313.69,
          "end": 318.85,
          "en": "So that all seems to work, we're able to log that, we're able to reuse that logic and we're able to do",
          "zh": "所以那全部似乎有效，我們能夠紀錄那個，我們能夠重複使用那個邏輯，而我們能夠做"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 318.85,
          "end": 321.79,
          "en": "this basic work with our Javascript object here.",
          "zh": "這裡和我們 JavaScript 物件的這個基本工作。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "15853276",
      "title": "undefined, null & NaN",
      "lectureOrder": 48,
      "videoOrder": 39,
      "sourceHash": "b1839a00379ac081e36c24598f8db71e55c631010abcfe4cc120625b5a281056",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.29,
          "end": 9.34,
          "en": "With arrays, booleans, objects, numbers and strings, we had a look at the most important or almost all",
          "zh": "有了陣列、布林、物件、數字和字串，我們看過了最重要的，或幾乎全部"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 9.34,
          "end": 11.38,
          "en": "of the most important data types",
          "zh": "最重要的資料型別，"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 11.38,
          "end": 20.41,
          "en": "you have in Javascript but there are two additional important data types and one strange value which",
          "zh": "你在 JavaScript 裡有的，但還有兩個額外的重要資料型別，以及一個奇怪的值，它"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 20.41,
          "end": 25.67,
          "en": "looks like a data type and that would be null, undefined and NaN. Now what's that?",
          "zh": "看起來像一個資料型別，而那會是 null、undefined 和 NaN。現在那是什麼？"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 25.69,
          "end": 33.1,
          "en": "These are kind of special values, though null and undefined are both values and data types.",
          "zh": "這些某種程度上是特殊值，不過 null 和 undefined 既是值也是資料型別。"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 33.13,
          "end": 40.7,
          "en": "So what's the idea behind that? Undefined is the default value uninitialized variables have,",
          "zh": "那麼背後的想法是什麼？undefined 是未初始化變數擁有的預設值，"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 40.71,
          "end": 47.4,
          "en": "so if you create a variable and you don't assign a value at the beginning with the equal sign, then this",
          "zh": "所以如果你建立一個變數，而你一開始沒有用等號指派一個值，那麼這個"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 47.4,
          "end": 49.11,
          "en": "variable is undefined.",
          "zh": "變數是 undefined。"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 49.11,
          "end": 55.5,
          "en": "We also saw undefined in the log when we try to access an element in the array at an index where",
          "zh": "我們也在紀錄裡看過 undefined，當我們試著在一個索引存取陣列裡的元素，那裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 55.5,
          "end": 57.61,
          "en": "no element was created yet,",
          "zh": "還沒有元素被建立，"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 57.69,
          "end": 63.74,
          "en": "then we tried to access an element which wasn't there and therefore we got back a value of undefined.",
          "zh": "那時我們試著存取一個不在那裡的元素，因此我們得到一個 undefined 的值。"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 63.9,
          "end": 70.56,
          "en": "So that's a value, it's a value that indicates that nothing's there but at the same time, it's also a separate",
          "zh": "所以那是一個值，它是一個值，表示那裡什麼都沒有，但同時，它也是一個分開的"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 70.56,
          "end": 71.46000000000001,
          "en": "data type.",
          "zh": "資料型別。"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 71.46000000000001,
          "end": 78.3,
          "en": "So just like numbers and strings are a data type, undefined is also a data type actually. Now you should",
          "zh": "所以就像數字和字串是一種資料型別，undefined 實際上也是一種資料型別。現在你應該"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 78.3,
          "end": 81.6,
          "en": "never assign undefined to a value on your own,",
          "zh": "永遠不要自己把 undefined 指派給一個值，"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 81.6,
          "end": 88.8,
          "en": "so never write equals undefined because that's just a default value you have if something has never",
          "zh": "所以永遠不要寫等於 undefined，因為那只是一個預設值，如果某樣東西從來"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 88.8,
          "end": 90.47,
          "en": "been assigned a value.",
          "zh": "沒被指派過一個值，你就有的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 90.51,
          "end": 96.42,
          "en": "Now you could have cases in your code where you indeed get something, where you're not sure if it's undefined",
          "zh": "現在你的程式碼裡可能有情況，你確實得到某樣東西，你不確定它是不是 undefined，"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 96.42,
          "end": 101.94,
          "en": "or not and later you will learn how you can check whether a value is defined or undefined but it's",
          "zh": "而稍後你會學你怎麼檢查一個值是已定義還是 undefined，但"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 101.94,
          "end": 104.38,
          "en": "already important to be aware of this type.",
          "zh": "已經重要的是要知道這個型別。"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 104.58,
          "end": 108.78999999999999,
          "en": "Now related to this, there is the null value and type.",
          "zh": "現在和這個相關的，有 null 值和型別。"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 108.78,
          "end": 116.28,
          "en": "Now it's very similar to undefined, it means that there is no data but undefined is the default value",
          "zh": "現在它和 undefined 非常相似，它表示沒有資料，但 undefined 是預設值，"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 116.28,
          "end": 123,
          "en": "for variables and so on where you never assigned a new value. Null is never a default value on the other",
          "zh": "給變數等等，你從來沒指派過一個新值的地方。null 永遠不是預設值，"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 123,
          "end": 123.34,
          "en": "hand,",
          "zh": "另一方面，"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 123.34,
          "end": 127.25,
          "en": "instead you have to set something to null to use that value",
          "zh": "相反你必須把某樣東西設成 null 來使用那個值，"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 127.68,
          "end": 133.5,
          "en": "and that's often used if you want to reset or clear a variable, let's say you have some user input",
          "zh": "而那常常被使用，如果你想重設或清除一個變數，讓我們說你有一些使用者輸入，"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 133.5,
          "end": 135.06,
          "en": "and you want to reset this,",
          "zh": "而你想重設這個，"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 135.09,
          "end": 141.3,
          "en": "you could set it to an empty string but you could also set it to null for example, to make it clear in",
          "zh": "你可以把它設成一個空字串，但你也可以把它設成 null，例如，讓它在"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 141.3,
          "end": 147.44,
          "en": "your program that there currently shouldn't be a value because no value has been entered or whatever.",
          "zh": "你的程式裡清楚，目前不該有一個值，因為沒有值被輸入，或無論什麼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 147.9,
          "end": 154.05,
          "en": "And again this is especially useful later if we can also run some checks, some conditional checks with",
          "zh": "而再次，這在稍後特別有用，如果我們也能跑一些檢查、一些條件檢查，用"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 154.11,
          "end": 161.66,
          "en": "if statements to find out if a value is set and then do something or if it's not set. So undefined and null",
          "zh": "if 陳述來找出一個值是否已設定，然後做某件事，或如果它沒設定。所以 undefined 和 null"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 161.67000000000002,
          "end": 168.6,
          "en": "are important to manage empty data, either because it never was set or because you want to set it to",
          "zh": "對管理空資料很重要，不是因為它從來沒被設定，就是因為你想把它設成"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 168.87,
          "end": 170.57999999999998,
          "en": "empty, to null.",
          "zh": "空的、設成 null。"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 170.75,
          "end": 176.18,
          "en": "They're very similar but they're not entirely equal because of the reasons I explained.",
          "zh": "它們非常相似，但它們不完全相等，因為我解釋的那些理由。"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 176.23,
          "end": 182.9,
          "en": "Now there also is one other special value and that's NaN, that stands for not a number",
          "zh": "現在也有另一個特殊值，那是 NaN，那代表 not a number，"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 183.11,
          "end": 187.85,
          "en": "and technically, unlike undefined and null which also are their own types,",
          "zh": "而技術上，不像 undefined 和 null，它們也是自己的型別，"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 187.85,
          "end": 189.28,
          "en": "this is not a type,",
          "zh": "這不是一個型別，"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 189.29,
          "end": 190.25,
          "en": "instead it's of type",
          "zh": "相反它的型別是"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 190.25,
          "end": 197.14,
          "en": "number, it's not its own type and you can therefore use it in calculations where you work with numbers.",
          "zh": "number，它不是自己的型別，而你因此可以在你和數字一起工作的計算裡使用它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 197.15,
          "end": 201.87,
          "en": "Now the idea behind NaN is that it's kind of like an error code",
          "zh": "現在 NaN 背後的想法是，它某種程度上像一個錯誤碼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 202.04,
          "end": 208.34,
          "en": "if you run a calculation with something that doesn't include a number, so if you have let's say a multiplication",
          "zh": "如果你用某樣不包含數字的東西跑一個計算，所以如果你有，讓我們說，一個乘法，"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 208.34,
          "end": 213.02,
          "en": "with text or anything like that, then you would get not a number as a result",
          "zh": "用文字或任何類似的東西，那麼你會得到 not a number 作為結果，"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 213.02,
          "end": 219.66,
          "en": "and if you use the not a number value in that calculation, you also get not a number as a result.",
          "zh": "而如果你在那個計算裡使用 not a number 值，你也得到 not a number 作為結果。"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 219.82999999999998,
          "end": 225.29,
          "en": "So this yields not a number if you use it in calculations and it's the result of calculations that are",
          "zh": "所以如果你在計算裡使用它，這產生 not a number，而它是計算的結果，那些是"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 225.29,
          "end": 226.25,
          "en": "invalid.",
          "zh": "無效的。"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 226.25,
          "end": 230.95,
          "en": "Now you might wonder why you would ever run an invalid calculation,",
          "zh": "現在你可能想知道你為什麼會跑一個無效的計算，"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 230.96,
          "end": 235.19,
          "en": "keep in mind that Javascript allows you to write highly dynamic code.",
          "zh": "記住 JavaScript 讓你能寫高度動態的程式碼。"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 235.19,
          "end": 242.12,
          "en": "So like in the case of our calculator here, you could have a calculator where users can enter any value,",
          "zh": "所以像我們這裡計算機的情況，你可以有一個計算機，使用者可以輸入任何值，"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 242.27,
          "end": 249.35,
          "en": "where they are maybe not forced to enter a number and where therefore you could run a calculation with",
          "zh": "他們也許不被強迫輸入一個數字，因此你可能用"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 249.35,
          "end": 251.78,
          "en": "some user input which is not a number",
          "zh": "某個不是數字的使用者輸入跑一個計算，"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 251.78,
          "end": 255.07,
          "en": "and then you could get such a not a number result.",
          "zh": "然後你可能得到這樣一個 not a number 結果。"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 255.08,
          "end": 261.05,
          "en": "Again this is most useful if you also have the abilities of comparing it or of checking it with some",
          "zh": "再次，這在你也有能力比較它、或用某個"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 261.08,
          "end": 264.7,
          "en": "if statement to run some code if you get such an invalid result",
          "zh": "if 陳述檢查它、在你得到這樣一個無效結果時跑一些程式碼時，最有用，"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 264.86,
          "end": 270.73,
          "en": "but it is worth being aware of this type. Now to quickly give you an idea of these types,",
          "zh": "但值得知道這個型別。現在為了快速給你這些型別的概念，"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 270.73,
          "end": 276.07,
          "en": "let's clear that Javascript console here because here we also can type some Javascript code which runs",
          "zh": "讓我們清掉這裡的 JavaScript 主控台，因為這裡我們也可以打一些 JavaScript 程式碼，它立刻"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 276.13,
          "end": 278.35,
          "en": "immediately, which is immediately evaluated",
          "zh": "跑，它立刻被求值，"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 278.35,
          "end": 284.11,
          "en": "and here I want to show you these three types I just talked about. Let's create a variable here,",
          "zh": "而這裡我想給你看我剛談的這三個型別。讓我們在這裡建立一個變數，"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 284.11,
          "end": 288.4,
          "en": "userName maybe and not set this equal to anything, just like this,",
          "zh": "也許 userName，而不把這個設成等於任何東西，就這樣，"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 288.4,
          "end": 291.52,
          "en": "so we declare it but we don't initialize it.",
          "zh": "所以我們宣告它，但我們不初始化它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 291.52,
          "end": 298.29,
          "en": "If we now hit enter, you see undefined here because that's the return value of this execution here",
          "zh": "如果我們現在按 Enter，你看到這裡是 undefined，因為那是這裡這個執行的回傳值，"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 298.33,
          "end": 300.4,
          "en": "but if you now write console log",
          "zh": "但如果你現在寫 console.log"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 300.42,
          "end": 301.61,
          "en": "userName",
          "zh": "userName，"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 301.69,
          "end": 306.37,
          "en": "or actually here in the console you can just write userName and it will automatically log into the",
          "zh": "或實際上在這裡的主控台，你可以只寫 userName，而它會自動紀錄到"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 306.37,
          "end": 311.45,
          "en": "console, you'll see the value that's in there and that's also undefined.",
          "zh": "主控台，你會看到在裡面的值，而那也是 undefined。"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 311.47,
          "end": 317.32,
          "en": "Now of course if I now assign a value like Max and I print this, you see",
          "zh": "現在當然，如果我現在指派一個值，像 Max，而我印出這個，你看到"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 317.35,
          "end": 319.46,
          "en": "Max here, it also showed it here.",
          "zh": "這裡是 Max，它也在這裡顯示了它。"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 320.38,
          "end": 324.84,
          "en": "So that's one thing, we got undefined if we haven't set this to a value yet.",
          "zh": "所以那是一件事，如果我們還沒把這個設成一個值，我們得到 undefined。"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 324.85,
          "end": 330.37,
          "en": "Now if we would want to reset this, as I mentioned you should never do this,",
          "zh": "現在如果我們想重設這個，如我提到的，你永遠不該做這個，"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 330.37,
          "end": 333.64,
          "en": "technically this would work but this is not recommended,",
          "zh": "技術上這會有效，但這不被建議，"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 333.64,
          "end": 336.34000000000003,
          "en": "instead you should set this to null now,",
          "zh": "相反你現在應該把這個設成 null，"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 336.34000000000003,
          "end": 344.31,
          "en": "this other special value and if you do that and you have a look into userName now, you see this indeed",
          "zh": "這個另一個特殊值，而如果你那樣做，並現在看 userName，你看到這個確實"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 344.4,
          "end": 348.40999999999997,
          "en": "is null. Now for the not a number example,",
          "zh": "是 null。現在對 not a number 的例子，"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 348.52,
          "end": 357.74,
          "en": "if you run three times hi here, you see the result is not a number. If you run three times not a number",
          "zh": "如果你在這裡跑 3 乘 hi，你看到結果是 not a number。如果你跑 3 乘 not a number，"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 357.77,
          "end": 359.98,
          "en": "which is also a special value written like this,",
          "zh": "那也是一個像這樣寫的特殊值，"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 360.02,
          "end": 361.85,
          "en": "you also get another number.",
          "zh": "你也得到 not a number。"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 361.88,
          "end": 368.84,
          "en": "So these are the special types which, for now, you should just keep in memory somewhere and which we'll",
          "zh": "所以這些是特殊型別，目前，你應該只把它們記在記憶裡某個地方，而我們會"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 368.84,
          "end": 374.66,
          "en": "come back to throughout the course when we'll be able to check for whether a variable has a value or",
          "zh": "在整門課程裡回到它們，當我們能夠檢查一個變數是否有一個值，或"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 374.66,
          "end": 375.16,
          "en": "not,",
          "zh": "沒有，"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 375.17,
          "end": 377.93,
          "en": "for now just loosely keep these values in mind.",
          "zh": "目前只是鬆鬆記住這些值。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "15853280",
      "title": "The \"typeof\" Operator",
      "lectureOrder": 49,
      "videoOrder": 40,
      "sourceHash": "3da0becf98b0f6940fa7012259f97c821c5e9c43a89a55062bbf66cb2e88ba1b",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.63,
          "end": 9.86,
          "en": "Now that we had a thorough look at these basic and very important types you can use in Javascript, these",
          "zh": "現在我們徹底看過這些基本且非常重要的型別，你可以在 JavaScript 裡使用的，這些"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 9.86,
          "end": 11.45,
          "en": "types of data, I",
          "zh": "資料的型別，我"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 11.66,
          "end": 16.01,
          "en": "want to show you a little keyword which you can use in your code here of course as well",
          "zh": "想給你看一個小關鍵字，你當然也可以在這裡的程式碼裡使用，"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 16.1,
          "end": 23.85,
          "en": "and that's the typeof keyword. The typeof keyword lets you evaluate the type of a variable at runtime.",
          "zh": "而那是 typeof 關鍵字。typeof 關鍵字讓你能在執行期求值一個變數的型別。"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 23.85,
          "end": 29.48,
          "en": "Now we could use it here but to quickly see the result, I'll just do it here in this console.",
          "zh": "現在我們可以在這裡使用它，但為了快速看到結果，我會只在這個主控台裡做。"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 29.48,
          "end": 35.78,
          "en": "You use it by typing typeof and then the name of the variable which you want to evaluate",
          "zh": "你藉由打 typeof，然後你想求值的變數名稱來使用它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 35.9,
          "end": 39.95,
          "en": "or of course just the hardcoded value like this string here.",
          "zh": "或當然只是寫死的值，像這裡這個字串。"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 39.95,
          "end": 46.14,
          "en": "So here if I run this, you see I get back a string which contains the name of the type I used,",
          "zh": "所以這裡如果我跑這個，你看到我得到一個字串，它包含我使用的型別名稱，"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 46.14,
          "end": 48.45,
          "en": "so here it's a string with the name string in it",
          "zh": "所以這裡它是一個字串，裡面有名稱 string，"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 48.53,
          "end": 49.91,
          "en": "and indeed that is the case here,",
          "zh": "而確實這裡情況就是那樣，"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 49.91,
          "end": 50.18,
          "en": "right,",
          "zh": "對吧，"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 50.18,
          "end": 51.5,
          "en": "that is a string.",
          "zh": "那是一個字串。"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 51.52,
          "end": 56.18,
          "en": "Now of course we could also use our userName variable which we initialized earlier, set this to Max",
          "zh": "現在我們當然也可以使用我們的 userName 變數，我們稍早初始化的，把這個設成 Max，"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 56.51,
          "end": 60.26,
          "en": "and check typeof userName here and we'd also get string,",
          "zh": "並在這裡檢查 typeof userName，而我們也會得到 string，"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 60.29,
          "end": 60.53,
          "en": "right.",
          "zh": "對吧。"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 60.53,
          "end": 66.26,
          "en": "So we can also use a variable here and you'll get the type of the value that's stored in the variable.",
          "zh": "所以我們也可以在這裡使用一個變數，而你會得到存在變數裡的值的型別。"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 66.26,
          "end": 71.57,
          "en": "Now we can of course also check the type of a number and you see it is number then, it's a string which",
          "zh": "現在我們當然也可以檢查一個數字的型別，而你看到那時它是 number，它是一個字串，"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 72.14,
          "end": 74.49,
          "en": "simply contains that description of the type,",
          "zh": "單純包含那個型別的描述，"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 74.5,
          "end": 76.61,
          "en": "so in this case number or the name of the type,",
          "zh": "所以在這個情況是 number，或型別的名稱，"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 76.64,
          "end": 82.46000000000001,
          "en": "so in this case number and that's the same no matter if we use an integer as here or a floating point",
          "zh": "所以在這個情況是 number，而那是一樣的，無論我們像這裡使用整數，或浮點"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 82.46000000000001,
          "end": 88.3,
          "en": "number as we do here. We also can check typeof true,",
          "zh": "數，如我們在這裡做的。我們也可以檢查 typeof true，"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 88.3,
          "end": 92.53,
          "en": "now we haven't really worked with true or false yet but these are these booleans I mentioned",
          "zh": "現在我們還沒真正和 true 或 false 一起工作，但這些是我提到的布林，"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 92.53,
          "end": 100.13,
          "en": "and hence of course it prints boolean here. We can also check the type of an array, like this and you",
          "zh": "因此它當然在這裡印出 boolean。我們也可以檢查陣列的型別，像這樣，而你"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 100.13,
          "end": 102.3,
          "en": "see here we actually get object and",
          "zh": "看到這裡我們實際上得到 object，而"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 102.35,
          "end": 110.14,
          "en": "that's interesting, an array is a very important feature, very technically though it's of type object,",
          "zh": "那很有趣，陣列是一個非常重要的功能，不過非常技術上它的型別是 object，"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 110.18,
          "end": 113.06,
          "en": "so there is no special array type.",
          "zh": "所以沒有特殊的 array 型別。"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 113.06,
          "end": 115.08,
          "en": "It's a special type of object if you will",
          "zh": "如果你願意，它是一種特殊的物件，"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 115.16,
          "end": 118.22,
          "en": "but the overall type is just object.",
          "zh": "但整體型別只是 object。"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 118.22,
          "end": 124.46,
          "en": "So thus far, we saw a string, number, boolean and now object. Now unsurprisingly,",
          "zh": "所以到目前為止，我們看到 string、number、boolean，而現在是 object。現在不令人意外，"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 124.46,
          "end": 128,
          "en": "if I check the type of an object which I create with curly braces here,",
          "zh": "如果我檢查一個物件的型別，我用大括號在這裡建立的，"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 131.6,
          "end": 134.37,
          "en": "I also see object being logged here.",
          "zh": "我也看到 object 在這裡被紀錄。"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 134.42,
          "end": 140.71,
          "en": "So they are of the same type and array is just a special type of object you could say. Now if we check",
          "zh": "所以它們是同一種型別，而陣列只是一種特殊的物件，你可以說。現在如果我們檢查"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 140.8,
          "end": 146.27,
          "en": "undefined, we see as I mentioned that this has its own type, undefined,",
          "zh": "undefined，我們看到如我提到的，這個有它自己的型別，undefined，"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 146.68,
          "end": 148.07999999999998,
          "en": "on the other hand null",
          "zh": "另一方面，null"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 148.15,
          "end": 150.02,
          "en": "is also just of type object,",
          "zh": "也只是型別 object，"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 150.04,
          "end": 156.72,
          "en": "so it also has a type, a special type which is not the same as undefined but it's not type null",
          "zh": "所以它也有一個型別，一個特殊型別，和 undefined 不一樣，但它不是型別 null，"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 156.76,
          "end": 158.47,
          "en": "but instead type object,",
          "zh": "而是型別 object，"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 158.5,
          "end": 165.87,
          "en": "so another special kind of object if you will. If you on the other hand check not a number written",
          "zh": "所以如果你願意，另一種特殊的物件。如果你另一方面檢查 not a number，寫成"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 165.87,
          "end": 167.78,
          "en": "like this, we see it's of type not a number,",
          "zh": "像這樣，我們看到它的型別是 number，"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 167.79,
          "end": 169.94,
          "en": "so this is not an object, this is not undefined,",
          "zh": "所以這不是一個物件，這不是 undefined，"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 169.95,
          "end": 171.44,
          "en": "this is not its own type,",
          "zh": "這不是它自己的型別，"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 171.45,
          "end": 173.81,
          "en": "this is a number instead.",
          "zh": "這反而是一個 number。"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 173.82,
          "end": 178.67000000000002,
          "en": "So typeof, quite nice here to get an understanding of which kind of data you're working with,",
          "zh": "所以 typeof，在這裡相當不錯，用來理解你正在一起工作的是哪種資料，"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 178.86,
          "end": 184.56,
          "en": "of course we'll see all these different types of data in action throughout this course and all the examples",
          "zh": "當然我們會在這整門課程裡看到所有這些不同的資料型別實際運作，以及所有"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 184.59,
          "end": 189.51,
          "en": "where we need to work with numbers, with strings, with arrays, with objects and so much more.",
          "zh": "我們需要和數字、字串、陣列、物件等等一起工作的例子。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "15853282",
      "title": "Importing Scripts Correctly with \"defer\" & \"async\"",
      "lectureOrder": 50,
      "videoOrder": 41,
      "sourceHash": "ac06c29120f55bfe2a4b4a3daf065a15841cedc8f651978bebb8830ae43217cf",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.33,
          "end": 9.5,
          "en": "Now to conclude this module, let's come back to something we actually started the module with and that's",
          "zh": "為了結束這個單元，我們回到這個單元一開始就碰到的主題，也就是"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 9.5,
          "end": 14.21,
          "en": "how we import our scripts into the HTML file.",
          "zh": "我們如何把腳本匯入 HTML 檔案。"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 14.24,
          "end": 19.76,
          "en": "I'm doing this here at the end of the body tag, at the end of the body section in the document and I'm",
          "zh": "我在這裡、也就是 body 標籤的結尾、文件 body 區段的最後面匯入，而我"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 19.76,
          "end": 28.28,
          "en": "doing it here because our scripts rely on the HTML page being rendered. We are accessing items in",
          "zh": "之所以放在這裡，是因為我們的腳本依賴已經渲染完成的 HTML 頁面。可以說，我們存取了"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 28.28,
          "end": 34.25,
          "en": "the page so to say, in the vendor file where I establish connections to the buttons and so on, to which",
          "zh": "頁面中的元素，例如在 vendor 檔案中我和按鈕等元素建立連結，"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 34.25,
          "end": 40.22,
          "en": "I then add event listeners here in the app.js file and in order to establish these connections, we",
          "zh": "接著在 app.js 檔案中為它們加上事件監聽器；為了建立這些連結，我們"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 40.22,
          "end": 47.78,
          "en": "need to run the scripts after the browser parsed and rendered all the HTML code, otherwise the buttons",
          "zh": "必須在瀏覽器解析並渲染完所有 HTML 程式碼之後才執行腳本，否則我們想連結的按鈕"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 47.78,
          "end": 51.38,
          "en": "to which we want to establish connections simply don't exist.",
          "zh": "根本還不存在。"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 52.04,
          "end": 55.13,
          "en": "So that's why I import the scripts down there.",
          "zh": "這就是我把腳本放在下面匯入的原因。"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 55.13,
          "end": 60.65,
          "en": "Now this is still not entirely optimal and let me show you why. For this,",
          "zh": "不過這仍然不是最理想的做法，我來說明原因。為此，"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 60.65,
          "end": 67.46,
          "en": "open your page here in a new incognito window here in Chrome and I simply use this incognito window here",
          "zh": "請在 Chrome 的新無痕視窗中開啟你的頁面；我之所以使用無痕視窗，"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 67.7,
          "end": 75.05,
          "en": "because this allows me to rule out that what I'm about to show you gets distorted by any extensions",
          "zh": "是因為這樣可以排除接下來要展示的內容被任何擴充功能"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 75.08,
          "end": 77.32,
          "en": "or browser plugins.",
          "zh": "或瀏覽器外掛干擾的可能。"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 77.39,
          "end": 82.22,
          "en": "So I opened the page here in Chrome, in the incognito window and now we can again open the developer",
          "zh": "我在 Chrome 的無痕視窗中開啟了頁面，現在可以再次打開開發者"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 82.22,
          "end": 89,
          "en": "tools which allow us to have a look behind the scenes and there, I increased them in size a little bit",
          "zh": "工具，讓我們看看幕後發生了什麼；我把視窗稍微放大一點，"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 89.3,
          "end": 92.00999999999999,
          "en": "and there you should go to this performance tab,",
          "zh": "接著你要切換到這個 Performance 分頁，"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 92.06,
          "end": 95.64,
          "en": "you can also click these arrows here if you don't find it here.",
          "zh": "如果在這裡找不到，也可以點這些箭頭。"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 95.87,
          "end": 97.99000000000001,
          "en": "Now what's the performance tab?",
          "zh": "那麼 Performance 分頁是什麼？"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 98.03,
          "end": 105.14,
          "en": "The performance tab allows us to get an idea of what the browser does in detail when it renders",
          "zh": "Performance 分頁能讓我們詳細了解瀏覽器在渲染"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 105.14,
          "end": 105.92,
          "en": "this page and",
          "zh": "這個頁面時做了哪些事情，"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 105.95,
          "end": 110.99000000000001,
          "en": "there are many things you can do with it but it's a great tool for understanding how the scripts are",
          "zh": "它的用途很多，但特別適合用來理解腳本是如何被"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 110.99000000000001,
          "end": 115.15,
          "en": "loaded, parsed and executed and what might be the issue here.",
          "zh": "載入、解析和執行的，以及可能有什麼問題。"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 115.16,
          "end": 123.38,
          "en": "So with the page being used here, press this record button here and then reload the page by using a",
          "zh": "在這個頁面上按下這個錄製按鈕，然後用快捷鍵或重新整理按鈕"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 123.38,
          "end": 127.75,
          "en": "shortcut for it or using the reload button and then stop recording this.",
          "zh": "重新載入頁面，再停止錄製。"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 127.79,
          "end": 132.32,
          "en": "Now you get this profile and this might look confusing at first,",
          "zh": "現在你會得到這份效能分析，一開始看起來可能有點混亂，"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 132.35,
          "end": 135.78,
          "en": "I'm only interested in a short part of this timeline.",
          "zh": "我只對時間軸中的一小段感興趣。"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 135.89,
          "end": 140.36,
          "en": "Now in this topmost window, you can select the part by holding the mouse button and dragging and I'm",
          "zh": "在最上方的視窗中，你可以按住滑鼠拖曳來選取區段，我"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 140.36,
          "end": 145.55,
          "en": "interested in this part where we have these little hills down there you could say, where you have these",
          "zh": "感興趣的是這一段，下面有一些小山丘，也就是這些"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 145.55,
          "end": 147.57999999999998,
          "en": "vertical lines.",
          "zh": "垂直線所在的地方。"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 147.61,
          "end": 153.89,
          "en": "Now if you select this, it gets zoomed in here in the middle and bottommost window and there, you see",
          "zh": "選取之後，中間和最下方的視窗就會放大這一段，在那裡你可以看到"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 153.89,
          "end": 157.76,
          "en": "which network requests were sent and what the browser did,",
          "zh": "送出了哪些網路請求，以及瀏覽器做了什麼，"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 157.76,
          "end": 161.64,
          "en": "so what it parsed, what it executed and so on.",
          "zh": "也就是它解析了什麼、執行了什麼等等。"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 161.66,
          "end": 166.96,
          "en": "Now what we can see relatively quickly is that we have one long going network request which downloads",
          "zh": "我們很快就能看出，有一個耗時很長的網路請求在下載"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 166.96,
          "end": 170.05,
          "en": "the fonts, this kind of distorts everything here",
          "zh": "字型，這有點干擾整體畫面，"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 170.06,
          "end": 176.63,
          "en": "so let me comment out this link here which does load the fonts to not have this distraction in here",
          "zh": "所以我把載入字型的這個 link 註解掉，免得造成干擾，"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 176.66,
          "end": 179.53,
          "en": "so that we can focus entirely on the scripts.",
          "zh": "讓我們能完全專注在腳本上。"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 179.75,
          "end": 185.69,
          "en": "So comment this out in the HTML file so that this is no longer getting used, save the file thereafter",
          "zh": "在 HTML 檔案中把它註解掉，讓它不再被使用，接著儲存檔案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 185.84,
          "end": 187.06,
          "en": "and then let's repeat it,",
          "zh": "然後再重做一次，"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 187.1,
          "end": 190.79,
          "en": "let's clear this, press the record button, reload this page,",
          "zh": "清除這些內容，按下錄製按鈕，重新載入頁面，"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 190.79,
          "end": 192.06,
          "en": "stop recording this,",
          "zh": "停止錄製，"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 192.09,
          "end": 196.97,
          "en": "zoom in here. Now we have a clearer picture of what happened.",
          "zh": "放大這裡。現在發生了什麼就比較清楚了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 197.06,
          "end": 201.32,
          "en": "What happened is that here in that work tab, we first download the index.html file,",
          "zh": "在 Network 分頁中，我們首先下載了 index.html 檔案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 201.32,
          "end": 205.54,
          "en": "that's the blue part and thereafter the CSS file and the script files.",
          "zh": "也就是藍色的部分，接著是 CSS 檔案和腳本檔案。"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 205.61,
          "end": 207.46,
          "en": "Now let's go to the bottommost window,",
          "zh": "現在來看最下方的視窗，"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 207.49,
          "end": 212.99,
          "en": "there we see what the browser did in detail and if we zoom in here, which you can do with the mouse",
          "zh": "那裡會顯示瀏覽器詳細做了什麼；如果我們放大，可以用滑鼠"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 212.99,
          "end": 220,
          "en": "wheel, you see that in the end here we receive a data, that's the downloaded HTML file, if you see, this",
          "zh": "滾輪來放大，你會看到最後這裡有個 Receive Data，也就是下載完成的 HTML 檔案；你看，這和"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 220.01,
          "end": 224.87,
          "en": "roughly lines up, here in network tab it's done downloading the file, that's when this receive, data event",
          "zh": "Network 分頁中檔案下載完成的時間大致對得上，下載完成時就會觸發這個 Receive Data"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 224.87,
          "end": 231.71,
          "en": "is triggered when it finished loading it and then it starts parsing the HTML code. Now it starts parsing",
          "zh": "事件，接著它就開始解析 HTML 程式碼。它開始解析"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 231.71,
          "end": 237.44,
          "en": "the HTML code and what you can see is that pretty much at the end of that when it's done parsing",
          "zh": "HTML 程式碼，而你可以看到，差不多在解析快結束、"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 237.44,
          "end": 245.3,
          "en": "this, it sends off requests to the Javascript files, the CSS file is sent off relatively early, if you",
          "zh": "也就是解析完成時，它才送出 JavaScript 檔案的請求；CSS 檔案則相對早就送出了，如果你"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 245.3,
          "end": 250.97,
          "en": "would draw a vertical line down there, that happens early when that gets parsed which makes sense because",
          "zh": "在下面畫一條垂直線，就會發現它在被解析到時很早就發生了，這很合理，因為"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 250.97,
          "end": 256.4,
          "en": "we request the CSS files here in the head section but the Javascript files get requested a bit",
          "zh": "我們在 head 區段中請求 CSS 檔案，但 JavaScript 檔案被請求得比較"
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 256.4,
          "end": 261.2,
          "en": "later because we request them at the bottom of our HTML file.",
          "zh": "晚，因為我們是在 HTML 檔案的底部請求它們。"
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 261.23,
          "end": 266.79,
          "en": "Now obviously that's not a huge file, so there's not much time difference between but still we request",
          "zh": "當然這不是很大的檔案，所以時間差距不大，但我們仍然是在"
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 266.82,
          "end": 272.87,
          "en": "the Javascript files only after the parsing is done or when it's almost done entirely because we do",
          "zh": "解析完成、或幾乎完全完成之後才請求 JavaScript 檔案，因為我們把它"
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 272.87,
          "end": 274.94,
          "en": "that at the bottom of the HTML file.",
          "zh": "放在 HTML 檔案的底部。"
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 275.12,
          "end": 281.03,
          "en": "So that's why we only request the files once we're almost done parsing the HTML document as you can",
          "zh": "所以如你所見，從這條垂直線可以看出，我們只有在 HTML 文件快解析完時"
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 281.03,
          "end": 284.9,
          "en": "see with this vertical line. Now what's the implication of that?",
          "zh": "才請求這些檔案。那這代表什麼呢？"
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 284.9,
          "end": 290.54,
          "en": "Of course the benefit is that the scripts only execute after parsing is done but we also see that we",
          "zh": "好處當然是腳本只會在解析完成後才執行，但我們也看到，我們"
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 290.54,
          "end": 296.75,
          "en": "start parsing and only when we're done, we download the scripts and only once the scripts are downloaded",
          "zh": "先開始解析，等解析完成後才下載腳本，而且要等腳本在"
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 296.87,
          "end": 298.01,
          "en": "way over here,",
          "zh": "這邊很後面才下載完成，"
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 298.1,
          "end": 302.78,
          "en": "of course that's not that long if we have a look at the milliseconds, I'm only talking about a few milliseconds",
          "zh": "當然，看毫秒數其實沒有很久，我說的只是幾毫秒，"
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 302.78,
          "end": 307.69,
          "en": "here but still, only after this is done, we actually execute the scripts,",
          "zh": "但仍然要等這一步完成，我們才真正執行腳本，"
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 307.7,
          "end": 309.92,
          "en": "these are these yellow blocks you find down there,",
          "zh": "也就是下面這些黃色區塊，"
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 309.92,
          "end": 312.24,
          "en": "these are the two scripts which are getting executed.",
          "zh": "這是正在執行的兩個腳本。"
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 312.32,
          "end": 316.37,
          "en": "The other parts are the stylesheet being parsed and the styles being rendered,",
          "zh": "其他部分是樣式表的解析和樣式的渲染，"
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 316.37,
          "end": 317.84,
          "en": "we can ignore that.",
          "zh": "我們可以忽略。"
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 317.84,
          "end": 320.18,
          "en": "So here we execute the scripts,",
          "zh": "所以在這裡執行腳本，"
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 320.21,
          "end": 328.88,
          "en": "now what we effectively see is that we start executing the first script at around 930ms and",
          "zh": "實際上我們看到，第一個腳本大約在 930 毫秒時開始執行，而"
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 328.88,
          "end": 334.23,
          "en": "we're done passing at around 906, 907,",
          "zh": "解析大約在 906、907 毫秒時完成，"
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 334.25,
          "end": 340.64,
          "en": "so there are roughly around 20 milliseconds of pause between us being done with parsing the HTML",
          "zh": "所以在 HTML 檔案解析完成和執行腳本之間，大約有 20 毫秒的"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 340.64,
          "end": 342.72,
          "en": "file and executing the script.",
          "zh": "停頓。"
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 342.83,
          "end": 347.87,
          "en": "Now these are all very small numbers which we can't even feel when we load the page because we have",
          "zh": "這些數字都非常小，載入頁面時根本感覺不到，因為我們的"
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 347.87,
          "end": 352,
          "en": "small scripts and we have a small, short HTML file",
          "zh": "腳本很小，HTML 檔案也很短，"
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 352.15999999999997,
          "end": 357.98,
          "en": "but imagine that our scripts would be longer, that they would take longer to load and execute and that",
          "zh": "但想像一下，如果腳本更長、需要更久才能載入和執行，而且"
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 357.98,
          "end": 364.22,
          "en": "we have way more HTML code that needs to be parsed. Then it's not that great that we wait for all",
          "zh": "有更多 HTML 程式碼需要解析，那麼等所有程式碼都解析完"
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 364.22,
          "end": 368.09,
          "en": "this code to be parsed just to start loading the scripts.",
          "zh": "才開始載入腳本，就不是那麼理想了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 368.12,
          "end": 374.06,
          "en": "We certainly want to execute them after this was parsed because we rely on the parsed content, so that's",
          "zh": "我們當然要在解析完成後才執行它們，因為我們依賴解析後的內容，所以這"
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 374.06,
          "end": 374.6,
          "en": "fine,",
          "zh": "沒問題，"
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 374.66,
          "end": 380.18,
          "en": "we don't want to execute the scripts earlier but loading them earlier, downloading them from the server",
          "zh": "我們不想更早執行腳本，但更早載入、更早從伺服器"
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 380.21,
          "end": 380.68,
          "en": "earlier,",
          "zh": "下載它們，"
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 380.71,
          "end": 382.85,
          "en": "that would be a good idea.",
          "zh": "就會是個好主意。"
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 382.88,
          "end": 388.61,
          "en": "Also keep in mind that all the loading is very fast here of course because we're doing this all locally,",
          "zh": "另外也要記得，這裡的載入當然非常快，因為我們全都在本機進行，"
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 388.61,
          "end": 390.31,
          "en": "we're just accessing the file here,",
          "zh": "只是直接存取這個檔案，"
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 390.32,
          "end": 391.92,
          "en": "there is no web server involved,",
          "zh": "沒有牽涉到網頁伺服器，"
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 392,
          "end": 398.75,
          "en": "there is no latency, so this would be slower if we were really serving this webpage and hence we have the",
          "zh": "也沒有延遲；如果我們真的透過伺服器提供這個網頁，速度會更慢，所以這裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 398.75,
          "end": 400.24,
          "en": "ideal scenario here",
          "zh": "是最理想的情境，"
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 400.34000000000003,
          "end": 406.55,
          "en": "and yet we have this unnecessary delay and we certainly want to shrink that delay if we think about",
          "zh": "即便如此還是有這段不必要的延遲；如果考慮到真的把它架設在網頁伺服器上，"
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 406.55,
          "end": 408.56,
          "en": "really hosting this on a web server.",
          "zh": "我們當然會想縮短這段延遲。"
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 408.56,
          "end": 412.7,
          "en": "We don't want to start loading the scripts once everything was parsed,",
          "zh": "我們不想等到所有內容都解析完才開始載入腳本，"
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 412.73,
          "end": 419.48,
          "en": "we want to load the scripts as early as possible and then still only execute them after everything was",
          "zh": "我們想盡早載入腳本，但仍然只在所有內容都解析完之後"
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 419.48,
          "end": 420.03,
          "en": "parsed",
          "zh": "才執行，"
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 420.14,
          "end": 422.94,
          "en": "so we want to get the best of both worlds.",
          "zh": "也就是兩全其美。"
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 423.05,
          "end": 429.4,
          "en": "Now of course we can grab the scripts and move them into head section, maybe here below the stylesheet.",
          "zh": "當然，我們可以把腳本移到 head 區段，例如放在樣式表下方。"
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 429.47,
          "end": 436.58,
          "en": "Now if we do that and I clear here, this start recording and reload and stop, we get a better picture here.",
          "zh": "這樣做之後，我清除紀錄、開始錄製、重新載入再停止，就能看得更清楚。"
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 436.58,
          "end": 443.02,
          "en": "If I zoom in, here we download the HTML file and now what we see is that we start parsing HTML.",
          "zh": "放大之後，這裡下載了 HTML 檔案，現在可以看到我們開始解析 HTML。"
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 443.18,
          "end": 450.92,
          "en": "Now we then fetch the styles and the scripts and we pause parsing here as you can see, we pause that,",
          "zh": "接著我們抓取樣式和腳本，而如你所見，解析在這裡暫停了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 451.04,
          "end": 456.65999999999997,
          "en": "we only pick it up back here when basically downloading the scripts finished,",
          "zh": "基本上要等腳本下載完成後才在這裡繼續，"
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 456.74,
          "end": 458.54,
          "en": "we also executed the scripts here.",
          "zh": "而且我們也在這裡執行了腳本。"
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 458.54,
          "end": 465.25,
          "en": "Now this looks a bit strange, looks like downloaded app.js for longer than it actually took because",
          "zh": "這看起來有點奇怪，看起來 app.js 下載的時間比實際更久，因為"
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 465.25,
          "end": 466.6,
          "en": "we do execute it here",
          "zh": "我們在這裡執行了它，"
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 466.6,
          "end": 468.34000000000003,
          "en": "so this is a bit distorted.",
          "zh": "所以這有點失真。"
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 468.34000000000003,
          "end": 474.69,
          "en": "The main takeaway here is that we start parsing HTML, then we encounter the script imports, we then",
          "zh": "重點是，我們開始解析 HTML，接著遇到腳本匯入，然後"
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 474.7,
          "end": 481.96,
          "en": "download the scripts and pause parsing therefore, this blocks parsing and then we execute the scripts and",
          "zh": "下載腳本，因此暫停了解析，也就是阻塞了解析，接著執行腳本，"
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 481.96,
          "end": 484.47,
          "en": "only thereafter we continue parsing.",
          "zh": "之後才繼續解析。"
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 484.6,
          "end": 489.49,
          "en": "Now that's of course bad and this also causes an error because now we try to interact with the buttons",
          "zh": "這當然很糟，而且還會造成錯誤，因為我們現在試圖在按鈕"
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 489.49,
          "end": 491.98,
          "en": "on the webpage without those being ready,",
          "zh": "還沒準備好時就和網頁上的按鈕互動，"
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 491.98,
          "end": 493.68,
          "en": "so that's also not ideal.",
          "zh": "所以這也不理想。"
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 493.69,
          "end": 500.35,
          "en": "We download the scripts earlier which is great but we now also execute them too early. The solution is",
          "zh": "我們更早下載腳本，這很好，但現在也執行得太早了。解決方法是"
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 500.35,
          "end": 505,
          "en": "an extra attribute which we can add to the script and that's the defer attribute.",
          "zh": "為 script 加上一個額外的屬性，也就是 defer 屬性。"
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 505,
          "end": 511.51,
          "en": "You add it like this, without a special value, just like this to both script tags and defer tells the",
          "zh": "像這樣加上去，不需要特別的值，兩個 script 標籤都這樣加；defer 會告訴"
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 511.51,
          "end": 519.1,
          "en": "browser that it should download these scripts right away but that it should not block parsing HTML",
          "zh": "瀏覽器應該立刻下載這些腳本，但不要阻塞 HTML 的解析，"
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 519.1,
          "end": 525.73,
          "en": "so that it instead should continue with parsing HTML and only execute the scripts after everything",
          "zh": "而是繼續解析 HTML，並且只在所有內容都解析完之後"
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 525.73,
          "end": 526.93,
          "en": "has been parsed.",
          "zh": "才執行腳本。"
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 527.14,
          "end": 533.3,
          "en": "So it starts downloading early but it doesn't execute the scripts right away once they've finished downloading,",
          "zh": "所以它會提早開始下載，但下載完成後不會立刻執行腳本，"
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 533.35,
          "end": 540.22,
          "en": "instead it guarantees us that it only executes the scripts once they were downloaded and once parsing",
          "zh": "而是保證只在腳本下載完成、而且 HTML 解析完成之後"
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 540.22,
          "end": 542.12,
          "en": "HTML finished.",
          "zh": "才執行。"
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 542.2,
          "end": 549.23,
          "en": "So if we now save this and we go back, clear this again and create a new snapshot, reload, stop,",
          "zh": "現在儲存後回到這裡，再次清除並建立新的快照，重新載入、停止，"
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 549.34,
          "end": 553.51,
          "en": "if we now zoom in here, we see HTML file is downloaded,",
          "zh": "放大之後，可以看到 HTML 檔案下載完成，"
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 553.63,
          "end": 562.71,
          "en": "we start parsing it and then here what happens is that I download all the scripts and I execute the",
          "zh": "我們開始解析它，接著在這裡下載所有腳本，並在那邊"
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 562.71,
          "end": 564.08,
          "en": "scripts over there,",
          "zh": "執行腳本，"
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 564.12,
          "end": 569.34,
          "en": "the two yellow blocks here but parsing HTML did finish before that.",
          "zh": "也就是這兩個黃色區塊，但 HTML 解析在那之前就已經完成了。"
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 569.34,
          "end": 574.95,
          "en": "This is the entire HTML document being parsed, this blue block here is the stylesheet, this is not HTML",
          "zh": "這是整份 HTML 文件的解析，這個藍色區塊是樣式表，不是 HTML，"
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 574.97,
          "end": 579.5,
          "en": "and these are just some events in between these small blue blocks.",
          "zh": "中間這些小藍色區塊只是一些事件。"
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 579.6,
          "end": 586.65,
          "en": "So now, the script downloading and execution doesn't block the HTML code from being parsed and rendered",
          "zh": "所以現在，腳本的下載和執行不會阻擋 HTML 程式碼被解析和渲染，"
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 586.65,
          "end": 592.2,
          "en": "and instead, that continues and the only thing that does change is that we download the scripts earlier",
          "zh": "解析會繼續進行，唯一改變的是我們更早下載腳本，"
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 592.23,
          "end": 593.26,
          "en": "which is great.",
          "zh": "這很好。"
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 593.43,
          "end": 599.55,
          "en": "Now again in this scenario here, that's all a bit hard to really see because it's all so super fast",
          "zh": "再說一次，在這個情境中很難真正看出差異，因為一切都超級快，"
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 599.55,
          "end": 606.69,
          "en": "because I serve it locally and we have very small files but the general concept and the difference should",
          "zh": "畢竟我是在本機提供檔案，而且檔案都很小，但整體概念和差異應該"
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 606.69,
          "end": 607.34,
          "en": "be clear",
          "zh": "很清楚了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 607.41,
          "end": 612.96,
          "en": "and of course this matters way more if you really serve this on a server and if you have bigger files",
          "zh": "如果你真的在伺服器上提供網頁、檔案也更大，這就重要得多；"
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 613.53,
          "end": 619.77,
          "en": "and you can see that all this parsing and script execution is done roughly 20 milliseconds after we",
          "zh": "你也可以看到，所有解析和腳本執行大約在我們開始解析 HTML 文件後"
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 619.77,
          "end": 626.94,
          "en": "started parsing the HTML document, so that is faster than what we saw previously when we started loading",
          "zh": "20 毫秒就完成了，這比我們之前在 body 標籤底部才開始載入"
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 626.94,
          "end": 630.43,
          "en": "and then executing the scripts at the bottom of the body tag.",
          "zh": "並執行腳本時更快。"
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 630.66,
          "end": 636.54,
          "en": "So therefore what you should do when working with Javascript is you should import it like this in your",
          "zh": "因此，使用 JavaScript 時，你應該像這樣在 head 區段中"
        },
        {
          "id": 136,
          "start": 636.54,
          "end": 642.99,
          "en": "head section with the defer attribute because this ensures that it gets loaded early but executed",
          "zh": "搭配 defer 屬性匯入，因為這能確保它被提早載入，但只在"
        },
        {
          "id": 137,
          "start": 643.08,
          "end": 651.8,
          "en": "only once parsing HTML finished, so you have the best of both worlds. Now sometimes, you also have scripts",
          "zh": "HTML 解析完成後才執行，兩全其美。有時候你也會有一些腳本，"
        },
        {
          "id": 138,
          "start": 651.86,
          "end": 657.71,
          "en": "which you want to load early but which you then also want to execute early because maybe they don't",
          "zh": "你想提早載入，也想提早執行，因為它們可能不"
        },
        {
          "id": 139,
          "start": 657.71,
          "end": 663.14,
          "en": "rely on the HTML code, you don't establish a connection to it and therefore you don't care whether",
          "zh": "依賴 HTML 程式碼，你沒有和 HTML 建立連結，因此不在乎"
        },
        {
          "id": 140,
          "start": 663.14,
          "end": 665.53,
          "en": "parsing HTML finished or not.",
          "zh": "HTML 是否已經解析完成。"
        },
        {
          "id": 141,
          "start": 665.72,
          "end": 673.31,
          "en": "This can also be achieved by using the async keyword instead of the defer keyword. Async works a bit like",
          "zh": "這可以用 async 關鍵字取代 defer 關鍵字來達成。async 的運作有點像"
        },
        {
          "id": 142,
          "start": 673.31,
          "end": 679.55,
          "en": "defer, it tells the browser to start loading the scripts as early as possible and then the browser is",
          "zh": "defer，它告訴瀏覽器盡早開始載入腳本，而瀏覽器不會"
        },
        {
          "id": 143,
          "start": 679.55,
          "end": 683.28,
          "en": "not blocked but instead continues parsing HTML",
          "zh": "被阻塞，而是繼續解析 HTML，"
        },
        {
          "id": 144,
          "start": 683.36,
          "end": 690.77,
          "en": "but the difference to defer is that with async, the script then executes right away once it was downloaded.",
          "zh": "但和 defer 的差別在於，使用 async 時，腳本一下載完成就會立刻執行。"
        },
        {
          "id": 145,
          "start": 691.13,
          "end": 694.5,
          "en": "So it does not wait for all the HTML code to be parsed,",
          "zh": "所以它不會等所有 HTML 程式碼解析完成，"
        },
        {
          "id": 146,
          "start": 694.52,
          "end": 701.48,
          "en": "instead it executes as early as possible. So then parsing of HTML will be paused until it is executed",
          "zh": "而是盡早執行。因此 HTML 的解析會暫停到腳本執行完成，"
        },
        {
          "id": 147,
          "start": 701.69,
          "end": 705.06,
          "en": "and only thereafter it will pick up again. Here",
          "zh": "之後才會繼續。在這裡"
        },
        {
          "id": 148,
          "start": 705.13,
          "end": 711.05,
          "en": "therefore this is not the correct solution because that could lead to the script being executed before",
          "zh": "這並不是正確的解決方法，因為這可能導致腳本在"
        },
        {
          "id": 149,
          "start": 711.35,
          "end": 717.14,
          "en": "all HTML code has been parsed but in other scenarios where your scripts don't interact with the web",
          "zh": "所有 HTML 程式碼解析完成之前就執行；但在其他情境中，如果你的腳本不和網"
        },
        {
          "id": 150,
          "start": 717.14,
          "end": 723.29,
          "en": "page because you maybe just send some data to some background server, well in such cases, you could use",
          "zh": "頁互動，例如只是把一些資料送到後端伺服器，那麼在這種情況下就可以使用"
        },
        {
          "id": 151,
          "start": 723.32,
          "end": 724.38,
          "en": "async.",
          "zh": "async。"
        },
        {
          "id": 152,
          "start": 724.46,
          "end": 730.61,
          "en": "One other important difference to be aware of is that with async, a script really executes as early as",
          "zh": "另一個要注意的重要差異是，使用 async 時，腳本真的會盡早"
        },
        {
          "id": 153,
          "start": 730.61,
          "end": 737.29,
          "en": "possible, so as soon as it was downloaded. The order of the script execution is therefore not guaranteed,",
          "zh": "執行，也就是一下載完成就執行。因此腳本的執行順序無法保證，"
        },
        {
          "id": 154,
          "start": 737.33,
          "end": 745.16,
          "en": "the app.js script could execute before the vendor.js script if it is loaded earlier. With defer",
          "zh": "如果 app.js 比較早載入完成，它就可能在 vendor.js 之前執行。至於 defer，"
        },
        {
          "id": 155,
          "start": 745.16,
          "end": 746.23,
          "en": "on the other side,",
          "zh": "另一方面，"
        },
        {
          "id": 156,
          "start": 746.3,
          "end": 748.56,
          "en": "the browser guarantees the order.",
          "zh": "瀏覽器會保證順序。"
        },
        {
          "id": 157,
          "start": 748.67,
          "end": 754.9,
          "en": "So even if app.js would be downloaded faster, vendor.js would still execute before app.js,",
          "zh": "所以即使 app.js 下載得比較快，vendor.js 仍然會在 app.js 之前執行，"
        },
        {
          "id": 158,
          "start": 755,
          "end": 757.16,
          "en": "so the order is guaranteed with defer,",
          "zh": "defer 能保證順序，"
        },
        {
          "id": 159,
          "start": 757.16,
          "end": 762.68,
          "en": "it's not with async, so async is really just a solution if you have a standalone script that doesn't",
          "zh": "async 則不行，所以 async 只適用於不依賴 HTML 內容的"
        },
        {
          "id": 160,
          "start": 762.68,
          "end": 770.56,
          "en": "rely on your HTML content. Also note that defer and async are only available if you have an external",
          "zh": "獨立腳本。另外要注意，defer 和 async 只有在使用外部"
        },
        {
          "id": 161,
          "start": 770.56,
          "end": 771.37,
          "en": "script,",
          "zh": "腳本時才有效，"
        },
        {
          "id": 162,
          "start": 771.4,
          "end": 778.48,
          "en": "if you have an inline script, so a script which you write right in here, in your HTML file, if you have something",
          "zh": "如果是內嵌腳本，也就是直接寫在 HTML 檔案裡的腳本，像這樣的話，"
        },
        {
          "id": 163,
          "start": 778.48,
          "end": 783.67,
          "en": "like this, defer and async is ignored because what would that do,",
          "zh": "defer 和 async 會被忽略，因為它們能做什麼呢？"
        },
        {
          "id": 164,
          "start": 783.67,
          "end": 785.74,
          "en": "there is no file to download,",
          "zh": "根本沒有檔案需要下載，"
        },
        {
          "id": 165,
          "start": 785.74,
          "end": 791.02,
          "en": "this is embedded in the HTML file so this is available once the HTML file was downloaded,",
          "zh": "它內嵌在 HTML 檔案中，所以 HTML 檔案下載完成時它就已經存在了，"
        },
        {
          "id": 166,
          "start": 791.02,
          "end": 796.47,
          "en": "so therefore defer and async doesn't make sense here because there is nothing that would need to be downloaded.",
          "zh": "因此 defer 和 async 在這裡沒有意義，因為沒有任何東西需要下載。"
        },
        {
          "id": 167,
          "start": 796.63,
          "end": 802.6,
          "en": "Such scripts are always executed immediately and therefore if those scripts which you embed here rely",
          "zh": "這類腳本一律會立即執行，因此如果你嵌在這裡的腳本依賴"
        },
        {
          "id": 168,
          "start": 802.6,
          "end": 806.82,
          "en": "on the HTML code, you'll always have to move them to the end of the body section",
          "zh": "HTML 程式碼，就必須一律把它們移到 body 區段的結尾，"
        },
        {
          "id": 169,
          "start": 806.92,
          "end": 812.79,
          "en": "but in general it's not a good idea to have important or longer scripts here in your HTML file,",
          "zh": "但一般來說，把重要或較長的腳本放在 HTML 檔案裡並不是好主意，"
        },
        {
          "id": 170,
          "start": 812.89,
          "end": 818.77,
          "en": "you should always use external files for that to keep your HTML files small and focused and don't",
          "zh": "你應該一律使用外部檔案，讓 HTML 檔案保持精簡、專注，不要"
        },
        {
          "id": 171,
          "start": 818.77,
          "end": 820.98,
          "en": "bloat it with a lot of scripts.",
          "zh": "塞滿一大堆腳本。"
        },
        {
          "id": 172,
          "start": 821.2,
          "end": 822.31,
          "en": "Also important,",
          "zh": "另外很重要的一點，"
        },
        {
          "id": 173,
          "start": 822.31,
          "end": 828.91,
          "en": "you can't combine an inline script like this and then an import with the source attribute.",
          "zh": "你不能把像這樣的內嵌腳本和使用 src 屬性的匯入結合在一起。"
        },
        {
          "id": 174,
          "start": 828.97,
          "end": 835.24,
          "en": "If you do that, then the inline script will be ignored and just the external file will be imported, so",
          "zh": "如果這麼做，內嵌腳本會被忽略，只會匯入外部檔案，所以"
        },
        {
          "id": 175,
          "start": 835.24,
          "end": 838.94,
          "en": "you can't combine that. Now with that,",
          "zh": "不能這樣組合。說完這些，"
        },
        {
          "id": 176,
          "start": 838.96,
          "end": 843.52,
          "en": "let me remove that and turn this back to defer because that's now our final setup",
          "zh": "我把它移除，改回 defer，因為這就是我們最終的設定，"
        },
        {
          "id": 177,
          "start": 843.52,
          "end": 850.3,
          "en": "and if I now save this and I close the developer tools and I reload here and I also comment back in",
          "zh": "現在儲存，關掉開發者工具並重新載入，同時把字型的註解"
        },
        {
          "id": 178,
          "start": 850.45,
          "end": 858.55,
          "en": "my font because now I want to have it back, if I do that, you see this still works as before but now",
          "zh": "取消，因為我想把它加回來；這樣做之後，你會看到一切照常運作，但現在"
        },
        {
          "id": 179,
          "start": 859.59,
          "end": 865.68,
          "en": "it does so with the help of scripts that are loaded in a more efficient way which does not make a big",
          "zh": "腳本是以更有效率的方式載入的；對這個簡單的應用程式、這個簡單的示範來說，"
        },
        {
          "id": 180,
          "start": 865.68,
          "end": 871.95,
          "en": "difference for this simple application, for this simple demo here but which does matter or could matter",
          "zh": "差異不大，但對於真正架設在網頁伺服器上的大型應用程式來說，"
        },
        {
          "id": 181,
          "start": 872.07,
          "end": 875.55,
          "en": "a lot for bigger applications which you really host on a web server.",
          "zh": "這可能就非常重要。"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
